      "title": "타입 꾸띄르 에디토리얼 — 오버사이즈 타이포가 구조가 되는 4방향 패션 포스터 템플릿",
      "prompt": "AI 패션 비주얼 시스템 Vol.09: 타입 꾸띄르 에디토리얼!\nChatGPT-Image2로 제작됨\n\n4가지 방향:\n1. 원형 창문 럭셔리 에디토리얼\n2. 쌓인 타입 좌식 포스터\n3. 투명 타이포그래피 의상\n4. 대각선 모션 패션 에디토리얼\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a high-end type couture editorial poster where typography becomes part of the fashion composition.\n\nTheme: [fashion campaign / couture poster / lookbook / designer editorial / luxury visual]\nDirection: [circular window luxury editorial / stacked type seated poster / transparent typography garment / diagonal motion fashion editorial]\nBrand name: [original fictional brand name]\nMain title: [original title]\nSubtitle: [short original subtitle]\nSubject: [adult fashion model / coat look / seated menswear look / experimental garment / walking couture look]\nMood: [luxury / minimal / experimental / elegant / structured / editorial]\nColor palette: [cream-white-black / soft grey / black-white / warm neutral]\nAspect ratio: [9:16]\n\nThe poster should feel like a premium fashion campaign, designer lookbook page or couture editorial.\n\nUse oversized typography as part of the visual structure, not just as a title.\nMake the words interact with the model, garment or space through overlap, masking, cropping, transparency, diagonal slicing, circular framing or spatial layering.\n\nChoose one direction:\n\n1. Circular window luxury editorial — clean white background, large circular image window, full-body model in a luxury coat, refined serif typography, model standing in front of the circular scene.\n2. Stacked type seated poster — huge black block letters as background structure, seated fashion model in front of the letters, chair/body partially overlapping the type.\n3. Transparent typography garment — walking model wearing a transparent outer layer covered with original letterforms, thin lines and abstract typography, as if text becomes fabric.\n4. Diagonal motion fashion editorial — walking couture model with flowing white fabric, large diagonal typography bands cutting across the composition, matching the motion of the garment.\n\nKeep all text original. Do not use real brand names, real magazine names, issue numbers, dates, barcodes, URLs, watermarks, copyright marks or reference-image wording.\n\nAvoid cheap templates, cluttered layouts, random small text, fake logos, messy typography, distorted anatomy, broken hands, plastic skin and low-end fashion ad style.\n\nGenerate one finished poster only.",
      "prompt_ko": "4가지 방향(원형창문/쌓인타입좌식/투명타이포의상/대각선모션) 중 하나를 고르는 패션 캠페인 포스터 템플릿. 핵심은 오버사이즈 타이포가 단순 제목이 아니라 시각 구조 자체가 되는 것 — 겹침·마스킹·크로핑·투명겹침·대각선 슬라이싱·원형 프레이밍으로 텍스트와 모델/의상/공간이 상호작용. Theme/Direction/Brand/Title/Subtitle/Subject/Mood/Palette/Aspect ratio 필드형 스펙시트. 실제 브랜드명·매거진명·발행호수·바코드·URL·워터마크 금지, 모든 텍스트는 오리지널. NLM 매거진 YAML의 타이포=레이아웃구조 어휘 참고용으로 연관성 있음.",
