      "target_model": "GPT Image 2 (ChatGPT) — 함수형 JSON 템플릿",
      "category": "제품 광고",
      "title": "음료 광고 자동 재디자인 포스터 (forced perspective 병, 함수형 {PRODUCT_NAME})",
      "prompt": "GPT image 2.0 On ChatGPT.\n\nPrompt;\n\n{\n  \"\nPRODUCT_NAME\": \"Enter Here\",\n  \"PRODUCT_FLAVOR\": \"Enter Here\",\n  \"TAGLINE\": \"Enter Here\",\n  \"BRAND_LOGO\": \"<Optional Upload>\",\n\n  \"prompt\": \"Create a premium modern beverage advertisement poster for {{PRODUCT_NAME}}. The product name is intentionally left blank so it can be replaced with any beverage brand while automatically adapting every design element to match the product.\\n\\nGenerate a high-end commercial advertising composition featuring a smiling lifestyle model holding the product bottle extremely close to the camera using forced perspective. The bottle occupies around 45-55% of the frame and becomes the primary focal point, while the model remains slightly behind it. The pose should feel confident, friendly, energetic, and authentic.\\n\\nAutomatically redesign the entire advertisement based on the entered product:\\n\\n• Determine the beverage type from {{PRODUCT_NAME}} and {{PRODUCT_FLAVOR}}.\\n• Choose an appropriate dominant brand color palette.\\n• Generate a matching gradient background.\\n• Adapt all supporting graphics, icons, highlights, and accents to the product.\\n• Generate realistic packaging with professional branding.\\n• Create a custom premium label with {{PRODUCT_NAME}} replacing all placeholder branding.\\n• Update bottle color, liquid color, cap color, condensation, and reflections accordingly.\\n\\nPoster Layout:\\n• Minimal luxury commercial design.\\n• Rounded rectangle gradient panel behind the subject.\\n• Large oversized transparent typography of the product name behind the model, partially hidden by the subject.\\n• Small elegant tagline positioned in the top-right corner using {{TAGLINE}}.\\n• Floating rounded product-name badge on the left side displaying {{PRODUCT_NAME}}.\\n• Four equally spaced feature cards along the bottom with simple black outline icons.\\n• Small marketing copy positioned on the lower-right.\\n• Plenty of clean white negative space.\\n\\nBottom Feature Cards should automatically adapt to the product, for example:\\n• Natural Ingredients\\n• Ice Cold Refreshment\\n• Rich in Vitamins\\n• Premium Packaging\\n\\nMarketing Copy should also adapt automatically to the beverage while remaining concise and premium.\\n\\nBottle Specifications:\\n• Realistic transparent glass bottle.\\n• Cold beverage with natural condensation droplets.\\n• Moisture beads.\\n• Slight frost near the neck.\\n• High-quality printed label.\\n• Crisp reflections.\\n• Studio product photography quality.\\n\\nModel:\\n• Young healthy lifestyle model.\\n• Casual premium clothing matching the product colors.\\n• Natural smile.\\n• Looking directly into camera.\\n• Hair slightly moving naturally.\\n• Relaxed confident pose.\\n\\nLighting:\\n• Bright commercial studio lighting.\\n• Soft key light.\\n• Large diffused softboxes.\\n• Clean rim lighting.\\n• Natural skin tones.\\n• Bright glossy reflections on the bottle.\\n• Premium advertising look.\\n\\nStyle:\\nUltra-realistic, premium beverage campaign, luxury branding, modern minimalism, commercial product photography, cinematic realism, vibrant colors, sharp focus, clean composition, realistic typography, photorealistic packaging, magazine-quality advertising, 8K, ultra-detailed.\"\n}",
      "prompt_ko": "{PRODUCT_NAME} 음료 광고 포스터를 제품에 맞춰 자동 재디자인하는 JSON 함수형 템플릿(Maercihh). 플레이스홀더=PRODUCT_NAME·PRODUCT_FLAVOR·TAGLINE·BRAND_LOGO(선택 업로드). forced perspective로 병을 카메라 극근접(프레임 45~55% 주 초점), 미소 라이프스타일 모델이 병 살짝 뒤에서 자신감·친근·에너제틱 포즈. 제품명/맛으로 음료 타입 판별 → 주도 브랜드 컬러 팔레트·매칭 그라디언트 배경·그래픽/아이콘/액센트 적응·리얼 패키징·커스텀 프리미엄 라벨(플레이스홀더 브랜딩 전부 교체)·병/액체/캡 색·condensation·반사 자동 조정. 레이아웃=미니멀 럭셔리 상업 디자인·라운드 그라디언트 패널·모델 뒤 대형 투명 제품명 타이포(주체에 일부 가림). ★함수형이라 PRODUCT_NAME 치환. gen_prompt=오리지널 스파클링 'AURA' 데모.",
      "gen_prompt": "Create a premium modern beverage advertisement poster for an original sparkling drink called 'AURA', citrus-berry flavor. A smiling lifestyle model holds the bottle extremely close to the camera using forced perspective; the bottle occupies around 45-55% of the frame as the primary focal point, the model slightly behind it, in a confident, friendly, energetic, authentic pose. Dominant brand palette of vivid magenta and electric purple, a matching gradient background, supporting graphics, icons and highlights adapted to the drink, realistic professional packaging, a custom premium label reading 'AURA', with bottle, liquid, cap color, condensation and reflections all matching. Poster layout: minimal luxury commercial design, a rounded-rectangle gradient panel behind the subject, large oversized transparent typography of the product name 'AURA' behind the model partially hidden by the subject, clean modern hierarchy, high-end commercial advertising finish, vertical 4:5.",
