      "prompt": "برومبت عام (Glass Pixel / Glass Voxel):\n\nUse the uploaded image as the ONLY identity reference. Preserve the exact facial identity, hairstyle, facial features, skin tone, body proportions, clothing, accessories, pose, and overall appearance without any changes. Transform the entire subject into a premium glass voxel sculpture made of thousands of perfectly aligned transparent cubic blocks. Each cube should have crystal-clear glass material with realistic refraction, reflections, subtle frosted edges, and soft internal light scattering. Maintain recognizable facial details while adapting them into voxel geometry. Create a clean minimal gradient background that complements the subject. Studio lighting, cinematic reflections, ray-traced glass, ultra-photorealistic 3D render, luxury digital art, Octane/Redshift quality, extremely detailed, 8K, masterpiece, no text, no watermark.",
