      "prompt": "GPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate a premium architectural concept presentation board for a minimalist courtyard villa, “Ink Courtyard Layers” edition, combining exploded villa design analysis with refined East Asian ink-wash atmosphere. The image should feel like a high-end architecture studio proposal sheet: multiple sectional villa studies, exploded layers, facade fragments, detached massing components, courtyard relationships, and support diagrams arranged across one elegant presentation board. The overall composition must be rich in information yet highly controlled, calm, spacious, and luxurious.\n\nThe core architectural language is a contemporary minimalist courtyard villa with horizontal roof planes, warm interior glow, slim structural edges, large glass openings, floating platforms, shallow water courts, open transitional corridors, and refined landscape integration. The same villa design family should appear in multiple analytical views across the board: front sectional cuts, detached upper/lower volume studies, courtyard cutaways, exploded roof and floor slab separations, facade rhythm studies, compact interior-open elevations, and smaller support diagrams. Every module should feel like part of one coherent architectural system.\n\nThe key visual emphasis is on layered courtyard relationships. The villa studies should repeatedly show how architecture, courtyard voids, reflecting pools, stepping platforms, trees, grasses, and corridor edges interact. Water must appear calm, shallow, and mirror-like. Courtyard planting should be sparse and elegant: one or two carefully placed trees, low moss islands, fine grasses, restrained shrubs, and soft shadow shapes. The emotional effect should be a breathing architectural landscape where interior and exterior dissolve into each other.\n\nUse clean ink-wash treatment as a premium atmospheric layer around and beneath the villa modules. Ink should appear as soft gray-black diffusion, pale watery brush haze, subtle feathered wash edges, and elegant spatial mist that suggests terrain, depth, shadow, and calm air. The ink must remain minimal, controlled, and luxurious, never messy or overly painterly. It should feel like architectural poetry supporting precision rather than replacing it.\n\nThe board composition should include 2 to 4 larger hero villa sectional studies, several medium exploded variants, and a range of smaller support diagrams such as material fragments, courtyard node studies, circulation hints, detail icons, and spatial annotation blocks. Arrange all elements with clean editorial spacing and strong hierarchy. The board must breathe through negative space, like a museum-grade design proposal.\n\nThe architecture itself should blend modern luxury with restrained East Asian courtyard sensibility: smooth ivory plaster walls, charcoal-gray stone plinths, smoked wood panels, matte concrete slabs, transparent glazing, warm oak interiors, black metal frames, shallow reflective water, and soft planted earth edges. The villa should feel buildable, elegant, and highly desirable, like a contemporary boutique retreat.\n\nThe color system must be restrained and intelligent: warm ivory paper tone, ash gray, ink black, charcoal green-gray, pale stone beige, soft moss green accents, smoked wood brown, and controlled amber interior glow. The palette should feel calm, architectural, and premium, with the ink wash and landscape integrated into the same tonal family.\n\nTypography should follow a high-end architecture board layout. Use a Chinese main title such as “极简风情小别墅设计分解” at the top or upper-left as the primary heading, paired with an elegant English subtitle such as “MINIMAL COURTYARD VILLA STUDY”. Add refined English annotation lines, section labels, micro captions, material notes, diagram tags, and subtle dimensional callouts across the board. Typography must be thin, precise, spacious, technical yet beautiful, like a real international architecture presentation sheet. No crude bold fonts, no clutter, no generic infographic look.\n\nLighting should be soft, realistic, and premium. Each villa module should have clean daylight shading, subtle ambient occlusion, elegant contact shadows beneath floating slabs, warm light glowing through interior glazing, and gentle tonal separation from the paper-like board background. The ink wash should feel airy and layered rather than dark or muddy.\n\nMood: serene, architectural, poetic, editorial, restrained, premium, intelligent, East-meets-modern, contemplative, highly refined.\n\nRendering style: hyper-realistic architectural visualization mixed with premium concept-board graphics, exploded sectional logic, luxury presentation design, restrained ink-wash atmosphere, editorial composition, museum-grade minimalism, 8k, sharp but elegant finish.\n\nNegative prompt: messy ink splashes, chaotic layout, cartoon building, rustic house, overly traditional Chinese painting, bright saturated greens, heavy decorative clutter, ugly bold fonts, cheap infographic style, sci-fi architecture, noisy background, random inconsistent villa designs",
      "prompt_ko": "미니멀 중정(courtyard) 빌라의 프리미엄 건축 컨셉 프레젠테이션 보드('Ink Courtyard Layers' 에디션, ou_zhen599). 익스플로디드 빌라 설계 분석 + 동아시아 잉크워시 분위기 결합, 하이엔드 건축 스튜디오 제안서 시트 느낌. 하나의 우아한 보드에 다중 단면 빌라 스터디·익스플로디드 레이어·파사드 조각·분리 매싱 컴포넌트·중정 관계·서포트 다이어그램 배열. 정보 풍부하되 고도로 절제·차분·여유·럭셔리. 빌라=현대 미니멀 중정 빌라(수평 지붕면·따뜻한 실내 글로우·슬림 구조 엣지·대형 유리 개구부·플로팅 플랫폼·얕은 수경 중정·개방 전이 복도·정제된 조경 통합). 동일 빌라 패밀리가 다중 분석 뷰(정면 단면·상하 볼륨 분리 스터디·중정 컷어웨이·지붕/슬래브 익스플로디드·파사드 리듬·내부-개방 입면·소형 서포트 다이어그램)로 반복, 하나의 일관 시스템. 잡지급 여백 레이아웃·정제 뉴트럴 팔레트·가는 폰트 테크니컬 조판·부드러운 리얼 광영·전체 질서와 절제. 원문 5k자 중 핵심 압축(gen_prompt).",
      "gen_prompt": "Create a premium architectural concept presentation board for a minimalist courtyard villa, \"Ink Courtyard Layers\" edition, combining exploded villa design analysis with refined East Asian ink-wash atmosphere. It should feel like a high-end architecture studio proposal sheet: multiple sectional villa studies, exploded layers, facade fragments, detached massing components, courtyard relationships, and support diagrams arranged across one elegant presentation board. Rich in information yet highly controlled, calm, spacious, luxurious. The villa is a contemporary minimalist courtyard villa with horizontal roof planes, warm interior glow, slim structural edges, large glass openings, floating platforms, shallow water courts, open transitional corridors, and refined landscape integration. The same villa design family appears in multiple analytical views across the board: front sectional cuts, detached upper and lower volume studies, courtyard cutaways, exploded roof and floor-slab separations, facade rhythm studies, compact interior-open elevations, and smaller support diagrams — every module part of one coherent architectural system. Magazine-quality layout with ample white space, a cohesive sophisticated neutral palette with soft ink-wash washes, thin-font technical typesetting, soft realistic lighting and shadows, overall order and restraint.",
