      "prompt": "Use the uploaded product image as the single source of truth and create one extraordinary campaign-ready ad.\n\nSilently analyze the product in a deep loop: category, function, audience, price tier, emotional promise, brand personality, materials, colors, typography, logo behavior, packaging details, and the most ownable selling point. Ground every decision in the uploaded product only.\n\nPRODUCT DNA LOCK:\nPreserve the product exactly: shape, proportions, structure, packaging, logo, label, typography, colors, materials, textures, finishes, reflections, and all visible details. Do not redesign, recolor, relabel, distort, duplicate, simplify, or invent anything. The product must remain instantly recognizable.\n\nCREATIVE LOOP:\nSilently generate 5 different ad concepts based on the product’s real DNA, then score them for visual hook, originality, brand fit, clarity, product focus, realism, and commercial strength. Reject weak ideas, refine the strongest one, and produce only the best final concept.\n\nBRAND COMMUNICATION:\nInclude:\n— the brand logo / name elegantly integrated in the layout\n— one ultra-short headline or slogan, 3 words maximum\n— headline may be Arabic, English, or the brand’s language, whichever fits best\n— typography should feel aligned with the brand’s own type style and identity\n— if needed, add only one ultra-short support phrase\n\nKeep text minimal, premium, and memorable. No paragraph copy. No long explanations.\n\nVISUAL RULES:\nMake it bold, cinematic, premium, and scroll-stopping. Strong hierarchy, intelligent negative space, realistic lighting, refined shadows, premium composition, and a clear hero product.\n\nDo not add infographic icons, callout bubbles, comparison elements, extra badges, fake UI, clutter, or random effects.\n\nOutput: one clean vertical 4:5 premium ad. Show only the final strongest advertisement, not the analysis.",
