      "prompt": "4 famous sci-fi movies visualized with Nano Banana. Kind of a fun style.  \n\nPrompt: \n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 famous space movies: <instructions>RENDER_CHAIN = \"[$SUBJECT :: monochrome_noir_raincut :: expressionist__poster]\"\n\nMORPH_RULES = {\n    \"palette\": \"pure black, stark white, layered grays only – no color\",\n    \"linework\": \"sharp angular ink shapes, hard silhouette edges, scratchy hatching, rain-line texture, dense stippled shadow\",\n    \"geometry\": \"tall distorted forms, elongated silhouettes, wedge-like faces, severe triangular planes, vertical compression\",\n    \"lighting\": \"extreme chiaroscuro, backlit glow, hard shadow blocks, white cutout highlights, deep black negative space\",\n    \"atmosphere\": \"heavy rain, mist, city haze, wet reflections, stormy noir mood\",\n    \"composition\": \"low-angle cinematic, towering vertical backgrounds, dramatic foreground silhouettes, oppressive urban scale\",\n    \"mood\": \"brooding, mysterious, tense, stylish, hardboiled, rain-soaked\"\n}\n\nNEGATIVE = \"color, photorealism, soft airbrush, glossy 3D, toy, clay, cute, clean vector, bright even lighting\"\n\nOUTPUT = (RENDER_CHAIN :: MORPH_RULES) - NEGATIVE\nRENDER: a single black-and-white illustration, frozen in a rain storm, graphic and cinematic</instructions>",
      "prompt_ko": "RENDER_CHAIN = \"[$SUBJECT :: monochrome_noir_raincut :: expressionist_poster]\" 형태의 체인 + MORPH_RULES 딕셔너리 문법. 규칙 7항: 팔레트(순흑·순백·회색 층만, 컬러 금지) / 선(날카로운 각진 잉크 형태, 단단한 실루엣 경계, 거친 해칭, 빗줄기 텍스처, 조밀한 점묘 그림자) / 기하(길게 왜곡된 형태, 늘어진 실루엣, 쐐기형 얼굴, 삼각 평면, 수직 압축) / 조명(극단 명암대비, 역광 글로우, 단단한 그림자 블록, 흰 컷아웃 하이라이트, 깊은 흑색 여백) / 대기(폭우·안개·도시 연무·젖은 반사) / 구도(로우앵글 시네마틱, 치솟는 수직 배경, 극적 전경 실루엣) / 무드(음울·긴장·하드보일드). NEGATIVE: 컬러·포토리얼·소프트 에어브러시·광택 3D·장난감·클레이·귀여움·밝은 균일조명. ※ 원문 예시는 유명 SF 영화 4편 → 저작권 회피로 오리지널 SF 아키타입 4종으로 치환.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 2x2 grid, 16:9, of four black-and-white expressionist noir posters, each a single illustration frozen in a rainstorm. Pure black, stark white and layered grays only, no color. Sharp angular ink shapes, hard silhouette edges, scratchy hatching, rain-line texture and dense stippled shadow. Tall distorted forms, elongated silhouettes, wedge-like faces, severe triangular planes and vertical compression. Extreme chiaroscuro with backlit glow, hard shadow blocks, white cutout highlights and deep black negative space. Heavy rain, mist, city haze and wet reflections throughout. Low-angle cinematic framing with towering vertical backgrounds and dramatic foreground silhouettes. Panel 1: a lone astronaut silhouetted against the colossal hull of a derelict starship. Panel 2: a hooded figure walking a rain-soaked megacity street beneath vast signage. Panel 3: a spacesuited figure kneeling before a monolithic black slab on a desert plain. Panel 4: a pilot silhouette in a cramped cockpit with a planet filling the canopy. Brooding, tense, hardboiled, stylish. No color, no photorealism, no soft airbrush, no glossy 3D, no clean vector.",
