      "prompt": "These visuals used to take me a long time to make. Now with GPT, you can explain any natural or unexplained phenomenon.\n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 unexplained phenomena: input: [phenomenon / force / reaction / field / state_change]  system: render the input as a luxury physics visualization poster. do not hardcode equations unless inevitable. infer the governing principles, energy transformations, scale range, mathematical beauty, historical discovery narrative, real-world manifestations, and philosophical implications.  semantic solve: phenomenon_autopsy =   (infer(governing_laws from fundamental_force + conservation_law + symmetry + boundary_conditions + limits) ::5) +   (infer(energy_logic from input + transformation + dissipation + resonance + equilibrium) ::4) +   (infer(discovery_memory from scientist + experiment + era + controversy + paradigm_shift) ::4) +   (infer(hidden_math from topology + fractal_dimension + phase_space + probability_field + emergence) ::3) -   (high-school textbook diagrams + generic stock illustrations + oversimplified cartoons + cluttered equations + powerpoint aesthetics) ::-4  composition: one central phenomenon visualized as an elegant physical manifestation. layered representations reveal mathematical structure, energy flow, scale comparisons (quantum to cosmic), historical experiment recreations, and real-world examples. use callout lines like a cern visualization or a feynman lecture diagram.  style dna: cern particle visualization ::0.30 feynman diagram elegance ::0.25 vintage physics textbook ::0.20 planetarium projection ::0.15 dark academia paper ::0.10  output: deep navy or black background luxury science poster, elegant serif + mathematical typography, restrained callouts, luminous data visualization, refined glow effects, premium negative space.  negative: no cartoon atoms, no generic lightbulb imagery, no cluttered chalkboard aesthetic, no neon rainbow vomit, no cheap infographic style, no watermark, no oversimplified metaphors.",
      "prompt_ko": "현상 하나를 '럭셔리 물리 시각화 포스터'로 렌더하는 시맨틱 솔브 프롬프트. 방정식 하드코딩 금지, 지배 원리·에너지 변환·스케일 범위·수학적 아름다움·발견의 역사·실제 발현·철학적 함의를 추론시킴. phenomenon_autopsy = 지배법칙(::5) + 에너지 논리(::4) + 발견의 기억: 과학자·실험·시대·논쟁·패러다임 전환(::4) + 숨은 수학: 위상·프랙탈 차원·위상공간·확률장·창발(::3) - 고교 교과서 도해·스톡 일러스트·과단순 만화·난잡한 수식·파워포인트 미학(::-4). 스타일 DNA 배합: CERN 입자 시각화 0.30 / 파인만 다이어그램 우아함 0.25 / 빈티지 물리 교과서 0.20 / 플라네타리움 투영 0.15 / 다크 아카데미아 종이 0.10. 출력=딥네이비·블랙 배경, 우아한 세리프+수학 조판, 절제된 콜아웃, 발광 데이터 시각화, 프리미엄 여백.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 2x2 grid, 16:9, of four luxury physics visualization posters on a deep navy-to-black background. Each panel centers one phenomenon rendered as an elegant physical manifestation, with layered representations revealing mathematical structure, energy flow and scale. Panel 1: ball lightning as a luminous plasma sphere wrapped in field-line topology, with a scale ladder from centimeters to storm cells. Panel 2: sonoluminescence as a collapsing bubble emitting a flash, surrounded by pressure-wave rings and a phase-space spiral. Panel 3: superfluid helium creeping up and over a vessel rim, annotated with a quantized vortex lattice. Panel 4: turbulence as a Karman vortex street with fractal-dimension insets and energy-cascade arrows. Thin callout lines annotate each panel like a CERN particle visualization or a Feynman lecture diagram, with restrained labels, elegant serif and mathematical typography, luminous data visualization, refined glow effects, premium negative space and a dark academia paper feel. No cartoon atoms, no lightbulb imagery, no cluttered chalkboard, no neon rainbow, no cheap infographic style.",
