      "title": "강제원근 링 캠페인 — 거대 전경 손 + 단색 그린 월드 (★반지·시계·네일 광고 범용 구조)",
      "prompt": "This layout can be adapted for any advertisement featuring rings, watches, or nail art: simply retain the forced perspective and focal hierarchy, then swap out the product and color scheme.\n这套结构可替换为任何戒指、腕表或美甲广告：保留强迫透视和焦点层级，再替换产品与色彩世界。\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate an ultra-premium vertical flagship jewelry campaign image for Tiffany & Co., featuring the Tiffany T ring as the absolute hero product, while preserving the same dramatic reclining-body and giant-foreground-hand forced-perspective skeleton, and pushing the image into a more iconic, more immersive, more museum-grade luxury direction. A healthy athletic European-looking female model lies naturally flat inside a fully unified monochromatic green world, her body extending deep into the background in soft cinematic blur, while one arm reaches elegantly and naturally toward the lens. The foreground hand must occupy a commanding proportion of the frame, creating a breathtaking near-to-far perspective transition. The body and face remain calm, distant, softly blurred, and emotionally restrained, supporting the jewelry without competing with it.\n\nThe Tiffany T ring must be unmistakably authentic, sculptural, and luxurious, worn naturally on the extended hand and rendered with macro-level realism. Emphasize the clean architectural geometry of the T motif, refined precious-metal finish, razor-clean contours, polished reflections, controlled edge highlights, and high-jewelry craftsmanship. The ring should feel modern, intelligent, elegant, and expensive, never flashy. The fingers must be long, relaxed, naturally spread, and anatomically beautiful, posed to maximize the perspective impact and let the ring sit at the strongest visual point of the composition.\n\nPush the main direction further by making the entire visual system more purely Tiffany in color psychology and material atmosphere. Build a seamless luxury green universe using a sophisticated tonal family of Tiffany green, pale mint, celadon, cool jade haze, soft emerald mist, muted sea-glass green, and restrained silver-white reflections. Let the background, floor, and fitted dress merge into one continuous immersive field, so the model appears embedded in a rarefied green dream chamber. The hand and ring should emerge from this environment like the central sculptural revelation.\n\nReconstruct the same skeleton more boldly by transforming the pure-color studio into a more architectural luxury installation. Keep the exact same body position, giant foreground hand, and soft-focus background figure, but upgrade the environment into a continuous high-end green space made of layered premium surfaces: matte lacquer planes, velvety light-absorbing texture, frosted translucent panels, and subtle glossy reflections that bend softly around the hand. The set should feel like a Tiffany flagship art pavilion rather than a normal studio backdrop, while remaining minimal, controlled, and monochromatic. This makes the image feel less like a simple print ad and more like a collectible brand monument.\n\nLighting must be exceptionally delicate, airy, and sculptural. Use refined soft studio light with long tonal gradients flowing across the ring, fingers, nails, skin, and dress. The ring receives the crispest highlight control, allowing the T silhouette to read instantly and luxuriously. Skin must be hyper-realistic and tactile with visible natural pores, soft warmth in the joints, elegant tonal transitions, realistic finger texture, and no plastic retouching. The nails should be polished in a restrained green-family or sophisticated neutral tone, perfectly integrated into the palette. The blurred face in the background should contribute stillness, confidence, and high-fashion calm.\n\nIntegrate minimal elegant English typography suitable for Tiffany & Co., with restrained luxury hierarchy, refined spacing, premium serif and clean sans-serif pairing, subtle official campaign branding, and tasteful product naming. Typography must feel airy, premium, and secondary, never disturbing the dominance of the foreground hand and ring.\n\nThe final image must feel like a world-class Tiffany & Co. flagship campaign poster: dramatic forced perspective, immersive monochromatic green luxury, hyper-real jewelry detail, serene modern femininity, architectural installation atmosphere, cinematic shallow depth of field, tactile material richness, subtle premium print grain, and award-level advertising polish.\n\nAvoid cheap jewelry styling, avoid clutter, avoid extra props, avoid distorted fingers, avoid stiff posing, avoid plastic skin, avoid harsh shadow blocks, avoid excessive sparkle effects, avoid generic fashion-ad styling, avoid loud graphic design, avoid muddy green tones, avoid low-end glamour.",
      "prompt_ko": "★작성자의 구조 정의 — **이 레이아웃은 반지·손목시계·네일아트 광고 어디에나 이식 가능하다. 강제원근과 초점 위계만 유지한 채 제품과 색채 세계만 교체하면 된다.** 또 하나의 팁: **이 주얼리 광고에서 가장 훔칠 만한 요소는 브랜드 레드가 아니라 '피사계심도의 역발상' — 얼굴을 배경으로 밀어넣고 손을 인물 사진의 초점으로 만든 것.** 구성=모델이 완전히 통일된 단색 그린 세계 안에 자연스럽게 누워 있고, 몸은 부드러운 시네마틱 블러로 배경 깊숙이 뻗어감. 한 팔이 렌즈를 향해 우아하게 뻗고, **전경의 손이 프레임의 압도적 비중을 차지**해 숨막히는 근경-원경 전이를 만듦. 몸과 얼굴은 차분하고 멀고 부드럽게 블러되어 주얼리와 경쟁하지 않음. 링은 매크로급 리얼리즘 — T 모티프의 깔끔한 건축적 기하, 정제된 귀금속 마감, 면도날 같은 윤곽, 광택 반사, 통제된 엣지 하이라이트. 손가락은 길고 이완되고 자연스럽게 벌어져 원근 임팩트를 극대화. 색=티파니 그린·페일민트·셀라돈·쿨 제이드 헤이즈·소프트 에메랄드 미스트·시글라스 그린·절제된 실버화이트가 배경·바닥·드레스로 이어져 하나의 몰입형 필드. 환경은 스튜디오 배경막이 아니라 **건축적 럭셔리 인스톨레이션**(무광 래커 면, 빛을 흡수하는 벨벳 질감, 프로스티드 반투명 패널).",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-premium vertical flagship jewelry campaign image with a sculptural ring as the absolute hero, built on a dramatic reclining-body and giant-foreground-hand forced perspective. A female model lies naturally flat inside a fully unified monochromatic green world, her body extending deep into the background in soft cinematic blur, while one arm reaches elegantly toward the lens. The foreground hand occupies a commanding proportion of the frame, creating a breathtaking near-to-far perspective transition, and the body and face remain calm, distant and softly blurred so they never compete with the jewelry. The ring is rendered with macro-level realism: clean architectural geometry, refined precious-metal finish, razor-clean contours, polished reflections and controlled edge highlights, modern and elegant rather than flashy. The fingers are long, relaxed and naturally spread to maximize the perspective. The entire visual system is one seamless luxury green universe of pale mint, celadon, cool jade haze, soft emerald mist, muted sea-glass green and restrained silver-white reflections, with background, floor and fitted dress merging into a single immersive field. The set reads as an architectural luxury pavilion of matte lacquer planes, velvety light-absorbing texture and frosted translucent panels rather than a studio backdrop. Delicate airy sculptural lighting with long tonal gradients across the ring, fingers, skin and dress.",
