      "prompt": "GPT image on chatgpt \n\nPrompt:\n\n((MASTERPIECE)), ((BEST QUALITY)), ((ULTRA REALISTIC)), ((8K RAW)), ((Luxury Korean Beauty Campaign)), ((High-End Fashion Editorial)), ((Premium Chocolate Cosmetic Advertisement)), Vogue Korea, Harper's Bazaar Korea, luxury skincare commercial, premium K-Beauty aesthetic, cinematic luxury atmosphere.\n\n((Use the SAME ultra-beautiful Korean supermodel in every image)), porcelain glass skin, luxurious long black wavy hair, glossy chocolate lips, soft Korean makeup, expressive eyes, elegant facial features, slim body, long legs, luxury fashion model, premium editorial pose, luxury attitude, natural beauty, consistent face across all images.\n\n((Dark chocolate oversized leather jacket with fur collar)), premium mini dress, sheer black stockings, luxury heels, elegant gold jewelry, holding luxurious chocolate dessert cup or premium cosmetic product, chocolate inspired accessories.\n\n((Luxury walnut wooden room)), premium hotel suite, rich wooden wall panels, warm chocolate brown color palette, golden rails, luxury furniture, cinematic soft flash lighting, soft shadows, expensive editorial photography, realistic reflections, luxury ambience.\n\n((Chocolate luxury concept)), melted chocolate details, gourmet dessert styling, premium cosmetic packaging, luxury lifestyle, elegant composition, fashion magazine layout.\n\n((Luxury English Typography))\n\"Chocolate Moment, So You.\"\n\"Luxury Chocolate Beauty.\"\n\"Indulge in Chocolate Care.\"\n\"Made for Soft Beautiful Lips.\"\n\n((Elegant Korean Typography))\n\"초콜릿처럼 달콤한 순간\"\n\"부드럽게 녹아드는 립 케어\"\n\"럭셔리 뷰티 컬렉션\"\n\"매일 빛나는 아름다움\"\n\nMinimal luxury branding, premium magazine advertisement, clean composition, plenty of negative space, luxury typography, soft glossy highlights.\n\n((Camera))\nCanon EOS R5\n85mm f/1.2\nRAW Photo\nHDR\nUltra Sharp Focus\nShallow Depth of Field\nLuxury Commercial Photography\nCinematic Color Grading\nMagazine Cover Quality\nHyper Detailed\nNatural Skin Texture\n\n((POSE))\n[Replace this line for each image]\nExamples:\n• standing in front of mirror applying lip balm\n• sitting inside luxury wooden chocolate box\n• crouching while holding chocolate dessert cup\n• close-up beauty portrait with cosmetic product\n• lying inside chocolate box from top view\n• elegant walking pose\n• mirror reflection pose\n\nNegative Prompt:\nlow quality, blurry, bad anatomy, ugly face, different face, duplicate person, extra fingers, watermark, logo, instagram UI, social media icons, cropped image, bad hands, text errors, plastic skin, cartoon, CGI, oversaturated, noise, artifacts, deformed body.",
      "prompt_ko": "((이중괄호)) 강조 문법으로 쌓아올린 K-뷰티 캠페인 프롬프트. 보그코리아/하퍼스바자코리아 톤을 명시적으로 지목한다.\n★시리즈 설계 — **((모든 컷에 동일한 한국 슈퍼모델을 쓸 것))**을 못박고, 맨 아래 ((POSE)) 블록만 컷마다 교체하는 구조(거울 앞 립밤·나무 초콜릿 상자 안에 앉기·디저트컵 들고 웅크리기·제품 클로즈업·상자 안 탑뷰·워킹·거울 반사). 얼굴 일관성을 프롬프트 레벨에서 강제하는 방식.\n컨셉=초콜릿. 의상은 다크초콜릿 오버사이즈 퍼카라 레더재킷·프리미엄 미니드레스·시스루 블랙 스타킹·골드 주얼리, 소품은 초콜릿 디저트컵 또는 화장품. 공간=럭셔리 월넛 우드룸/호텔 스위트, 초콜릿 브라운 팔레트, 골든 레일, 시네마틱 소프트 플래시.\n타이포는 영문 4줄 + **한글 4줄**을 함께 지정('초콜릿처럼 달콤한 순간' 등) — 한글 카피를 프롬프트에 직접 박는 사례. 카메라 블록=Canon EOS R5 / 85mm f/1.2 / RAW / HDR. 네거티브 프롬프트 별도 명시.",
      "gen_prompt": "Ultra-realistic luxury Korean beauty campaign photograph, 8K, Vogue Korea editorial mood. A beautiful Korean model with porcelain glass skin, long glossy black wavy hair, chocolate-glossy lips and soft Korean makeup stands in a luxury walnut wood room — rich wooden wall panels, golden rails, warm chocolate-brown palette, premium hotel suite furnishings. She wears an oversized dark-chocolate leather jacket with a fur collar over a premium mini dress, sheer black stockings, luxury heels and elegant gold jewelry, holding a gourmet chocolate dessert cup. Melted chocolate details and premium cosmetic packaging styled into the composition. Cinematic soft flash lighting with gentle shadows and realistic reflections, expensive editorial photography, generous negative space, minimal luxury branding, magazine advertisement layout. Shot on Canon EOS R5, 85mm f/1.2, shallow depth of field, ultra sharp focus, natural skin texture, cinematic color grading.",
