      "prompt": "Prompt 1:\nMasterpiece, futuristic explorer wearing an oversized orange expedition jacket and mirrored visor reflecting distant landscapes, standing beneath a deep blue twilight sky, cinematic outdoor portrait, luxury adventure aesthetic, advanced survival gear, soft atmospheric lighting, contemporary sci-fi fashion photography, dramatic contrast between cool blue environment and warm orange clothing, visual confidence, hyper realistic materials, premium editorial style, atmospheric depth, museum-quality composition, cinematic color grading, award-winning image, ultra realistic.\n\nPrompt 2:\nMasterpiece, delicate green plant growing inside transparent crystal cubes arranged in geometric space, iridescent rainbow light refracting through glass surfaces, deep black background, futuristic botanical architecture, holographic reflections, luxury design photography, dreamlike technological nature, hyper detailed transparent materials, cinematic illumination, elegant minimalism, optical diffraction effects, atmospheric depth, contemporary gallery installation, visual poetry, premium editorial aesthetic, refined composition, ultra realistic, cinematic color grading, award-winning image.\n\nPrompt 3:\nMasterpiece, futuristic deep-sea diver surrounded by streams of rising bubbles, polished copper diving helmet reflecting underwater light, dark aquatic environment fading into shadow, cinematic underwater photography, warm metallic highlights contrasting against cool blue depths, atmospheric immersion, retro-futuristic exploration aesthetic, luxury sci-fi imagery, hyper realistic materials, dreamlike underwater atmosphere, visual tension, soft volumetric lighting, museum-quality composition, cinematic color grading, award-winning image, ultra realistic.\n\nPrompt 4:\nMasterpiece, futuristic fashion portrait of an androgynous model wearing a sculpted liquid-chrome face mask and an oversized white faux-fur coat, pale platinum hair, glossy porcelain skin, deep black background, luxury couture aesthetic, dramatic studio lighting, metallic reflections dancing across the mask, ultra-premium fashion campaign, cinematic contrast, editorial photography for a futuristic luxury house, rich textures, hyper detailed fur fibers, elegant composition, high-fashion surrealism, polished silver surfaces, visual sophistication, ultra realistic, cinematic color grading, award-winning image.",
      "prompt_ko": "'Masterpiece,'로 시작해 형용구를 쉼표로 길게 나열하는 고전적 문법. 네 컷이 **차가운 환경 × 따뜻한 오브젝트**라는 하나의 대비 원칙을 공유한다.\n1) 미래 탐험가 — 오버사이즈 오렌지 원정 재킷 + 원경을 반사하는 미러 바이저, 짙푸른 황혼 하늘 아래. **차가운 블루 환경 vs 따뜻한 오렌지 의상**의 극적 대비가 핵심.\n2) 크리스탈 식물 — 투명 크리스탈 큐브 안에서 자라는 연한 초록 식물, 유리를 통과하는 무지갯빛 굴절, 순흑 배경. '꿈결 같은 기술적 자연'.\n3) 심해 다이버 — 상승하는 기포 줄기에 둘러싸인 폴리시드 구리 잠수 헬멧, 어둠으로 사라지는 수중 환경. **따뜻한 금속 하이라이트 vs 차가운 청색 심연**.\n4) 리퀴드크롬 — 조각적인 액체 크롬 마스크 + 오버사이즈 화이트 페이크퍼 코트, 플래티넘 헤어, 순흑 배경.\n공통 꼬리표: museum-quality composition / cinematic color grading / award-winning image / ultra realistic.",
      "gen_prompt": "Masterpiece: a futuristic explorer wearing an oversized orange expedition jacket and a mirrored visor that reflects distant landscapes, standing beneath a deep blue twilight sky. Cinematic outdoor portrait with a luxury adventure aesthetic and advanced survival gear, soft atmospheric lighting, contemporary sci-fi fashion photography. Dramatic contrast between the cool blue environment and the warm orange clothing. Hyper-realistic materials, premium editorial style, atmospheric depth, museum-quality composition, cinematic color grading, award-winning image, ultra realistic.",
