      "prompt": "Prompt 1:\nA minimalist designer lounge chair with a rounded seat upholstered in long, shaggy olive-green faux-fur-like fabric with a deep voluminous pile, soft loose strands catching light individually, extremely plush and airy tactile texture, slim matte black metal legs, placed against a solid flat warm beige background with no gradient or texture, soft diffused studio lighting from above creating gentle highlights that catch on the long fluffy fibers and cast tiny soft shadows between strands, subtle soft shadow cast directly below the chair, eye-level camera, slight 3/4 angle, shallow depth of field, clean high-end product photography.\n\nPrompt 2:\nA close-up portrait shot of a person's face and ear wearing a small avant-garde designer earring in sculptural matte olive-green resin with an unconventional organic curved form, delicate compact scale sitting neatly along the earlobe, calm neutral expression, hair pulled back to reveal the ear, standing against a solid flat warm beige background with no gradient or texture, soft diffused studio lighting from above creating gentle highlights on the glossy resin surface, subtle soft shadow cast directly behind, eye-level camera, shallow depth of field, clean high-end fashion product photography.\n\nPrompt 3:\nA close-up shot of a person's feet wearing avant-garde designer sneakers in matte olive-green suede with an unconventional chunky asymmetric sole, sculptural exaggerated silhouette, unexpected panel cutouts and contrasting tonal green leather overlays, paired with ribbed olive-green socks, standing against a solid flat warm beige background with no gradient or texture, soft diffused studio lighting from above creating gentle highlights on the suede and leather textures, subtle soft shadow cast directly below the feet, eye-level camera framing from mid-shin down, shallow depth of field, clean high-end fashion product photography.\n\nPrompt 4:\nA minimalist designer leather backpack with a structured olive-green suede body, slim matte gold buckles, and clean rolled-top silhouette, placed against a solid flat warm beige background with no gradient or texture, soft diffused studio lighting from camera left creating a subtle sheen on the leather texture, soft shadow cast directly below, eye-level camera, slight 3/4 angle, shallow depth of field, clean high-end product photography.",
      "prompt_ko": "★차용 가치가 가장 높은 지점 — **네 개의 다른 제품 컷을 '한 캠페인'으로 묶는 방법.** 피사체만 바꾸고 아래 세 문장을 **토씨까지 그대로 반복**한다:\n① `solid flat warm beige background with no gradient or texture` (그라데이션·질감 명시적 금지)\n② `soft diffused studio lighting from above` (광원 위치 고정)\n③ `subtle soft shadow cast directly below` + `eye-level camera` + `shallow depth of field`\n이렇게 하면 개별 생성이라도 카탈로그처럼 붙는다. 색은 **올리브그린 하나로 통일**.\n1) 라운지체어 — 길고 덥수룩한 올리브그린 페이크퍼 좌면, 가닥 하나하나가 빛을 받고 사이사이 작은 그림자, 슬림 무광 블랙 다리, 3/4 앵글.\n2) 이어링 — 조각적 무광 올리브 레진, 유기적 곡선, 귓불에 딱 맞는 작은 스케일, 머리를 넘겨 귀를 드러냄.\n3) 스니커즈 — 무광 올리브 스웨이드 + 비대칭 청키솔 + 패널 컷아웃 + 톤온톤 그린 레더, 립드 올리브 양말, 정강이 아래 프레이밍.\n4) 백팩 — 구조적 올리브 스웨이드 보디 + 슬림 무광 골드 버클 + 롤탑, 좌측 광원.",
      "gen_prompt": "A minimalist designer lounge chair with a rounded seat upholstered in long, shaggy olive-green faux-fur fabric with a deep voluminous pile, soft loose strands catching light individually, extremely plush and airy tactile texture, on slim matte black metal legs. Placed against a solid flat warm beige background with no gradient and no texture. Soft diffused studio lighting from above creates gentle highlights along the long fluffy fibers and casts tiny soft shadows between the strands, with a subtle soft shadow directly beneath the chair. Eye-level camera at a slight three-quarter angle, shallow depth of field, clean high-end product photography.",
