      "title": "포커스 윈도우 인물 커버 (전체는 흐리고 창 안 한 부위만 선명 — 4방향 템플릿, 9:16)",
      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 on ChatGPT \n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a 9:16 high-end focus-window portrait cover.\n\nTheme: [Custom Title]\nSubject: [Subject Description]\nColor palette: [Color Palette]\nFocus window: [Focus Window Style]\nSupporting text: [Supporting Text]\nYear: 2026\n\nUse one continuous portrait as the base image. Most of the face and body should remain softly blurred, grainy, misted, or motion-softened, while one selected facial fragment inside the window becomes sharp and memorable.\n\nThe focus window must reveal the same aligned portrait, not a second face. Prioritize the eyes, eyebrow, cheekbone, lips, or a narrow half-face section.\n\nUse realistic skin texture, natural hair strands, expressive eyes, soft film grain, subtle paper texture, refined editorial typography, and strong negative space. Keep the text sparse: one dominant title, one subtitle, a few short notes, and 2026.\n\n4 directions:\n\n1. EYE DISTRICT — black-and-white portrait with a red frame revealing the eyes\n\n2. BLUR SIGNAL — deep crimson portrait with a sharp gaze window\n\n3. QUIET TARGET — olive-green haze with a yellow-green eye crop\n\n4. PALE MEMORY — grayscale side profile with a thin white focus window\n\nOverall mood: cinematic, fashion editorial, psychological, refined, modern, and magazine-cover quality.",
      "prompt_ko": "★기법 하나로 성립하는 프롬프트 — **얼굴 대부분을 흐림·그레인·안개·모션블러로 뭉개고, 창(window) 안의 '한 조각'만 선명하게** 만든다. 눈·눈썹·광대·입술 또는 얼굴 절반의 좁은 띠를 우선 선택.\n★가장 중요한 제약 — **창 안은 반드시 같은 인물의 정렬된 부위여야 한다. 두 번째 얼굴이 아니다.** (이 한 줄이 없으면 창 안에 다른 얼굴이 생성되는 사고가 난다.)\n베이스는 연속된 단일 초상 1장. 사실적 피부결·자연스러운 머리카락·표정 있는 눈·소프트 필름그레인·은은한 종이 질감·정제된 에디토리얼 타이포·강한 여백. 텍스트는 희소하게 — 지배적 타이틀 1개 + 서브 1개 + 짧은 노트 몇 개 + 연도.\n변수: Theme / Subject / Color palette / Focus window style / Supporting text.\n4방향 예시: ①EYE DISTRICT(흑백 + 붉은 프레임이 눈을 드러냄) ②BLUR SIGNAL(딥 크림슨 + 날카로운 시선 창) ③QUIET TARGET(올리브그린 헤이즈 + 옐로그린 눈 크롭) ④PALE MEMORY(그레이스케일 측면 + 얇은 흰 창).",
      "gen_prompt": "A 9:16 high-end editorial magazine cover built on a single continuous black-and-white portrait. Most of the face and body stay softly blurred, grainy and misted, while a clean rectangular focus window framed in red reveals one aligned fragment of the same portrait — the eyes — rendered perfectly sharp and memorable. The window shows the same face in correct alignment, never a second face. Realistic skin texture, natural hair strands, expressive eyes, soft film grain and subtle paper texture throughout. Refined editorial typography with strong negative space: one dominant title reading 'EYE DISTRICT', a small subtitle, a few short marginal notes and the year 2026. Cinematic, psychological, refined, modern, magazine-cover quality.",
