      "prompt": "Images Created using ChatGPT \n\nPrompt: Use the girl from the reference image and preserve her exact facial identity, natural features, proportions, hairstyle texture, and overall appearance.\n\nCreate an ultra-realistic vertical 9:16 luxury fashion editorial portrait of an adult Japanese woman seated elegantly in a modern minimalist armchair. Frame her from head to upper thighs, showing the natural silhouette of the outfit. She has long, silky, straight dark hair with a soft center part and realistic natural texture. Her pose is relaxed and graceful, with one shoulder slightly angled, arms naturally resting, and a calm, soft direct gaze into the camera. The mood is elegant, feminine, natural, and effortlessly beautiful.\n\nShe wears a unique ivory-white one-piece dress with a refined asymmetrical halter neckline, soft draped fabric around the neck, subtle ribbed texture, elegant fitted silhouette, and tasteful modern design. The dress should look luxurious, sophisticated, and fashion-forward while remaining tasteful and non-revealing.\n\nSet the scene in a warm minimalist studio or cozy modern interior with soft morning sunlight entering from one side. Create gentle highlights and artistic shadows across her face, hair, skin, and dress. Capture realistic skin pores, fine facial details, natural body proportions, authentic fabric texture, and lifelike lighting.\n\nShot on Sony A7R IV, 85mm f/1.4 lens, cinematic depth of field, premium high-fashion editorial photography, soft warm contrast, natural lighting, ultra-detailed 8K RAW quality.\n\nStrict requirements: preserve the exact face and identity from the reference image, no face alteration, no artificial beauty filter, no excessive skin smoothing, no body distortion, natural realistic proportions, no extra accessories, no text, no logos, no watermark.",
      "prompt_ko": "참조 이미지의 얼굴 정체성·이목구비 비율·헤어 질감을 그대로 보존하도록 먼저 못박은 뒤 장면을 지시하는 구조.\n구도=모던 미니멀 암체어에 앉은 인물을 **머리부터 허벅지 위까지** 프레이밍해 의상 실루엣이 자연스럽게 보이게 한다. 포즈는 한쪽 어깨를 살짝 틀고 팔은 자연스럽게 내린 채 차분한 시선으로 카메라 직시.\n의상=아이보리 화이트 원피스, 비대칭 홀터 넥라인, 목 주변에 부드럽게 드레이프된 원단, 은은한 립 텍스처, 몸에 맞는 실루엣. **'럭셔리하고 세련되되 노출은 없게(tasteful, non-revealing)'** 를 명시.\n공간=따뜻한 미니멀 스튜디오 또는 아늑한 현대적 실내, **한쪽에서 들어오는 아침 햇살**이 얼굴·머리·피부·드레스에 은은한 하이라이트와 회화적 그림자를 만든다.\n디테일 요구=실제 피부 모공, 미세한 얼굴 디테일, 자연스러운 신체 비율, 진짜 원단 질감. 카메라=Sony A7R IV / 85mm f1.4 / 시네마틱 심도 / 8K RAW.\n엄격 금지=얼굴 변형·인위적 뷰티필터·과도한 피부 보정·신체 왜곡·추가 액세서리·텍스트·로고·워터마크.",
      "gen_prompt": "Ultra-realistic vertical 9:16 luxury fashion editorial portrait of an adult East Asian woman seated elegantly in a modern minimalist armchair, framed from head to upper thighs so the natural silhouette of the outfit reads clearly. She has long silky straight dark hair with a soft center part and realistic natural texture. Her pose is relaxed and graceful, one shoulder slightly angled, arms resting naturally, with a calm soft direct gaze into the camera. She wears an ivory-white one-piece dress with a refined asymmetrical halter neckline, softly draped fabric around the neck, subtle ribbed texture and an elegant fitted silhouette — luxurious and fashion-forward while remaining tasteful and non-revealing. The setting is a warm minimalist studio interior with soft morning sunlight entering from one side, creating gentle highlights and artistic shadows across her face, hair, skin and dress. Realistic skin pores, fine facial detail, natural body proportions, authentic fabric texture, lifelike lighting. Shot on a Sony A7R IV with an 85mm f/1.4 lens, cinematic depth of field, soft warm contrast, ultra-detailed 8K RAW quality. No text, no logos, no watermark.",
