      "prompt": "The Art of Paper & Thread 🧵✨\n\nWhat happens when centuries-old traditional art meets next-gen AI?\n\nWe pushed digital modeling into paper quilling, fine crochet lace, and metallic filigree. Every fold, stitch, and shadow tells a story of patience, texture, and pure imagination.\n\n🎞️Visuals generated with Seedream 5.0\n\nPrompt below👇🏾\n\n--- (자기 답글: 프롬프트 원문) ---\nUniversal Plug-in Prompt\n\nCreate an exquisite, highly detailed 3D mixed-media paper craft artwork featuring [MAIN SUBJECT / CHARACTER] in [POSE / ACTION], surrounded by [PRIMARY ENVIRONMENT / STORY ELEMENTS].\n\nConstruct the entire scene from intricate handcrafted materials including [PRIMARY MATERIAL: paper quilling / folded paper / crochet / lace / filigree / embossed paper / layered paper sculpture], with every surface showing visible tactile craftsmanship, precise coils, curled strips, pleated forms, woven fibers, embossed patterns, delicate cutwork, and layered dimensional relief.\n\nThe central figure wears [COSTUME / GARMENT DESCRIPTION], designed with elaborate handcrafted textures and sculptural volume. Add [ACCESSORY / PROP] featuring intricate [FILIGREE / QUILLING / LACE / WIRE / EMBOSSED DETAIL]. Surround the subject with [FLOWERS / TREES / FOLIAGE / ARCHITECTURE / DECORATIVE ELEMENTS], each individually constructed with meticulous handcrafted detail.\n\nBuild strong depth through multiple overlapping layers, substantial paper relief, raised textures, dimensional elements, and subtle cast shadows between each handcrafted component. Preserve a refined balance between [COLOR 1], [COLOR 2], [COLOR 3], and [ACCENT COLOR], creating a cohesive, sophisticated visual palette.\n\nThe background should be [BACKGROUND STYLE / COLOR], allowing the handcrafted sculpture to remain the primary focus. Use [LIGHTING STYLE] with soft dimensional illumination, controlled highlights, and subtle drop shadows that emphasize the depth, texture, and physical construction of the artwork.\n\nThe overall aesthetic should feel like a museum-quality handcrafted paper sculpture blended with [SECONDARY ART STYLE OR MATERIAL], combining elegance, fantasy, cultural atmosphere, and extraordinary artisanal precision. The composition should be carefully balanced, visually rich but uncluttered, with a strong focal point and cinematic storytelling.\n\nUltra-detailed handcrafted textures, intricate micro-details, tactile material realism, dimensional relief, layered construction, sophisticated composition, gallery-quality presentation, dramatic yet refined lighting, premium artistic craftsmanship, realistic paper and textile behavior, subtle shadows, no plastic appearance, no flat digital illustration, no photorealistic rendering.\n\n--ar [ASPECT RATIO]",
      "prompt_ko": "★전통 수공예를 3D로 재현하는 **'범용 플러그인' 템플릿**. 작성자 콘셉트 = *\"수백 년 된 전통 예술이 차세대 AI를 만나면?\"* — 종이 퀼링, 고운 크로셰 레이스, 메탈릭 필리그리를 디지털 모델링으로 밀어붙였다. (작성자는 Seedream 5.0로 생성했다고 밝힘.)\n\n**설계가 완전 템플릿이다.** `[대괄호]` 슬롯을 갈아끼우기만 하면 어떤 주제든 이 수공예 질감으로 나온다. 슬롯: 주제/캐릭터, 포즈, 환경·서사 요소, **주재료**(퀼링/접지/크로셰/레이스/필리그리/엠보싱/레이어드 페이퍼 조각 중 택), 의상, 액세서리+세공 종류, 주변 장식(꽃·나무·건축), 색 3+액센트, 배경, 조명, 2차 아트스타일, 화면비.\n\n★핵심은 **'손맛'을 강제하는 어휘 밀도**다. 모든 표면에 보이는 촉각적 수공예 — 정교한 코일, 말린 종이 띠, 주름 잡힌 형태, 짜인 섬유, 엠보싱 문양, 섬세한 컷워크, 층진 입체 부조 — 를 나열한다. 그리고 **깊이를 물리적으로 쌓으라**고 요구한다: 여러 겹의 중첩 레이어, 두툼한 종이 부조, 솟은 질감, 각 수공예 요소 사이의 은은한 드리운 그림자.\n\n★마감 규칙이 방향을 못박는다 — **박물관급 수공예 종이 조각**의 느낌을 목표로, `no plastic appearance / no flat digital illustration / no photorealistic rendering` 세 가지를 동시에 배제한다. 즉 플라스틱처럼도, 평면 일러스트처럼도, 사진처럼도 아닌 **'진짜 손으로 만든 종이·섬유 물성'** 을 노린다. 종이와 직물의 사실적 거동(realistic paper and textile behavior)을 명시.\n\n※ Krea2 재현 시 --ar은 해상도로 치환. 재료 슬롯을 무엇으로 채우느냐가 결과를 가르는 핵심 변수.",
      "gen_prompt": "An exquisite, highly detailed 3D mixed-media paper craft artwork of a serene crane spreading its wings, surrounded by blooming lotus and reeds. The entire scene is constructed from intricate handcrafted materials — paper quilling, folded paper and fine crochet lace — with every surface showing visible tactile craftsmanship: precise coils, curled paper strips, pleated forms, woven fibers, embossed patterns, delicate cutwork and layered dimensional relief. The crane's body is built from tightly quilled white and ivory coils, its wing feathers as curled paper strips catching light along each edge; the lotus petals are pleated and embossed paper, the reeds thin rolled filigree. Strong depth is built through multiple overlapping layers, substantial paper relief and subtle cast shadows between each handcrafted component. A refined palette balances soft ivory, blush pink and sage green against a gold accent, on a deep muted teal background that lets the sculpture remain the focus. Soft dimensional studio lighting with controlled highlights and gentle drop shadows emphasizes the physical construction. Museum-quality handcrafted paper sculpture aesthetic, elegant and culturally atmospheric, richly detailed yet uncluttered, with realistic paper and textile behavior. No plastic appearance, no flat digital illustration, no photorealistic rendering.",
