      "prompt": "Prompt:\nHere's a high-quality prompt to recreate this poster, but with a deep metallic red finish instead of chrome silver.\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a premium futuristic cyberpunk product poster featuring a floating industrial digital wristwatch suspended in mid-air against a minimalist black-to-dark charcoal gradient background. The watch should have an aggressive mechanical design with oversized bolts, exposed screws, layered armor plating, sharp conical spikes protruding from the bezel and case, heavy-duty metal links, and intricate CNC-machined detailing. Replace the chrome finish with a luxurious deep metallic crimson red anodized titanium surface featuring glossy automotive paint, polished beveled edges, subtle brushed-metal textures, and realistic micro scratches that catch the light naturally.\nThe digital display should emit a vivid neon lime-green glow reading \"05:00\", creating strong contrast against the rich red metal body. The display should feature authentic retro LCD styling with soft internal illumination, subtle bloom, and realistic reflections on the surrounding crystal.\nIlluminate the watch using professional luxury product photography lighting with a large overhead softbox, dramatic rim lights, and controlled studio reflections that accentuate every bevel, spike, and machined surface. Use physically accurate ray tracing, HDRI studio lighting, global illumination, ambient occlusion, and PBR materials to achieve ultra-realistic reflections and depth.\nThe watch should float slightly tilted in a dynamic three-quarter perspective with no visible support. Capture the image using an 85mm full-frame lens for premium product photography compression, maintaining razor-sharp focus across the entire watch while preserving a subtle depth of field. Every screw, brushed surface, engraved marking, chamfered edge, and polished metal component should appear exceptionally detailed.\nMaintain abundant negative space around the product, creating a clean editorial composition suitable for a luxury technology campaign. At the bottom-left, include minimalist white sans-serif typography displaying a fictional creative studio logo and project title in a modern Swiss editorial layout. Add small copyright text and fine-print details at the bottom for a refined commercial poster aesthetic.\nThe overall visual style should blend luxury industrial design, cyberpunk engineering, brutalist aesthetics, high-end CGI, and premium editorial advertising. The final render should resemble a museum-quality commercial campaign with hyper-realistic materials, dramatic studio lighting, cinematic color grading, ultra-clean composition, Octane Render, Redshift, Unreal Engine 5 quality, ray tracing, HDR lighting, 8K resolution, photorealistic, luxury product photography, premium CGI, sharp focus, and world-class industrial design.",
      "prompt_ko": "★원본 포스터를 **재현하되 마감만 변주**하는 접근 — \"크롬 실버 대신 딥 메탈릭 레드로\". 즉 기존 이미지의 구조는 그대로 두고 재질·색만 교체하는 리믹스 문법.\n\n제품 = 공중에 부유하는 산업풍 디지털 손목시계, 미니멀 블랙→다크차콜 그라데이션 배경. 공격적 기계 디자인 — 오버사이즈 볼트, 노출된 나사, 층진 아머 플레이팅, 베젤·케이스에서 돋은 원뿔형 스파이크, 헤비듀티 메탈 링크, 정밀 CNC 디테일.\n\n★마감 변주 — 크롬을 **딥 메탈릭 크림슨 레드 아노다이즈드 티타늄**으로: 글로시 오토모티브 페인트, 폴리시드 베벨 엣지, 은은한 브러시드 메탈 질감, 빛을 받는 사실적 미세 스크래치.\n★디스플레이 — 선명한 네온 라임그린 발광 \"05:00\", 붉은 금속과 강한 대비. 레트로 LCD 스타일·소프트 내부 조명·블룸·크리스탈 반사.\n\n★렌더 지침 — 프로 럭셔리 제품 사진 조명(대형 오버헤드 소프트박스·드라마틱 림라이트·통제된 스튜디오 반사) + **물리적으로 정확한 레이트레이싱·HDRI·전역조명·앰비언트 오클루전·PBR 재질**. 시계는 살짝 기운 3/4 시점으로 지지대 없이 부유, 85mm 풀프레임 렌즈 압축, 전체 샤프 + 은은한 심도.",
