      "prompt": "The world, reimagined through art\n\nGPT image 2 \n\nPrompt:\nA vertical travel poster (4:5 ratio) for [COUNTRY NAME], split into two visual halves.\n\nTOP HALF (on a soft off-white/cream background, with a faint repeating watermark pattern):\n- Bold, hand-brushed/marker-style typography spelling \"[COUNTRY NAME]\" in all caps, centered, in [BRAND COLOR — e.g. deep forest green / navy blue], filling most of the width\n- A thin horizontal double-line divider below the title, in a muted accent color (e.g. brick red / gold), with a small centered national or cultural emblem (e.g. national eagle crest, olive branch, or country-specific icon) breaking the line\n- Below that, a short italic-serif tagline in dark gray, two centered lines, evocative and poetic, describing the country's spirit (e.g. \"A land of [X], [Y], and [Z]\")\n\nBOTTOM HALF (photorealistic cinematic landscape, seamlessly emerging from the top background):\n- A wide establishing shot combining the country's most iconic natural backdrop (mountains/coastline/countryside) with its most famous historic skyline or old-town architecture on the right side, softly lit, golden-hour or clear daylight\n- On the left, a body of water (river, sea, or lake) with a small traditional boat and figures\n- A cobblestone or stone-paved foreground shaped like a small floating \"island\" or diorama tile, with visible rough-cut rock edges (as if a chunk of the scene was lifted out), fading to transparency at the edges\n- On this stone foreground: a culturally iconic mode of transport or human activity (e.g. a horse-drawn carriage, locals walking, café tables with umbrellas), plus small period-appropriate figures in the background\n- A tall flagpole flying the country's national flag, positioned near a landmark building\n- The country's most recognizable historic building/monument/cathedral rendered in fine architectural detail on the right, with colorful traditional row-house facades beside it\n- A winding, glowing \"paint river\" effect: a ribbon of flowing, glossy paint-like liquid in the exact colors of the national flag (2-3 colors, following the flag's actual color order), cascading from the background road/path down through the foreground and off the edge of the stone tile, with visible brush-stroke/marbling texture\n\nLIGHTING & FINISH: soft cinematic color grade, high detail, subtle vignette, professional travel-poster composition, seamless blend between the flat title background and the photorealistic scene below.",
      "prompt_ko": "★같은 작성자의 다른 여행포스터 문법 — 어제 담은 '전경·중경·배경 3층'과 달리 이건 **상하 2분할 + 떠있는 디오라마 타일** 구조.\n\n**상단 절반** (옅은 오프화이트/크림 배경 + 은은한 반복 워터마크):\n- [국가명]을 굵은 손브러시/마커 타이포 대문자로 중앙, [브랜드컬러: 딥포레스트그린/네이비]로 폭을 채움\n- 그 아래 얇은 이중선 구분선(뮤트 액센트: 브릭레드/골드) + 중앙에 국가 상징(독수리 문장·올리브 가지 등)이 선을 끊음\n- 그 아래 이탤릭 세리프 태그라인 2줄, 다크그레이, 시적으로 그 나라의 정신을 묘사\n\n**하단 절반** (상단 배경에서 이음매 없이 이어지는 실사 시네마틱 풍경):\n- 가장 상징적인 자연 배경(산/해안/전원) + 우측에 유명 역사 스카이라인/구시가 건축, 골든아워\n- 좌측에 물(강/바다/호수) + 작은 전통 배와 인물들\n- ★핵심 장치 — 전경이 **작은 떠있는 '섬'/디오라마 타일**: 자갈·석재 포장이 거친 절단 암석 가장자리를 가진 채(장면 한 조각을 들어낸 듯) 가장자리로 갈수록 투명하게 페이드\n- 그 돌 전경 위에 문화적 상징 교통수단/활동(마차·카페 테이블) + 시대적 인물들\n- 랜드마크 건물 옆 국기 게양대",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical travel poster (4:5) for Greece, split into two halves. TOP HALF on a soft cream background with a faint repeating watermark: bold hand-brushed marker-style typography spelling 'GREECE' in all caps, centered, in deep navy blue filling most of the width; below it a thin horizontal double-line divider in muted gold with a small centered olive-branch emblem breaking the line; beneath that a short italic-serif tagline in dark gray, two centered poetic lines about the country's spirit. BOTTOM HALF is a photorealistic cinematic landscape emerging seamlessly from the cream background: a wide establishing shot of white-washed cliffside architecture and blue domes on the right under golden-hour light, the Aegean sea on the left with a small traditional fishing boat and tiny figures. In the foreground a small floating diorama 'island' — cobblestone paving with visibly rough-cut rock edges, as if a chunk of the scene was lifted out, fading to transparency at the edges; on this stone tile sit café tables with umbrellas and small period-appropriate figures, and a tall flagpole flies the national flag near a landmark. Fine architectural detail, warm colour, refined travel-magazine composition.",
