      "prompt": "GPT image on chatgpt\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate an ultra-luxury Chinese-inspired perfume editorial campaign featuring a premium matte ivory perfume bottle named \"[PRODUCT NAME]\" as the hero of the composition.\n\n[POSE / SCENE]\n\nA sophisticated Asian-inspired luxury aesthetic with deep burgundy silk, rich crimson tones, warm amber lighting, elegant black patent stilettos, polished mahogany furniture, subtle oriental architecture elements, soft incense smoke, golden sunlight beams, cinematic luxury atmosphere.\n\nThe model wears a flowing wine-red satin dress with graceful posing that feels romantic, mysterious and timeless. Focus on elegance rather than exposure. Capture only the necessary body framing to create desire and luxury.\n\nDecorate the composition with authentic gold Chinese calligraphy (different in every image), a traditional red seal stamp, minimalist luxury typography, delicate hanging silk ribbons, subtle lantern glow reflections, and premium editorial spacing.\n\nUse different romantic Chinese phrases in every image such as:\n\n「一见倾心」\nLove at First Sight\n\n「为你心动」\nMy Heart Beats for You\n\n「爱意蔓延」\nLove Lingers\n\n「醉于你」\nDrunk on You\n\n「余生有你」\nYou Are My Forever\n\n「相思成诗」\nLonging Becomes Poetry\n\nAdd elegant English luxury copy beneath the Chinese typography:\n\n• Love Begins With A Scent.\n• Every Breath Finds You.\n• Fall Deeper. Stay Forever.\n• Where Hearts Remember.\n• A Fragrance Worth Missing.\n• Love Never Leaves.\n• Drunk On Your Presence.\n• Forever Starts With One Breath.\n\nLuxury Chinese perfume campaign, cinematic editorial photography, Vogue China Beauty, Harper's Bazaar China, Dior Beauty campaign, Tom Ford fragrance aesthetics, premium Asian luxury branding, photorealistic, museum-quality lighting, soft volumetric light, creamy bokeh, realistic skin texture, physically accurate reflections, premium color grading, ultra-detailed, 8K, HDR, masterpiece.\n\nNegative Prompt:\nInstagram UI, social media icons, ChatGPT text, watermark, logo, low quality, blurry, AI artifacts, extra fingers, bad anatomy, distorted limbs, cheap advertisement, cartoon, CGI, oversaturated colors, bad typography, cropped bottle, plastic skin, noisy background.",
      "prompt_ko": "무광 아이보리 향수병을 히어로로 한 초럭셔리 중국풍 향수 캠페인. `[PRODUCT NAME]`·`[POSE/SCENE]`만 갈아끼운다.\n\n미학 = 딥 버건디 실크·리치 크림슨·따뜻한 앰버 조명·검정 페이턴트 스틸레토·폴리시드 마호가니 가구·은은한 동양 건축 요소·향 연기·황금 햇살 빔. 모델은 와인레드 새틴 드레스, **우아함이 노출보다 우선**(욕망과 럭셔리를 만드는 최소 프레이밍만).\n\n★장식 장치 — **진짜 금색 중국 서예**(이미지마다 다르게) + 전통 홍색 인장 + 미니멀 럭셔리 타이포 + 걸린 실크 리본 + 등롱 글로우 반사. 中英 이중 카피가 시그니처:\n- 「一见倾心」Love at First Sight / 「为你心动」My Heart Beats for You / 「爱意蔓延」Love Lingers / 「醉于你」Drunk on You / 「余生有你」You Are My Forever / 「相思成诗」Longing Becomes Poetry\n- 영문: Love Begins With A Scent / Every Breath Finds You / Fall Deeper. Stay Forever 등\n\n무드 레퍼런스로 Vogue China·Dior Beauty·Tom Ford를 지목. ※한자·영문 조판은 Krea2에서 깨질 수 있어 방침대로 타이포는 자리만(정밀 글자는 Figma).",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-luxury Chinese-inspired perfume editorial campaign, vertical. A premium matte ivory perfume bottle is the hero of the composition, set in a sophisticated Asian luxury aesthetic: deep burgundy silk drapery, rich crimson tones, warm amber lighting, polished mahogany furniture, subtle oriental architecture elements, soft incense smoke and golden sunlight beams. An elegant model in a flowing wine-red satin dress poses with romantic, mysterious, timeless grace — elegance over exposure, only the framing needed to create desire and luxury. The composition is decorated with authentic gold Chinese calligraphy, a traditional red seal stamp, minimalist luxury typography, delicate hanging silk ribbons and subtle lantern-glow reflections, with premium editorial spacing. Cinematic luxury atmosphere in the spirit of a Vogue China beauty campaign: photorealistic, soft volumetric light, creamy bokeh, realistic skin texture, physically accurate reflections, premium color grading, ultra-detailed, 8K.",
