      "title": "파파라치 스마트폰 리얼리즘 — \"카메라 결함 목록\"으로 진짜 사진을 위조하는 문법 (레퍼런스 얼굴 보존 + 야간 플래시)",
      "prompt": "Use the person from the reference image. Preserve the face, identity, skin tone, facial proportions, hairstyle, and expression with near-perfect accuracy. The person must remain instantly recognizable.\n\nCreate an ultra-photorealistic smartphone photograph that looks like an accidentally leaked paparazzi shot captured during a secret midnight beach escape.  The scene feels completely unscripted.  She has just stepped out of the ocean and is walking slowly across reflective black wet sand, laughing naturally while turning her head away from the camera as if she has just noticed someone secretly taking her photo.  An oversized white linen shirt clings naturally to her body from seawater, partially transparent only where physically realistic. The shirt is loose, wrinkled, wind-blown, casually unbuttoned, with one shoulder slipping down naturally.  Her extremely long wet hair explodes dramatically in the strong ocean wind, with hundreds of loose strands illuminated by the flash. Tiny droplets of seawater fly through the air around her like floating crystals.  \n\nThe camera is handheld at waist level with a slight Dutch angle, creating the feeling that the photographer was quickly hiding while taking the shot.  \n\nA harsh flagship smartphone LED flash freezes her perfectly while the background remains almost completely black.  The dark ocean disappears into the night. Only faint moon reflections shimmer across distant waves.  The wet sand behaves like a natural mirror, producing beautiful distorted reflections beneath her feet.  \n\nInclude authentic smartphone imperfections: • slight autofocus hunting • natural handheld shake • motion blur only in flying hair • realistic HDR • compressed smartphone texture • high ISO grain • sensor noise • tiny water droplets on the lens • subtle lens flare • slight overexposure on the white shirt • realistic skin pores • imperfect framing • accidental composition  No posing. No fashion shoot feeling. No studio lighting.  The final image should feel like an exclusive celebrity photo accidentally captured by paparazzi before it was deleted from someone's phone.  \n\nLuxury editorial realism mixed with raw documentary photography.  Impossible to distinguish from a real smartphone photograph.",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-photorealistic smartphone photograph that looks like an accidentally leaked candid shot captured during a midnight walk on a beach. A woman in a loose oversized white linen shirt and rolled trousers walks slowly across reflective black wet sand, laughing naturally while turning her head away from the camera as if she has just noticed someone taking her photo. The scene feels completely unscripted. Her long hair blows dramatically in the strong ocean wind, hundreds of loose strands lit by the flash; tiny seawater droplets fly through the air like floating crystals. The camera is handheld at waist level with a slight Dutch angle. A harsh flagship smartphone LED flash freezes her while the background falls almost completely black — the dark ocean disappears into night, only faint moon reflections shimmer on distant waves, and the wet sand behaves like a mirror. Authentic smartphone imperfections: slight autofocus hunting, natural handheld shake, motion blur only in the flying hair, realistic HDR, compressed smartphone texture, high ISO grain, sensor noise, tiny water droplets on the lens, subtle lens flare, slight overexposure on the white shirt, realistic skin pores, imperfect framing, accidental composition. No posing, no fashion-shoot feeling, no studio lighting. Luxury editorial realism mixed with raw documentary photography.",
      "prompt_ko": "★진짜 값어치는 피사체가 아니라 **\"카메라 결함을 목록으로 나열해 진짜 사진을 위조하는\" 문법**이다. 이 블록만 떼어 어떤 장면에도 이식할 수 있다:\n\n```\n• slight autofocus hunting   • natural handheld shake\n• motion blur only in [특정 요소]  • realistic HDR\n• compressed smartphone texture   • high ISO grain / sensor noise\n• tiny water droplets on the lens • subtle lens flare\n• slight overexposure on [밝은 옷]  • realistic skin pores\n• imperfect framing              • accidental composition\n```\n\n- **\"모션블러를 어디에만 넣을지\"를 지정**하는 게 핵심(`motion blur only in flying hair`). 전체 블러는 실패한 사진처럼 보이지만, 한 요소에만 걸리면 **셔터가 실제로 열려 있었다는 증거**가 된다.\n- 부정형 3종이 연출 티를 지운다: `No posing. No fashion shoot feeling. No studio lighting.`\n- 조명 구조: **강한 스마트폰 LED 플래시로 피사체를 얼리고 배경은 완전히 검게** → 야간 스냅의 물리를 그대로 재현.\n- 첫 문단은 별도 문법 — 레퍼런스 이미지의 **얼굴·정체성·피부톤·비율·헤어·표정을 보존**하라는 지시. i2i 계열에서 재사용 가능([[project_face_swap_consistency]] 계열과 같은 목적).\n\n※`gen_prompt`는 원문의 신체 노출 지시(젖어서 비치는 셔츠·어깨 흘러내림)를 빼고 중립적으로 재구성했다. **이 프롬프트에서 배울 것은 결함 목록 문법이지 피사체가 아니다.** 원문은 `prompt`에 그대로 보존.",
