      "title": "JSON 스타일시트 + swap 5필드 — 3D 카툰 캐릭터를 실사 경기장에 합성하는 \"차원 불일치를 무기로\" 포스터",
      "prompt": "Copy the whole block, swap only the 5 fields at the bottom:\n\n{\n  \"style\": \"mixed-dimension-composite-sports-poster\",\n  \"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n  \"style_rules\": {\n    \"character\": \"one exaggerated 3D cartoon athlete, Pixar/game-IP grade: oversized head, puffy muscles, flushed red cheeks, fierce expression, superhero proportions\",\n    \"environment\": \"photorealistic stadium: textured crowd, arena floodlights, wet reflective floor, venue signage — realism level completely different from the character, composited as one seamless scene\",\n    \"headline\": \"two-word imperative, huge condensed block letters, word 1 purple #7B2FBE, word 2 fluorescent lime #C6FF00 — EXACTLY the character's jersey colors\",\n    \"jersey_rule\": \"uniform uses only the two headline colors; the character grew out of the brand, not labeled by it\",\n    \"lightning_block\": \"one red-orange diagonal lightning shape slashing behind the character\",\n    \"foreground_prop\": \"one sport prop in extreme close-up forced perspective, bigger than the character's head, thrusting at camera\",\n    \"label\": \"bottom-right diagonal orange strip, white text: event name + issue code\",\n    \"lighting\": \"arena floodlight key + rim light, cartoon character receives realistic lighting and casts real shadows on the wet floor\"\n  },\n  \"negative\": \"fully realistic athlete, fully cartoon background, flat illustration, pastel palette, white background, motion blur, extra characters, brand logos\",\n  \"swap\": {\n    \"SPORT\": \"ice hockey\",\n    \"HEADLINE\": \"BREAK ICE\",\n    \"CHARACTER\": \"burly cartoon hockey player mid-slapshot, helmet tilted, gritted teeth\",\n    \"PROP\": \"battered stick blade and flying puck in extreme close-up, ice spray frozen mid-air\",\n    \"EVENT\": \"FROST LEAGUE FINAL\"\n  }\n}",
      "gen_prompt": "A mixed-dimension composite sports poster, 4:5 vertical. One exaggerated 3D cartoon ice-hockey player mid-slapshot — Pixar / game-IP grade, oversized head, puffy muscles, flushed red cheeks, fierce gritted teeth, helmet tilted, superhero proportions — composited into a fully photorealistic arena: textured crowd, arena floodlights, wet reflective floor, venue signage. The realism levels are deliberately different yet fused into one seamless scene, the cartoon character receiving realistic floodlight key and rim light and casting a real shadow on the wet floor. Behind him, one red-orange diagonal lightning shape slashes across the frame. A huge condensed two-word block headline reads BREAK ICE — the first word in deep purple, the second in fluorescent lime, exactly matching his jersey colors, so the character looks grown out of the brand rather than labelled by it. In extreme close-up forced perspective a battered stick blade and a flying puck thrust toward the camera, larger than his head, ice spray frozen mid-air. A diagonal orange strip at the bottom right carries small white text. No fully realistic athlete, no fully cartoon background, no flat illustration, no pastel palette, no motion blur.",
      "prompt_ko": "★구조가 그대로 **JSON 스타일시트**다. 작성자 안내: *\"Copy the whole block, swap only the 5 fields at the bottom\"* — 상단 `style_rules`는 고정, 하단 `swap` 5칸(SPORT/HEADLINE/CHARACTER/PROP/EVENT)만 교체.\n\n★기획 의도가 날카롭다 — *\"Cartoon characters on real photos look cheap. Everyone knows that. These 4 posters weaponize it.\"* **차원 불일치를 숨기지 않고 무기로 쓴다.** 그래서 규칙이 \"realism level completely different from the character, **composited as one seamless scene**\"로 적힌다.\n\n- **색 규칙이 서사를 만든다**: 헤드라인 두 단어의 색 = 유니폼 두 색. 주석까지 달려 있다 — *\"the character grew out of the brand, not labeled by it\"*(브랜드가 캐릭터에 붙은 게 아니라 캐릭터가 브랜드에서 자라났다). 로고 없이 브랜딩하는 법.\n- **합성을 믿게 만드는 한 줄**: 카툰 캐릭터가 *실사 조명을 받고 젖은 바닥에 진짜 그림자를 드리운다.* 이 한 줄이 \"붙여넣기\"와 \"합성\"을 가른다.\n- 전경 소품은 **캐릭터 머리보다 크게**, 카메라를 향해 돌진하는 강제 원근. 깊이를 만드는 상수.\n- `negative`에 **\"fully realistic athlete\"와 \"fully cartoon background\"를 동시에** 넣어 양쪽으로 미끄러지는 걸 막는다. 혼합 스타일에서 반드시 필요한 이중 차단.",
