      "prompt": "Pencil strokes, endless imagination ✏️\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a hyper-realistic monochromatic graphite pencil sketch of [SUBJECT/CHARACTER] in a [POSE/ACTION]. Include detailed facial features, expressive emotions, and [KEY ELEMENTS/PROPS]. Use realistic pencil shading with smooth gradients, deep contrasts, sharp highlights, and soft shadows to create a convincing 3D illusion. Render the artwork on textured off-white drawing paper placed on a [SURFACE/SETTING] with realistic perspective. Add a subtle drop shadow and include a [HAND/PENCIL/ARTIST ELEMENT] to create the feeling of a live sketching process.",
      "gen_prompt": "A hyper-realistic monochromatic graphite pencil sketch of a wolf mid-howl on a rocky outcrop, with detailed fur texture, expressive intensity and a few scattered pine needles around it. Realistic pencil shading with smooth gradients, deep contrasts, sharp highlights and soft shadows create a convincing three-dimensional illusion on the page. The artwork sits on textured off-white drawing paper laid on a warm wooden desk, seen in realistic perspective with a subtle drop shadow under the sheet. A hand holding a graphite pencil enters from the lower right, mid-stroke, so the scene reads as a live sketching process rather than a finished scan. Sharp macro detail on the paper tooth and the graphite grain.",
      "prompt_ko": "★템플릿형. 치환 슬롯 4개만 갈면 된다 — `[SUBJECT/CHARACTER]` `[POSE/ACTION]` `[KEY ELEMENTS/PROPS]` `[SURFACE/SETTING]` `[HAND/PENCIL/ARTIST ELEMENT]`.\n\n★배울 것은 **\"그림\"이 아니라 \"그리는 중인 장면\"을 만드는 4장치**다. 이게 없으면 그냥 스캔한 드로잉이 되고, 있으면 사진이 된다:\n1. **질감 있는 오프화이트 도화지** — 종이가 흰 배경이 아니라 물체가 된다\n2. **놓인 표면과 원근**(`placed on a [SURFACE] with realistic perspective`) — 평면이 공간에 들어간다\n3. **종이 밑 드롭섀도** — 두께와 접지감\n4. **손/연필의 난입** — 시간축이 생긴다(\"완성품\"이 아니라 \"진행 중\")\n\n- 음영 규칙은 4단으로 못 박는다: 매끈한 그라데이션 + 깊은 대비 + 날카로운 하이라이트 + 부드러운 그림자 → *\"convincing 3D illusion\"*. 연필 그림이 밋밋해지는 걸 막는 최소 세트.\n- 어떤 매체(수채·목탄·펜)로도 같은 4장치를 그대로 옮길 수 있다.",
