      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 on ChatGPT \n\nPROMPT ⬇\n\nUltra-realistic running campaign magazine cover featuring an athletic Korean woman mid-stride on a misty mountain trail, wearing On Running Cloudmonster shoes in glacier-white colorway, CloudTec sole pods visible mid-impact, full athletic running gear — On performance tights and windbreaker jacket. Powerful athletic expression, sweat-kissed glowing skin, hair loose and windswept. Background: dramatic Swiss alpine trail at sunrise — pink and gold sky, morning mist in valley below, motion blur on background only. \"RUNNER'S WORLD\" masthead in bold blue athletic sans-serif. 35mm lens motion capture feel, ultra-detailed CloudTec sole and trail terrain impact, 8K photorealistic outdoor athletic. \n\nNegative: cartoon, blurry, static pose, watermark, incorrect shoe design.",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-realistic running campaign magazine cover: an athletic woman mid-stride on a misty mountain trail, caught at the exact moment of impact. She wears white performance running shoes whose cushioning pods are clearly visible compressing under the strike, plus full running tights and a lightweight windbreaker. Powerful athletic expression, sweat-glowing skin, hair loose and windswept. Background: a dramatic alpine trail at sunrise — pink and gold sky, morning mist filling the valley below — with motion blur applied to the background only, keeping the runner and the shoe razor sharp. A bold blue athletic sans-serif masthead sits across the top. 35mm motion-capture feel, ultra-detailed sole geometry and trail terrain at the point of impact, 8K photorealistic outdoor athletic photography. No cartoon, no static pose, no watermark.",
      "prompt_ko": "★제품 광고의 급소를 하나로 압축한 프롬프트 — **기술 디테일을 '충격 순간'에 고정한다.**\n\n핵심 구절: *\"CloudTec sole pods visible **mid-impact**\"* — 신발을 예쁘게 보여주는 게 아니라 **밑창이 눌리는 물리적 순간**을 잡으라고 지시한다. 제품의 기술이 작동하는 찰나가 곧 광고다.\n\n★두 번째 장치 — **모션블러를 배경에만.** `motion blur on background only`. 이 한 줄로 속도감과 제품 선예도를 동시에 얻는다. 전체에 블러를 걸면 광고로서 죽는다.\n\n- 커버 문법: 매스트헤드를 색·서체까지 지정(볼드 블루 애슬레틱 산세리프)해 잡지 포맷을 확정.\n- 환경이 인물의 성격을 대신 말한다: 새벽 알파인 트레일 + 핑크골드 하늘 + 계곡의 아침 안개.\n- 네거티브에 `incorrect shoe design`을 넣은 게 실전적 — 제품 광고에서 AI가 가장 자주 망치는 지점.\n※ 원문의 실브랜드·실모델명은 `prompt`에 보존하고 `gen_prompt`에서는 일반명으로 치환했다.",
