      "prompt": "GPT image 2 on ChatGPT \n\nBrand Name :\nProduct Name :\nPrice :\n\nCreate a promotional poster using the uploaded photo. Do not alter the product, logo, packaging, shape, texture, or colors in any way. Arrange the products on minimalist white pedestals with a layered composition to create a more premium look and enhance visual depth. Adjust the camera angle to make the products appear more attractive, tempting, and appetizing.\n\nInclude a header featuring the brand/store name, an automatically generated tagline, the product name, and a dedicated description for each product consisting of at least three sentences.\n\nUse a pure white background with clean studio lighting and soft, natural shadows. Leave sufficient negative space to maintain an elegant and uncluttered layout. Add a three-sentence promotional description, include a price label, and use minimalist, modern, elegant typography with a soft, refined appearance rather than a rigid style.\n\nAspect Ratio: 4:5.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium promotional poster for a small artisan skincare line, 4:5. Three product bottles are arranged on minimalist white pedestals of different heights in a layered composition that builds visual depth, shot from a slightly low camera angle that makes them look taller and more tempting. The products themselves are pristine and untouched — clean labels, exact packaging shapes, crisp material texture. Pure white background with clean studio lighting and soft natural shadows pooling at the base of each pedestal. A header carries the store name and a short tagline; beside each product sits its name and a small three-line description, with a discreet price label. Generous negative space keeps the layout elegant and uncluttered. Minimalist modern typography, soft and refined rather than rigid.",
      "prompt_ko": "★업로드 이미지 기반 광고의 **분업 지시**가 요점이다. 첫 문장이 경계선을 긋는다 — *\"Do not alter the product, logo, packaging, shape, texture, or colors in any way.\"* **제품은 건드리지 말고, 그 주변(받침대·구도·각도·카피·조판)만 만들어라.**\n\nAI에게 제품 사진을 주면 슬그머니 라벨을 다시 그리고 병 모양을 바꾼다. 그 실패를 원천 차단하는 한 줄.\n\n★깊이를 만드는 두 장치:\n- **높이가 다른 흰 받침대 + 레이어드 배치** — 나열이 아니라 계단으로 놓아 깊이를 만든다\n- **카메라 각도를 제품이 더 매력적으로 보이게 조정**(`more attractive, tempting, appetizing`) — 구도를 AI에게 위임하는 대신 **목표 형용사**를 준다\n\n- 텍스트 생성까지 위임한다: 태그라인 자동 생성 + 제품별 **최소 3문장** 설명 + 가격 라벨. \"자동 생성\"으로 두면 카피까지 한 번에 나온다.\n- 조판 톤을 형용사로 못 박음: *\"minimalist, modern, elegant … soft, refined rather than rigid\"*.\n※ Krea2는 업로드 기반 i2i가 아니라 텍스트 재구성이므로, 제품 보존 규칙의 효과는 이 재현으로는 검증되지 않는다.",
