      "prompt": "Creating geometric posters with your photo in GPT Image2..\nPrompt :\nVertical bizarre flat cartoon portrait of [a man from the attached photo] with a high geometric head shape, a long narrow neck, huge round eyes, a tiny mouth and an unflappable laugh, dressed in [clothes from the photo], with a capybara sitting on his head like a living hat. Pure black outline, smooth color scheme, simple face shapes, rare drawings on animal fur or skin, playful surreal character design, bold graphic palette [blue]. Background decorations: [New York City street decorations are made using simplified shapes, clear depth, a small number of landscapes from the environment and a clear cartoon perspective. Clear digital illustration, vertical framing in the form of a poster, no realism, no 3D rendering, no picturesque shading, aspect ratio 4:5.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical bizarre flat cartoon portrait of a young man with a tall geometric head shape, a long narrow neck, huge round eyes, a tiny mouth and an unflappable grin, dressed in a mustard corduroy jacket, with a capybara sitting on his head like a living hat. Pure black outlines throughout, smooth flat colour fills, simple face shapes, sparse line details on the animal's fur, playful surreal character design, a bold graphic palette built on blue. Background decoration: New York City street elements rendered as simplified shapes with clear depth — a few water towers, fire escapes and a yellow cab reduced to flat geometry, in clean cartoon perspective. Clear digital illustration, vertical poster framing, 4:5. No realism, no 3D rendering, no painterly shading.",
      "prompt_ko": "★얼굴을 **기하 도형의 조합으로 재정의**하는 지시가 스타일의 전부다:\n- **높은 기하 두상**(high geometric head shape)\n- **길고 좁은 목**(long narrow neck)\n- **거대한 둥근 눈**(huge round eyes)\n- **아주 작은 입**(tiny mouth)\n- **태연한 웃음**(unflappable laugh)\n\n이 5개 비율만 고정하면 어떤 얼굴을 넣어도 같은 캐릭터 언어로 수렴한다. 사진 → 캐릭터 변환 템플릿.\n\n★기억점 장치는 **머리 위의 동물을 '살아있는 모자'로**(`a capybara sitting on his head like a living hat`). 초현실 한 스푼이 평범한 초상을 굿즈로 만든다. 동물만 갈아끼우면 시리즈가 된다.\n\n- 렌더 규칙 4개: **순수 검정 아웃라인** / 매끈한 플랫 컬러 / 단순한 얼굴 형태 / 동물 털에만 드문 선 디테일. 명암을 아예 배제해 그래픽으로 민다.\n- 배경 규칙이 좋다 — 도시를 **단순 도형으로 환원**하되 *\"명확한 깊이와 또렷한 카툰 원근\"*을 유지. 평면인데 공간이 있는 상태.\n- 금지 3종으로 스타일을 지킨다: `no realism, no 3D rendering, no picturesque shading`.",
