      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on Chatgpt \n\nPrompt:\nUltra-cinematic golden hour portrait of a beautiful young woman sitting by the window inside a moving train, wrapped in an oversized charcoal knit sweater, long naturally tousled dark hair illuminated by warm sunlight, soft relaxed expression with subtle smile, candid lifestyle photography. Rich golden-hour sunlight streams through the train window, creating soft highlights across her face and hair while the cabin falls into deep cinematic shadows. Vintage train interior with passengers softly blurred in the background, warm practical lights glowing overhead, dreamy atmosphere, subtle window reflections, shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh, realistic skin texture, natural imperfections, soft bloom, Kodak Portra 400 film aesthetic, muted earthy color grading, gentle film grain, authentic travel mood, intimate storytelling composition, Leica M11, 50mm Summilux f/1.4, f/1.4, HDR, ultra-photorealistic, editorial fashion photography, award-winning travel portrait, 8K.",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-cinematic golden-hour portrait of a young woman sitting by the window inside a moving train, wrapped in an oversized charcoal knit sweater, her long naturally tousled dark hair lit by warm sunlight, a soft relaxed expression with a subtle smile. Rich golden-hour light streams through the train window and creates soft highlights across her face and hair while the rest of the cabin falls into deep cinematic shadow. Vintage train interior with passengers softly blurred in the background, warm practical lights glowing overhead, subtle reflections on the window glass. Shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh, realistic skin texture with natural imperfections, soft bloom, Kodak Portra 400 film aesthetic, muted earthy grading, gentle grain, intimate travel storytelling, 50mm f/1.4 look, ultra-photorealistic.",
      "prompt_ko": "★조명 설계 한 줄이 이 사진의 전부다 — **\"창으로 들어온 빛이 얼굴과 머리카락에 하이라이트를 만들고, 객실의 나머지는 깊은 시네마틱 그림자로 떨어진다.\"**\n\n빛을 넣는 게 아니라 **나머지를 어둡게 하는 것**이 요령이다. 객실 전체가 밝으면 스냅사진이 되고, 창가만 밝으면 초상이 된다.\n\n★공간을 증명하는 요소 3개:\n- **흐릿한 승객들**(passengers softly blurred) — 사람이 있어야 기차 안이 된다\n- **머리 위의 실용 조명**(warm practical lights glowing overhead) — 객실 천장의 백열등\n- **창유리 반사**(subtle window reflections) — 유리가 유리로 보이게\n\n- 필름 스택으로 톤을 잠근다: `Kodak Portra 400` + `muted earthy grading` + `gentle film grain` + `soft bloom`. 디지털 선명함을 덜어내는 조합.\n- 라이브러리의 **유리 계열 4번째** — 쇼윈도 반사([[taaruk-through-glass-reflection-street-portrait]]) / 빗방울 창([[missdelulu9-rain-speckled-window-goldenhour-portrait]]) / 차창 측광([[kingofdairyque-backseat-goldenhour-candid-selfie]]) / **기차 창가(이 항목)**. 네 개를 나란히 두면 \"유리를 사이에 둔 초상\"의 변주 카탈로그가 된다.",
