      "prompt": "Create a 3×3 grid of premium social media promotional graphics for a specialty tea brand called “CHAGO (茶果).” Use a modern Asian tea-house aesthetic with a soft pastel pink and deep forest green color palette, elegant studio lighting, geometric pedestals, and surreal creative photography. Feature iced teas, milk teas, fruit beverages, boba drinks, and signature flavors with artistic compositions, fresh fruits, bamboo, and minimalist props. Include clean luxury typography, brand-focused layouts, and concepts like Jasmine Milk Tea, Grapefruit Citrus Tea, Coconut Shaken Espresso, Peach Oolong, and Aged Milk Tea. The overall style should feel sophisticated, refreshing, premium, and visually striking like a high-end beverage campaign.",
