      "prompt": "Motion Blur\n\nMidjourney prompt:\nA warm film street portrait at golden hour, young woman standing perfectly sharp and still with a quiet confident expression, sun-bleached blonde hair, simple white outfit, the crowd rushing around her dissolved into long-exposure ghostly motion streaks, she is the only crisp point in a blur of warm movement, soft overexposed analog grain, honey and amber tones, cinematic and editorial --ar 4:5 --raw --profile hq8ipax --stylize 180 --weird 4 --hd --preview",
