      "prompt": "Exploring the soul of Romania 🇷🇴\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a highly detailed vintage scrapbook-style travel journal for [COUNTRY/DESTINATION] on an aged parchment background with torn paper edges, traditional cultural patterns, vintage postage stamps, handwritten notes, maps, and travel memorabilia. Place a central digital tablet showing the destination's most iconic landscapes, landmarks, architecture, and natural wonders, with a hand holding a white stylus appearing to draw or refine the artwork. Surround the tablet with the country's traditional cuisine, drinks, local crafts, cultural symbols, and wildlife arranged in an elegant collage. Add a bold travel title reading \"[COUNTRY] — [INSPIRING TAGLINE]\", a travel checklist of famous places, vintage compass, signposts, musical instruments, and fine line-art sketches of iconic landmarks along the borders. Use a warm earthy color palette, cinematic lighting, ultra-realistic textures, intricate details, premium editorial travel-poster aesthetic, balanced composition, 8K photorealistic quality.",
      "gen_prompt": "A highly detailed vintage scrapbook-style travel journal spread on an aged parchment background with torn paper edges, traditional folk patterns, vintage postage stamps, handwritten notes, old maps and travel memorabilia. At the centre lies a digital tablet displaying the destination's most iconic landscapes, castles and mountain scenery, with a hand holding a white stylus appearing to draw and refine the artwork on screen. Around the tablet, the country's traditional cuisine, drinks, local crafts, cultural symbols and wildlife are arranged in an elegant collage. A bold travel title runs across the top, and the borders carry a checklist of famous places, a vintage compass, small signposts, folk musical instruments and fine line-art sketches of landmarks. Warm earthy palette, cinematic lighting, ultra-realistic paper and object textures, balanced premium editorial composition.",
      "prompt_ko": "★[[noorwithwifi-ipad-papercut-diorama-travel-poster]]와 같은 계정의 자매 문법 — **아날로그 바탕 + 디지털 화면의 이중 매체**다. 이번엔 종이 디오라마가 아니라 **스크랩북**.\n\n구조가 3층으로 명확하다:\n| 층 | 내용 |\n|---|---|\n| 바탕 | 낡은 양피지, 찢긴 종이 가장자리, 전통 문양, **빈티지 우표**, 손글씨 메모, 지도, 여행 기념품 |\n| 중앙 | **태블릿 화면**에 그 나라의 대표 풍경 — 스타일러스를 든 손이 **그리는 중** |\n| 주변 | 전통 음식·음료·공예품·문화 상징·야생동물의 콜라주 |\n| 테두리 | 명소 체크리스트 · 빈티지 나침반 · 이정표 · 악기 · **랜드마크 선화 스케치** |\n\n★영리한 점 — **\"그리는 중인 손\"**이 두 매체를 잇는다. 태블릿만 놓으면 목업이고, 스타일러스를 든 손이 있으면 **작업 중인 여행 기록**이 된다. 시간이 들어가는 것([[noorwithwifi-graphite-sketch-live-drawing-template]]의 손·연필과 같은 장치).\n- 치환 슬롯: `[COUNTRY/DESTINATION]` + `[INSPIRING TAGLINE]`.\n- 팔레트를 `warm earthy`로 고정해 잡다한 요소들이 한 화면에서 겉돌지 않게 묶는다.",
