      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on Chatgpt \n\nPrompt 1 \nUltra-detailed sports illustration of a young Cristiano Ronaldo in Manchester United's iconic red Vodafone home kit, captured striking a powerful volley, dynamic mid-air action pose, highly detailed vector painting with sharp brush strokes and clean outlines, selective color grading with vivid red jersey while skin and shorts remain mostly monochrome, floating football with subtle motion blur, minimalist white background with huge bold red typography reading \"RED DEVIL\" behind the player, premium football poster design, negative space composition, crisp shadows beneath the boots, Nike advertising aesthetic, Behance sports artwork, ultra clean, 8K, poster-quality, centered composition.\nPrompt 2 \nHigh-end digital sports illustration of Cristiano Ronaldo during his early Manchester United years, dribbling at speed in the classic red Vodafone jersey, dynamic running pose, comic-book realism mixed with premium vector painting, rich saturated reds against a deep black background, oversized bold red text reading \"C. RONALDO\" behind the player, cinematic spotlight, subtle ground reflection, clean outlines, premium football poster, minimal composition, modern sports branding aesthetic, ultra-sharp details, 8K wallpaper, Behance-quality artwork.\nPrompt 3 \nPremium digital illustration of Cristiano Ronaldo celebrating after removing his Manchester United jersey, muscular physique rendered in grayscale with only the red jersey, Nike swoosh, and subtle accents remaining vibrant, roaring expression, dramatic anatomy, minimalist white background with massive negative space, floating red Nike logo positioned behind the head, ultra-clean vector painting, smooth gradients, editorial sports poster, premium athletic campaign aesthetic, high-detail digital brushwork, ultra-realistic illustration, 8K.\nPrompt 4 \nStylized hyper-detailed digital painting of Cristiano Ronaldo dribbling the football in Manchester United's blue away Vodafone kit, aggressive attacking stance, realistic anatomy combined with premium graphic illustration, vivid royal blue kit with bright red accents, detailed football and boots, blurred stadium crowd background with warm cinematic lighting, dynamic motion, dramatic contrast, sports magazine cover aesthetic, premium football artwork, highly polished digital painting, ultra-sharp details, 8K wallpaper, Behance trending style.",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-detailed sports illustration of a young footballer striking a powerful mid-air volley in a red home kit, dynamic action pose, rendered as a highly detailed vector painting with sharp brush strokes and clean outlines. Selective colour grading: the jersey stays vivid saturated red while the skin, shorts and boots remain largely monochrome, so the eye is forced onto the kit. The ball floats with subtle motion blur. A minimalist white background carries huge bold red typography reading RED DEVIL directly behind the player, with generous negative space around the figure and crisp shadows beneath the boots. Premium football poster design, centred composition, ultra-clean, poster-quality, modern sports branding aesthetic.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**선택적 채색**(selective color grading)이 이 포스터 시리즈의 엔진이다:\n> *\"vivid red jersey while **skin and shorts remain mostly monochrome**\"*\n\n인물 전체를 컬러로 두면 시선이 흩어진다. **유니폼 한 색만 남기면** 브랜드 색이 곧 주인공이 된다. 3번 변주에서는 더 밀어붙인다 — *\"근육질 몸은 그레이스케일로, **저지와 로고와 미묘한 액센트만** 선명하게.\"*\n\n★4개 변주가 **같은 규칙의 적용 범위**를 보여준다:\n| # | 장면 | 배경 | 타이포 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 공중 발리 | 미니멀 화이트 | 거대 빨강 `RED DEVIL` 배후 |\n| 2 | 질주 드리블 | 딥 블랙 | 거대 빨강 이름 배후 + 시네마틱 스포트라이트 |\n| 3 | 셔츠 벗은 세리머니 | 화이트 + 대면적 여백 | 머리 뒤에 떠 있는 로고 |\n| 4 | 어웨이 킷 드리블 | 흐린 관중석 + 시네마틱 조명 | (없음) |\n\n→ 1·3번은 **여백형**, 2·4번은 **배경형**. 같은 선택적 채색인데 배경 처리로 완전히 다른 인상이 된다.\n- 렌더 좌표: `vector painting` + `sharp brush strokes` + `clean outlines` — 사진이 아니라 **일러스트**임을 못박는다.\n※ 원문의 실인물·실구단·실브랜드명은 `prompt`에 보존하고, `gen_prompt`는 일반 선수로 치환했다.",
