      "id": "gdgtify-scale-hierarchy-3d-food-typography",
      "source": "https://x.com/Gdgtify/status/2080751121342066714",
      "author": "gdgtify",
      "date": "2026-07-25",
      "lang": "en",
      "target_model": "GPT Image 2",
      "category": "타이포 포스터",
      "title": "★4단계 스케일에 각각 다른 물리를 부여 — 갤러리(플랫) → 포스터 레이아웃(인쇄) → 3D 음식 활자(사진) → 1:87 셰프(서사), 그리고 층간 상호작용",
      "prompt": "I need to post more food prompts. This one combines 3D typography with food. \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 famous foodie cities: // ═══ SCALE Λ (Lambda): 4 levels, each with own physics ═══\n\nΛ_0 (MACRO, ~1m): \"GALLERY CONTEXT\"\n  physics: {\n    geometry: \"flat_wall, single_object, centered\"\n    light: \"ambient_gallery_spot, soft, from_above\"\n    detail: \"poster is ONE shape. No internal detail visible.\"\n    color: \"white_wall + dark_frame_rectangle\"\n    rule: \"poster reads as a SINGLE GESTALT object\"\n  }\n  ↓ flow (zoom in)\n\nΛ_1 (MESO, ~50cm): \"POSTER LAYOUT\"\n  physics: {\n    geometry: \"3 horizontal zones, Swiss grid, construction lines\"\n    light: \"flat, even, printed_ink (no 3D lighting yet)\"\n    detail: \"typography readable, grid visible, zones distinct\"\n    color: \"{{PALETTE}}, # 1a3a6b, #111, # F5F0E8\"\n    rule: \"reads as GRAPHIC DESIGN. Flat. Intellectual.\"\n    elements: [header_grid, footer_diagram, construction_overlay]\n  }\n  ↓ flow (zoom into center zone)\n\nΛ_2 (MICRO, ~15cm): \"3D FOOD TYPOGRAPHY\"\n  physics: {\n    geometry: \"volumetric, photoreal, casts_shadow_on_Λ_1\"\n    light: \"studio_3point, specular, SSS, caustics_in_glass\"\n    detail: \"rice_grains, fish_fiber, batter_crunch, nori_wrinkle\"\n    color: \"full_spectrum, ingredient-accurate\"\n    rule: \"reads as PHOTOGRAPHY. Tactile. Hungry.\"\n    elements: [{{LETTER_MAP}} as 3D objects]\n    INTERACTION: \"3D objects from Λ_2 cast shadows INTO Λ_1\"\n    // this is the SCALE BREAK: photoreal objects on flat poster\n  }\n  ↓ flow (zoom onto a letter)\n\nΛ_3 (NANO, ~2cm): \"1:87 CHEF INTERACTIONS\"\n  physics: {\n    geometry: \"tiny figures, readable_pose, NOT detailed_face\"\n    light: \"inherits Λ_2 lighting (same studio)\"\n    detail: \"tool_shape, body_angle, action_clear\"\n    color: \"white_chef_coat, dark_pants, skin_tone\"\n    rule: \"reads as NARRATIVE. Story. Whimsy.\"\n    elements: [{{CHEF_ACTIONS}}]\n    INTERACTION: \"chef from Λ_3 modifies Λ_2 object\"\n    // knife cuts letter. bucket pours glaze. rope pulls slice.\n  }\n\n// ═══ RG FLOW RULES (how scales connect) ═══\n\nFLOW(Λ_0 → Λ_1): \"frame becomes container. Wall disappears.\"\nFLOW(Λ_1 → Λ_2): \"flat zone EXPLODES into 3D. Shadow appears.\"\nFLOW(Λ_2 → Λ_3): \"giant food becomes LANDSCAPE for tiny chefs.\"\n\n// CRITICAL: each scale has DIFFERENT render engine:\n  Λ_0: vector/flat (1 shape)\n  Λ_1: graphic_design (grid, type, line_art)\n  Λ_2: photoreal_3D (Octane/Redshift quality)\n  Λ_3: miniature_photography (tilt-shift, shallow_dof)\n\n// The FINAL IMAGE composites ALL 4 scales simultaneously.\n// Viewer's eye zooms: Λ_0→Λ_1→Λ_2→Λ_3 in ~3 seconds.\n// Each zoom level REWARDS with new detail.\n\n// ═══ BOUNDARY CONDITIONS ═══\n  Λ_1 ∩ Λ_2 boundary: \"hard shadow line. 3D sits ON flat.\"\n  Λ_2 ∩ Λ_3 boundary: \"chef feet touch food surface. No float.\"\n  Λ_0 ∩ Λ_1 boundary: \"frame edge. Clean crop.\"\n\nRENDER: {{CITY}}. All 4 Λ scales active. 1:1. Mixed media.\nThe poster is a WORLD at 4 resolutions simultaneously.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 2x2 grid, 16:9, of four food-city posters, each built on a deliberate scale break. Each panel reads first as a flat Swiss-grid graphic poster — three horizontal zones, construction lines, header grid and footer diagram in navy, near-black and warm off-white, printed flat with no 3D lighting. But the city name in the centre zone is built from photoreal volumetric food: rice grains, fish fibre, batter crunch and nori wrinkle rendered as three-dimensional letterforms under studio three-point light with specular highlights, subsurface scattering and caustics — and these 3D letters cast real shadows down onto the flat printed poster beneath them. On and around the letters, tiny 1:87 scale chef figures in white coats interact with the food: one slices into a letter with a knife, one pours glaze from a bucket, one hauls a slice with rope — poses readable, faces not detailed. Gallery-clean presentation, tactile and hungry up close, intellectual and flat from afar.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**한 이미지 안에 4개의 스케일을 두고, 각 스케일에 서로 다른 물리를 부여한다.** 물리학의 재규격화군(RG) 표기를 빌린 문법이다:\n\n```\nΛ_0 (MACRO, ~1m)  \"갤러리 맥락\"   → 포스터는 하나의 형태(gestalt). 내부 디테일 안 보임\n  ↓ zoom in\nΛ_1 (MESO, ~50cm) \"포스터 레이아웃\" → 스위스 그리드 3구역. 플랫한 인쇄 잉크. 3D 조명 없음\n  ↓ zoom into center\nΛ_2 (MICRO, ~15cm) \"3D 음식 활자\"  → 볼류메트릭·포토리얼. 스튜디오 3점광·SSS·커스틱\n  ↓ zoom onto a letter\nΛ_3 (NANO, ~2cm)  \"1:87 셰프\"     → 작은 인물. 자세는 읽히되 얼굴은 디테일 없이\n```\n\n★각 층에 **`rule` 한 줄**이 붙는 게 핵심이다 — 그 층이 **무엇으로 읽혀야 하는지**:\n- Λ_1: *\"reads as **GRAPHIC DESIGN**. Flat. Intellectual.\"*\n- Λ_2: *\"reads as **PHOTOGRAPHY**. Tactile. Hungry.\"*\n- Λ_3: *\"reads as **NARRATIVE**. Story. Whimsy.\"*\n\n★그리고 ★**층간 상호작용**(INTERACTION)이 이 프롬프트를 완성한다:\n- `Λ_2 → Λ_1`: **3D 오브젝트가 평면 포스터에 그림자를 드리운다** ← 주석에 *\"this is the SCALE BREAK: photoreal objects on flat poster\"*\n- `Λ_3 → Λ_2`: **셰프가 Λ_2의 오브젝트를 변형시킨다** — 칼이 글자를 자르고, 양동이가 글레이즈를 붓고, 밧줄이 조각을 끌어당긴다\n\n→ 층을 나누기만 하면 콜라주지만, **아래 층이 위 층에 물리적으로 개입**하면 하나의 세계가 된다.\n- `FLOW()` 규칙으로 층 전이도 서술: *\"평면 구역이 3D로 폭발한다. 그림자가 나타난다.\"*",
      "ref_image": null,
      "result": "results/gdgtify-scale-hierarchy-3d-food-typography.webp",
