      "prompt": "A timeless mid-century hand-painted editorial portrait of an elegant woman standing on grand European stone stairs outside a historic cream-colored building, turning back over her shoulder with a warm radiant smile, short vintage pixie hairstyle, expressive oversized eyes, classic red lipstick, soft blush, ivory short-sleeve blouse neatly tucked into a high-waisted beige A-line skirt, graceful feminine posture, bright Mediterranean afternoon sunlight, warm cream and sandstone architecture, subtle blue sky, nostalgic 1950s European travel poster atmosphere, refined gouache and watercolor illustration, delicate ink linework, textured brush strokes, painterly canvas grain, muted pastel color palette, vintage magazine cover aesthetic, elegant composition, cinematic framing, handcrafted illustration, premium editorial artwork, highly detailed facial features, soft natural shadows, timeless charm, sophisticated retro fashion, museum-quality illustration, no text, no logo, no watermark. 1950s fashion illustration, vintage Vogue cover aesthetic, hand-painted gouache, watercolor wash, ink outlines, retro European postcard, classic travel poster, editorial elegance, painterly realism, textured paper, timeless feminine beauty, refined brushwork, ultra-detailed illustration",
      "gen_prompt": "A timeless mid-century hand-painted editorial portrait of an elegant woman standing on grand European stone stairs outside a historic cream-coloured building, turning back over her shoulder with a warm radiant smile. Short vintage pixie hair, expressive oversized eyes, classic red lipstick and soft blush; an ivory short-sleeve blouse tucked neatly into a high-waisted beige A-line skirt. Bright Mediterranean afternoon sunlight falls across warm cream and sandstone architecture under a subtle blue sky. Rendered as refined gouache and watercolour illustration with delicate ink linework, textured brush strokes, painterly canvas grain and a muted pastel palette — 1950s European travel poster atmosphere, vintage magazine cover aesthetic, handcrafted and museum-quality. No text, no logo.",
