      "prompt": "Create a highly detailed LEGO-style miniature recreation of Al Ahsa, Saudi Arabia, where the entire city is built exclusively from authentic LEGO bricks. Reimagine Al Ahsa's famous palm groves, traditional mud-brick architecture, Al Qaisariya Souq, roads, parks, landmarks, and surrounding desert entirely as colorful LEGO constructions. Every building, tree, street, vehicle, and landscape element must be assembled from visible LEGO bricks and plates with realistic studs, interlocking pieces, and accurate plastic textures. The city should feel like an official premium LEGO diorama with playful proportions, vibrant colors, cinematic golden-hour lighting, soft shadows, tilt-shift miniature photography, ultra-realistic rendering, incredible detail, 8K, masterpiece, no text, no watermark",
