      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on CHATGPT \n\nCreate a clean, modern Indonesian food promotion flyer in a square (1:1) format with a premium restaurant advertising style.\n\nLayout:\n- White background with subtle green leaf decorations in the corners.\n- Large bold headline on the left:\n  \"Menu\"\n  \"HARI\"\n  \"SENIN\"\n  (\"HARI\" in dark green, \"SENIN\" in bright orange, \"Menu\" in elegant green handwritten script.)\n\nTop right:\n- Small delivery truck icon with clock.\n- Text:\n  \"PENGIRIMAN\"\n  \"JAM 06.00\"\n  \"PAGI\"\n\nMain dishes:\n- Top right: A white round plate filled with Stir-Fried Shrimp, Green Beans, Baby Corn, and Carrots.\n- Label over the plate:\n  \"Tumis Udang\"\n  \"Buncis Jagung Muda\"\n\nBottom left:\n- A white plate with grilled chicken (Ayam Bakar Teflon), fresh lettuce, and sliced tomatoes.\n- Label:\n  \"Ayam Bakar Teflon\"\n\nCenter-bottom:\n- Large white circular price badge with thin green outline.\n- Text:\n  \"HANYA\"\n  \"50.000\"\n  \"/PORSI\"\n  with \"50.000\" in large orange font.\n\nLeft middle:\n- Small leaf icon.\n- Text:\n  \"Masakan rumahan bikin rindu rumah\"\n\nRight side:\n- Three feature icons arranged vertically:\n  ✓ Bahan Berkualitas\n  ✓ Dimasak Higienis\n  ✓ Rasa Enak Seimbang\n\nBottom left:\n- WhatsApp order box with icon.\n- Text:\n  \"PESAN SEKARANG\"\n  \"0815 923 222 8\"\n\nBottom right:\n- Instagram icon with:\n  \"@ruangdigitalco\"\n\nDesign style:\n- Professional Indonesian catering advertisement.\n- Fresh green (#3F6B2A) and orange (#F28C1A) color palette.\n- Clean typography with bold sans-serif fonts and elegant handwritten accent.\n- High-resolution food photography.\n- Soft natural shadows beneath plates.\n- Bright, appetizing colors.\n- Balanced spacing.\n- Premium social media promotional design.\n- Commercial food flyer aesthetic.\n- Ultra-sharp, realistic, print-ready quality.",
      "gen_prompt": "A clean modern food promotion flyer in square format, premium restaurant advertising style. White background with subtle green leaf decorations in the corners. On the left, a large bold headline stack in three parts — a script word in elegant green handwriting above two heavy lines, the first in dark green and the second in bright orange. Top right carries a small delivery-truck icon with a clock and three short lines of delivery-time text. A white round plate of stir-fried shrimp with green beans, baby corn and carrots sits at the upper right with a two-line label over it; a second white plate of grilled chicken with lettuce and sliced tomato sits at the lower left with its own label. A large white circular price badge with a thin green outline anchors the centre-bottom, the number in large orange type. A small leaf icon with one line of copy sits at the left middle, three check-mark feature icons run vertically down the right side, and contact boxes close the bottom corners. Fresh green and orange palette on white, professional catering advertisement layout.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**전단 레이아웃을 위치별로 발주하는** 프롬프트다. 이미지 묘사가 아니라 **배치 명세서**에 가깝다:\n```\n좌측       : 대형 볼드 헤드라인 3단(손글씨 스크립트 + 다크그린 + 브라이트 오렌지)\n우측 상단   : 배송 트럭 아이콘 + 시계 + 배송 시간 3줄\n우측 상단   : 요리 1 접시 + 2줄 라벨\n좌측 하단   : 요리 2 접시 + 라벨\n중앙 하단   : ★대형 원형 가격 배지(가는 초록 테두리, 숫자는 큰 오렌지)\n좌측 중앙   : 잎 아이콘 + 카피 한 줄\n우측       : 체크 특징 아이콘 3개 세로 배열\n하단 좌우   : 주문 연락처 박스\n```\n\n★배울 점 — **각 요소의 위치·색·글자 크기를 개별 지정**하면 AI가 임의로 배치하지 않는다. 라이브러리의 [[diplomeme-instagram-post-with-layout-spec]](레이아웃 명세를 함께 받기)와 짝을 이루는데, 그쪽은 **명세를 받아내고** 이쪽은 **명세를 넣어준다**.\n\n- 색을 HEX로 고정(`#3F6B2A` 등)한 것도 [[simplyannisa-json-sketch-portrait-identity-spec]]과 같은 원리.\n- 우리 작업에 그대로 적용된다 — Krea2에서 글자는 깨지지만 **레이아웃 골격**은 재현되므로, 이 구조로 시안을 뽑고 조판은 Figma에서 얹으면 된다.\n※ 원문의 실제 전화번호·SNS 계정은 `gen_prompt`에서 제외했다.",
