      "title": "플랫 벡터 유머 시리즈 — \"누구나 아는 곤란한 순간\"을 두꺼운 외곽선 + 과채도 4색으로 (밈 소재 양산 템플릿)",
      "prompt": "Prompt 1:\nIllustration of a man trying to sneak an entire pizza box past airport security by holding it awkwardly behind his back, security guard staring directly at it, bold flat vector illustration style, thick outlines, oversaturated colors — yellow, pink, blue, green.\n\nPrompt 2:\nIllustration of a man sweating nervously while being asked a simple question, two big red buttons in front of him, bold flat vector illustration style, thick outlines, oversaturated colors — yellow, pink, blue, green.\n\nPrompt 3:\nIllustration of a man staring blankly into the distance while everything behind him is on fire, coffee cup in hand, completely unfazed, bold flat vector illustration style, thick outlines, oversaturated colors — yellow, pink, blue, green.\n\nPrompt 4:\nIllustration of a man walking with his partner but turning his head to admire another woman walking by, partner glaring at him in disbelief, bold flat vector illustration style, thick outlines, oversaturated colors — yellow, pink, blue, green.",
      "gen_prompt": "Four bold flat vector illustrations sharing one style: thick black outlines, oversaturated colour limited to yellow, pink, blue and green, no gradients. One shows a man trying to sneak an entire pizza box past airport security by holding it awkwardly behind his back while the guard stares directly at it. One shows a man sweating nervously in front of two big red buttons while being asked a simple question. One shows a man staring blankly into the distance with a coffee cup in hand while everything behind him is on fire, completely unfazed. One shows a man walking with his partner but turning his head to admire someone passing by, his partner glaring in disbelief. Flat shapes, exaggerated expressions, clear silhouettes.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**밈 소재를 양산하는 템플릿**이다. 스타일 규칙은 세 줄로 고정하고 **상황만 갈아끼운다**:\n```\nbold flat vector illustration style\nthick outlines\noversaturated colors — yellow, pink, blue, green\n```\n\n★네 상황의 공통점 — 전부 **\"누구나 아는 곤란한 순간\"**이다:\n- 피자 박스를 등 뒤에 숨기려는데 보안요원이 정면으로 쳐다봄\n- 간단한 질문에 식은땀 흘리며 빨간 버튼 두 개 앞에 섬(밈 원본 구도)\n- 뒤에서 다 타고 있는데 커피 들고 멍하니 정면 응시(this is fine 계열)\n- 파트너와 걸으면서 지나가는 사람을 돌아봄(distracted boyfriend 계열)\n\n→ **상황이 곧 콘텐츠**다. 스타일은 도구일 뿐이고, 프롬프트의 값어치는 \"공감되는 곤란함\"을 문장 하나로 압축하는 데 있다.\n\n- **색을 4개로 제한**(노랑·핑크·파랑·초록)한 게 시리즈 통일의 핵심. 색이 많으면 세트로 안 보인다.\n- 플랫 벡터 + 두꺼운 외곽선은 **작게 줄여도 읽히는** 형식이라 SNS·스티커에 적합하다.",
