      "prompt": "Another cute style that should work for all kinds of characters. I tested it with GPT Image 2 \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 famous generals -> highly polished 3d capsule-toy rendering, compact kawaii urban diorama, [character or creature] performing [everyday action] with exaggerated seriousness, balancing [adorable optimism] and [quiet adult exhaustion], soft-touch vinyl construction, miniature [tokyo-inspired alley / train platform / convenience store / rooftop], tiny vending machines, umbrellas, utility boxes, food packaging shapes and one charmingly oversized object, palette of [pastel neons / rainy blues / cream and red / custom], diffused overcast lighting with miniature neon reflections, low macro camera position, close product framing, shallow depth of field, clean molded forms, subtle paint gradients and realistic plastic highlights, displayed as a premium blind-box collectible with a small scenic base, professional toy photography, commercial catalog quality, high resolution. ai art direction: choose culturally coherent but fictional signage shapes without producing readable brand names. fill missing details with small everyday objects that reinforce the character’s mood. keep the composition charming, compact and readable.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 2x2 grid of highly polished 3D capsule-toy renderings, each a compact kawaii urban diorama of a different historical general performing a mundane everyday action with exaggerated seriousness — queuing for a train, buying a drink from a vending machine, shielding under an umbrella, eating at a counter. Each figure balances adorable optimism against quiet adult exhaustion. Soft-touch vinyl construction with clean molded forms, subtle paint gradients and realistic plastic highlights. Miniature Tokyo-inspired settings — a narrow alley, a train platform, a convenience store corner, a rooftop — dressed with tiny vending machines, umbrellas, utility boxes, food packaging shapes and one charmingly oversized object per scene. Palette of rainy blues with pastel neon accents, diffused overcast lighting with small neon reflections. Low macro camera position, close product framing, shallow depth of field, each presented as a premium blind-box collectible on a small scenic base. Professional toy photography, commercial catalogue quality. Culturally coherent but fictional signage shapes with no readable brand names.",
      "prompt_ko": "★이 프롬프트의 심장은 한 줄이다:\n> **\"[사랑스러운 낙관]과 [조용한 어른의 피로] 사이의 균형을 잡아라.\"**\n(balancing [adorable optimism] and [quiet adult exhaustion])\n\n→ 캐릭터의 **정서를 두 극 사이의 좌표로** 지정한다. 하나만 주면 그냥 귀엽거나 그냥 우울한데, 둘을 동시에 요구하니 **표정에 층이 생긴다**. 여기에 *\"일상적 행동을 **과장된 진지함으로** 수행\"*이 겹치면서 유머가 나온다.\n\n★AI에게 넘기는 지시(`ai art direction`)가 따로 붙어 있는 게 특징이다:\n```\n· 문화적으로 일관되되 **가공의 간판 형태**를 고르고, 읽히는 브랜드명은 만들지 마라\n· 빠진 디테일은 **캐릭터의 기분을 강화하는 작은 일상 사물**로 채워라\n· 구성은 사랑스럽고 컴팩트하고 **읽히게** 유지하라\n```\n→ *\"빠진 건 알아서 채우되 **기분을 강화하는 방향으로**\"*가 좋은 위임 방식이다.\n\n- 재질을 완구 생산 용어로 지정: `soft-touch vinyl` · `clean molded forms` · `subtle paint gradients` · `realistic plastic highlights`. 플라스틱 완구의 질감이 그대로 나온다.\n- **`one charmingly oversized object`** — 미니어처 디오라마에 하나만 크게 넣으면 스케일 유머가 생긴다.\n- 슬롯 교체로 시리즈: 장군 4명 → 철학자·작곡가·화가·과학자.",
