      "prompt": "Classic travel poster vibes with a contemporary twist. \n\nGPT image 2\nPrompt:\nPremium vector travel poster of (county) in huge elongated bold sans-serif typography, letters containing continuous COUNTRY panorama: temples, BTS skytrain, markets, bridges, river boats, neon streets, cafés, tropical urban scenery. Flat geometric illustration, retro-futuristic travel branding, Swiss poster design, editorial layout, screen-print aesthetic. Color palette: deep red, coral red, warm ivory, muted charcoal. Thin top strip with skyline silhouettes, cars, train, birds, sun. Minimalist vector only, no gradients, no AI text errors, ultra-clean composition, sharp vector lines, 8K poster quality.",
