      "prompt": "She is framing the vibe🔥\nMade with GPT IMAGE 2\nPrompt:\n\nHigh-fashion futuristic sportswear editorial poster.\nFull-body shot of a female model in a dynamic, confident wide-leg stance. She is wearing an oversized white minimalist sweatshirt with voluminous sleeves, glossy translucent parachute pants, and chunky white-and-orange athletic sneakers. Styling includes a sleek messy updo, gold statement earrings, and soft natural makeup with a confident editorial expression. The background is a smooth neutral beige gradient, featuring large, abstract, glossy red-pink organic 3D inflatable blob shapes. Bold, oversized white typography reading\n\"just\" is positioned partially behind the model, with subtle futuristic graphic microtext in the margins.\nPremium athletic brand campaign aesthetic, contemporary luxury streetwear magazine cover design. Shot on Sony A1 with an 85mm f/1.2 lens.\nUltra-clean studio lighting, soft diffused shadows, highly polished commercial retouching. Cinematic soft contrast, rendered in Octane and Unreal Engine 5, insanely detailed, photorealistic, 8k resolution.",
      "gen_prompt": "A high-fashion futuristic sportswear editorial poster. Full-body shot of a model in a dynamic, confident wide-leg stance, wearing an oversized white minimalist sweatshirt with voluminous sleeves, glossy translucent parachute trousers and chunky white-and-orange athletic sneakers. Sleek messy updo, gold statement earrings, soft natural makeup with a confident editorial expression. The background is a smooth neutral beige gradient populated with large abstract glossy red-pink organic 3D inflatable blob shapes. Bold oversized white typography sits partially behind the model, with subtle graphic microtext along the margins. Premium athletic brand campaign aesthetic, contemporary luxury streetwear magazine design, ultra-clean studio lighting, soft diffused shadows, highly polished commercial retouching, cinematic soft contrast, photorealistic.",
      "prompt_ko": "★조판을 인물과 **겹치게** 배치하는 게 이 포스터의 문법이다:\n> *\"굵고 거대한 흰색 타이포가 **인물 뒤에 부분적으로 가려진 채** 놓이고, 여백에는 미세한 그래픽 마이크로텍스트.\"*\n→ 글자가 인물 앞에 있으면 배너가 되고, **뒤로 반쯤 숨으면** 깊이가 생기면서 잡지 표지가 된다. 라이브러리의 [[noorwithwifi-dense-grid-journal-collage-poster]] 등에서도 반복되는 요령이다.\n\n★배경 처리가 이 프롬프트의 개성이다: **매끄러운 뉴트럴 베이지 그라디언트 + 커다란 광택 레드핑크 유기적 3D 인플레이터블 덩어리.** 평평한 배경에 **부풀린 덩어리 몇 개**만 놓으면 스튜디오가 세트가 된다.\n\n- 의상에서 재질 대비를 만든다: `오버사이즈 미니멀 화이트 스웻셔츠`(무광·볼륨) vs **`광택 반투명 파라슈트 팬츠`**(유광·투명). 위아래 재질이 다르면 실루엣이 읽힌다.\n- 포즈를 `dynamic, confident wide-leg stance`로 — **다리를 벌린 정지 자세**는 움직임 없이 에너지를 주는 스포츠 캠페인의 상투 포즈다.\n- 렌더 어휘에 `Octane` · `Unreal Engine 5`를 섞은 건 **인플레이터블 덩어리의 광택**을 겨냥한 것.",
