      "title": "★\"두 번 봐야 보이는 작은 시각적 장치\" — 두 개념을 분리 불가능한 하나의 마크로 합치는 마스코트 로고",
      "prompt": "Prompt:\n\nCreate a playful and unexpected black-and-white logo for an original fictional brand.\n\nUse a pure white background and design one compact mascot symbol with a bold silhouette, clear negative space, and a small visual trick that becomes noticeable on a second look.\n\nCombine two ideas into one inseparable mark, such as:\n- a creature passing through an object\n- a character hiding inside a folded structure\n- an animal fused with a letter or everyday item\n- a speech bubble transformed into a mascot\n\nAdd a few restrained details such as thin structural lines, small dots, short hatching, clipped corners, asymmetrical eyes, or localized halftone texture. Keep the details subtle and purposeful rather than decorative.\n\nThe character should feel odd, witty, slightly awkward, and full of personality—not childish, overly cute, or perfectly symmetrical.\n\nPlace an original English brand name below the symbol. Customize one or two letters so the wordmark subtly echoes the icon, while remaining clear and readable.\n\n1:1 square composition, centered logo, approximately 45%–55% of the canvas width, with generous white space.\n\n────────── ※트윗 본문 ──────────\nLogo Drop 36!\n🤯 Minimal logos can be playful, unexpected, and full of character!\n\nBold silhouettes, negative space, fine lines, dots, and a little visual mischief.\n\n1. THRUU — a creature passing through a tag\n2. HUSH — a character hiding inside a folded box\n3. MUMBLO — a speech-bubble mascot\n4. SLOOP — a snail built around the letter S\n\nMade with ChatGPT-Image2\nPrompt below 👇",
      "gen_prompt": "A playful and unexpected black-and-white logo for an original fictional brand, on a pure white background. One compact mascot symbol with a bold silhouette and clear negative space: a small creature is passing through a luggage tag, its head and forelegs emerging on one side while its tail exits the other, so the tag's die-cut hole and the creature's body read as a single inseparable mark — the trick only becomes noticeable on a second look. A few restrained details: thin structural lines, small dots, short hatching, clipped corners, asymmetrical eyes and a patch of localised halftone texture, all purposeful rather than decorative. The character feels odd, witty and slightly awkward — not childish, not overly cute, never perfectly symmetrical. Below the symbol sits an original English brand wordmark in clean sans-serif capitals, with one letter customised so it subtly echoes the icon while staying readable. Square composition, centred, the logo occupying about half the canvas width with generous white space.",
      "prompt_ko": "★로고 프롬프트의 핵심 한 줄:\n> *\"**두 개의 아이디어를 분리할 수 없는 하나의 마크로 합쳐라**(Combine two ideas into one inseparable mark).\"*\n\n그리고 그 합침의 **유형을 예시로 제시**한다 — 이게 슬롯 역할을 한다:\n```\n· 사물을 통과하는 생물     (a creature passing through an object)\n· 접힌 구조물 안에 숨은 캐릭터 (a character hiding inside a folded structure)\n· 글자나 일상 사물과 융합된 동물\n· 말풍선이 마스코트로 변한 것\n```\n\n★그리고 **\"두 번 봐야 보이는 장치\"**를 요구한다: *\"굵은 실루엣, 명확한 네거티브 스페이스, 그리고 **다시 볼 때 알아차리게 되는 작은 시각적 장난**(a small visual trick that becomes noticeable on a second look).\"*\n\n★캐릭터의 성격을 **부정형으로** 못 박은 게 정확하다:\n> *\"이상하고, 재치 있고, 약간 어색하고, 개성이 넘쳐야 한다 — **유치하거나, 지나치게 귀엽거나, 완벽하게 대칭이어서는 안 된다.**\"*\n→ 마스코트 로고가 실패하는 지점이 정확히 이 셋이다.\n\n- 워드마크 처리도 요령이 있다: *\"한두 글자를 커스텀해 **워드마크가 아이콘을 은근히 반향**하게 하되, 명확하고 읽히게 유지.\"*\n- 캔버스 대비 로고 크기를 **45~55%로 수치화**하고 넉넉한 여백을 요구한다.\n- 디테일은 절제: 가는 구조선·작은 점·짧은 해칭·잘린 모서리·비대칭 눈·국부 하프톤 — *\"장식적이지 않고 목적이 있게.\"*",
