      "prompt": "VISUAL OS 005 — Glass Weekend Covers\n\nTo sell slowness, everyone reaches for soft things: linen, fog, pastel gradients. These 4 covers use the hardest, most breakable material in the room.\n\nFour pets, four fictional magazines:\n\n- MISO — Tokyo, The Slow Saturday\n- PIPPIN — Paris, The Brunch Pause\n- MOMO — San Jose, The Sunday Stretch\n- NORI — Monterey, The Float Time\nWhy glass sells rest better than linen ever will: glass can't hurry. A glass cat isn't allowed to pounce. The material carries the message before you read a single word.\n\nTwo more tricks worth stealing:\n\n1. The masthead is the pet's name, set in racing italics — the fastest type on the page shouting the slowest idea.\n2. Exactly one un-glassed detail per cover: a fur face, whiskers, an amber croissant. The eye lands where the glass breaks.\nThe detail most people will miss: every city is the animal's real habitat. Otters raft in Monterey. Cats run Tokyo. Croissants live in Paris.\n\nLocked: black void, prismatic glass render, racing masthead, thin editorial stack, fictional issue metadata, city + mantra footer\n\nSwaps: pet / magazine name / city / mantra / weekend ritual\n\nThe material is the message. The pet is the masthead.\n\nPrompt ↓\n\n--- (작성자 답글) ---\n\nCopy & swap the 5 fields at the bottom:\n\n{\n  \"style\": \"prismatic-glass-animal-weekend-editorial\",\n  \"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n  \"style_rules\": {\n    \"field\": \"pure black studio void, no floor line, no gradient\",\n    \"subject\": \"one small animal rendered as transparent blown glass — heavy dispersion, rainbow caustics on edges, deep internal reflections, resting pose only\",\n    \"organic_anchor\": \"exactly ONE un-glassed detail (real fur face, whiskers, or one amber-glass prop) — the focal point is where the glass breaks\",\n    \"masthead\": \"the pet's NAME, huge white racing-italic caps, top of frame\",\n    \"editorial_stack\": \"thin light type for the ritual title, tiny mono metadata: fictional series name, month/day, circled issue number\",\n    \"footer\": \"city in spaced caps + bold italic mantra + one quiet sub-line\"\n  },\n  \"negative\": \"colored background, environment, action pose, cartoon proportions, opaque materials, text errors\",\n  \"swap\": {\n    \"PET_NAME\": \"MISO\",\n    \"ANIMAL\": \"a chubby shorthair cat lying beside a glass alarm clock, eyes half closed\",\n    \"RITUAL\": \"THE SLOW SATURDAY\",\n    \"CITY\": \"TOKYO\",\n    \"MANTRA\": \"LET THE MORNING ARRIVE\"\n  }\n}",
      "gen_prompt": "{\n  \"style\": \"prismatic-glass-animal-weekend-editorial\",\n  \"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n  \"style_rules\": {\n    \"field\": \"pure black studio void, no floor line, no gradient\",\n    \"subject\": \"one small animal rendered as transparent blown glass — heavy dispersion, rainbow caustics on edges, deep internal reflections, resting pose only\",\n    \"organic_anchor\": \"exactly ONE un-glassed detail (real fur face, whiskers, or one amber-glass prop) — the focal point is where the glass breaks\",\n    \"masthead\": \"the pet's NAME, huge white racing-italic caps, top of frame\",\n    \"editorial_stack\": \"thin light type for the ritual title, tiny mono metadata: fictional series name, month/day, circled issue number\",\n    \"footer\": \"city in spaced caps + bold italic mantra + one quiet sub-line\"\n  },\n  \"negative\": \"colored background, environment, action pose, cartoon proportions, opaque materials, text errors\",\n  \"swap\": {\n    \"PET_NAME\": \"MISO\",\n    \"ANIMAL\": \"a chubby shorthair cat lying beside a glass alarm clock, eyes half closed\",\n    \"RITUAL\": \"THE SLOW SATURDAY\",\n    \"CITY\": \"TOKYO\",\n    \"MANTRA\": \"LET THE MORNING ARRIVE\"\n  }\n}",
      "prompt_ko": "★발상의 출발점이 정확히 반대다:\n> *\"느림을 팔려고 하면 다들 부드러운 걸 집는다 — 린넨, 안개, 파스텔 그라디언트.\n> 이 4장의 커버는 **방 안에서 가장 단단하고 가장 잘 깨지는 재질**을 쓴다.\"*\n\n★왜 유리가 린넨보다 휴식을 더 잘 파는가:\n> *\"**유리는 서두를 수 없다.** 유리 고양이는 덮칠 수 없다.\n> 재질이 한 글자를 읽기도 전에 메시지를 먼저 전달한다.\"*\n\n★훔칠 만한 장치 2개 (작성자 본인 표현):\n```\n1. 마스트헤드 = 반려동물의 이름을 레이싱 이탤릭으로.\n   → 페이지에서 가장 빠른 서체가 가장 느린 아이디어를 외친다   ← 의도된 모순\n2. 커버당 정확히 하나만 유리가 아닌 디테일.\n   실제 털 얼굴, 수염, 앰버빛 크루아상 —\n   → 시선은 「유리가 깨지는 지점」에 내려앉는다\n```\n\n★대부분 놓칠 디테일: **도시가 그 동물의 실제 서식지다.** 수달은 몬터레이에서 뗏목을 만들고,\n고양이는 도쿄를 지배하고, 크루아상은 파리에 산다.\n\n★잠근 것 / 바꿀 것이 프롬프트에 명시돼 있다:\n```\n잠금: 블랙 보이드 · 프리즘 유리 렌더 · 레이싱 마스트헤드 · 얇은 에디토리얼 스택\n      · 가상 발행 메타데이터 · 도시+만트라 푸터\n교체: 반려동물 / 잡지명 / 도시 / 만트라 / 주말 의식\n```\n\n★JSON 구조 프롬프트이고 `swap` 블록만 갈아끼우면 시리즈가 된다. 이번 생성은 MISO(도쿄·느린 토요일) 편.",
