      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on CHATGPT \n\nA full-body, photorealistic portrait of a stylish young woman posing dramatically beside a sunlit concrete wall. She wears an oversized charcoal button-up shirt over a fitted black top, loose cargo pants, and chunky white sneakers. Warm golden-hour sunlight casts soft shadows across the wall. Next to her, a large hand-drawn black doodle version of herself appears as if sketched directly onto the wall with rough pencil and ink strokes. The doodle perfectly matches her hairstyle and oversized outfit but has an exaggerated chibi-inspired face with a mischievous grin, expressive eyes, and energetic personality. Instead of copying her pose, the doodle performs a funny, over-the-top action, stretching its arms into an exaggerated pose while pointing in the opposite direction, creating a playful contrast. The real woman confidently points toward the doodle with a knowing smile, as if aware that her illustrated shadow has a mind of its own. Minimalist indoor setting, textured concrete wall, cinematic golden sunlight, ultra-detailed, realistic photography, high resolution, natural lighting, editorial fashion photography, humorous interaction between the real subject and the hand-drawn doodle, sketchy pencil texture, expressive line art, whimsical, playful, premium composition.",
      "gen_prompt": "A full-body, photorealistic portrait of a stylish young woman posing dramatically beside a sunlit concrete wall. She wears an oversized charcoal button-up shirt over a fitted black top, loose cargo pants, and chunky white sneakers. Warm golden-hour sunlight casts soft shadows across the wall. Next to her, a large hand-drawn black doodle version of herself appears as if sketched directly onto the wall with rough pencil and ink strokes. The doodle perfectly matches her hairstyle and oversized outfit but has an exaggerated chibi-inspired face with a mischievous grin, expressive eyes, and energetic personality. Instead of copying her pose, the doodle performs a funny, over-the-top action, stretching its arms into an exaggerated pose while pointing in the opposite direction, creating a playful contrast. The real woman confidently points toward the doodle with a knowing smile, as if aware that her illustrated shadow has a mind of its own. Minimalist indoor setting, textured concrete wall, cinematic golden sunlight, ultra-detailed, realistic photography, high resolution, natural lighting, editorial fashion photography, humorous interaction between the real subject and the hand-drawn doodle, sketchy pencil texture, expressive line art, whimsical, playful, premium composition.",
      "prompt_ko": "★실사 인물 + 손그림 낙서를 한 화면에 넣는 합성은 흔하다. 이 프롬프트의 차별점은\n**낙서가 인물을 복제하지 않는다**는 한 줄이다:\n> *\"포즈를 따라 하는 대신, **낙서는 우스꽝스럽고 과장된 다른 동작을 한다** —\n> 팔을 늘려 반대 방향을 가리키며 대비를 만든다.\"*\n> *\"실제 인물은 자신의 그림자가 제멋대로라는 걸 아는 듯한 미소로 낙서를 가리킨다.\"*\n\n★즉 두 레이어의 관계를 \"복사\"가 아니라 **대화**로 설계했다. 이게 초현실 합성이 밋밋해지지 않는 분기점이다.\n\n★일치시킬 것과 어긋나게 할 것도 분리돼 있다:\n```\n일치 : 헤어스타일 · 오버사이즈 의상 실루엣   (같은 사람임을 알게)\n어긋남: 얼굴(치비풍 과장된 장난기) · 포즈 · 동작 방향   (다른 인격임을 알게)\n```\n\n★배경은 골든아워 햇살이 드는 콘크리트 벽 하나로 단순화 — 낙서가 \"벽에 직접 그려진 것\"으로 읽히게\n연필·잉크의 거친 스트로크 질감을 지정했다.",
