      "title": "★★\"완성도 그라디언트\" — 주인공만 완성하고, 주변은 60%, 가장자리는 맨 종이로 풀어놓는다",
      "prompt": "Minimalist watercolor and ink urban sketch\n\nGPT Image 2\n\nPrompt:\n3:4 vertical minimalist watercolor and ink urban sketch on cold-press handmade paper. Loose studio sketch, not a finished illustration.\n\nFINISH GRADIENT (priority): the couple is the only fully resolved area. Nearby architecture ~60% painted, with clear patches of bare paper and contour line breaking through. Distant buildings and frame edges dissolve into loose graphite and untouched paper before the border. ~20% of the page stays unpainted, mostly upper area and edges. Background is bare paper, not a painted sky. Unfinished edges are intentional.\n\nSCENE: Top of the Rock observation deck, Midtown Manhattan, clear afternoon. Two lovers at the stone parapet seen from behind, shoulders touching, one leaning in and pointing toward the Empire State Building. Wind in hair and a light cardigan. Quiet, unposed.\n\nCOMPOSITION: High vantage point. Couple small and back-turned in the lower third. Empire State Building off-center mid-distance. High horizon, deep space, generous open paper above.\n\nWASH: Wet-on-wet bleeding with blooms and backruns. Washes deliberately offset from the ink lines, spilling past contours and stopping short of others. Strong dilution variation within one facade — saturated, ghost-pale, and bare paper in turn. Visible granulation in the paper tooth. Hard wet-on-dry edges beside soft blooms. Reserved white paper as highlights, never white paint.\n\nLINE: Fast searching graphite and fine ink, construction marks left uncorrected. Scribble loops for railings and distant windows instead of literal detail. Weight varies hairline to bold. Faces suggested in a few marks.\n\nVALUE: High-key and airy, with exactly one deep dark note — the shaded face of the nearest rooftop tower in ink navy.\n\nCOLOR: Cool blue-dominant. 55% slate blue, dusty cerulean, powder blue, pale blue-gray. 20% bare warm off-white paper. 15% warm stone gray and limestone as mid-tone relief against flat monochrome blue. 10% taxi yellow on sunlit edges. Muted, low saturation.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY: Upper right, italic \"New York\" with one short poetic English line below in muted slate navy, absorbed into the paper.\n\nNEGATIVE: flat monochrome blue, painted sky, uniform flat coverage, no white space, over-detailed architecture, smooth gradients, digital airbrush, color perfectly inside the lines, photorealistic, 3D render, heavy black outlines, harsh shadows, muddy gray-blue, oversaturated, cluttered, realistic faces, stiff pose, single person, misspelled text, logo, watermark, border, frame.",
      "gen_prompt": "3:4 vertical minimalist watercolor and ink urban sketch on cold-press handmade paper. Loose studio sketch, not a finished illustration.\n\nFINISH GRADIENT (priority): the couple is the only fully resolved area. Nearby architecture ~60% painted, with clear patches of bare paper and contour line breaking through. Distant buildings and frame edges dissolve into loose graphite and untouched paper before the border. ~20% of the page stays unpainted, mostly upper area and edges. Background is bare paper, not a painted sky. Unfinished edges are intentional.\n\nSCENE: Top of the Rock observation deck, Midtown Manhattan, clear afternoon. Two lovers at the stone parapet seen from behind, shoulders touching, one leaning in and pointing toward the Empire State Building. Wind in hair and a light cardigan. Quiet, unposed.\n\nCOMPOSITION: High vantage point. Couple small and back-turned in the lower third. Empire State Building off-center mid-distance. High horizon, deep space, generous open paper above.\n\nWASH: Wet-on-wet bleeding with blooms and backruns. Washes deliberately offset from the ink lines, spilling past contours and stopping short of others. Strong dilution variation within one facade — saturated, ghost-pale, and bare paper in turn. Visible granulation in the paper tooth. Hard wet-on-dry edges beside soft blooms. Reserved white paper as highlights, never white paint.\n\nLINE: Fast searching graphite and fine ink, construction marks left uncorrected. Scribble loops for railings and distant windows instead of literal detail. Weight varies hairline to bold. Faces suggested in a few marks.\n\nVALUE: High-key and airy, with exactly one deep dark note — the shaded face of the nearest rooftop tower in ink navy.\n\nCOLOR: Cool blue-dominant. 55% slate blue, dusty cerulean, powder blue, pale blue-gray. 20% bare warm off-white paper. 15% warm stone gray and limestone as mid-tone relief against flat monochrome blue. 10% taxi yellow on sunlit edges. Muted, low saturation.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY: Upper right, italic \"New York\" with one short poetic English line below in muted slate navy, absorbed into the paper.\n\nNEGATIVE: flat monochrome blue, painted sky, uniform flat coverage, no white space, over-detailed architecture, smooth gradients, digital airbrush, color perfectly inside the lines, photorealistic, 3D render, heavy black outlines, harsh shadows, muddy gray-blue, oversaturated, cluttered, realistic faces, stiff pose, single person, misspelled text, logo, watermark, border, frame.",
      "prompt_ko": "★수채 스케치가 \"AI가 그린 완성 일러스트\"로 보이지 않게 하는 결정적 장치를 **우선순위 1번**으로\n못 박았다:\n> **FINISH GRADIENT (priority)**\n> *\"커플만이 유일하게 완전히 그려진 영역이다. 근처 건축은 **약 60%만 채색**되고,\n> 맨 종이와 윤곽선이 뚫고 나오는 구간이 분명히 보인다.\n> 원경 건물과 프레임 가장자리는 테두리에 닿기 전에 **느슨한 흑연과 손대지 않은 종이로 녹아든다.**\n> **페이지의 약 20%는 칠하지 않은 채로 둔다** — 주로 상단과 가장자리.\n> 배경은 칠한 하늘이 아니라 맨 종이다. **미완성 가장자리는 의도된 것이다.**\"*\n\n★\"스튜디오 스케치이지 완성 일러스트가 아니다(Loose studio sketch, not a finished illustration)\"를\n첫 줄에 선언한 것도 같은 목적.\n\n★수채 물성도 실패 지점을 알고 쓴 지시다:\n```\n· 젖은 데 젖게(wet-on-wet) — 블룸·백런이 생기게\n· 워시를 잉크 선에서 「일부러 어긋나게」 — 윤곽을 넘치기도, 못 미치기도\n· 한 건물 파사드 안에서도 농도 편차: 진한 곳 / 유령처럼 옅은 곳 / 맨 종이\n· 하이라이트는 흰 물감이 아니라 「남겨둔 흰 종이」        ← 수채의 정석\n```\n\n★값(value) 규칙: 전체를 하이키·경쾌하게 두되 **딱 하나의 깊은 어둠**(가장 가까운 옥상 탑의 그늘면,\n잉크 네이비)만 허용 — 밝은 그림이 붕 뜨지 않게 잡아주는 앵커.\n\n★색 배분을 퍼센트로 지정: 55% 블루 계열 / 20% 맨 따뜻한 오프화이트 종이 / 15% 따뜻한 석회암 그레이\n(단조로운 파랑에 대한 중간톤 완충) / 10% 택시 옐로.\n**\"평평한 단색 블루\"를 네거티브 1순위로 둔 것**과 짝을 이룬다.",
