      "prompt": "Nano banana pro promotional and Cinematic Prompt🤽‍♀️🏀 ⤵️\n\nDynamic playful product photography of [product from uploaded photo] frozen mid-air over a volleyball net, being spiked/hit by two diverse hands reaching from opposite sides of the net, solid vivid blue background with visible water splash/spray texture, bright saturated studio lighting, high-energy sports-ad composition, slight motion blur on the net strap, product sharply in focus, colorful bracelets and nail polish visible on one hand for a fun candid touch, bold graphic advertising aesthetic, high-resolution commercial photography, square or portrait crop\n\n #NanoBananaPro",
