      "prompt": "Font inspired by science. Made with ChatGPT.\n\n2x2 grid, 4 science inspired topics: <instruction>\nInput A is the subject photo. You are a god-tier typographer, lettering artist, graphic engineer, and brand identity designer.\n\nPhase 1: Letterform Synthesis\nRandomly select TWO Typographic Traditions and TWO Letter Construction Systems. Blend them into a coherent typographic identity.\n\nTypographic Traditions:\n[Blackletter Manuscript, Swiss Grotesk Modernism, Art Nouveau Display Type, 1970s Funk Lettering, Japanese Brush Calligraphy, Bauhaus Geometric Type, Victorian Circus Poster Type, Cyberpunk Interface Typography, Roman Inscriptional Capitals, Graffiti Wildstyle, Minimal Luxury Serif, Psychedelic Bubble Lettering, Devanagari-Inspired Modular Forms, Arabic Geometric Calligraphy, Pixel Bitmap Type]\n\nLetter Construction Systems:\n[Modular Grid Strokes, Ribbon-Like Continuous Line, Chiseled Stone Cuts, Neon Tube Bends, Ink Bleed Edges, Extruded 3D Letter Blocks, Layered Paper Cutouts, Metallic Foil Stamping, Variable-Width Brush Pressure, Mosaic Tile Assembly, Embroidered Thread Stitches, Glitch Fragmentation, Inflated Balloon Forms, Laser-Cut Acrylic, Kinetic Split-Flap Segments]\n\nPhase 2: Visual Rendering\nGenerate a 2:1 horizontal asset sheet.\n\nLEFT HALF:\nTransform the main subject or readable text in Input A into the generated typographic identity. Preserve exact composition, spacing relationships, silhouette, and camera angle.\n\nRIGHT HALF:\nCreate a clean type-specimen panel.\n\nPhase 3: Text Content\nRender this text on the right panel:\n\n\"Type Identity: [Generate a name from the selected elements]\n\n<instruction>\nInput A is the source image.\nGoal: Transform Input A into '[Type Identity]'.\nRules:\nComposition Fidelity: Preserve original layout, spacing, silhouette, and scene structure.\nTypographic Fusion: Combine [Typographic Tradition 1] with [Typographic Tradition 2].\nConstruction: Build the forms using [Letter Construction System 1] and [Letter Construction System 2].\nDetails: Include stroke contrast, terminals, joins, texture, dimensionality, and production artifacts.\nLighting: Reveal material and letterform depth clearly.\nRendering: High-resolution typographic design visualization.\nOutput: ONE image, high-fidelity letterform transformation.\n</instruction>\"\n</instruction>",
      "gen_prompt": "A two-panel horizontal typographic asset sheet, 2:1. Left half: a bold display word rendered as a fusion of blackletter manuscript weight and swiss grotesk geometry, built from neon tube bends and chiseled stone cuts, preserving the original composition and silhouette. Right half: a clean type-specimen panel on off-white, showing the alphabet, stroke contrast detail, terminals and joins, with small-caps annotations. Studio lighting that reveals material and letterform depth, high-resolution design visualization.",
      "prompt_ko": "**무작위 조합 테이블**로 스타일을 뽑는 방식. 타이포 전통 15종(블랙레터·스위스 그로테스크·아르누보·70년대 펑크·일본 붓글씨·바우하우스…)과 문자 구성 시스템 15종(모듈 그리드·리본 연속선·석재 조각·네온 튜브·잉크 번짐·압출 3D·자수 실땀·글리치…)에서 **각각 2개씩 뽑아 블렌드**하고, 그 조합에 이름을 붙인다. 매번 다른 결과가 나오면서도 결과물이 무너지지 않는 이유는 2단계 구조 때문 — 좌측은 **원본 구도·간격·실루엣·카메라 각도를 보존한 변환**, 우측은 **스펙시멘 패널**로 규칙을 눈으로 검증하게 만든다.",
