      "title": "★공간 주파수 대역으로 디테일 예산을 배분 — 저주파는 블로킹, 고주파는 음식에만",
      "prompt": "Another prompt for visualizing cities based on their signature dishes. Cairo looks pretty delicious to me \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 famous Middle East foodie cities: POSTER = F_low + F_mid + F_high   F_low (0-1 cycles/region): \"MASS + ZONE BLOCKING\"   → 3 horizontal bands: header(cream), center(white), footer(cream)   → frame: single black rectangle   → wall: flat # FAFAFA, zero texture   → construction_grid: 0.25pt lines, 8% opacity  F_mid (1-4 cycles/region): \"STRUCTURE + LABELS\"   → header: 12 cell borders, tiny text labels   → footer: flowchart arrows, step icons, numbered   → letters: basic food silhouettes recognizable   → chefs: basic pose readable (not detailed faces)  F_high (4+ cycles/region): \"PHOTOREAL TEXTURE\"   → ONLY on food letters:     - rice grain individuality     - fish muscle fiber + moisture sheen     - tempura batter crunch texture     - nori wrinkle + translucency   → ONLY on chef tools:     - knife edge reflection     - bucket liquid meniscus   → ZERO high-freq on: wall, frame, grid lines, labels  ENERGY_CONSTRAINT:   H(F_high_center) > 10 × H(F_high_header)   H(F_high_footer) < 0.1 × H(F_high_center)   // center DOMINATES. header/footer stay FLAT and CLEAN.  RENDER: {{CITY}} poster. Swiss flat + photoreal center ONLY.",
      "gen_prompt": "A swiss-flat food poster with three horizontal bands: cream header, white center, cream footer, framed by a single thin black rectangle on a flat off-white wall with no texture. The center holds a photoreal hero dish rendered with extreme material detail — individual rice grains, moisture sheen, batter crunch texture, translucent wrinkled nori. Header and footer stay completely flat and clean: tiny cell borders with small-caps labels, flowchart arrows and numbered step icons. Studio lighting on the food only.",
      "prompt_ko": "**디테일을 어디에 쓸지 예산처럼 배분**하는 방법. 이미지를 공간 주파수 3개 대역으로 나눠 각 대역이 담당할 것을 못 박는다 — `F_low`(0~1 cycles)는 덩어리와 영역 블로킹, `F_mid`(1~4)는 구조와 라벨, `F_high`(4+)는 **오직 음식과 조리도구에만**. 벽·프레임·그리드선·라벨에는 고주파를 **0으로 지정**한다. 여기에 에너지 제약까지 붙였다 — `H(중앙) > 10 × H(헤더)`, `H(푸터) < 0.1 × H(중앙)`. \"중앙이 지배하고 헤더·푸터는 납작하게\"를 말이 아니라 **수식으로** 건 것이 이 프롬프트의 값.",
