      "title": "★\"사진이 아니라 컨셉아트 페인팅으로 느껴져야 한다\" — 도시를 화가 이름으로 그리는 [CITY] 템플릿",
      "prompt": "Create a cinematic digital painting inspired by the expressive painterly style of Craig Mullins, depicting [CITY] as the main subject. Preserve the city's authentic identity through its iconic landmarks, traditional architecture, cultural details, native vegetation, and recognizable atmosphere.\n\nUse bold, confident brushstrokes, rich painterly textures, dramatic lighting, natural color harmony, soft atmospheric perspective, realistic scale, and cinematic composition. Blend warm golden sunlight with subtle volumetric light, deep shadows, and dynamic cloud formations to create an emotional, timeless scene.\n\nThe artwork should feel like a premium concept art painting rather than a photograph, with handcrafted brushwork, layered textures, controlled edges, and realistic environmental storytelling. High detail, museum-quality digital painting, ultra-realistic concept art, 8K, no text, no watermark.",
      "gen_prompt": "A cinematic digital painting inspired by the expressive painterly style of Craig Mullins, depicting Istanbul as the main subject. Preserve the city's authentic identity through its iconic landmarks - the domes and minarets of the Hagia Sophia and the Blue Mosque rising over the Bosphorus - along with traditional Ottoman architecture, ferry boats, gulls, cypress trees and the recognisable haze of the strait. Use bold, confident brushstrokes, rich painterly textures, dramatic lighting, natural colour harmony, soft atmospheric perspective, realistic scale and cinematic composition. Blend warm golden sunlight with subtle volumetric light, deep shadows and dynamic cloud formations to create an emotional, timeless scene. The artwork should feel like a premium concept art painting rather than a photograph, with handcrafted brushwork, layered textures, controlled edges and realistic environmental storytelling. High detail, museum-quality digital painting, ultra-realistic concept art, no text, no watermark.",
      "prompt_ko": "도시 이미지를 만들 때 대부분 \"시네마틱 포토\"로 가는데, 이 템플릿은 **처음부터 회화로 방향을 잡는다.**\n\n★기준을 **화가 이름 하나로** 세웠다 — `the expressive painterly style of Craig Mullins`. 크레이그 멀린스는 디지털 컨셉아트의 원류로 불리는 화가라, 이 이름 하나가 **\"두꺼운 붓자국 + 정보를 생략한 큰 덩어리 + 빛으로 형태를 세우는\"** 방식을 한꺼번에 부른다. 스타일을 형용사로 나열하는 것보다 훨씬 압축적이다.\n\n★그리고 **못을 박는 문장**이 따로 있다: **`The artwork should feel like a premium concept art painting rather than a photograph`** — AI는 기본값으로 사진 쪽으로 수렴하므로, \"사진이 아니라 그림\"을 명시하지 않으면 붓자국이 사라진다. 뒤에 `handcrafted brushwork`, `controlled edges`(가장자리를 통제 — 다 흐리지도 다 선명하지도 않게)를 붙여 회화의 조건을 구체화했다.\n\n★`[CITY]` 슬롯을 쓰면서도 **정체성 보존**을 앞줄에 뒀다 — `Preserve the city's authentic identity through its iconic landmarks, traditional architecture, cultural details, native vegetation, and recognizable atmosphere`. **토착 식생(native vegetation)까지 항목에 넣은 게 좋다** — 도시를 구분 짓는 건 건물만이 아니다. 같은 계정의 [[ksa8turky-knitted-yarn-miniature-riyadh]] · [[ksa8turky-lego-brick-city-tiltshift-diorama]]와 함께 \"도시를 재료·화법으로 번역하는\" 세트로 볼 것.",
