      "id": "vigocreativeai-stat-block-instead-of-backstory-dossier",
      "source": "https://x.com/VigoCreativeAI/status/2081760376912302217",
      "author": "VigoCreativeAI",
      "date": "2026-07-27",
      "lang": "en",
      "target_model": "GPT Image 2",
      "category": "캐릭터 시트",
      "title": "★★캐릭터에 서사를 주지 말고 서류를 줘라 — 랩타임·압력로그·통행허가 같은 수치가 한눈에 '이미 존재하던 인물'로 만든다",
      "prompt": "VISUAL OS 007 — Violet Manga Character Dossier\n\nBackstory is the most expensive way to make a character feel real. A stat block does it in one glance.\n\nFour strangers, four files:\n\n- TORQUE — Juno Rhee, dune racer, best lap 03:19.482\n- VEKTOR — Nia Kade, signal courier, unit 17\n- ABYSS — Mara Sol, salvage pilot, depth 09\n- CANOPY — Eli Voss, sky botanist, archive 22\n\nYou've never met them, but the paperwork insists they've existed for seasons: lap data, pressure logs, route clearances. Nobody fact-checks a number — they inherit it. Instant canon, zero lore dump.\n\nTwo tricks worth stealing:\n\n1. Every codename prints twice — a huge distressed violet word cropped off the top edge (atmosphere), and a tight black headline you can actually read (information). Same word, two jobs.\n2. The black vertical rail on the outer edge does what a spine does for a book: it turns a poster into an issue. Instant collectible.\n\nLocked: warm-white paper, violet dossier grid, cel-ink hero at 2/3 height, monochrome violet echo portrait, black identity rail\n\nSwaps: codename / character / role line / action / wardrobe + prop\n\nThe character is fiction. The paperwork makes her canon.\n\nPrompt ↓\n\n--- (답글: 프롬프트 전문) ---\nCopy the whole block, swap only the 5 fields at the bottom:\n\n{\n  \"style\": \"violet-manga-character-dossier\",\n  \"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n  \"style_rules\": [\n    \"asymmetrical three-zone dossier grid: info-card stack on the left, large rounded portrait frame center, narrow black vertical identity rail on the outer edge\",\n    \"one original cel-ink character at ~2/3 canvas height — decisive black contours, flat planar shadows, hard white highlights, no photorealism\",\n    \"the same character repeats once as a monochrome violet close-up behind the figure; three depth layers only\",\n    \"one enormous distressed violet uppercase word cropped past the top edge, plus a short black condensed codename as the readable headline\",\n    \"warm off-white paper dominant; violet #6D25C8 family, black structure, tiny hot-magenta signals, max one warm counter-color on the character\",\n    \"dense but disciplined metadata: boxed profile cards, micro labels, dotted matrices, diagonal ticks, barcode marks — all grid-aligned\",\n    \"print finish: paper grain, dry-ink wear and halftone on violet fields and big type only; face and headline stay crisp\",\n    \"all names, emblems and classifications fictional\"\n  ],\n  \"MAIN_TEXT\": \"TORQUE\",\n  \"SECONDARY_TEXT\": \"JUNO RHEE / DUNE RACER / GRID 04\",\n  \"SUBJECT\": \"an original desert mech racer with swept black hair, amber goggles and a sharp competitive grin\",\n  \"SUBJECT_ACTION\": \"kneeling beside a portable turbine wheel while tightening one armored glove\",\n  \"WARDROBE_AND_PROP\": \"white moto armor with black joint panels, violet belt hardware, restrained amber shell plates; prop: an exposed-fin turbine wheel\"\n}",
      "gen_prompt": "A 4:5 violet manga character dossier on warm off-white paper, built as an asymmetrical three-zone grid: a stack of boxed info cards on the left, a large rounded portrait frame in the centre, and a narrow black vertical identity rail down the outer edge like the spine of an issue. One original cel-ink character fills about two thirds of the canvas height — a desert mech racer with swept black hair, amber goggles and a sharp competitive grin, kneeling beside a portable turbine wheel while tightening one armoured glove, drawn with decisive black contours, flat planar shadows and hard white highlights, no photorealism. The same character repeats once behind her as a monochrome violet close-up echo; only three depth layers exist. One enormous distressed violet uppercase word reading TORQUE is cropped past the top edge, while a short black condensed headline repeats the same codename readably, with the line JUNO RHEE / DUNE RACER / GRID 04. Violet #6D25C8 family with black structure, tiny hot-magenta signals and at most one warm counter-colour on the character; white moto armour with black joint panels, violet belt hardware and restrained amber shell plates. Dense but disciplined metadata — boxed profile cards, micro labels, dotted matrices, diagonal ticks and barcode marks, all grid-aligned. Print finish with paper grain, dry-ink wear and halftone on the violet fields and big type only; the face and headline stay crisp. All names, emblems and classifications fictional.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**이 배치에서 가장 값어치 있는 건이다.** 작성자가 프롬프트보다 **왜 그렇게 짰는지**를 먼저 설명했다:\n\n> *\"**뒷이야기(backstory)는 캐릭터를 진짜처럼 만드는 가장 비싼 방법이다. 스탯 블록은 그걸 한눈에 해낸다.**\"*\n\n> *\"당신은 이들을 만난 적이 없지만, **서류가 이들이 몇 시즌째 존재해 왔다고 우긴다** — 랩 데이터, 압력 로그, 경로 통행 허가. **아무도 숫자를 검증하지 않는다. 그냥 물려받는다.** 즉석 정전(canon), 로어 덤프 제로.\"*\n\n```\nTORQUE — Juno Rhee, dune racer, best lap 03:19.482\nVEKTOR — Nia Kade, signal courier, unit 17\nABYSS  — Mara Sol, salvage pilot, depth 09\nCANOPY — Eli Voss, sky botanist, archive 22\n```\n★`03:19.482` 같은 **소수점 셋째 자리**가 핵심이다. 어림수면 설정이지만, 정밀한 수치면 기록이 된다.\n\n★작성자가 직접 꼽은 **훔칠 만한 요령 두 가지**:\n> 1. *\"모든 코드네임이 **두 번 인쇄된다** — 상단에 잘려 나간 거대한 디스트레스 바이올렛 단어(**분위기**)와, 실제로 읽히는 작고 촘촘한 검정 헤드라인(**정보**). **같은 단어, 두 가지 일.**\"*\n> 2. *\"바깥 가장자리의 검정 세로 레일은 **책에서 책등이 하는 일**을 한다 — 포스터를 한 권의 '호(issue)'로 만든다. 즉석 수집품.\"*\n\n★프롬프트는 **JSON + 잠금/교체 분리**다:\n```json\n{ \"style\": \"violet-manga-character-dossier\", \"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n  \"style_rules\": [ …8개 규칙, 여기가 잠금 구간… ],\n  \"MAIN_TEXT\": \"TORQUE\",                    ← 교체 5필드\n  \"SECONDARY_TEXT\": \"JUNO RHEE / DUNE RACER / GRID 04\",\n  \"SUBJECT\": \"…\", \"SUBJECT_ACTION\": \"…\", \"WARDROBE_AND_PROP\": \"…\" }\n```\n> *\"Locked: 웜화이트 종이 · 바이올렛 도시에 그리드 · 화면 2/3 높이의 셀잉크 히어로 · 모노크롬 바이올렛 에코 초상 · 검정 아이덴티티 레일\"*\n> *\"Swaps: 코드네임 / 캐릭터 / 역할 줄 / 액션 / 의상+소품\"*\n\n★그리고 마지막 한 줄: ***\"The character is fiction. The paperwork makes her canon.\"***\n\n우리 적용점: **쇼츠 캐릭터 소개 컷**에 그대로 쓸 수 있다 — 로어를 설명하는 대신 수치 몇 개를 박는 방식.\n\n같은 계정 계열: [[vigocreativeai-versioned-json-style-definition]] · [[vigocreativeai-mixed-dimension-sports-poster-json]] · [[zephyraleigh-blueprint-character-concept-sheet]]",
