      "title": "사람과 개가 동시에 뒤돌아본다 — '동기화된 작별의 순간'을 지시하고, 대각선 리드줄로 둘을 삼분할선에 묶는다",
      "prompt": "A cinematic golden-hour portrait of a Korean woman in New York.\n\nGPT Image 2\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a poetic cinematic golden-hour urban travel portrait of the same elegant Korean woman and the same small cream-colored toy poodle, walking along Washington Street in DUMBO, Brooklyn, with the Manhattan Bridge naturally framed between red-brick warehouse buildings.\n\nPreserve the woman’s exact facial identity, Korean features, age range, skin tone, slim proportions, and recognizable character from the reference image. Keep the dog identical: small cream toy poodle, softly curled fur, slightly apricot ears, round dark eyes, pale tan leather harness, and brass name tag.\n\nShe wears an oversized powder-blue linen shirt over a fitted white tank top, high-waisted ivory wide-leg trousers, beige canvas sneakers, a woven crossbody bag, and delicate silver earrings. Her dark brown hair is styled in a loose low braid with softly backlit strands.\n\nShe walks away from the camera, then turns gently over her shoulder with a peaceful, slightly nostalgic expression. The dog pauses one step behind and also looks back, creating a synchronized farewell moment.\n\nPlace the woman on the left third and the dog on the lower-right third, connected by a diagonal leash. Use the cobblestone street, brick façades, parked cars, and bridge structure as converging leading lines. Keep the Manhattan Bridge in the upper-center-right background, clearly separated from her head.\n\nRear three-quarter near-full-body view from several meters behind at waist height, resembling the final contemplative frame of a contemporary Korean travel film.\n\nLow golden sunlight streams beneath the bridge, creating warm rim light, restrained amber flare, atmospheric dust, gentle fabric movement, and soft highlight bloom. Palette: red brick, powder blue, warm ivory, aged steel, muted brown, and blue-gray shadows.\n\nProfessional cinematic editorial photography, Sony A7R IV, 85mm lens, f/2.0, shallow depth of field, realistic skin texture, softly compressed background, subtle Kodak Vision3 grain, warm highlight roll-off, gentle anamorphic flare.\n\nVertical 3:4, full-bleed photograph, no text, no border, no watermark, no identity drift, no dog variation, no duplicate dog, no malformed hands or leash, no oversized bridge, no crowded landmark collage.",
      "gen_prompt": "A poetic cinematic golden-hour urban travel portrait of an elegant Korean woman walking a small cream toy poodle along Washington Street in DUMBO, Brooklyn, with the Manhattan Bridge naturally framed between red-brick warehouse buildings. She wears an oversized powder-blue linen shirt over a fitted white tank, high-waisted ivory wide-leg trousers, beige canvas sneakers, a woven crossbody bag and delicate silver earrings; her dark brown hair in a loose low braid with backlit strands. The dog has softly curled fur, slightly apricot ears, round dark eyes, a pale tan leather harness and a brass name tag. She walks away from the camera then turns gently over her shoulder with a peaceful, slightly nostalgic expression, and the dog pauses one step behind and also looks back — a synchronized farewell moment. She sits on the left third, the dog on the lower-right third, connected by a diagonal leash; cobblestones, brick façades, parked cars and bridge structure act as converging leading lines, the bridge held in the upper-centre-right and clearly separated from her head. Rear three-quarter near-full-body view from several metres behind at waist height. Low golden sunlight streams beneath the bridge with warm rim light, restrained amber flare, atmospheric dust and soft highlight bloom. Palette of red brick, powder blue, warm ivory, aged steel, muted brown and blue-grey shadow. Sony A7R IV, 85mm, f/2.0, shallow depth of field, realistic skin texture, subtle Kodak Vision3 grain, gentle anamorphic flare. Vertical 3:4 full-bleed photograph, no text, no border, no duplicate dog, no malformed hands or leash, no oversized bridge.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**한 장면에 '동기화'를 지시한 프롬프트**다:\n\n> *\"그녀는 카메라에서 멀어지며 걷다가 어깨 너머로 부드럽게 돌아본다. **개는 한 걸음 뒤에서 멈추고 역시 돌아본다 — 동기화된 작별의 순간을 만들며.**\"*\n\n사람과 동물을 각각 지시하면 따로 노는데, **하나의 사건(작별)으로 묶으면** 두 동작이 한 이야기가 된다.\n\n★구도를 좌표로 못박았다:\n```\n여성 = 좌측 1/3 · 개 = 우측 하단 1/3 · 둘을 **대각선 리드줄로 연결**\n자갈길·벽돌 파사드·주차된 차·다리 구조 = **수렴하는 리딩 라인**\n맨해튼 브리지 = 상단 중앙우측, ★**그녀의 머리와 분명히 분리**\n시점 = 몇 미터 뒤 허리 높이에서 후면 3/4, 근접 전신\n```\n★`clearly separated from her head` — 랜드마크가 인물 머리에 겹치는 흔한 사고를 미리 막았다.\n\n★**아이덴티티 보존 지시가 사람과 개 양쪽에** 걸려 있다 — *\"참조 이미지의 얼굴 정체성·한국인 특징·연령대·피부톤·비례를 정확히 보존\"*, *\"개도 동일하게: 작은 크림색 토이푸들, 부드럽게 말린 털, 살짝 살구빛 귀, 둥근 검은 눈, 연한 탠 가죽 하네스, 황동 이름표\"*. 소품(이름표)까지 고정한 게 재현 열쇠다.\n\n★네거티브도 실패 지점을 이름으로 지목한다: `no identity drift, no dog variation, **no duplicate dog**, no malformed hands or leash, no oversized bridge, no crowded landmark collage`. '개가 두 마리 나오는' 실패를 겪어 본 사람의 목록이다.\n\n★촬영 스펙(Sony A7R IV · 85mm · f/2.0 · Kodak Vision3 그레인 · 아나모픽 플레어)은 *\"현대 한국 여행 영화의 마지막 사색 프레임\"*이라는 레퍼런스와 짝을 이룬다.\n\n같은 계정 계열: [[goodmanprotocol-luxury-sedan-candid-portrait]] · [[goodmanprotocol-quiet-street-highfashion-editorial]]",
