      "prompt": "Turning imagination into comic chaos.\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a playful comic-style digital illustration of two animated, caricature-inspired characters engaged in a humorous dramatic showdown. One character wears a sleek formal outfit and looks surprised, shocked, or off-balance while reacting to the other character’s playful action. The second character wears a stylish oversized outfit with a confident, mischievous expression and a dynamic pose. Add expressive comic speech bubbles with bold, fun dialogue, including a small crown or symbolic motion lines, swirls, arrows, and playful doodles. Add exaggerated facial expressions, energetic poses, vibrant colors, and a modern pop-art comic aesthetic. Make the image feel humorous, icon for extra personality.\n\nUse a textured paper background with pastel color splashes, filled with hand-drawn comic elements like hearts, stars, lightning bolts, motion lines, swirls, arrows, and playful doodles. Add exaggerated facial expressions, energetic poses, vibrant colors, and a modern pop-art comic aesthetic. Make the image feel humorous, lively, detailed, and suitable for a social media cartoon illustration.",
      "gen_prompt": "A playful comic-style digital illustration of two caricature-inspired characters in a humorous dramatic showdown. One wears a sleek formal outfit and looks surprised and off-balance, reacting to the other's playful action; the second wears a stylish oversized outfit with a confident, mischievous expression and a dynamic pose, a small crown floating above. Expressive comic speech bubbles carry bold fun dialogue. A textured paper background with pastel colour splashes is filled with hand-drawn comic elements — hearts, stars, lightning bolts, motion lines, swirls, arrows and playful doodles. Exaggerated facial expressions, energetic poses, vibrant colours, modern pop-art comic aesthetic, humorous, lively and highly detailed, suited to a social-media cartoon illustration.",
      "prompt_ko": "★두 인물 만화에서 자주 실패하는 지점 — **둘 다 비슷한 표정이 되는 것**을 지시로 갈랐다:\n\n```\n캐릭터 A: 매끈한 정장, **놀라거나 충격받거나 균형을 잃은** 모습으로\n         상대의 장난스러운 행동에 **반응**한다\n캐릭터 B: 스타일리시한 오버사이즈, **자신만만하고 장난기 있는** 표정에 역동적 포즈\n         + 작은 왕관이나 상징적 모션 라인\n```\n★**한쪽을 '반응하는 쪽'으로 못박은 것**이 요점이다. 그래야 둘 사이에 인과가 생기고 장면이 성립한다.\n\n★배경도 요소를 열거로 채운다 — 질감 있는 종이 바탕 + 파스텔 물감 튀김 + 손그림 요소(하트·별·번개·모션라인·소용돌이·화살표·낙서). 팝아트 코믹의 상투 자산을 **목록으로 나열**해 밀도를 확보하는 방식.\n\n★말풍선에 *\"굵고 재미있는 대사\"*를 넣으라고 했지만, 생성 모델의 글자 정확도를 감안하면 실제로는 **말풍선 형태만 얻고 텍스트는 후반에 얹는** 편이 낫다 — [[reference_storyboard_conti_workflow]]의 HTML 텍스트 레이어 분리와 같은 판단.\n\n소셜 카툰 양산용 템플릿으로 값어치가 있다.",
