      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 on ChatGPT \n\nPrompt:\n\nUse the uploaded reference image as the strict identity and outfit reference. Preserve the face, facial features, skin tone, hairstyle, hair colour, accessories, outfit, and overall vibe exactly as shown.\nCreate a high-quality vertical (4:5 or 9:16) mixed-media portrait featuring:\nA realistic full-body version of the person. A black hand-drawn doodle-shadow of the same person on the wall beside them.\n\nThe real person should look cute, slightly embarrassed, playful, and naturally copying a new random mischievous pose each generation. The doodle-shadow should perform the same pose idea in a much more exaggerated, chaotic, cartoonish way, with manga motion lines, stars, hearts, and sparkles.\n\nUse a clean white/cream studio wall, minimal background, soft natural lighting, and keep both figures fully visible. The doodle should clearly resemble the real person through hairstyle, accessories, outfit silhouette, and pose.\n\nNegative Prompt: outfit changes, identity changes, realistic second person, normal shadow, horror, anime human, cluttered background, repeated pointing or finger-gun poses, stiff pose, extra limbs/fingers, distorted body, text, watermark, logo, AI artifacts.",
      "gen_prompt": "A high-quality vertical mixed-media portrait: a realistic full-body young woman stands against a clean white studio wall, looking cute, slightly embarrassed and playful in a mischievous pose. Beside her on the wall, a black hand-drawn doodle-shadow of the same person performs the same pose idea in a much more exaggerated, chaotic and cartoonish way, with manga motion lines, stars, hearts and sparkles. The doodle clearly resembles her through hairstyle, accessories, outfit silhouette and pose. Minimal background, soft natural lighting, both figures fully visible. No realistic second person, no normal shadow, no cluttered background, no repeated pointing or finger-gun poses, no stiff pose, no extra limbs or fingers, no text or watermark.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**역할 분담이 재미를 만든다** — 실사 인물과 그림자에 서로 다른 감정 온도를 배정했다:\n\n```\n실사 인물   : 귀엽고, **약간 부끄러워하며**, 장난스럽게,\n             ★**매 생성마다 새로운 무작위 장난 포즈**를 자연스럽게 따라 한다\n낙서 그림자 : 같은 포즈 아이디어를 **훨씬 과장되고 혼란스럽고 만화적으로** 수행\n             + 만화 모션라인 · 별 · 하트 · 반짝임\n★낙서는 **헤어스타일·액세서리·의상 실루엣·포즈**로 실제 인물임이 분명히 드러나야 한다\n```\n\n★**`a new random mischievous pose each generation`** — 같은 프롬프트를 여러 번 돌릴 것을 전제하고 **변주를 지시**했다. 시리즈 생성용 프롬프트의 요령.\n\n★네거티브가 특히 실전적이다: `repeated pointing or finger-gun poses` — 이런 프롬프트를 돌리면 모델이 **손가락 총 포즈만 반복**하는 사고가 난다. 그걸 이름으로 지목해 막았다. `normal shadow`(평범한 그림자)와 `realistic second person`(진짜 두 번째 사람)도 이 컨셉이 무너지는 두 방향이다.\n\n★우리 라이브러리에 같은 개념이 둘 더 있다 — [[simplyannisa-realistic-doodle-shadow-duo]] · [[goodmanprotocol-still-subject-mischievous-shadow]]. 이 판본의 차이는 **매 생성 변주 지시 + 네거티브 목록의 구체성**이다.",
