      "title": "★예술가의 손을 화면에 남긴다 — \"지금 이 작품이 실시간으로 만들어지는 중\"임을 붓 하나로 증명",
      "prompt": "The Modern Bridal Atelier 💐\n\nIf you could step into one of these 3D art pieces, which color room are you entering?\n\n1. Lavender Royalty\n2. Emerald Elegance\n3. Ivory Couture\n4. Wildflower Dream\n\n🎞️ GPT Image 2.0 Visuals\n\nPrompt👇🏾 https://t.co/Cved4vatj2\n\n--- (답글: Universal Prompt) ---\nUniversal Plug-in Prompt\n\nCreate an extraordinarily detailed, hyper-realistic 3D mixed-media bridal artwork in a perfect 1:1 square composition, photographed from a [CAMERA ANGLE / PERSPECTIVE] on a [CANVAS OR SURFACE] placed against a [BACKGROUND / WORKSPACE].\n\nAt the visual centre, feature [BRIDE / FEMALE SUBJECT] wearing an elaborate [GOWN STYLE / COLOUR / MATERIAL], with [NECKLINE / BODICE DETAILS / EMBELLISHMENTS] and a dramatic [SKIRT / TRAIN / SILHOUETTE] extending organically across the artwork. Her styling includes [HAIRSTYLE], [CROWN / HEADPIECE], [JEWELLERY], [VEIL DETAILS], and [BOUQUET / HAND POSITION / POSE].\n\nTransform the surrounding gown, train, or composition into an intricate fusion of [PAPER ART / FABRIC / LACE / FLOWERS / BOTANICAL ELEMENTS / QUILLING / SCULPTED DETAILS], with the physical materials appearing to [EMERGE / BLOOM / FLOW / DISSOLVE / MERGE] seamlessly from the surface. Emphasise highly tactile dimensionality, visible raised layers, delicate paper edges, realistic fabric folds, fine lace patterns, sculpted petals, and intricate handcrafted textures.\n\nInclude [ARTIST TOOL / BRUSH / PEN / HAND] visibly interacting with the artwork, suggesting that the masterpiece is actively being created in real time. Add [SECONDARY PROPS / ARTISAN TOOLS / DECORATIVE ELEMENTS] naturally around the composition to reinforce the handcrafted studio environment.\n\nUse [LIGHTING STYLE] with carefully controlled shadows that reveal the raised dimensional elements and enhance the contrast between [PRIMARY COLOUR PALETTE] and [ACCENT COLOURS].\n\nPreserve a refined fine-art atmosphere with cinematic depth, photorealistic materials, subtle imperfections, exquisite craftsmanship, and museum-quality detail.\nThe final image should feel like a seamless fusion of couture fashion, bridal portraiture, handcrafted paper sculpture, mixed-media artistry, and miniature worlds, with the boundary between illustration and physical reality intentionally blurred.\n\nVisual style: ultra-detailed, hyper-realistic 3D mixed-media sculpture, tactile handcrafted textures, photorealistic materials, exquisite fine-art craftsmanship, realistic depth and shadows, cinematic studio photography, 8K detail, sharp focus, premium editorial quality, --ar 1:1.\n\n--- (답글: Cheat Sheet) ---\nCheat Sheet\n\n[CAMERA ANGLE] → Top-down, high-angle, macro close-up, overhead flat-lay\n[CANVAS OR SURFACE] → White sketch canvas, beige backdrop, textured sketchbook\n\n[BRIDE / FEMALE SUBJECT] → Seated bride, standing miniature bride, rear-facing bride\n[GOWN STYLE] → Lavender satin, emerald beaded couture, ivory lace\n\n[HAIRSTYLE] → Dark updo, low bun, long wavy hair\n[MATERIALS] → Paper flowers, lace, fabric, petals, vines, butterflies\n\n[ARTIST TOOL] → Fine paintbrush, detailing brush, flower-filled fountain pen\n[SECONDARY PROPS] → Art tools, brushes, candle, coaster, paper butterflies\n\n[LIGHTING STYLE] → Soft studio, bright editorial, warm candlelit\n[COLOUR PALETTE] → Lavender + silver, emerald + white, ivory + beige, multicolour\n\nCore aesthetic → Couture × bridal art × paper sculpture × handcrafted illusion",
      "gen_prompt": "An extraordinarily detailed hyper-realistic 3D mixed-media bridal artwork in a perfect 1:1 composition, photographed top-down on a white sketch canvas placed on a warm studio desk. At the visual centre a seated bride wears an elaborate ivory lace gown with a beaded bodice and a dramatic train extending organically across the artwork, her dark hair in a low updo with a pearl crown and a soft veil, holding a small bouquet. The gown and train transform into an intricate fusion of paper art, lace, fabric flowers and botanical elements, the physical materials appearing to bloom and flow seamlessly out of the canvas surface — visible raised layers, delicate paper edges, realistic fabric folds, fine lace patterns and sculpted petals. A fine detailing brush held by a hand is visibly interacting with the artwork, suggesting the piece is being created in real time, with art tools, loose petals and paper butterflies arranged naturally around the composition. Soft studio lighting with controlled shadows reveals the raised dimensional elements and heightens the contrast between ivory and beige with silver accents. Cinematic depth, photorealistic materials, subtle imperfections, museum-quality detail, 8K, 1:1.",
      "prompt_ko": "★네 번째 세트. 앞의 것들과 같은 구조인데 **결정적 장치가 하나 추가됐다**:\n\n> *\"**[예술가 도구/붓/펜/손]이 작품과 눈에 보이게 상호작용**하도록 포함시켜, **이 걸작이 지금 실시간으로 만들어지고 있음**을 암시하라.\"*\n\n★★**손과 붓 하나가 이미지의 성격을 바꾼다.** 완성된 작품 사진은 결과물이지만, 손이 들어오면 **과정의 한 순간**이 된다. 보는 사람이 '만들어지는 중'이라는 시간 안으로 들어온다.\n\n★재료가 캔버스에서 **나오는 방식**도 슬롯으로 뺐다:\n```\n물리적 재료가 표면에서 [EMERGE / BLOOM / FLOW / DISSOLVE / MERGE] 하듯 보이게\n  (솟아나기 / 피어나기 / 흘러나오기 / 녹아들기 / 뒤섞이기)\n```\n다섯 개 동사가 각각 다른 느낌을 만든다 — **동사를 슬롯으로 만든** 드문 예다.\n\n★마지막 선언이 이 시리즈 전체의 목표를 말한다:\n> *\"최종 이미지는 쿠튀르 패션 · 브라이덜 초상 · 수공예 종이 조각 · 믹스드미디어 · 미니어처 세계의 이음매 없는 융합처럼 느껴져야 하며, **일러스트와 물리적 실재의 경계를 의도적으로 흐려야** 한다.\"*\n\n★치트시트의 마지막 줄도 같은 요약이다 — `Core aesthetic → Couture × bridal art × paper sculpture × handcrafted illusion`.\n\n★네 세트를 나란히 놓으면 이 계정의 방법론이 보인다: **하나의 미감(수공예 부조)을 잡고 주제만 바꿔가며(미니어처 월드 / 쿠튀르 / 랜드마크 / 브라이덜) 범용 프롬프트를 계속 찍어내는 것.**",
