      "title": "★주제를 '거대한 은유 기계'로 번역하고, 2D 잉크와 3D 미니어처를 한 화면에 섞는다",
      "prompt": "I was doing these satire and cartoon prompts and wondered why not create a hybrid style. Here is one: \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 Ai inferred topics in this: CONCEPT ANCHOR 1: \"Crowded editorial satire panel — one giant metaphor machine, labeled consequences, speech bubbles, warning signs, bottom thesis banner, social critique energy\"  ::  CONCEPT ANCHOR 2: \"Open-book pop-up comic diorama — miniature 3D scene rising from printed comic pages, bold action typography, toy-like staging, collectible tabletop presentation\"  ::  CONCEPT ANCHOR 3: \"Minimal contradiction comic — simple black-and-white irony panels, blunt headline captions, literalized hypocrisy, clean readable humor\"  INSTRUCTION: Find the exact visual center of these three concepts. Ignore the specific topic, characters, brands, and written jokes. Extract only the reusable style logic.  Render $ SUBJECT as a satirical pop-up comic machine: a physical metaphor for the subject rising from an open illustrated book, surrounded by ironic mini-scenes and blunt labels.  STYLE RULES: - Convert $ SUBJECT into a central oversized machine, attraction, institution, ritual, factory, game, shrine, or absurd public system. - Stage it on an open comic book, printed guide page, or pop-up paper spread. - Add tiny 3D figures interacting with the system in funny, self-defeating, exaggerated, or ironic ways. - Surround the scene with labels, speech bubbles, warning signs, scoreboard stats, arrows, contradiction captions, and small symbolic stations. - Use a hybrid look: 3D miniature objects rising from 2D comic panels. - Let some parts remain flat black-and-white ink drawings while others become dimensional clay/resin/paper miniatures. - Include one bold bottom banner or title strip that summarizes the satire. - Keep it dense with jokes but compositionally readable.  OUTPUT: A viral satirical pop-up diorama where $ SUBJECT becomes a literal metaphor machine explained through comic labels, tiny people, and ironic storybook staging.",
      "gen_prompt": "Render SOCIAL MEDIA ALGORITHM as a satirical pop-up comic machine: a physical metaphor for the subject rising from an open illustrated book, surrounded by ironic mini-scenes and blunt labels. Convert the subject into a central oversized machine and absurd public system. Stage it on an open comic book / pop-up paper spread. Add tiny 3D figures interacting with the system in funny, self-defeating, exaggerated ways. Surround the scene with labels, speech bubbles, warning signs, scoreboard stats, arrows and contradiction captions. Hybrid look: 3D miniature objects rising from 2D comic panels — some parts remain flat black-and-white ink drawings while others become dimensional clay/resin/paper miniatures. One bold bottom banner summarizes the satire. Dense with jokes but compositionally readable. Single image, 16:9.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**세 개의 앵커에서 '시각적 중심'만 뽑아 쓰는 합성 문법.**\n\n```\nCONCEPT ANCHOR 1: 편집 풍자 패널 …\nCONCEPT ANCHOR 2: 팝업북 코믹 디오라마 …\nCONCEPT ANCHOR 3: 미니멀 모순 코믹 …\nINSTRUCTION: 이 셋의 정확한 시각적 중심을 찾아라.\n             구체적 주제·인물·브랜드·농담은 무시하고 **재사용 가능한 스타일 논리만** 추출하라.\n```\n\n세 레퍼런스를 나열하고 \"이것들의 교집합을 찾아라\"고 시킨다. 예시를 베끼지 말라고 명시하는 게\n핵심 — **스타일 DNA만 남기고 내용은 버리게 한다.**\n\n★**주제 변환 규칙이 명시적이다**: `주제를 중앙의 거대한 기계·놀이기구·제도·의식·공장·게임·사당·\n부조리한 공공 시스템으로 바꿔라`. 추상적 주제를 물리적 장치로 강제 번역하는 지시다.\n\n★**2D와 3D를 의도적으로 섞는다** — 일부는 평면 흑백 잉크로 남기고 일부는 점토·레진·종이\n미니어처로. 그 대비 자체가 스타일이 된다.",
      "ref_image": null,
      "result": "results/gdgtify-satire-popup-comic-machine.webp",
      "seed": 695551833
