      "title": "★`::숫자` 가중치로 앵커→형태→재질→조명→렌더→네거티브를 층층이 쌓는다",
      "prompt": "Famous inventors visualized in this cool blueprint style with GPT Image 2. \n\n<instructions> input = famous inventors input = ai inferred invention blueprints function render_blueprint ($ inventor, $ invention) anchor: [line‑art silhouette of $ inventor] :: [cyanotype overlay of $ invention mechanical drawings]::5 morphology: the silhouette is drawn with white ink on deep blue paper, internal details are precise patent‑style schematics, gears and levers echo the facial features::4 material physics: cyanotype paper texture, white ink pen, blue watercolor washes, occasional chemical stains, slightly yellowed edges::3 illumination: UV‑exposed glow, subtle vignette, light leaking through folded paper creases::2 render stack: archival patent illustration, high‑contrast monochrome blueprint, 8k, Behance technical art::1 negative: [photorealism, soft shading, 3D render, handwriting]::-1 </instructions>",
      "gen_prompt": "Line-art silhouette of Nikola Tesla overlaid with cyanotype mechanical drawings of an alternating-current generator. The silhouette is drawn with white ink on deep blue paper; internal details are precise patent-style schematics; gears and levers echo the facial features. Cyanotype paper texture, white ink pen, blue watercolour washes, occasional chemical stains, slightly yellowed edges. UV-exposed glow, subtle vignette, light leaking through folded paper creases. Archival patent illustration, high-contrast monochrome blueprint, 8k. Not photorealistic, no soft shading, no 3D render, no handwriting.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**가중치 스택 문법.** 항목마다 `::숫자`로 중요도를 매겨 층을 쌓는다.\n\n```\nanchor:           [$inventor 라인아트 실루엣] :: [$invention 청사진 도면]::5\nmorphology:       흰 잉크 실루엣, 내부는 특허 도면, **톱니와 레버가 이목구비를 반복**::4\nmaterial physics: 사이아노타입 종이결, 흰 잉크펜, 청색 수채 번짐, 화학 얼룩, 누런 가장자리::3\nillumination:     UV 노출 발광, 접힌 자국 사이로 새는 빛::2\nrender stack:     아카이브 특허 삽화, 고대비 청사진, 8k::1\nnegative:         [사진사실주의, 부드러운 음영, 3D 렌더, 손글씨]::-1\n```\n\n★**핵심은 morphology 한 줄** — *\"톱니와 레버가 얼굴 생김새를 반향한다\"*.\n인물과 발명품을 나란히 놓는 게 아니라 **발명품의 부품으로 얼굴을 그리게** 만든다.\n\n★가중치가 5→1로 내려가고 네거티브만 -1. 모델에게 \"무엇을 먼저 볼지\" 순서를 준다.",
      "ref_image": null,
      "result": "results/gdgtify-cyanotype-inventor-blueprint.webp",
      "seed": 2022381605
