      "title": "★STEP 1→5로 '무엇을 추론할지'를 순서대로 시킨다 (음식 → 미니 작업 현장)",
      "prompt": "I asked GPT to show me 4 international dishes everyone should try that are not well known ... I don't know. They made me hungry \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 international dishes everyone should try that are not well known: 05 :: CULINARY_TASK_SOLVER :: FOOD → MICRO-SCENE  INPUT ::= [FOOD_SUBJECT]  STEP_1 :: infer edible architecture - overall food shape - surface texture - layers / filling / crust / glaze / garnish - fragile or sturdy zones - preparation stage  STEP_2 :: infer tiny crew logic - who would work on this food? - what tools match the preparation? - where would ladders, tables, carts, brushes, grills, knives, or trays go? - what actions reveal scale?  STEP_3 :: infer book context - recipe book for domestic memory - menu for restaurant service - travel journal for cuisine origin - ledger for market/price story - manuscript for poetic/nostalgic tone  STEP_4 :: add atmosphere - steam for hot food - smoke for grilled food - sugar dust for pastry - sauce gloss for rich food - crumbs and spills for realism  STEP_5 :: photograph - macro lens - warm shallow depth - realistic food texture - tiny shadows anchoring workers",
      "gen_prompt": "A macro photograph of a bowl of Korean kimchi jjigae turned into a micro-scene: tiny crew members work on the dish at real scale cues. Infer the edible architecture first — overall shape, surface texture, layers, fragile and sturdy zones, stage of preparation. Then place the tiny workers with tools that match the cooking: ladders on the rim, brushes, ladles, trays, a small cart. Stage the bowl on an open recipe book page for domestic memory. Steam rises from the hot stew; sauce gloss, crumbs and spills for realism. Macro lens, warm shallow depth of field, realistic food texture, tiny shadows anchoring the workers.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**절차형 문법.** 결과를 묘사하지 않고 **추론 순서**를 지시한다.\n\n```\nSTEP_1 :: 먹을 수 있는 건축 구조를 추론 — 전체 형태, 표면 질감, 층/속/껍질/광택/고명,\n                                        무른 곳과 단단한 곳, 조리 단계\nSTEP_2 :: 작은 인부들의 논리를 추론 — 누가 이 음식을 작업할까? 어떤 도구가 맞을까?\n                                    사다리·수레·솔·그릴·칼을 어디에 둘까?\n                                    어떤 동작이 축척을 드러낼까?\nSTEP_3 :: 책의 맥락을 추론 — 가정의 기억이면 레시피북, 서비스면 메뉴판,\n                            원산지면 여행일지, 시장이면 장부, 향수면 필사본\nSTEP_4 :: 분위기 — 뜨거우면 김, 구운 것이면 연기, 페이스트리면 설탕가루\nSTEP_5 :: 촬영 — 매크로 렌즈, 따뜻한 얕은 심도, 인부를 바닥에 고정하는 작은 그림자\n```\n\n★**STEP_2가 이 프롬프트의 중심**이다. \"작은 사람들을 넣어라\"가 아니라 **\"누가·어떤 도구로·\n어디서 일할지를 음식에서 역산하라\"**고 시킨다. 그래서 장면에 논리가 생긴다.\n\n★STEP_3처럼 **맥락에 따라 배경 매체를 갈아끼우는 분기**도 그대로 차용할 값어치가 있다.",
      "ref_image": null,
      "result": "results/gdgtify-food-micro-scene-steps.webp",
      "seed": 1409973299
