      "title": "★바깥은 아이콘, 안은 이야기 — 실루엣 내부에 미니어처 장면을 층층이 넣는다",
      "prompt": "I don't do these prompts with GPT because of restrictions but Nano Banana handles them well.\n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 famous pink floyd like albums: CONCEPT ANCHOR 1: \"Monochrome album-card design — rectangular framed panels, bold title bands, ornamental linework, symbolic architecture, music-poster rhythm\"\n\n::\n\nCONCEPT ANCHOR 2: \"Double-exposure cinema poster — subject silhouette filled with narrative scenes, psychological landscapes, hidden memories, high-contrast mood\"\n\n::\n\nCONCEPT ANCHOR 3: \"Pastel storybook relief — delicate handmade textures, tiny scenic details, soft architectural forms, quiet poetic atmosphere\"\n\nINSTRUCTION:\nFind the exact visual center of these three concepts.\nIgnore literal bands, film references, characters, and known stories.\nUse only the compositional and material DNA.\n\nRender $ SUBJECT as a symbolic story-poster where its outer form is graphic and iconic, but its interior becomes a delicate illustrated world.\n\nSTYLE RULES:\n- Place the subject inside a rectangular poster/card frame with elegant Art Deco borders.\n- Use a large title plaque or caption band inferred from the subject’s core identity.\n- The subject’s silhouette should contain layered miniature scenes, memories, symbolic landscapes, or interior story fragments.\n- Use mostly monochrome linework and gray contrast, but allow small pastel textile accents inside the inner world.\n- Add decorative patterns: circuits, vines, waves, gears, stars, windows, arches, or symbols inferred from $ SUBJECT.\n- Let the poster feel archival, musical, cinematic, and storybook-like.\n- The image should be readable as a bold icon from far away and emotionally rich up close.\n\nOUTPUT:\nA framed symbolic poster where $ SUBJECT becomes a monochrome Art Deco icon containing a soft hidden story-world.",
      "gen_prompt": "Render a lighthouse as a symbolic story-poster: its outer form is graphic and iconic, but its interior becomes a delicate illustrated world. Place the subject inside a rectangular poster frame with elegant Art Deco borders and a large title plaque inferred from its identity. The lighthouse silhouette contains layered miniature scenes — a keeper climbing a spiral stair, a storm-tossed boat, a sleeping village, a beam cutting fog — rendered as interior story fragments. Mostly monochrome linework and grey contrast, with small pastel textile accents inside the inner world. Decorative patterns inferred from the subject: waves, rope coils, stars, arched windows. Archival, musical, cinematic, storybook-like. Readable as a bold icon from far away and emotionally rich up close.",
      "prompt_ko": "★앞 배치의 `satire-popup-comic-machine`·`scifi-gatefold-dossier`와 **같은 CONCEPT ANCHOR\n문법**이다. 이번에 합치는 재료는 이것:\n\n```\nANCHOR 1: 모노크롬 앨범 카드 — 사각 프레임, 굵은 타이틀 밴드, 장식 선, 상징적 건축\nANCHOR 2: 이중노출 영화 포스터 — 실루엣 안에 서사 장면, 심리적 풍경, 숨은 기억\nANCHOR 3: 파스텔 그림책 부조 — 섬세한 수제 질감, 작은 풍경 디테일, 조용한 시적 분위기\nINSTRUCTION: 셋의 정확한 시각적 중심을 찾아라. **밴드·영화·캐릭터·알려진 이야기는 무시하고\n             구성과 재료의 DNA만 써라.**\n```\n\n★**\"멀리서는 굵은 아이콘, 가까이서는 감정이 풍부하게\"** — 이 한 줄이 목표를 두 거리로 나눠\n지정한다. 11번(공간주파수 하이브리드)의 *\"1600px와 120px에서 각각 검사하라\"*와 같은 발상이다.\n\n★**바깥은 그래픽, 안은 삽화**라는 이중 구조가 핵심. 실루엣을 창으로 쓰는 방식.",
