      "prompt": "🇸🇦 عندما يتحول الوطن إلى قطعة تحملها معك\n\nالبرومبت ⬇️\n\nCreate a premium luxury keychain shaped like [CITY/LANDMARK/COUNTRY], transforming its iconic skyline, landmarks, streets, and cultural identity into an intricate miniature relief engraved inside the silhouette. Use premium gold metal edges, ultra-detailed craftsmanship, realistic embossed architecture, elegant depth, luxurious materials, cinematic studio lighting, macro photography, soft reflections, dark premium background, ultra-photorealistic, collectible souvenir design, masterpiece quality, 8K, no people, no watermark",
