      "title": "★얼굴을 '스타일'이 아니라 해부 목록으로 잠근다 — 두개골·눈·빠진 이까지 세어서 지정",
      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on Chatgpt\n\nPROMPT:\n\nTwo-dimensional alternative character illustration of [CHARACTER], occupying approximately seventy-five percent of the frame in [POSE], with [HAIR] and [EXPRESSION]. Oversized rounded cranium, a short flattened lower face, a narrow jaw, a long thin neck, slightly oversized ears, huge pale oval eyes with tiny off-center pupils, extremely thick horizontal black eyebrows, heavy black upper eyelids, muted mauve under-eye rings, a tiny broad triangular nose, and a wide asymmetrical grin showing individually drawn irregular rectangular teeth, one clearly missing upper tooth, one chipped tooth and deep black gaps. Dress the character in [CLOTHING], simplified into broad graphic shapes with chunky seams, minimal folds and small hand-drawn accessories. Confident black ink contours using thick outer silhouettes, medium-weight facial lines, thin angular hair strands and only a few short scratch marks around the eyes, hair and clothing seams; use flat opaque color fields, one hard-edged cel-shadow shape per form, sparse pencil hatching, subtle ink wobble, slight color misregistration and restrained worn-paper texture. Controlled [COLORS] palette, keeping every color clearly separated and moderately saturated. Place the character against [BACKGROUND], reduced to large flat shapes, a few loosely drawn environmental details and oversized rough hand-painted lettering reading \"[TEXT]\"; use an off-center waist-up composition, a slight camera tilt, cropped background typography, loose poster margins and lightly weathered printed edges. 4:5 AR.",
      "gen_prompt": "Two-dimensional alternative character illustration of an original teenage street skater girl, occupying approximately seventy-five percent of the frame, leaning back with her arms crossed, with choppy shoulder-length dark green hair and blunt bangs, and a smug sideways expression. Oversized rounded cranium, a short flattened lower face, a narrow jaw, a long thin neck, slightly oversized ears, huge pale oval eyes with tiny off-center pupils, extremely thick horizontal black eyebrows, heavy black upper eyelids, muted mauve under-eye rings, a tiny broad triangular nose, and a wide asymmetrical grin showing individually drawn irregular rectangular teeth, one clearly missing upper tooth, one chipped tooth and deep black gaps. She wears an oversized varsity jacket over a striped tee and baggy cargo shorts, simplified into broad graphic shapes with chunky seams, minimal folds and small hand-drawn accessories. Confident black ink contours using thick outer silhouettes, medium-weight facial lines, thin angular hair strands and only a few short scratch marks around the eyes, hair and clothing seams; flat opaque color fields, one hard-edged cel-shadow shape per form, sparse pencil hatching, subtle ink wobble, slight color misregistration and restrained worn-paper texture. Controlled palette of mustard, teal, off-white and oxblood, every color clearly separated and moderately saturated. She stands against a graffiti-covered skatepark wall reduced to large flat shapes, a few loosely drawn environmental details and oversized rough hand-painted lettering reading \"NO BRAKES\"; off-center waist-up composition, a slight camera tilt, cropped background typography, loose poster margins and lightly weathered printed edges.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**이 프롬프트는 스타일을 부르지 않는다. 얼굴을 해부로 잠근다.**\n\n보통 캐릭터 프롬프트는 *\"얼터너티브 카툰 스타일, 그로테스크한 느낌\"*처럼 **인상**을 적는다.\n그러면 모델이 자기가 아는 평균적인 카툰을 그리고, 다음 장은 다른 얼굴이 된다.\n이건 정반대다 — **기관을 하나씩 세어 적는다.**\n\n```\n두개골      크고 둥글게        하관        짧고 납작하게\n턱          좁게               목          길고 가늘게\n귀          약간 크게          눈          거대한 창백한 타원 + 아주 작은 비중심 동공\n눈썹        극단적으로 굵은 수평선          윗눈꺼풀    두꺼운 검정\n다크서클    탁한 모브색        코          작고 넓은 삼각형\n```\n\n★**치아까지 내려간다.** `individually drawn irregular rectangular teeth` — 이가 하나씩\n직사각형으로 따로 그려지고, **윗니 하나가 명백히 빠져 있고, 하나는 깨졌고, 사이는 검다.**\n\"못생긴 미소\"라고 쓰면 모델이 알아서 뭉갠다. **결손을 개수로 지정**하면 그 얼굴이 나온다.\n\n★**선을 굵기별로 나눠 배정한다.** 이 프롬프트의 두 번째 축이다.\n```\n바깥 실루엣      두꺼운 선\n얼굴 선          중간 굵기\n머리카락         가늘고 각진 선\n긁힌 자국        눈·머리·옷 솔기 주변에만 몇 개\n```\n그리고 **채색은 \"면당 하드엣지 셀그림자 하나\"** — 그라데이션을 쓰지 않는다는 뜻이다.\n인쇄 사고(`ink wobble`·`color misregistration`)까지 얹어 **손으로 찍은 포스터**로 만든다.\n\n★**슬롯 8개가 전부 교체형이다** — 캐릭터·포즈·머리·표정·의상·색·배경·글자.\n얼굴 규격은 고정이고 내용만 바뀌므로 **같은 세계관의 인물을 계속 뽑을 수 있다.**\n우리가 캐릭터 일관성에 face swap을 쓰던 것과 다른 접근이다 — **스펙으로 잠그는 쪽.**",
