      "title": "★ANIME FRAGMENTS — 거대 활자 안에 환경을 담고 신체·무기·이펙트 중 하나는 반드시 글자를 뚫게",
      "prompt": "🤯AI Visual Systems Vol.17.5: Demon Slayer breaks through the type!\n\nWater, kicks, lightning, and poison blades — each character is built around oversized letters and strong foreground perspective.\n\n1. WATER TRACE — Tanjiro’s flowing strike\n2. PINK KICK — Nezuko breaking through the frame\n3. THUNDER FLASH — Zenitsu at full speed\n4. BUTTERFLY VEIL — Shinobu’s silent blade\n\nThe typography becomes part of the attack.\n\nMade with ChatGPT-Image2\nPrompt below👇\n\n--- (작성자 답글 = 프롬프트 본체) ---\nPromp:\n\nCharacter: [Tanjiro / Nezuko / Zenitsu / Shinobu / custom anime character]\nTitle: [two-word English title]\nMain typography: [WATER / KICK / THUNDER / VEIL]\nAction: [sword strike / airborne kick / forward dash / piercing attack]\nEnvironment: [mountain waterfall / moonlit bamboo forest / dark street / wisteria walkway]\nColor palette: [custom palette]\nSeries label: ANIME FRAGMENTS\nYear: 2026\n\nCreate a high-impact 9:16 anime editorial poster featuring one iconic character in a dynamic action moment.\n\nUse oversized, cropped English typography as the main composition structure. The letters should fill most of the poster and extend beyond the frame. Embed the surrounding environment inside the letterforms, including architecture, landscapes, moonlight, water, lightning, flowers, or street scenery.\n\nPlace the character in front of and partially inside the typography. At least one body part, weapon, garment, or action effect must break beyond the letter boundaries with strong foreground perspective.\n\nUse a dramatic low-angle or close wide-angle composition. Emphasize one clear foreground element such as a shoe sole, sword blade, hand, flowing sleeve, or attack effect. Keep the pose readable, energetic, and anatomically coherent.\n\nAdapt the visual effects to the character:\n\n1. WATER TRACE — flowing water, mountain waterfalls, sword and front foot breaking through the letters.\n\n2. PINK KICK — moonlit bamboo forest, airborne kick, enlarged foreground foot, pink motion ribbons.\n\n3. THUNDER FLASH — dark street, explosive forward dash, golden lightning cutting through the typography.\n\n4. BUTTERFLY VEIL — wisteria night scene, elegant mid-air pose, sword pointing toward the viewer, restrained butterfly elements.",
      "gen_prompt": "A high-impact 9:16 anime editorial poster of one original action heroine at the peak of a movement. Oversized cropped English typography is the main structure of the composition: the letters fill most of the poster and run past every edge, and the environment lives *inside* the letterforms — a mountain waterfall, wet rock and falling water are visible through the counters and bowls of the type, not behind them. The character stands in front of and partly inside that typography; her forward foot, her blade and a ribbon of water break out beyond the letter boundaries toward the viewer with strong foreground perspective. She is an original design, not from any existing series: a young swordswoman with a long dark braid, a deep indigo haori over a pale training kimono, and a single teal cord at her wrist. Dramatic low-angle wide composition; one clear foreground element — the sole of her front foot — reads largest. The pose stays readable, energetic and anatomically coherent. Palette of indigo, wet slate, foam white and one cold teal accent. Small editorial labels sit sparsely at the margins. Print-like flat finish, no cinematic bloom.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**기존 HUMAN FRAGMENTS 계열(Vol.17~17.4)의 애니 확장판이다.** 골격은 같다 —\n**거대 활자를 구조로 쓰고, 글자 안에 환경을 담고, 인물이 글자를 뚫고 나온다.**\n\n새로 생긴 건 **효과를 캐릭터별로 4종 정의**한 것이다.\n```\nWATER TRACE    흐르는 물·산 폭포 · 칼과 앞발이 글자를 뚫는다\nPINK KICK      달빛 대숲 · 공중 발차기 · 전경의 발이 확대 · 분홍 모션 리본\nTHUNDER FLASH  어두운 거리 · 폭발적 전진 · 금색 번개가 타이포를 가른다\nBUTTERFLY VEIL 등나무 밤 · 우아한 공중 자세 · 칼끝이 관객을 향함 · 나비는 절제\n```\n**각 이름이 이미 연출을 담고 있다** — 동사(TRACE·KICK·FLASH·VEIL) 하나로 모션의 성격이 정해진다.\n빈 슬롯을 주는 대신 **완성된 네 조합을 예시로 박아둔 것**이 이 버전의 차이다.\n\n★**\"최소한 신체 일부·무기·의상·이펙트 중 하나는 글자 경계를 뚫고 나와야 한다\"**가 규칙으로\n못박혀 있다. 이걸 안 적으면 인물이 글자 안에 얌전히 갇혀 평면이 된다. 17.3판의\n*\"글자가 신체를 자르지 않게\"*와 짝을 이루는 조항이다.\n\n⚠️**저작권** — 원문 슬롯이 실제 IP 캐릭터(귀멸의 칼날 4인)를 지목한다. 런북 §저작권대로\n`gen_prompt`에서 **오리지널 검사 캐릭터**로 갈았다. 40번(루이비통) 이후 규칙대로 이름뿐 아니라\n그 캐릭터를 특정하는 조형 어휘(체크무늬 하오리·특정 귀걸이 등)도 넣지 않았다.",
