      "prompt": "Adventure awaits...\n\nGPT Image 2\n\nPrompt:\n{LOCATION}\n{TAGLINE 1}\n{TAGLINE 2}\n{TAGLINE 3}\n{MONTH YEAR}\n\nCreate a highly detailed, whimsical 3D handcrafted clay diorama inside an opened natural container that perfectly represents {LOCATION}. The container should match the destination's theme (such as a coconut, shell, geode, treasure chest, flower, or another location-appropriate natural object) and reveal a breathtaking miniature landscape of {LOCATION}.\n\nInside the diorama, include {LOCATION}'s most iconic landmarks, natural scenery, architecture, vegetation, beaches, mountains, lakes, rivers, wildlife, cultural heritage, and signature local elements. Everything should look like premium handcrafted polymer clay with realistic textures, tiny details, soft sculpted edges, and intricate miniature craftsmanship.\n\nThe water should overflow naturally from the container, creating a magical cascading waterfall onto an antique vintage map centered on {LOCATION}.\n\nArrange charming travel-themed accessories around the container:\n- Vintage passport\n- Boarding pass\n- Retro camera\n- Compass\n- Suitcase with {LOCATION}-themed stickers\n- Travel notebook with an inspirational travel quote\n- Seashells or location-appropriate decorative items\n- Native flowers or plants\n- Tiny sailboat, canoe, or another destination-appropriate vehicle\n\nAdd elegant scrapbook typography on the right side:\n\nMy Travel Diary\n\n{LOCATION}\n\n• {TAGLINE 1}\n• {TAGLINE 2}\n• {TAGLINE 3}\n\nDate badge: {MONTH YEAR}\n\nBoarding pass text: Adventure Awaits\n\nNotebook quote: Collecting memories, not things\n\nUse warm golden lighting, shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh background, soft shadows, premium travel poster composition, pastel colours with vibrant turquoise water where appropriate, ultra-detailed polymer clay textures, realistic handcrafted imperfections, cinematic product photography, luxury travel souvenir aesthetic, centred composition, portrait orientation, 8K resolution, hyper-realistic miniature art, Instagram-worthy travel keepsake.",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-premium travel poster, 3:4 vertical. A single sweeping landscape hero fills the frame — a high mountain lake at dawn, still water holding an exact mirror of the peaks, one small figure standing on a rock at the shore, tiny in the composition so the scale of the place reads. Cool blue hour light with the first warm band touching only the highest ridge. Across the upper third, one oversized display headline in a wide serif sits with generous letter spacing, and two short supporting lines sit far below it near the lower margin, small and quiet. A thin hairline rule and a small circular badge anchor one corner. All the type is held inside clean margins and never crowds the landscape. The palette is restrained: deep slate blue, glacier white, cold stone grey, with one warm amber accent used only where the sunrise touches the ridge and in the badge. Fine printed poster finish — subtle paper grain, matte surface, no glossy digital sheen, no lens flare. Serene, expensive, timeless.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**슬롯형 여행 포스터 템플릿이다.** `{LOCATION}` `{TAGLINE 1}` `{TAGLINE 2}` 식으로\n바꿔 끼우는 자리를 열어두고, 나머지(구도·타이포 위치·팔레트 성격·인쇄 마감)는 전부 고정한다.\n**도시만 갈아끼우면 같은 톤의 시리즈가 나오는 구조**다.\n\n★**인물을 아주 작게 두는 게 이 템플릿의 장치다.** 풍경 안에 작은 사람 하나를 세워\n**장소의 규모를 읽히게** 한다. 사람이 커지면 인물 사진이 되고, 없으면 스케일 기준이 사라진다.\n\n★**타이포를 위아래로 멀리 떼어놓는다** — 상단 3분의 1에 거대한 표제, 아래쪽 여백 가까이에\n작고 조용한 보조 두 줄. 그 사이를 비워서 풍경이 숨 쉰다. **글자를 한 덩어리로 모으지 않는 것**이\n싸구려 여행 포스터와 갈리는 지점이다.\n\n★**따뜻한 색을 한 곳에만 쓴다** — 해가 능선에 닿는 자리, 그리고 배지. 차가운 팔레트 안에\n온기 한 점이라 시선이 거기로 간다. 95번(병 고정 시리즈)의 \"면적은 작고 무겁게\"와 같은 원리.\n\n우리 라이브러리에 여행 포스터가 54건 있지만 **슬롯형 범용 템플릿은 드물다.**",
