      "title": "★클레이 타이포 앞에 캐릭터를 세운다 — 「올라타지·기어오르지·섞이지 마라」 3금지 + 가릴 글자를 글자 단위로 지정",
      "prompt": "Minimalist 3D clay illustration.\n\nGPT Image 2\n\nPrompt:\nMinimalist 3D clay illustration. Giant bold typography reading \"[TEXT]\"\nstands flat against a pure white background — thick chunky extruded\nletterforms in matte [LETTER COLOR] plasticine (a single solid\nsaturated color across all letters), soft rounded edges\nand bevels, subtle fingerprint texture, no gloss, a faint soft drop\nshadow beneath.\n\nA cute stylized clay character stands IN FRONT of the letters,\noverlapping them, full body visible from head to sneakers. The\nletters remain fully readable behind — the character never sits on,\nclimbs, or merges into them.\n\nCHARACTER: chubby handmade proportions, oversized round head, big\nglossy black dot eyes, tiny smiling mouth, soft blush cheeks, mitten\nhands. [CHARACTER DESCRIPTION].\nNOTE: the character wears NO colors matching the letters — use\ncontrasting colors only, so the character separates cleanly from the\ntypography.\n\nACTION: [ACTION DESCRIPTION]. Body overlaps the first and middle\nletters; the final letter stays clear on the right.\n\nSCALE: character height about 65% of the letter height, centered\nslightly left.\n\nACCENTS: [NUMBER] small hand-drawn [ACCENT COLOR] motion dashes\ntrailing behind the character, one tiny doodled [ACCENT ELEMENT]\narcing in the upper right — thin flat 2D marks, not 3D.\n\nRENDER: soft diffused studio light from upper left, gentle ambient\nocclusion, matte clay surfaces throughout, clean white seamless\nbackdrop, slightly elevated eye-level camera, vertical 3:4.\n\nNEGATIVE: glossy plastic, metallic sheen, gradients on the letters,\nletters obscured or broken, character standing on or inside the\nletters, extra text, readable text on props, misspelled words,\nbrand or commercial logos, realistic skin, harsh shadows,\ncolored background.",
      "gen_prompt": "Minimalist 3D clay illustration, vertical 3:4. Giant bold typography reading \"PLAY\" stands flat against a pure white background — thick chunky extruded letterforms in matte warm coral plasticine, a single solid saturated colour across all four letters, soft rounded edges and bevels, subtle fingerprint texture, no gloss, a faint soft drop shadow beneath. A cute stylised clay character stands IN FRONT of the letters, overlapping them, full body visible from head to sneakers. The letters remain fully readable behind — the character never sits on, climbs, or merges into them. CHARACTER: chubby handmade proportions, oversized round head, big glossy black dot eyes, tiny smiling mouth, soft blush cheeks, mitten hands. A small round penguin in a mustard-yellow raincoat and white sneakers. The character wears no colour matching the letters — mustard, white and charcoal only, so it separates cleanly from the typography. ACTION: caught mid-stride running to the right, one arm swinging forward and one back, both feet off the ground. The body overlaps the first and middle letters; the final letter stays clear on the right. SCALE: character height about 65% of the letter height, centred slightly left. ACCENTS: three small hand-drawn teal motion dashes trailing behind the character, one tiny doodled star arcing in the upper right — thin flat 2D marks, not 3D. RENDER: soft diffused studio light from upper left, gentle ambient occlusion, matte clay surfaces throughout, clean white seamless backdrop, slightly elevated eye-level camera. Letters unbroken and unobscured, correctly spelled, no extra text anywhere, no readable text on props, no logos, no gradients on the letters, no glossy or metallic sheen, no harsh shadows, white background only.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**글자와 캐릭터의 관계를 「금지 세 개」로 못박은 것**이 이 프롬프트의 뼈대다.\n\n캐릭터를 글자 앞에 세우라고만 하면 모델은 십중팔구 **글자 위에 올려 앉히거나, 글자를 타고 오르게\n하거나, 글자와 한 덩어리로 반죽해 버린다.** 그래서 원문이 세 가지를 따로 적는다:\n\n```\nnever sits on   글자 위에 앉지 마라\nnever climbs    글자를 타고 오르지 마라\nnever merges    글자와 한 덩어리가 되지 마라\n```\n\n★**겹침을 글자 단위로 지정한다** — *\"몸이 첫 글자와 가운데 글자를 가리고, **마지막 글자는\n오른쪽에 온전히 남긴다**.\"* 「앞에 서라」는 방향 지시로는 안 되고, **어느 글자를 가리고 어느\n글자를 남길지**까지 적어야 글자가 계속 읽힌다.\n\n★**색을 대비로 강제한다** — *\"캐릭터는 글자와 같은 색을 입지 않는다.\"* 같은 색이면 앞뒤가\n분리되지 않아 겹침 자체가 무의미해진다. 원문이 `NOTE:`로 따로 빼서 강조한 이유다.\n\n★**스케일을 비율로 준다** — 캐릭터 키 = 글자 높이의 65%, 위치는 중앙에서 살짝 왼쪽.\n숫자를 주면 지켜진다(우리 실측 반복 확인).\n\n★**3D와 2D를 명시적으로 분리한다** — 클레이는 전부 3D인데 모션 대시와 별 낙서만\n*\"thin flat 2D marks, not 3D\"*. 이 한 줄이 없으면 대시까지 찰흙으로 빚어 나온다.\n\n`[TEXT]`·`[LETTER COLOR]`·`[CHARACTER DESCRIPTION]`·`[ACTION]`·`[ACCENT]` 전부 슬롯이라\n**글자와 캐릭터만 갈아끼우면 시리즈**가 된다. 재현은 `PLAY` + 노란 우비 펭귄으로 채웠다.\n\n⚠️우리 실측 기준으로 **글자는 한 단어가 안전하다.** Krea2는 큰 제목 한 단어는 잘 쓰지만\n여러 단어가 붙으면 무너진다(2026-07-30 실측). 원문 슬롯에 문장을 넣지 말 것.",
