      "title": "★뷰티 캠페인을 한 장이 아니라 「3컷 세트」로 — 인물·제품·플랫레이가 같은 소재를 공유하고, 음식 소재를 얼굴에도 옮겨 심는다",
      "prompt": "Glazed, but caramel. 🍯\n\nCreated with GPT Image 2 on @TapNow_AI \n\nA sweet little beauty campaign concept blending glossy lipgloss with bakery inspired visuals. \n\nPrompt below 👇 https://t.co/Hk3keDFebK\n\n--- (작성자 답글 = 프롬프트 본체) ---\nImage \n\nLuxury beauty campaign, ultra-realistic studio photography, close-up portrait of a beautiful young woman with flawless glowing skin, sleek dark hair pulled back, soft caramel-inspired makeup, tiny colorful sprinkle decorations scattered across her cheeks and under her eyes, holding a thick slice of caramel banana bread close to her mouth while elegantly presenting a chocolate-brown lip treatment tube beside her face. Warm golden background, creamy natural lighting, premium skincare commercial aesthetic, shallow depth of field, soft shadows, editorial composition, crisp skin texture, highly detailed food texture, luxurious color grading, 85mm lens, photorealistic, high-end cosmetic advertisement.\n\nImage\n\nPremium food and beauty product photography, a chocolate-brown lip treatment tube resting diagonally across freshly sliced caramel banana bread loaf, visible caramel chunks and rich moist texture, rustic bakery presentation with a silver spoon placed beside the loaf, warm pastel yellow seamless studio background, soft diffused lighting, luxury commercial styling, clean composition, macro-level texture detail, shallow depth of field, premium editorial food photography, realistic reflections, cinematic HDR color grading, ultra photorealistic.\n\nImage\n\nLuxury flat-lay commercial product photography featuring a chocolate-brown lip treatment tube placed diagonally on a cream ceramic tray drizzled with glossy salted caramel sauce, scattered caramel cubes and crunchy crumbs surrounding the product, warm pastel yellow background, elegant minimalist styling, premium cosmetic advertisement aesthetic, overhead camera angle, soft studio lighting, crisp macro details, rich glossy textures, clean editorial composition, cinematic HDR, ultra-realistic product photography.\n\nImage\n\nHigh-end beauty editorial, close-up portrait of a beautiful young woman with luminous skin and sleek dark hair tied back, wearing playful caramel-inspired sprinkle makeup around the eyes and cheeks, holding a glossy caramel lollipop near her lips while displaying a chocolate-brown lip treatment tube beside her face. Warm pastel yellow seamless background, soft diffused studio lighting, luxurious skincare campaign aesthetic, shallow depth of field, premium cosmetic commercial, cinematic color grading, realistic skin texture, elegant composition, ultra-photorealistic, fashion magazine quality.",
      "gen_prompt": "A luxury beauty campaign photograph, ultra-realistic studio work, close-up portrait of a young woman with flawless glowing skin and sleek dark hair pulled back. Her makeup is soft and caramel-toned; a scatter of tiny colourful sprinkles sits across her cheeks and just under her eyes like freckles. She holds a thick slice of caramel banana bread close to her mouth while presenting a chocolate-brown lip-treatment tube beside her face, both hands elegant and unhurried. Warm golden background, creamy natural light, premium skincare-commercial styling, shallow depth of field, soft shadows, editorial composition. Crisp skin texture with visible pores, highly detailed crumb and caramel texture on the bread, luxurious warm colour grading, 85mm lens, photorealistic high-end cosmetic advertising. Plain image with no lettering anywhere.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**한 캠페인을 「세 컷 세트」로 쪼갠 것**이 이 건의 논지다. 프롬프트가 하나가 아니라\n`Image / Image / Image` 세 덩이로 되어 있고, 셋이 같은 제품과 같은 소재를 공유한다:\n```\n1컷  인물   모델이 캐러멜 바나나브레드를 입가에, 립 트리트먼트를 얼굴 옆에\n2컷  제품   갓 자른 브레드 위에 립 튜브를 사선으로 · 은수저 · 파스텔 옐로 배경\n3컷  플랫레이  크림 세라믹 트레이 + 솔티드 캐러멜 소스 + 캐러멜 큐브\n```\n**뷰티 광고 한 장이 아니라 캠페인 한 벌**을 만드는 구조다. 광고는 원래 이렇게 세트로 나간다.\n\n★**뷰티와 베이커리를 섞되 「제품이 주인공」을 유지한다** — 볼과 눈 밑의 스프링클을 주근깨처럼\n흩는 것이 이 프롬프트의 발상이다. 음식을 소품으로 쓰면서 **얼굴에도 그 소재를 옮겨 심어**\n두 세계를 한 화면에서 잇는다.\n\n⚠️기보유 `shazdiii-chocolate-kbeauty-campaign`(초콜릿 × K-뷰티)과 소재가 가깝다.\n그쪽은 **동일 모델 유지 + 이중 타이포**가 논지이고, 이건 **한 캠페인의 3컷 분업**이 논지다.\n\n재현은 1컷(인물)로 했다. 원문에 글자 지시가 없어 **\"글자 없음\"을 명시**했다 — 비워두면\n프롬프트 어휘가 화면에 새어나온다(오늘 실측).",
