      "prompt": "ماذا لو احتضنت ورقة شجر مدينة كاملة  ☘️\n\nالبرومبت ⤵️\nCreate a cinematic fantasy scene of a miniature [اسم المدينة] nestled inside a giant fresh green leaf shaped like a natural bowl. Preserve the recognizable landmarks, architecture, cultural identity, natural environment, and famous details of [اسم المدينة] inside the leaf.\n\nThe leaf should be vibrant green with realistic veins, soft texture, curved edges, and tiny water droplets. Add miniature buildings, vegetation, glowing lights, narrow streets, bridges, and natural elements associated specifically with [اسم المدينة].\n\nMagical photorealistic atmosphere, cinematic natural lighting, macro photography, shallow depth of field, strong scale contrast between the giant leaf and the tiny city, ultra-detailed, realistic textures, 8K, no people, no text, no watermark.",
      "gen_prompt": "A cinematic fantasy macro photograph of a miniature city nestled inside one giant fresh green leaf curved into a natural bowl. The leaf is vivid green with realistic veins, soft surface texture, gently curled edges and a few tiny water droplets caught along the rim. Inside the hollow sit miniature buildings with tiled and curved roofs, a small pagoda, narrow streets, a stone bridge over a thread of water, dense little trees and warm glowing windows. Strong scale contrast between the enormous leaf and the tiny city, magical photorealistic atmosphere, natural cinematic lighting, macro photography with shallow depth of field, ultra detailed realistic textures. Plain photograph with no words, no signage and no watermark.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**스케일 대비 하나로 장면을 세운다.** 도시를 작게 만드는 게 아니라 **나뭇잎을 거대하게**\n둔다 — 같은 크기 차이인데 후자가 훨씬 강하다(`strong scale contrast between the giant leaf and\nthe tiny city`를 프롬프트에 직접 명시한다).\n\n★**나뭇잎을 그릇 모양으로 지정**한 것이 요령이다(`shaped like a natural bowl`). 평평한 잎에\n도시를 올리면 얹은 것처럼 보이고, 오목하게 만들면 **품은 것**이 된다.\n\n★**매크로 사진 어휘를 빌려온다** — 매크로 렌즈, 얕은 심도, 잎맥, 물방울. 판타지 장면인데\n카메라는 실사 접사로 고정해서 \"그림\"이 아니라 \"찍은 것\"으로 읽히게 만든다.\n\n★**작은 창의 불빛**(`glowing windows`)이 미니어처를 살아 있게 만든다. 이 계열에서 빠지면\n모형이 되고, 넣으면 사람이 사는 도시가 된다.\n\n⚠️같은 작성자의 재질 교체 시리즈 중 하나다 — [[ksa8turky-wooden-typographic-city-sculpture]]와\n같은 자리. 이쪽은 **글자 없이 스케일만으로** 간다.",
