      "title": "★★시리즈 차이는 디테일이 아니라 「크기와 보는 방향」에서 벌어진다 — 같은 투명 글자를 기둥으로 세우거나 수중 천장으로 띄운다",
      "prompt": "把字母放大，海报就有了建筑感。\n\nAQUA 把透明字母立成比人更高的列柱；\nDIVE 则把字母移到水面上方，变成水下“天花板”。\n\n这两张让我确认：尺度和观看方向，比继续堆细节更能拉开系列差异。\n\n提示词Prompt：\nUse case: ads-marketing.\nAsset type: vertical editorial fashion poster, soft constraint 3:4.\nReference role: Image 1 is a style_reference and mechanism_reference only. Retain only the clear inflated-vinyl letter construction, water-caustic optics and refined Korean fashion-editorial sensibility. Do not copy the person, identity, exact pose, exact word, letter layout or camera.\n\nCreate a new photorealistic underwater Korean swim-fashion poster. One clearly adult 23-year-old Korean woman with mature adult facial proportions, healthy athletic body, natural Korean features, realistic skin, minimal waterproof makeup, and dark hair floating in one controlled ribbon-like shape. She wears a complete opaque sunflower-yellow high-neck performance one-piece swimsuit with navy athletic seam accents and secure coverage, no logos. She is fully underwater, neutrally buoyant in a calm vertical glide just below the surface, torso upright with both arms relaxed and slightly away from her sides, open hands visible, legs together with a gentle natural bend at the ankles. She looks calmly toward the submerged camera; pose athletic and poised, not sensual.\n\nAt the water surface directly above and around her float four enormous separate transparent inflatable uppercase letters spelling exactly “DIVE”. Seen from underneath, the letters create a ceiling-like typographic installation: D at upper-left, I upper-center-left, V upper-center-right, E upper-right, all fully readable in correct order despite refraction. The woman occupies the clean negative space below the I/V gap without overlapping any letter. Clear vinyl seams, air valves, trapped droplets and tiny bubbles are visible. Sunlight passes through the inflated volumes, projecting warped letter-shaped caustics and prismatic cyan-yellow shadows down into the pool. Letters remain visibly soft, air-filled and buoyant, not solid glass. No other words or letters.\n\nCamera: fully submerged low-angle view looking diagonally upward toward the water surface, 24–28 mm underwater housing, full-body environmental framing, strong depth from darker cobalt foreground to bright turquoise surface, restrained perspective and no body-part emphasis. Lighting: high noon sun filtered through rippling water, luminous caustic bands across the swimsuit and clear letters, sunflower yellow / cobalt / turquoise palette, premium experimental Korean sports-fashion magazine quality, realistic fine grain and controlled bubbles.\n\nConstraints: one adult woman; exactly four letter objects D-I-V-E in correct order; all letters readable; complete opaque sporty swimsuit; non-erotic, non-suggestive; correct face, open hands, fingers, limbs, anatomy, buoyancy and underwater optics; no minor cues, no childlike styling, no school uniform; no extra text, no logo, no watermark, no collage, no duplicated anatomy, no extra fingers, no transparent clothing, no mermaid tail.",
      "gen_prompt": "A photorealistic underwater fashion poster, vertical three-by-four. One adult woman in a plain opaque sunflower-yellow high-neck performance one-piece swimsuit with navy seam accents is fully underwater, neutrally buoyant in a calm vertical glide just below the surface, torso upright, both arms relaxed slightly away from her sides with open hands visible, legs together with a gentle bend at the ankles. Her dark hair floats in one controlled ribbon-like shape and she looks calmly toward the submerged camera; the pose is athletic and poised. At the water surface directly above her float four enormous separate transparent inflatable uppercase letters spelling DIVE, seen from underneath so they form a ceiling-like typographic installation — D at upper left, I upper centre-left, V upper centre-right, E upper right, all readable in correct order despite the refraction. She occupies the clean empty space below the gap between I and V without overlapping any letter. Bright water caustics ripple across her and across the letters, clear blue-green water, sunlight from above, refined editorial sensibility. DIVE is the only word in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**\"글자를 키우면 포스터에 건축감이 생긴다.\"**\n같은 투명 인플레이터블 글자를 두 장에서 다르게 썼고, 작성자가 그 차이를 정리했다.\n\n```\nAQUA   투명 글자를 사람보다 높은 「기둥(列柱)」으로 세운다   → 수직 · 지상\nDIVE   글자를 수면 위로 올려 수중에서 올려다보는 「천장」으로 → 수평 · 수중\n```\n★**작성자의 결론이 값어치다** — *\"스케일과 보는 방향이, 디테일을 더 쌓는 것보다 시리즈의\n차이를 더 크게 벌린다.\"* 같은 소재로 시리즈를 만들 때 **무엇을 바꿔야 하는가**에 대한 답이다.\n색이나 소품이 아니라 **크기와 카메라의 위치**를 바꾼다.\n\n★**참조 이미지의 역할을 문장으로 제한한 것**도 배울 점이다:\n```\nReference role: Image 1 is a style_reference and mechanism_reference only.\nRetain only the inflated-vinyl letter construction, water-caustic optics and sensibility.\nDo not copy the person, identity, exact pose, exact word, letter layout or camera.\n```\n「무엇을 가져오고 무엇을 가져오지 않는가」를 나눠 적는다. 참조를 통째로 복제하는 사고를 막는다.\n\n★글자 배치를 좌표로 못박고(`D upper-left, I upper-center-left…`), **굴절에도 순서대로 읽혀야\n한다**고 조건을 걸었다. 그리고 인물은 `I/V 사이 빈 공간`에 두어 글자와 겹치지 않게 한다 —\n§⑦(반투명이 글자 위를 지나면 글자를 먹는다)를 원작자가 이미 피해 간 설계다.\n\n⚠️`DIVE` 네 글자는 짧고 흔한 단어라 §⑤의 생존 조건에 맞는다.\n\n---\n### 재현 결과 (2026-08-01 실측)\n\n★**투명 인플레이터블 글자 `DIVE`가 수면에 떠서 수중에서 올려다본 「천장」이 됐다.**\n네 글자가 굴절 속에서도 순서대로 읽히고, 인물은 지시대로 글자와 겹치지 않는 아래쪽 빈\n공간에 있다. 물의 코스틱이 글자와 인물 위로 함께 흐른다.\n\n★**§⑦(발광·반투명이 글자 위를 지나면 글자를 먹는다)의 예외 조건을 하나 더 확인했다** —\n여기서는 **글자 자체가 반투명체**인데도 온전했다. 겹친 게 아니라 **글자가 스스로 반투명한\n것**이기 때문이다. 위험한 것은 「글자 위를 지나가는」 반투명체이지, 반투명한 글자가 아니다.\n\n★`DIVE` 네 글자는 짧고 흔한 단어라 §⑤의 생존 조건에 맞았다.",
