      "title": "★★글자를 물체로 만들어 인물이 매달리게 한다 — 접촉 그림자와 무게 이동이 있어야 「자세가 글자가 실재해야만 성립」한다",
      "prompt": "Prompt:\n\nCreate a 9:16 high-fashion editorial poster where one person physically interacts with a monumental 3D letter.\n\nThe letter must function like a real sculptural structure—not flat typography. Show believable weight, contact, shadows, depth, and clear front-to-back layering. The subject should grip an edge, step on a stroke, pass a limb through a counter, sit inside the letter, or emerge through an opening.\n\nSubject: [Asian / Western / male / female]\nLetter: [A / B / G / R]\nInteraction: [climb / hold / sit inside / break through]\nTitle: [custom title]\nSeries: TYPE CONTACT\nYear: 2026\n\n4 directions:\n\n1. BREAK THE TYPE — a stylish male figure emerging through the two openings of a translucent cobalt-blue “B,” with his head and arms crossing from behind the letter to the foreground.\n\n2. GRIP THE FORM — an athletic woman climbing a monumental stone “R,” gripping its top edge, stepping on its strokes, and threading one leg through the inner opening.\n\n3. HOLD THE LINE — a contemporary male dancer supported by a massive matte-black “A,” with hands gripping both sides, one foot resting on the crossbar, and the body stretching through the triangular space.\n\n4. FORM — an elegant woman seated inside the cavity of a dark green “G,” leaning against the inner curve while one leg remains inside and the other extends beyond the letter.\n\nUse realistic anatomy, natural skin and fabric, controlled studio lighting, refined material textures, strong negative space, and a distinct color palette for each poster.\n\nKeep the typography minimal: one main title, one short supporting line, “TYPE CONTACT,” and “2026.” Let part of the title pass behind the subject or sculpture, but keep it readable.",
      "gen_prompt": "A nine-by-sixteen high-fashion editorial poster in which one person physically interacts with an enormous word set across the frame. The word ECHO is set in a heavy condensed sans serif large enough to span the full width, sitting behind and around the model as a solid physical object rather than flat type. She grips the crossbar of the E with one hand and leans her weight back from it, one foot braced against the upright of the H, her coat falling naturally with that pull so the pose only makes sense if the letters are real. The letterforms cast their own shadows onto the seamless backdrop and receive contact shadows where her hand and shoe press against them; the letters pass both in front of and behind her body so the depth order is unambiguous. Studio lighting from the upper left across both her and the type, muted concrete-grey backdrop, one desaturated ochre accent in her coat. ECHO is the only word in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**글자를 「물체」로 만들어 인물이 붙잡게 한다.**\n타이포를 배경에 얹는 게 아니라, **인물이 글자에 «매달리고 밀어내게»** 한다.\n\n```\n글자      화면 폭을 가로지르는 거대 콘덴스드 산세리프 — «평면 타입이 아니라 고체 물체»\n상호작용  E의 가로대를 «잡고», 무게를 뒤로 «싣고», H의 세로획에 «발을 디딘다»\n          ★코트가 그 당김을 따라 떨어져야 한다 — 자세가 «글자가 실재해야만 성립»하게\n그림자    글자가 배경에 «자기 그림자»를 드리우고,\n          손과 신발이 닿은 자리에 «접촉 그림자»를 받는다\n깊이      글자가 몸의 «앞뒤를 넘나들어» 깊이 순서를 분명히 한다\n```\n★★**접촉 그림자와 무게 이동**이 성패를 가른다. 이건\n[[chenlinspark-giant-props-need-contact-not-scale]](거대 소품은 접촉으로 증명한다)와\n정확히 같은 원리인데, 소품 자리에 «글자»가 들어간 것이다.\n\n★**\"자세가 글자가 실재해야만 성립하게 만든다\"**가 요령이다. 인물이 그냥 서 있고 글자가\n뒤에 있으면 합성으로 보이는데, **몸이 글자에 기대어 균형을 잡고 있으면** 물리적으로 읽힌다.\n\n★`ECHO` 네 글자 — 짧고 흔한 단어라 §⑤의 생존 조건에 맞는다.",
