      "category": "일러스트/그래픽",
      "title": "★플랫 2D에서 깊이는 겹침으로, 조명은 「색 하나」로 만든다 — 그림자를 넣기 시작하면 무너진다",
      "prompt": "Made with Seedram 5.0 pro\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a vertical 3:4 flat 2D vector illustration of a Korean family of four enjoying a calm New York family trip in DUMBO, Brooklyn.\n\nScene: The family stands together on Washington Street in DUMBO, calmly posing in the middle foreground. The father stands slightly to the left holding a folded travel map, the mother stands to the right with one hand on a rolling suitcase and a compact camera hanging from her neck, the daughter stands between the parents with a small pastel pink crossbody bag, and the son stands near the mother wearing a small crossbody pouch. In the background, the Manhattan Bridge is framed between two simplified red-brick warehouse buildings, clearly recognizable but rendered in a minimal way. Add only a few supporting elements such as a very subtle cobblestone street pattern and one tiny cloud. Keep the street quiet and uncluttered.\n\nCharacter style: rounded simple faces, two small vertical oval eyes, no mouth, very short nose line or omitted nose, calm and clean expressions, slightly simplified cute everyday body proportions, smooth solid hair shapes without strands, minimal clothing folds, minimal finger detail, near-white skin tone.\n\nIllustration style: clean commercial-quality flat vector illustration, smooth curves, simple color blocks, uniform dark charcoal outline, very few internal lines, crisp polished finish, no sketch texture, no shadow, no gradient, no paper texture, no 3D feel.\n\nColor palette: bright ivory or off-white background, dark charcoal outlines and hair, muted pastel blue, soft beige, pale sage, and soft warm gray. Keep the overall mood bright, calm, tidy, and premium like a modern lifestyle brand illustration.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical three-by-four flat two-dimensional vector illustration of a Korean street scene at dusk. Hanok tiled roofs with upturned eaves layer back into the distance, a modern glass tower rises softly behind them, and a narrow alley of small shopfronts with hanging lanterns runs through the middle ground. Two figures walk away from the viewer down the alley, drawn as simple flat shapes without facial detail. Everything is built from clean flat colour fields with no gradients and no outlines — depth comes only from overlapping shapes and a limited value range. The palette holds to five flat colours: deep indigo, warm terracotta, muted sage, cream and a single warm amber for the lantern glow, which is the only light source described. Crisp geometric simplification, generous empty sky, editorial poster quality. No lettering anywhere.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**플랫 2D 벡터에서 「깊이」를 만드는 법** — 그라데이션도 윤곽선도 없이,\n**겹침과 제한된 명도 폭**만으로 원근을 만든다.\n\n```\n금지    그라데이션 · 윤곽선\n깊이    ★도형이 «겹치는 순서»와 명도 차이로만\n색      5색으로 고정 — 그중 «하나»만 광원 역할(등불의 앰버)\n```\n★★**\"광원을 색 하나로 지정한다\"**가 이 스타일의 요령이다. 플랫 일러스트에서 조명을\n표현하려 그림자를 넣기 시작하면 곧바로 무너지는데, **빛나는 색을 하나만 배정**하면\n그 색이 있는 곳이 광원으로 읽힌다.\n\n★**한국적 소재를 다루는 방식**도 참고할 만하다 — 기와지붕의 처마 곡선을 겹쳐 원근을 만들고,\n뒤에 현대 건물을 «부드럽게» 세워 시대를 겹친다. 인물은 얼굴 없이 뒷모습 도형으로 둬\n장면이 주인공이 되게 한다.\n\n★우리 쓸 자리 — GK·보람투어의 한국 소개 비주얼, 행사 도시 소개.",
      "ref_image": null,
