      "title": "★★★프롬프트를 「유전자」로 쓴다 — 구성·재질·그래픽·분위기를 각각 다른 계보에서 물려받고, 「의미 돌연변이」 하나로만 초현실을 넣는다",
      "prompt": "I can't say I have tested any of these dishes but they look delicious.\n\nGPT Prompt\n\nGourmet_Dish_DNA:     def __init__(self):         self.subject = \"[SIGNATURE DISH]\"          self.parents = {             \"composition_parent\": \"Modernist cuisine ingredient separation\",             \"material_parent\": \"Macro food texture photography\",             \"graphic_parent\": \"Minimalist Swiss menu design\",             \"atmosphere_parent\": \"Soft studio lighting with steam\"         }         self.mutations = {             \"semantic_mutation\": \"The ingredients reveal their origin (e.g., a tiny wheat field inside a grain of bread)\",             \"information_mutation\": \"Calorie callouts, sourcing map pins, flavor profile graphs, freshness indicators\",             \"medium_mutation\": \"Matte fine art paper texture\",             \"scale_mutation\": \"Microscopic view of sauce viscosity and crumb structure\"         }         https://t.co/lO9r3S2ZwX_mix = [0.40, 0.30, 0.15, 0.10, 0.05]       def generate_subject(self):         subject = \"\"\"         [SIGNATURE DISH] components floating in perfect suspension: sauces, solids, garnishes.         Reveal vegetable fibers, crystallized sugar structures, and the origin story of the ingredients.         \"\"\"          return render(             subject,             format=\"vertical menu art\",             title=\"[DISH NAME]\",             subtitle=\"[CHEF / RESTAURANT]\",             constraints=\"appetizing, clean, warm tones, high detail\"         )",
      "gen_prompt": "A signature plated dish photographed as a modernist culinary study on a matte off-white surface. The components are deliberately separated across the plate rather than composed together — a seared scallop, a smear of pea purée, three crisp wafers and a scatter of microherbs each occupy their own zone with clean space between them, in the manner of modernist cuisine ingredient separation. Every element is rendered at macro texture fidelity: the caramelised crust of the scallop, the aerated grain of the purée, the porous snap of the wafers. Soft broad studio light with a faint thread of steam rising. The whole plate is framed with the restraint of a minimalist Swiss menu — the dish sits low and left with a wide calm margin, thin rules implied by the alignment of the components. And one surreal mutation runs through it: inside the translucent wafer a miniature field of wheat is visible growing at grain scale, as if the ingredient were revealing where it came from. Hyper-realistic, wide horizontal composition. No lettering anywhere.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★★**프롬프트를 「유전자」로 쓴다 — 네 「부모」에서 축을 물려받고 「돌연변이」로 초현실을 더한다.**\n```python\nGourmet_Dish_DNA:\n  self.parents = {\n    \"composition_parent\" : 모더니스트 퀴진의 «재료 분리»\n    \"material_parent\"    : 매크로 푸드 텍스처 사진\n    \"graphic_parent\"     : 미니멀 «스위스 메뉴» 디자인\n    \"atmosphere_parent\"  : 김이 오르는 부드러운 스튜디오 조명\n  }\n  self.mutations = {\n    \"semantic_mutation\"  : ★재료가 «자기 출신»을 드러낸다\n                           (예: 빵 한 알갱이 «안»에 작은 밀밭)\n  }\n```\n★★**「부모」를 축별로 나눈 것**이 이 은유의 값어치다 — 구성 / 재질 / 그래픽 / 분위기를\n각각 다른 계보에서 가져온다. 스타일 이름을 나열하면 뒤섞이는데,\n**어느 축을 누구에게서 물려받는지** 적으면 충돌하지 않는다.\n\n★★**`semantic_mutation`이 진짜 발명이다.** 나머지가 다 «사실적»인데 «의미 층위»에서만\n한 번 비튼다 — 재료 안에 그 재료의 «기원»이 들어 있다. 초현실을 «양»이 아니라\n«위치»로 통제하는 방법이다.\n\n★같은 계정의 [[gdgtify-set-algebra-hybrid-brick-diorama]](집합 연산) ·\n[[gdgtify-fusion-rule-evolved-never-assembled]](융합 규칙)과 같은 계보 —\n**형식 언어를 계속 바꿔가며 「합성의 문법」을 실험한다.** 이번엔 생물학이다.",
