      "title": "★★얼굴 한 구간을 「겹치지 말고 치환하라」 — 은은하면 이중노출이고, 딱딱한 경계로 잘라 바꾸면 그래픽 디자인이 된다",
      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on CHATGPT \n\nPROMPT:\n\nBold surreal editorial portrait of [CHARACTER], shown in a centered frontal chest-up composition, wearing [CLOTHING]. Keep the portrait highly realistic and symmetrical, but interrupt one full vertical section of the subject with translucent overlay [ELEMENT], treated as a dominant surreal replacement strip that occupies roughly one-third to nearly one-half of the face, cutting from the top of the head through the eye, cheek, mouth, neck, and into the clothing. The replacement strip must feel structural and graphic, not subtle or decorative, with crisp hard edges and strong visual contrast. Build the background as a flat graphic poster field using [BACKGROUND], composed of large pastel rectangles, photo of a [SCENERY] circles, line clusters, cropped panels, and abstract inserts, with a few retro-print accents integrated across the composition. Use a [COLORS] palette, soft paper grain, slight print texture, clean edges, strong geometric balance, and a polished art-poster finish. Make the surreal intervention large, unmistakable, and visually commanding.Vertical 4:5.",
      "gen_prompt": "A bold surreal editorial portrait, centred and frontal, chest up. A young woman faces the camera symmetrically in a plain black turtleneck, rendered with high photographic realism — and one full vertical section of her is replaced. A translucent strip running from the top of her head straight down through one eye, cheek, mouth, neck and into her clothing has been substituted with a layered slice of a coral reef: fronds, small fish and refracted blue water occupying that band instead of her face. The strip covers close to half her width, has crisp hard edges where it meets the photograph, and reads as a structural graphic replacement rather than a soft double exposure — the contrast between the two is deliberate and strong. The background is a flat graphic poster field built from large pastel rectangles in dusty rose, sage and cream, arranged as clean blocks with no gradient. Even studio light on the real half, generous margin. No lettering anywhere.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**얼굴의 한 «세로 구간»을 다른 것으로 «대체»한다.** 겹치는 게 아니라 «치환»이다.\n```\nInterrupt one full vertical section of the subject with translucent overlay [ELEMENT],\ntreated as a ★dominant surreal replacement strip\nthat occupies roughly one-third to nearly one-half of the face,\ncutting from the top of the head through the eye, cheek, mouth, neck, and into the clothing.\n★The replacement strip must feel structural and graphic,\n not subtle or decorative, with crisp hard edges and strong visual contrast.\n```\n★★**\"미묘하거나 장식적이면 안 된다\"**가 이 프롬프트의 핵심 조항이다.\n이중노출처럼 은은하게 겹치면 흔한 사진 효과가 되고,\n**딱딱한 경계로 «잘라 바꾸면»** 그래픽 디자인이 된다.\n\n★**차지하는 면적을 「1/3~절반」으로 못박은 것**도 중요하다. 좁으면 장식이고,\n절반쯤 되어야 «지배적»이 되어 무엇이 대체됐는지가 주제로 읽힌다.\n\n★**어제 담은 [[taaruk-split-the-face-and-put-a-journey-in-the-gap]]과 짝을 이룬다:**\n```\ntaaruk       얼굴을 «쪼개고» 그 «틈»에 원근이 있는 여정을 넣는다  → 깊이를 «판다»\nsimplyannisa 얼굴의 한 구간을 «통째로 바꾼다»                    → 정체를 «치환한다»\n```\n둘 다 「얼굴 + 세로 그래픽 개입」인데 **개입의 성격이 다르다.** 나란히 두면 축이 보인다.\n\n★배경을 «플랫 그래픽 포스터 필드»(큰 파스텔 사각형 블록)로 둔 것도 조건이다.\n사실적 배경이면 초현실이 «합성 실수»로 보이고, 평면 그래픽이면 «의도»로 읽힌다.",
      "ref_image": null,
      "result": "results/simplyannisa-replacement-strip-must-be-structural.webp",
      "seed": 1990114624
