      "target_model": "Nano Banana",
      "category": "일러스트/그래픽",
      "title": "★농담을 「모순 레코드」로 자료구조화한다 — claim/reality/institution 세 필드 + 해시 시드로 «칸마다 다른 농담»을 강제하고 정규식으로 구조를 검증",
      "prompt": "Tried the same prompt with Nano Banana. You can generate so many of these fun visuals with these prompts  <instructions> Define the subject as text. Define a contradiction as a record containing three text fields: claim: what is claimed reality: what is actually true institution: the system or organization connected to the contradiction Each contradiction produces two kinds of material: Pool 1 returns the claim and the reality. This is the source of the joke. Pool 4 returns the institution. This represents the system being criticized. Each finished comic panel has a unique text signature containing its framing, visual beat, character roles, banner, speech, signs, props, drawing style, composition, gutter, mood, caption mood, and joke ID. The four-panel comic’s full signature is created by concatenating the signatures of all four panels. A regular expression checks that every panel follows the required structure. Each panel must contain exactly: one banner slot one speech slot Reject any output that includes: color photorealistic or continuous-tone rendering meta text, watermarks, or signatures the same joke ID in more than one panel two banners in a single panel a visual or stylistic kernel that changes between panels To generate contradictions from a subject: Find the main values associated with the subject. For each value, identify an opposing reality or antonym. Identify the institution associated with that value. Store the result as a contradiction containing the value, its opposite reality, and the institution. To compose the final image: Infer a set of contradictions from the subject. This becomes the available joke space. Create a deterministic hash from the subject. Use that hash to generate repeatable random seeds. Shuffle the contradictions and select four without replacement, so every panel uses a different joke. Generate cosmetic details independently for each panel. For each panel: select and resolve one banner and one speech element select and resolve two characters into protagonist and foil roles draw the panel using the same global visual kernel use the assigned contradiction as the panel’s joke keep the subject consistent across all panels incorporate any optional text provided by the user Arrange the four panels in a two-by-two grid. Validate the completed grid against the required structure and all forbidden patterns. If it passes validation, grade the image according to the requested mood.",
      "gen_prompt": "(칸별 생성 — grid spec 참조)",
      "prompt_ko": "★**프롬프트를 「프로그램」으로 쓴 사례.** 자연어 서술이 아니라 자료구조·검증·시드로 짰다.\n\n```\n자료구조   contradiction = { claim, reality, institution }\n           Pool 1 → 농담의 재료(주장 vs 실제) · Pool 4 → 비판 대상(제도)\n결정성     주제로 «해시»를 만들고 그 해시로 시드를 뽑는다 → 같은 주제면 같은 결과\n중복 방지  네 개를 «비복원 추출» → 칸마다 반드시 다른 농담\n검증       정규식으로 「칸마다 배너 1 + 대사 1」 구조를 강제, 위반 시 reject\n```\n★**금지 목록이 「거부 조건」으로 적혀 있다** — 컬러·사진풍, 워터마크, 같은 농담 ID 중복,\n한 칸에 배너 둘, 칸마다 달라지는 시각 커널. 「하지 마라」가 아니라 「나오면 버려라」다.\n\n⚠️글자는 후반 합성 — Krea2는 만화 대사를 못 쓴다(§⑤ 작은 글자 붕괴).\n\n---\n★재현 방식 교체 — 처음엔 한 장으로 그리드를 시켰는데 **Krea2가 칸마다 같은 구도를\n반복**해서 원본과 딴판이 나왔다. 주제를 gen_prompt에 정확히 적어놔도 그렇다 — 지시를 못 따르는 게\n아니라 **단일 이미지 확산 모델이라 칸마다 다른 의미를 배정하지 못하는 것**이다.\n→ **칸마다 한 장씩 뽑아 합성**하고, Krea2가 못 쓰는 영문 타이포는 코드로 얹었다.\n   정본 스크립트 `automation/grid_repro.py` + spec `automation/grid_specs/gdgtify-contradiction-engine-four-panel-comic.json`.\n   런북 §gen_prompt ④ 참조.",
