      "target_model": "GPT Image 2",
      "category": "토이/디오라마 그리드",
      "title": "★`INFER(...)` 바인딩 문법 — 포즈·무드·소품·컬러웨이를 값으로 «주지 않고» 주제에서 추론하도록 슬롯만 선언한다(+/−/= 산술로 원하는 것과 뺄 것을 함께)",
      "prompt": "I am going to use some of these for videos. Here is the prompt structure I am using for these: \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, Ai picks subjects System_role: INFER(render_role FROM \"limited_edition_designer_toy_gallery_drop\" + {$SUBJECT}) \n\n[SUBJECT / TOPIC]\n+ [urban vinyl designer toy]\n+ [mini rebellion diorama]\n+ [limited-edition collectible sculpture staged like a gallery drop]\n+ [chunky stylized figure surrounded by inferred micro-environmental street details]\n+ [matte vinyl, sculpted base, subtle graffiti texture, editorial museum lighting]\n- [full realistic city scene]\n- [overcrowded environment]\n- [toy photography that feels mass-market]\n- [overly cute children’s toy styling]\n= [high-end narrative art-toy diorama]\n\nINPUT_BINDING {\n  SUBJECT_IDENTITY       : \"{$SUBJECT}\"\n  POSE_LOGIC             : INFER(slumped_pose / sitting_pose / leaning_pose / deadweight_stance / shrugging_rebellion FROM SUBJECT_IDENTITY)\n  MOOD_AXIS              : INFER(apathy <-> mischief <-> playful defiance)\n  URBAN_WORLD_CUES       : INFER(3-7 small environmental motifs from SUBJECT_IDENTITY)\n  GALLERY_DROP_THEME     : INFER(edition concept, drop title, release energy, collectible aura)\n  BASE_ARCHITECTURE      : INFER(modular pedestal / curb fragment / rooftop slab / transit block / alley slice)\n  BONUS_PROP_SYSTEM      : INFER(street micro-props such as cones, boombox, skate piece, sticker bomb, crate, utility box, spray cap, pigeon, mini sign)\n  COLORWAY               : INFER(striking premium color blocking with one unexpected accent)\n}\n\nFORM_ENGINE {\n  TOY_FORM               : \"chunky sculptural massing, oversized head, stylized compression, crisp negative spaces\"\n  POSTURE                : \"slouch-heavy body language with confident low-energy presence\"\n  EMOTION                : \"subtle anti-attitude, bored charisma, fashionable rebellion\"\n  READABILITY            : \"strong silhouette from a distance, collectible richness up close\"\n}\n\nENVIRONMENT_ENGINE {\n  SCALE                  : \"micro-diorama, not full scene\"\n  BASE                   : \"sculptural urban fragment under the figure\"\n  DETAIL_POLICY          : \"only a few highly curated props, each iconic and photogenic\"\n  WORLD_BUILDING         : \"imply a larger street world through fragments rather than literal full environment\"\n}\n\nMATERIAL_SYSTEM {\n  FIGURE_MATERIAL        : \"premium matte vinyl with soft diffuse finish\"\n  BASE_MATERIAL          : INFER(cast concrete, resin curb, painted asphalt slab, powder-coated platform)\n  PROP_FINISHES          : INFER(rubber, satin plastic, enamel accents, textured decal surfaces)\n  WEAR                   : \"minimal stylized wear; clean art-object finish, not dirty realism\"\n}\n\nLIGHTING_AND_CAMERA {\n  LIGHTING               : \"museum-grade soft studio lighting with subtle sculptural drama\"\n  CAMERA                 : \"slightly low 3/4 angle to emphasize collectible presence\"\n  DEPTH                  : \"controlled depth of field, crisp focus on figure and immediate props\"\n  PRESENTATION           : \"luxury gallery catalog meets hype collectible launch image\"\n}\n\nEXTRA_RICHNESS {\n  DROP_EDITION_MARKS     : INFER(serial number, title plaque, drop insignia, collector seal)\n  SUBTLE_GRAPHICS        : INFER(one or two graphic decals, stencils, or symbol marks tied to SUBJECT_IDENTITY)\n  VARIANT_FLAVOR         : INFER(possible chase edition accent or alt colorway implication)\n}\n\nOUTPUT_CONTRACT {\n  Produce a premium limited-edition urban vinyl art-toy render of {$SUBJECT} staged on a small narrative diorama base. The figure should feel emotionally slumped yet visually magnetic, expressing urban apathy or playful rebellion through silhouette, color, pose, and prop curation. Keep the world minimal but rich, as if this is a sold-out gallery drop photographed for an elite collector catalog. AI should infer the exact street-world details, props, edition concept, and mood refinements.\n}",
      "gen_prompt": "(칸별 생성 — grid spec 참조)",
      "prompt_ko": "★**값을 안 주고 「추론 슬롯」만 선언한다.**\n\n```\nPOSE_LOGIC        : INFER(slumped / sitting / leaning / deadweight / shrugging FROM SUBJECT)\nMOOD_AXIS         : INFER(apathy <-> mischief <-> playful defiance)\nURBAN_WORLD_CUES  : INFER(3-7 small environmental motifs FROM SUBJECT)\nCOLORWAY          : INFER(premium color blocking with one unexpected accent)\n```\n선택지를 «후보 목록»으로 주고 그중 주제에 맞는 걸 고르게 하는 방식이라, 고정값보다\n주제가 바뀌어도 무너지지 않는다.\n\n★도입부의 **`+ / − / =` 산술**도 같은 결이다 — 원하는 것을 `+`로 쌓고, 피할 것을 `−`로\n빼고, 마지막에 `= [high-end narrative art-toy diorama]`로 «합»을 선언한다.\n\n★엔진을 층으로 나눈 것도 눈여겨볼 것 — FORM / ENVIRONMENT / MATERIAL을 각각 블록으로\n두어 조형·무대·재질이 서로 간섭하지 않게 했다.\n\n---\n★재현 방식 교체 — 처음엔 한 장으로 그리드를 시켰는데 **Krea2가 칸마다 같은 구도를\n반복**해서 원본과 딴판이 나왔다. 주제를 gen_prompt에 정확히 적어놔도 그렇다 — 지시를 못 따르는 게\n아니라 **단일 이미지 확산 모델이라 칸마다 다른 의미를 배정하지 못하는 것**이다.\n→ **칸마다 한 장씩 뽑아 합성**하고, Krea2가 못 쓰는 영문 타이포는 코드로 얹었다.\n   정본 스크립트 `automation/grid_repro.py` + spec `automation/grid_specs/gdgtify-infer-binding-designer-toy-drop.json`.\n   런북 §gen_prompt ④ 참조.",
