      "prompt": "电商详情页-14™️Product imagery with a traditional Chinese aesthetic is most prone to becoming mere “collages of elements.” By transforming a fruit tea into an accessible Eastern fairyland, the product naturally becomes the protagonist of the story.\n国风产品图最容易沦为“元素拼贴”。把果茶做成一个可进入的东方仙境，产品自然成了故事里的主角。\n★ rice-paper beige, mineral green, tea gold, seal red\n颜色不是古风滤镜，而是一套完整的纸本设色系统；包装、人物衣饰、果茶和印章都用同一种气质说话。\n★ fruit-tea maiden, ribbons, mist, distant pavilion\n人物不是装饰模特，而是“果茶精灵”。她携着果篮穿过云雾与亭台，让产品拥有神话般的来源感。\n★ transparent glass cup in foreground, held by hands\n再飘逸的仙境，也要用一杯被拿在手里的果茶落回真实饮用体验。前景杯子就是商业锚点。\n★ large brush-calligraphy masthead, restrained vertical annotations\n书法标题制造气势，竖排小字和印章负责补充文化密度；大与小的节奏，让画面既有古意也有现代海报感。\n真正有记忆点的国风商业视觉，不是“画得像古画”，而是让品牌、产品和叙事全部活在同一个世界观里。",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical premium poster for an invented Chinese fruit-tea brand rendered as an enterable fairyland rather than a collage of period motifs. A fruit-tea maiden carries a basket of fruit through drifting mist past a distant pavilion, ribbons trailing — she is the spirit of the drink, not a decorative model, so the product gains a mythic origin. In the foreground a transparent glass cup of fruit tea is held in a pair of hands, bringing the whole vision back down to a real act of drinking: this cup is the commercial anchor. Rice-paper beige, mineral green, tea gold and seal red used as one coherent paper-and-pigment system across packaging, the figure's clothing, the drink and the seals. A large calligraphic masthead area and a restrained vertical annotation column left clear. traditional Chinese ink-wash light-color aesthetics fused with refined commercial poster design, xuan-paper purity, thin mineral pigment washes, large breathing negative space, soft diffused natural light, low saturation with selective premium accents, no western watercolor, no oil painting, no thick paint, no hard studio glare, no text, no lettering, no logos",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「고화처럼 그리는 것」이 아니라 «브랜드·제품·서사가 같은 세계관 안에 사는 것».**\n\n```\n★ 색은 필터가 아니라 «지본 설색 체계»  포장·인물 의상·과차·인장이 «같은 기질»로 말한다\n★ 인물은 모델이 아니라 «과차 정령»     안개와 정자를 지나며 제품에 신화적 출처를 준다\n★ 전경의 «손에 들린» 유리컵            아무리 표일한 선경이라도 실제 음용 경험으로 착지시킨다.\n                                      ★전경 컵이 상업적 앵커다\n★ 큰 서예 + 절제된 세로 주석            대·소의 리듬이 고의와 현대 포스터를 동시에 만든다\n```\n⚠️**원문에 GPT 프롬프트 본문이 없다**(★원리 4줄만 공개). 런북 §유료게이트 규칙대로 스타일 서술과 키워드만으로 `gen_prompt`를 재구성했다.",
