      "prompt": "Nature is not the backdrop, but consciousness itself.\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate a same-series four-panel cinematic surreal fantasy composition in a strict 2x2 grid, fully preserving the exact logic, panel placement, image rhythm, subject relationship, and visual storytelling structure of the original four-frame collage. Do not change the macro composition. Keep the exact four-panel arrangement: top-left monumental cracked stone face with internal vertical opening and tiny human figure, top-right hands pulling open a luminous vertical passage to reveal a lake landscape, bottom-left hooded side profile fused with forest and stream, bottom-right female side profile fused with cliffs, waterfalls, forest, clouds, and cosmic atmosphere. The final artwork must feel like a collector-edition UE5 film poster series, with stronger Orbit-style visual pressure and stronger Port-style mythic reconstruction, while remaining absolutely consistent with the original structure and style logic. No text, no logo, no title.\n\nGlobal art direction:\nultra-realistic UE5 cinematic rendering, premium fantasy realism, same-series film key art, poetic environmental surrealism, dreamlike but physically grounded, subtle print grain, extremely delicate cinematic lighting, atmospheric dust, volumetric mist, refined color grading, soft haze with razor-sharp focal detail, immersive blockbuster fantasy mood, de-AI human realism, highly unified lens language and emotional tone across all four panels\n\nPanel 1, top-left:\nA colossal eroded human side profile carved from ancient cracked stone, facing right, dominating nearly the entire frame. Inside the head silhouette, preserve the tall vertical opening exactly, with a tiny lone human figure standing inside for scale. Push the Orbit intensity: make the stone face even more monumental, the internal opening brighter and deeper, and the scale contrast more overwhelming. Push the Port transformation: the face should feel less like a rock formation and more like an ancient mythic gateway-being formed by nature itself. Keep realistic rock fracture lines, erosion logic, dust fall, drifting debris, weathered edges, pale fog, and cinematic atmospheric depth. The image must feel sacred, ancient, and overpowering.\n\nPanel 2, top-right:\nA luminous vertical tear or opening being pulled apart by two realistic human hands from the left and right edges, preserving the exact composition logic. Through the opening, reveal a tranquil lake, a solitary tree, distant dark forest, soft morning mist, and warm radiant sunlight. Strengthen the Orbit effect by making the opening more magnetic, more glowing, and more emotionally charged, as if the viewer is looking into another realm. Strengthen the Port effect by making the torn surface feel like a veil between worlds rather than simple material, with the revealed landscape feeling like a mythic sanctuary. The hands must be de-AI, anatomically correct, softly lit, with real skin texture, believable finger tension, and subtle warmth against the light.\n\nPanel 3, bottom-left:\nA hooded human side profile facing right, keeping the exact shadow-heavy composition and silhouette dominance. The hood must feel large, heavy, tactile, and cinematic, with realistic fabric folds and slight moisture-darkened edges. Inside and around the silhouette, preserve the forest-world fusion: a narrow stream, trees, rocks, sunlight shafts, mist, and layered depth. Orbit enhancement: deepen the inner-world contrast so the hidden landscape feels more immersive and visually irresistible. Port enhancement: make the hooded figure feel like a guardian of an internal wilderness, as if the person and the forest are one mythic entity. The face must remain partially shadowed, solemn, and believable, with natural profile anatomy and subtle de-AI realism.\n\nPanel 4, bottom-right:\nA highly detailed female side profile facing left, fused seamlessly with a vertical fantasy world of waterfalls, mossy cliffs, trees, drifting mist, bright sky, and a distant celestial body. Preserve the exact composition logic and silhouette relationship. Orbit enhancement: increase the impact of the female profile and the scale of the environmental fusion, making the side face more iconic, more sculptural, and more dominant within the frame. Port enhancement: transform her into a mythic nature-divinity presence, where the face is not only merged with the world but is the world itself. Her anatomy must be adult, athletic, healthy, feminine, and realistic, with strong neck structure, clean jawline, natural skin texture, subtle pores, refined lips and nose bridge, and a cinematic de-AI expression. Waterfalls must flow through and around the facial contour with physically believable gravity, spray, mist breakup, and sunlight scattering.\n\nSeries consistency:\nAll four images must feel directed by the same filmmaker, designed by the same concept team, rendered with the same UE5 pipeline, and graded with the same premium cinematic color logic. Keep the same melancholic fantasy atmosphere, the same human-nature fusion language, the same luxurious soft contrast, the same print-grain finish, and the same high-end mythic visual coherence. The result must feel like one unified epic fantasy film pre-release poster series.\n\nLighting:\nextremely delicate cinematic lighting, soft volumetric glow, sun bloom through mist, rich atmospheric scattering, nuanced midtone transitions, gentle rim light, elegant fog diffusion, no harsh clipping, no muddy darks, premium shadow separation, highly refined highlight roll-off\n\nPhysics and effects:\nphysically accurate drifting dust, falling rock particles, mist layers, waterfall spray, floating debris, condensation haze, atmospheric depth falloff, controlled wind motion, realistic fluid breakup, believable gravity and particle behavior, elegant and not chaotic\n\nColor direction:\ncold teal-gray stone, pale mist blue, moss green, muted forest shadow, warm sunrise gold, soft ivory haze, restrained silver-blue celestial tones, subtle saturated highlights, premium cinematic richness without neon\n\nMood:\nmythic, sacred, surreal, awe-inspiring, monumental, mysterious, poetic, spiritually charged, emotionally immersive, cinematic, elegant, dreamlike, epic fantasy\n\nRendering quality:\nUE5 ultra-realistic fantasy cinema key art, world-class feature film concept frame quality, sharp rock texture, sharp hand anatomy, sharp skin detail, sharp fabric edges, sharp forest micro-detail, sharp waterfall structure, subtle analog print grain, 8k, collector-edition premium image quality\n\nNegative prompt:\ntext, logo, title, cheap collage, cartoon rendering, broken anatomy, extra fingers, plastic skin, AI-looking hands, low-detail face, fake waterfalls, muddy fog, oversaturated fantasy color, weak composition, inconsistent style between panels, blurry details, low-end matte painting look",
