      "category": "팝업북/디오라마",
      "title": "미니어처를 「광택 점토·수지 조각」으로 규정하고 배경은 임파스토로 조각한다 — 재질을 먼저 정하면 장소는 슬롯이 된다",
      "prompt": "The world, one miniature masterpiece at a time. 🌊\n\nGPT Image 2\n\nPrompt:\nA highly detailed miniature diorama of [DESTINATION/LANDMARK], designed as a handcrafted glossy clay and resin sculpture. Cinematic composition with the iconic landmark as the focal point, surrounded by native landscapes, vegetation, and cultural elements. Thick impasto-style textured background with sculpted clouds and mountains. Smooth ceramic surfaces with glossy reflections, rounded organic forms, miniature travelers exploring the scene, vibrant natural colors unique to the location, ultra-detailed handcrafted textures, tilt-shift photography, shallow depth of field, soft golden-hour lighting, premium editorial travel poster aesthetic, hyper-realistic 3D render, collectible miniature world, vertical 4:5 composition, Instagram-worthy, 8K.\nNegative Prompt:\nLow quality, blurry, flat illustration, cartoon, anime, low-poly, realistic photography, text, watermark, logo, oversaturated colors, distorted perspective, duplicate objects, deformed people, noisy textures, harsh shadows, washed-out colors, extra limbs, cropped subject, empty foreground, cluttered composition.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 4:5 vertical highly detailed miniature diorama of Machu Picchu, made as a handcrafted glossy clay and resin sculpture. Cinematic composition with the terraced stone citadel as the focal point, the sharp peak rising behind it, surrounded by native cloud forest vegetation, llamas and small cultural details. The background sky and mountains are built in thick impasto-style sculpted strokes with rounded modelled clouds, so even the distance reads as a made object rather than a photograph. Smooth ceramic surfaces with glossy highlights, rounded organic forms, tiny miniature travellers exploring the terraces for scale, vibrant natural greens and warm stone tones, ultra-detailed handcrafted texture, tilt-shift photography with a shallow depth of field, soft golden-hour light, premium editorial travel poster feel, collectible miniature world. There is no text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지는 「장소를 정하기 전에 재질을 정한다」다. 미니어처 여행 포스터는 흔하지만 이 건은 **光泽 점토와 수지로 «빚은 조각»**이라고 못박고, 배경 하늘·산까지 **임파스토(두껍게 바른 물감) 질감으로 조각**하게 한다. 그래서 원경마저 사진이 아니라 «만들어진 물건»으로 읽힌다.\n\n여기에 **틸트시프트 + 얕은 심도**를 걸어 실제 미니어처를 접사한 것처럼 만들고, **작은 여행자 인물**을 넣어 축척을 읽히게 한다. 재질·촬영·축척 셋이 정해지면 `[DESTINATION]`은 그냥 슬롯이 된다.\n\n⚠️원문에 Negative Prompt가 길게 붙어 있는데(low-poly·realistic photography·text·watermark·distorted perspective·extra limbs…), Krea2는 cfg 1이라 네거티브가 사실상 무시된다. 런북 §① 그대로 **긍정 서술로 옮겨** gen_prompt를 썼다.",
