      "title": "★화면을 75:25로 갈라 아래 25%를 「점토로 빚은 음악 플레이어 UI」로 준다 — 민속예술 문양을 «조각된 질감»으로 심는다",
      "prompt": "One song. One destination. One unforgettable memory... \n\nGPT Image 2\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a premium Instagram-ready aspect ratio 4:5 vertical handcrafted travel illustration inspired by {LOCATION}. Blend adorable 3D chibi characters, soft matte plasticine clay, miniature diorama craftsmanship, and subtle Gond folk art-inspired sculpted textures. The artwork should feel like a luxury handcrafted travel collectible.\n\nFeature a romantic chibi couple naturally enjoying a local experience unique to {LOCATION}. Build a rich miniature scene with the destination's iconic landmark, architecture, landscapes, native flora, wildlife, cuisine, traditions, and cultural details. Everything should feel authentic, whimsical, and handcrafted.\n\nIntegrate Gond-inspired dots, flowing lines, and organic motifs as sculpted textures within trees, flowers, mountains, water, clouds, architecture, clothing, pathways, wildlife, transportation, and decorative borders.\n\nUse matte clay with subtle fingerprints, rounded forms, layered foliage, handcrafted fabric textures, soft edges, tactile realism, and premium artisan detailing. Avoid photorealism, glossy plastic, CGI, or flat vector styles.\n\nComposition: Top 75% features an immersive destination scene with one dominant landmark and layered foreground, midground, and background. Bottom 25% features an elegant clay music player UI with waveform, playback controls, progress bar, destination-inspired icons, and minimal typography seamlessly integrated into the artwork.\n\nColor palette: warm creams, blush pinks, muted greens, terracotta, dusty blues, warm neutrals, and subtle destination-inspired accents. Lighting: warm golden hour, soft ambient shadows, gentle depth of field, editorial-quality illumination.\n\nStyle: handcrafted stop-motion clay animation, premium designer toy aesthetic, miniature diorama, Pixar-level craftsmanship, subtle Indian folk art influence, cozy romantic atmosphere, ultra-detailed, ultra-high resolution. Maintain Aspect Ratio 4:5",
      "gen_prompt": "A 4:5 vertical handcrafted travel illustration about Jaipur, made of soft matte plasticine clay in a miniature diorama, in the manner of stop-motion clay animation and premium designer toys.\n\nThe top three quarters of the frame hold an immersive scene: an adorable 3D chibi couple sharing masala chai on a rooftop, with the pink sandstone facade and honeycomb windows of a palace rising as the dominant landmark behind them, layered foreground planters, midground rooftops and a distant fort on the ridge. Peacocks, marigold garlands, block-printed fabrics and street food carts fill in the culture.\n\nFolk-art dots, flowing lines and organic motifs are sculpted directly into the surfaces rather than painted on: into the trees, the flowers, the clouds, the architecture, the clothing and the decorative border. The clay keeps subtle fingerprints, rounded forms, layered foliage and soft edges, tactile and clearly handmade rather than glossy plastic or CGI.\n\nThe bottom quarter of the frame is an elegant music player interface modelled in the same clay: a sculpted waveform, rounded playback controls, a progress bar and two small destination-inspired icons, seamlessly integrated into the artwork so it reads as part of the same handmade object.\n\nWarm creams, blush pink, muted green, terracotta and dusty blue, warm golden-hour light with soft ambient shadows and gentle depth of field. There is no lettering anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지는 「화면을 기능으로 나눈다」다. **상단 75%는 몰입형 여행 장면, 하단 25%는 음악 플레이어 UI** — 그리고 그 UI마저 **같은 점토로 빚어** 하나의 물건처럼 보이게 한다. 스크린샷을 얹는 게 아니라 인터페이스를 조형물로 만드는 것.\n\n★★두 번째가 더 값어치 있다 — **민속예술(Gond) 문양을 «그려 넣지» 말고 «조각된 질감»으로 심으라**고 했다. 나무·꽃·산·물·구름·건축·의복·길·야생동물·탈것·장식 테두리 «안에» 점과 선이 새겨지게 한다. 패턴을 표면에 붙이면 스티커가 되고, 형태 안에 새기면 재질이 된다.\n\n점토의 «손자국»을 남기라고 한 것, 광택 플라스틱·CGI·플랫 벡터를 피하라고 한 것도 같은 목적이다 — **만든 사람의 흔적**을 남겨 수공예 수집품처럼 보이게.\n\n재현은 자이푸르로 잡았다(원문의 Gond 민속예술이 인도 계열이라 문화적으로 맞물린다).",
      "ref_image": null,
      "result": "results/goodmanprotocol-scene-75-player-ui-25-clay-travel.webp",
