      "title": "빈티지 동화책 수채 — 소품을 «열거»해 장면의 밀도를 만들고, 잉크선은 느슨하게 풀어 둔다",
      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on CHATGPT \n\nUltra-detailed watercolor and ink illustration in a delicate vintage storybook style, inspired by classic European children's book art. A charming young girl with large expressive blue eyes, rosy cheeks, and soft light-brown hair tied loosely with a ribbon sits peacefully at a rustic wooden garden table in a sunlit forest clearing. She gently rests her chin on her hand while smiling dreamily and watching several small butterflies flutter through warm golden afternoon light. The table is decorated with elegant teacups, a porcelain teapot, strawberry sponge cake slices, fresh strawberries, pastries, muffins, lemon slices, wildflowers in glass jars, and a white linen tablecloth. Surrounding her are colorful wildflowers, lush green trees, soft foliage, and dappled sunlight filtering through leaves. Loose expressive ink linework, soft watercolor washes, warm cream, sage green, honey yellow, peach and pastel floral palette, subtle paper texture, whimsical botanical details, airy negative space, gentle cinematic composition, cozy cottagecore aesthetic, peaceful spring garden atmosphere, highly detailed, elegant hand-drawn illustration, premium children's book artwork, soft glowing light, dreamy, nostalgic, masterpiece, 8K.",
      "gen_prompt": "Ultra-detailed watercolour and ink illustration in a delicate vintage storybook style, in the manner of classic European children's book art. A young girl with large expressive blue eyes, rosy cheeks and soft light-brown hair tied loosely with a ribbon sits at a rustic wooden garden table in a sunlit forest clearing. She rests her chin on her hand, smiling dreamily, watching several small butterflies drift through warm golden afternoon light.\n\nThe table carries elegant teacups, a porcelain teapot, slices of strawberry sponge cake, fresh strawberries, pastries, muffins, lemon slices, wildflowers in glass jars and a white linen tablecloth. Around her are colourful wildflowers, lush green trees, soft foliage and dappled sunlight coming through the leaves.\n\nLoose expressive ink linework that wanders slightly off the watercolour washes, soft washes in warm cream, sage green, honey yellow, peach and pastel floral tones, subtle paper texture, whimsical botanical detail, airy negative space at the edges where the painting fades back to bare paper, gentle cinematic composition, cosy cottagecore feel, elegant hand-drawn illustration, soft glowing light, dreamy and nostalgic.\n\nThere is no text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "형용사 나열형 완결 프롬프트다. 구조를 선언하지 않고 **소품을 길게 열거해 장면의 밀도를 만든다** — 찻잔·자기 주전자·딸기 스펀지케이크·생딸기·페이스트리·머핀·레몬 슬라이스·유리병 속 들꽃·린넨 테이블보. 목록 자체가 화면을 채우는 방식이다.\n\n★담은 이유를 적어둔다 — 런북 §「분량·품질은 탈락 사유가 아니다」. 이 계정의 기보유 27건과 매체(수채 스토리북)가 겹치지만, **같은 계정이 같은 소재를 다뤄도 논지는 매번 다를 수 있다**는 규칙(2026-08-02 제이크 지적)에 따라 계정·소재로 묶지 않았다. 다만 이 건은 구조 지식이 얇은 편이라는 점은 그대로 적어둔다.\n\n재현 시 원문 말미의 `8K`·`masterpiece` 같은 품질 주문어는 Krea2에서 의미가 없어 뺐고, 대신 원문에 있던 `airy negative space`를 **\"가장자리에서 그림이 맨 종이로 풀린다\"**로 형태 지시로 바꿔 적었다.",
      "ref_image": null,
