      "title": "★색 수를 「정확히 넷」으로 못박고 머리 뒤에 원반 하나를 둔다 — 옆모습 + 후광 원반이 성상화 구조를 만든다",
      "prompt": "Gpt image 2 on ChatGPT \n\nPrompt:\nEditorial poster featuring [CHARACTER] in strict left-facing profile, cropped from mid-torso, with [HAIR] forming a dominant graphic silhouette and [CLOTHING]. Place one large flat circular disk directly behind the head. Render crisp flat vector shapes, angular facial features, controlled black contour lines, screen-print grain, halftone dots, and woven grid texture. Construct the background from layered [BACKGROUND] while keeping the composition clean and the subject dominant. Limit the entire artwork to exactly four high-contrast colors: [PALETTE]. Add the minimalist title “[TITLE]” at the upper left in bold condensed uppercase sans serif, with the smaller headline “[HEADLINE]” directly beneath it; clear hierarchy, generous negative space, Vertical 4:5 AR.",
      "gen_prompt": "Editorial poster of a woman in strict left-facing profile, cropped at mid-torso. Her tightly coiled afro hair forms a dominant graphic silhouette, and she wears a high-collared work jacket. One large flat circular disk sits directly behind her head like a halo, filling the space between her profile and the frame.\n\nCrisp flat vector shapes, angular faceted facial features, controlled black contour lines, visible screen-print grain, halftone dots and a woven grid texture across the whole surface. The background is built from layered flat geometric bands, kept clean so the figure stays dominant.\n\nThe entire artwork uses exactly four high-contrast colours and no others: deep oxblood red, warm bone cream, near-black ink and a single mustard yellow.\n\nAt the upper left, the title THE MAKER is set in bold condensed uppercase sans serif, and directly beneath it in a much smaller size the headline HANDS BEFORE MACHINES. Those two lines are the complete and only lettering in the image, sitting in clean empty background that the figure never crosses, so both stay fully legible. Clear hierarchy, generous negative space, vertical 4:5.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지 둘. **① 색 수를 「정확히 넷」으로 못박는다** — 팔레트를 분위기로 주문하지 않고 개수로 제한하면 스크린프린트 특유의 절제가 강제된다. **② 머리 뒤에 큰 평면 원반 하나**를 둔다 — 이 하나로 옆모습 초상이 «성상화(icon)» 구조가 된다.\n\n나머지는 재질 지시로 고정했다 — 플랫 벡터·각진 이목구비·검은 윤곽선·스크린프린트 그레인·하프톤 점·직조 그리드 질감. 슬롯은 `[CHARACTER]` `[HAIR]` `[CLOTHING]` `[BACKGROUND]` `[PALETTE]` `[TITLE]` `[HEADLINE]` 일곱 개다.\n\n★**\"엄격한 좌향 옆모습(strict left-facing profile)\"** 처럼 방향까지 못박은 것이 이 계정의 방식이다. 제이크 투척(2026-08-05).",
