      "prompt": "Ultra-detailed hyper-realistic studio photograph of gourmet crispy snack pieces designed in the exact silhouette of the [brand logo], golden lightly fried pastry texture with delicate blistering, airy crunchy structure, subtle oil sheen, realistic handcrafted irregularities, luxury fashion-meets-food concept, spilling naturally from a premium open-top fries box wrapped in the authentic visual language of [brand], elegant logo pattern, refined typography, authentic brand-matching colors, minimal high-end styling, isolated on a pure white seamless background, no plate, no extra objects, soft cinematic lighting, realistic shadows, crisp surface detail, sharp focus, premium commercial food photography aesthetic, photorealistic, 8k, no watermark, no extra text",
      "gen_prompt": "Ultra-detailed hyper-realistic studio photograph of gourmet crispy snack pieces baked in the exact silhouette of a bold geometric shield monogram, so each piece is the mark itself rather than a piece stamped with it. Golden lightly fried pastry texture with delicate blistering, airy crunchy structure, subtle oil sheen and realistic handcrafted irregularities.\n\nThey spill naturally from a premium open-top fries box in deep forest green and cream, carrying an elegant repeated pattern of the same monogram and refined small typography, styled minimally and expensively, luxury fashion meeting food.\n\nIsolated on a pure white seamless background with nothing else in frame, no plate and no props. Soft cinematic lighting, realistic contact shadows, crisp surface detail, sharp focus, premium commercial food photography. There is no readable lettering anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지는 「로고를 붙이지 말고 «형태로 만든다»」다. 브랜딩 목업이 흔히 하는 것 — 제품 위에 로고를 얹기 — 대신, **과자 조각 하나하나를 로고 실루엣 그대로 성형**한다. 그래서 로고가 표면이 아니라 «물건 자체»가 된다.\n\n패키지는 프렌치프라이 박스로 고정하고 브랜드의 색·패턴·타이포를 «정품 시각언어»로 감싸게 했다. 순백 배경·접시 없음·소품 없음으로 정리해 제품 사진의 문법을 지킨다.\n\n⚠️Nano Banana Pro용으로 쓰인 프롬프트다(작성자 명시). Krea2 재현은 「로고를 자동 식별한다」는 부분이 성립하지 않아 오리지널 모노그램으로 대체했다 — 런북 §저작권.",
