      "prompt": "Prompt share: Paper cut\n\nPaper cut-out animation style, [subject], full body character shot, layered paper shapes, handmade paper texture, visible cut edges, soft shadow between layers, simple readable action, charming storybook character design, flat paper colors, slightly imperfect handcrafted details, paper collage background, minimal folk tale scenery, gentle stop-motion animation feel, poetic children’s story atmosphere, clean white background with simple paper elements\n\nTry it and share yours 🔥",
      "gen_prompt": "Paper cut-out animation style, a young fox in a travelling cloak carrying a lantern, full body character shot. Built from layered paper shapes with handmade paper texture and visible cut edges, each layer casting a soft shadow onto the one beneath so the depth reads as real stacked paper. The pose is one simple readable action, mid-stride with the lantern swinging forward. Charming storybook character design, flat paper colours, slightly imperfect handcrafted details with edges that do not quite line up. A paper collage background of minimal folk-tale scenery, a few paper hills and one paper moon, on a clean white ground with simple paper elements. Gentle stop-motion animation feel, poetic children's story atmosphere. There is no text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★기보유 [[azed-layered-papercut-illustration]]과 매체는 같지만 논지가 다르다. 그쪽은 «2색 겹침의 정물 일러스트»이고, 이 건은 **«스톱모션 애니메이션의 한 프레임»**이다.\n\n차이를 만드는 지시가 셋이다 — **① 전신 캐릭터 샷**(정물이 아니라 배역) **② 층 사이의 부드러운 그림자**(종이가 실제로 쌓여 있다는 증거) **③ 「하나의 읽히는 단순한 동작」**(포즈가 아니라 행동). 여기에 **「살짝 불완전한 수공 디테일」**을 더해 기계로 자른 티를 지운다.\n\n`[subject]` 슬롯 하나짜리 짧은 템플릿이라 캐릭터만 갈아 끼우면 시리즈가 된다.",
