      "title": "★두 칸에 같은 인물을 세우는 광고는 「한 장으로」 뽑아야 한다 — 배경(검은 스튜디오 + 주황 원형 할로)을 상수로 두고 제품만 바꿔 두 브랜드를 한 캠페인으로 묶는다",
      "prompt": "Create a viral luxury fashion advertising campaign featuring the same elegant young woman in two completely different poses, presented as a premium cinematic diptych poster.\n\nLeft panel: The woman wears a structured matte-black blazer with a sleek black outfit. She holds a luxurious amber perfume bottle close to her neck with one hand, while looking confidently away from the camera with a calm, powerful expression. Her hair is styled in a soft messy bun with natural loose strands framing her face.\n\nRight panel: Show the same woman in a dramatic over-the-shoulder pose, wearing a minimalist black evening dress. A premium black leather handbag with subtle gold hardware hangs elegantly from her shoulder. She lightly rests one hand beneath her chin and looks directly into the camera with effortless confidence.\n\nUse a deep black studio background with a large glowing burnt-orange circular halo behind the model in both panels. Add cinematic orange rim lighting around her hair, face and shoulders, soft directional key lighting, deep shadows, glossy highlights and high-fashion editorial contrast.\n\nHyper-realistic natural skin texture, realistic pores, elegant makeup, sharp expressive eyes, premium hair detail, realistic leather texture, polished perfume glass reflections, sophisticated luxury styling, 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, HDR, ultra-sharp focus, 8K photorealism, Vogue-style editorial photography, international luxury campaign quality.\n\nAdd clean premium serif typography in warm metallic gold and ivory:\n\nLeft panel text:\nLUXÉLUNE\nSCENT OF CONFIDENCE\nNot just a fragrance. It’s your signature.\n\nRight panel text:\nLUXORA\nCARRY CONFIDENCE.\nOWN EVERY ROOM.\nTimeless. Effortless. You.\n\nKeep the typography perfectly aligned, readable and minimal. Use balanced negative space, symmetrical luxury composition and a bold scroll-stopping social-media aesthetic. No watermark, no existing brand logos, no distorted hands, no extra fingers, no duplicate products, no clutter, no cartoon effect, no artificial plastic skin.\n\nAspect ratio: 16:9 cinematic campaign poster.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 16:9 cinematic luxury advertising diptych, split down the middle into two equal panels by a thin dark gutter, showing the same elegant young woman twice — identical face, identical soft messy dark bun with loose strands, identical skin and makeup in both panels, only the pose and the product changing. Both panels share one deep black studio background with a single large glowing burnt-orange circular halo behind her, warm orange rim light along her hair and shoulders, soft directional key light, deep shadows and glossy highlights. In the left panel she wears a structured matte-black blazer and holds an amber glass perfume bottle near her neck, looking away from camera with a calm, powerful expression. In the right panel she is seen over her shoulder in a minimal black evening dress, a black leather handbag with gold chain hardware hanging from her shoulder, one hand resting lightly beneath her chin, looking straight into the lens. Two short lines of warm metallic gold serif type sit in the empty black areas, well away from her face and never overlapping her: the word LUXELUNE low in the left panel, and the word LUXORA high in the right panel. These two words are the only text in the whole image and no other lettering appears anywhere. Hyper-realistic skin texture with visible pores, sharp expressive eyes, realistic leather grain, polished glass reflections, 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, high-fashion editorial contrast.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**두 칸에 같은 인물을 세우는 광고 — 여기서 칸별 생성은 오히려 실패한다.**\n\n런북 §④는 «칸마다 다른 내용»일 때 칸별로 뽑아 합치라고 한다. 이 건은 **정반대**다:\n```\n칸 사이에 고정돼야 할 대상이 있는가?\n  있다 (같은 모델의 얼굴)  →  ★한 장으로 뽑는다\n  없다 (서로 다른 주제)    →  칸별 생성 후 합성\n```\n칸별로 뽑으면 Krea2에 인물 고정 수단이 없어 **두 칸이 다른 사람**이 된다. 한 장으로 뽑으면\n타일링 습성이 여기서는 «바라던 동작»이 된다([[ouzhen599-identical-package-color-block-flavor-grid]]\n와 같은 자리).\n\n★**구성 설계는 「배경을 공유하고 제품만 바꾼 것」이다.**\n검은 스튜디오 + 등 뒤 주황 원형 할로 + 오렌지 림라이트를 두 칸에 똑같이 걸어 놓고,\n왼쪽엔 향수·오른쪽엔 가방을 준다. 배경이 상수라서 **두 브랜드가 한 캠페인으로 읽힌다** —\n서로 다른 두 광고가 아니라. 뒤의 원형 할로 하나가 그 접착제 역할을 한다.\n\n⚠️원문에는 브랜드명·태그라인·부제까지 **패널당 4줄씩 총 8줄**이 들어 있다. Krea2에서\n그 분량은 무너지므로(§⑤) **브랜드명 두 단어만 남기고** 총량을 못박았다. 나머지 카피는\n후반 합성 대상이다. 원본 이미지에는 8줄이 전부 정확히 나와 있다 — GPT Image 2와의 차이가\n이 항목의 비교탭에서 그대로 보인다.",
