      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 on Chatgpt \n\nPrompt:\nTransform the uploaded reference photo into a minimalist black-and-white hand-drawn doodle illustration while preserving the subject's pose, hairstyle, clothing, accessories, and overall composition. Use a cute, simple character design with a large rounded head, tiny dot eyes, a tiny button nose, small blush dots on the cheeks, and a minimal mouth. Draw with confident black ink lines of varying thickness, smooth slightly wobbly outlines, and almost no interior detail. Simplify all clothing into loose graphic shapes with minimal folds while keeping recognizable items such as jackets, scarves, bags, dresses, microphones, bows, jewelry, or hand poses. Preserve the original gesture and expression. Add only a few playful accent elements such as sparkle icons, tiny stars, or simple motion marks around the character. Place the original reference photo as a small rectangular inset in the upper-left corner with a generous white margin surrounding both the reference and illustration. Keep the illustration on a pure white background with no shading, no grayscale, no color, and no textures. Clean manga-inspired doodle aesthetic, cute sketchbook style, bold black line art, highly simplified, balanced composition, 1:1 aspect ratio.",
      "gen_prompt": "A square composition on a pure white background, divided into two parts with generous white margin between and around them. In the upper left corner sits a small rectangular photographic inset with clean edges: a colour photo of a young woman with a short dark bob and blunt fringe, seen from behind and turning her head back over her shoulder, wearing a black jacket and carrying a plain unbranded tan leather shoulder bag with no logo or pattern, standing before green foliage. Filling the rest of the square at much larger scale is the same pose redrawn as a minimalist black-ink doodle illustration: a large rounded head, tiny dot eyes, a small curved nose, a minimal mouth, hair simplified into a few confident sweeping strokes, the jacket and bag reduced to loose graphic shapes with almost no interior detail. The ink lines vary in thickness and wobble slightly, drawn with a brush pen in one pass. Nothing is shaded, there is no grey and no colour in the drawing, and the pose, hairstyle and bag of the photograph are clearly preserved in it. A few tiny sparkle marks float near the figure. Clean manga-inspired sketchbook aesthetic, bold black line art, balanced composition. No lettering anywhere.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**변환 결과 옆에 「원본을 작게 박아 넣는다」 — 한 장이 곧 비교 자료가 된다.**\n\n같은 날 담은 [[missdelulu9-doodle-transform-wobbly-strokes]]와 매체는 같지만 **논지가 다르다.**\n그쪽은 «어긋남의 형태»를 적어 손맛을 만드는 쪽이고, 이쪽은 구조다:\n\n```\n좌상단   원본 사진을 작은 «인셋»으로            ← 무엇을 변환했는지\n나머지   훨씬 크게 그린 두들 일러스트           ← 어떻게 변환됐는지\n사이     넉넉한 흰 여백                        ← 둘을 갈라 놓아 비교가 성립한다\n```\n★**우리 프로젝트가 하는 일과 정확히 같은 사고**다 — 라이브러리의 원본↔재현 «비교탭»을\n한 장의 이미지 안에서 하는 것. 변환기 프롬프트를 SNS에 올릴 때 결과만 올리면 «그림»이지만,\n원본을 함께 박으면 **«기법의 증명»**이 된다.\n\n★보존 목록도 명시적이다 — 포즈 · 헤어스타일 · 의상 · 소품 · 구도는 지키고, 내부 디테일만\n지운다. 그래서 «다른 그림»이 아니라 «같은 장면의 다른 표기»로 읽힌다.\n\n⚠️원본 인셋 사진에 명품 가방 모노그램이 찍혀 있어 재현에서는 무늬 없는 무지 가죽으로 바꿨다\n(런북 §2 — 브랜드는 이름을 지워도 조형으로 재현되므로 조형을 다르게 지정).",
