      "prompt": "🎨 HALFTONE HORROR 🎨\n\nPrompt :\n\n[SUBJECT] depicted in Halftone Horror, using varying sizes of black dots to create a stark, high-contrast image. Focus on unsettling imagery and dramatic lighting to create a sense of unease and dread\n\nCheck ALTS https://t.co/1j0pjHLwwG\n\n--- ALT (적용 예시) ---\nA decaying skull depicted in Halftone Horror, using varying sizes of black dots to create a stark, high-contrast image. Focus on unsettling imagery and dramatic lighting to create a sense of unease and dread --ar 3:2\n\nA hollow-eyed porcelain doll depicted in Halftone Horror, using varying sizes of black dots to create a stark, high-contrast image. Focus on unsettling imagery and dramatic lighting to create a sense of unease and dread --ar 3:2\n\nA monstrous creature crawling out of a mirror depicted in Halftone Horror, using varying sizes of black dots to create a stark, high-contrast image. Focus on unsettling imagery and dramatic lighting to create a sense of unease and dread --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nA rotting scarecrow in a dead cornfield depicted in Halftone Horror, using varying sizes of black dots to create a stark, high-contrast image. Focus on unsettling imagery and dramatic lighting to create a sense of unease and dread --ar 3:2 --v 8.2",
      "gen_prompt": "A rotting scarecrow standing alone in a dead cornfield, rendered entirely in halftone: the whole image is built from black dots of widely varying size on bare white, with dots swelling into dense clots where the shadows fall and thinning to sparse specks where light hits, so that form is read purely from dot density. Only pure black and pure white exist — no grey wash, no line work, no shading. The scarecrow's burlap head sags to one side, its stitched mouth pulls open, straw juts from the sleeves of a ruined coat, and the broken cornstalks around it bend away into darkness. Hard raking light from one low side carves it out and leaves most of the frame in heavy black. Unsettling, high-contrast, coarse print texture like a newspaper enlarged far past its resolution. Horizontal 3:2 framing. No lettering anywhere.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「하프톤」을 필터가 아니라 「형태를 만드는 유일한 수단」으로 쓴다.**\n\n원문은 짧은 슬롯형 한 줄이다 — *`[SUBJECT]`를 Halftone Horror로 묘사하되, **크기가 다른 검은\n점들**로 극명한 고대비 이미지를 만들고, 불안한 심상과 극적인 조명으로 불쾌감과 공포를 만들어라.*\n\n★값어치는 **`varying sizes of black dots`** 한 마디에 있다. 하프톤을 «후처리 효과»로 얹으면\n점 크기가 균일해 무늬가 되는데, **점 크기 자체가 명암을 만들게** 하면 그림자에서 점이 뭉치고\n빛에서 흩어져 **형태가 점 밀도로만 읽힌다.** 회색을 아예 배제해야 성립한다.\n\n★**작성자가 ALT에 적용 예시 넷을 붙여 놓은 것**도 이 항목의 값어치다 — 썩어가는 해골 /\n눈이 뻥 뚫린 도자기 인형 / 거울에서 기어 나오는 괴물 / 죽은 옥수수밭의 허수아비.\n**같은 문법이 어디까지 버티는지**를 작성자가 스스로 시험한 기록이라, 슬롯형 템플릿의\n적용 범위가 함께 온다. (재현은 넷째 예시로 했다)\n\n우리 쪽 쓸 자리: 흑백 썸네일, 공포·미스터리 소재 인서트. 인쇄 질감이라 작은 화면에서도\n뭉개지지 않는다.",
