      "prompt": "Gpt image 2 on ChatGpt\n\nPROMPT:\n\nBold surreal editorial portrait of [CHARACTER], shown in a centered frontal chest-up composition, wearing [CLOTHING]. Keep the portrait highly realistic and symmetrical, but interrupt one full vertical section of the subject with translucent overlay [ELEMENT], treated as a dominant surreal replacement strip that occupies roughly one-third to nearly one-half of the face, cutting from the top of the head through the eye, cheek, mouth, neck, and into the clothing. The replacement strip must feel structural and graphic, not subtle or decorative, with crisp hard edges and strong visual contrast. Build the background as a flat graphic poster field using [BACKGROUND], composed of large pastel rectangles, photo of a [SCENERY] circles, line clusters, cropped panels, and abstract inserts, with a few retro-print accents integrated across the composition. Use a [COLORS] palette, soft paper grain, slight print texture, clean edges, strong geometric balance, and a polished art-poster finish. Make the surreal intervention large, unmistakable, and visually commanding.Vertical 4:5.",
      "gen_prompt": "A bold surreal editorial poster portrait, vertical 4:5. A woman with long deep-magenta waves is shown chest-up, centred and frontal, wearing an open sage-green utility jacket over a cream cropped top; the photographic half of her is highly realistic and symmetrical. One full vertical band, about a third of the frame wide, replaces part of her — it runs from the top of her head straight down through one eye, cheek, mouth, neck and into the jacket, and inside that band she is gone, substituted by a collage of palm trees, pale blue sky and a strip of beach at dusk. The band has crisp hard edges and reads as a structural graphic cut, dominant and unmistakable, never a soft double exposure. Around her the background is a flat graphic poster field: large pastel rectangles in sage, cream and powder blue, a peach-coloured circle, a cluster of thin parallel rules, a cropped photographic panel of cactus, and small retro-print accents. Soft paper grain, slight print texture, clean edges, strong geometric balance, polished art-poster finish. No lettering anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**초현실을 「덧씌우지」 말고 「잘라내고 대체하라」 — 얼굴의 세로 한 구간을 통째로 바꾼다.**\n\nAI 초현실 초상의 흔한 실패는 이중노출처럼 **반투명하게 겹치는 것**이다. 그러면 «몽환적인\n필터»가 되고 논지가 사라진다. 이 프롬프트는 정반대를 명시한다:\n\n```\n폭      화면의 «1/3~거의 1/2»                        ← 애매하면 장식이 된다. 크게 못박는다\n경로    머리 꼭대기 → 눈 → 볼 → 입 → 목 → 옷까지 «관통»\n성격    ★\"구조적이고 그래픽하게. 미묘하거나 장식적이지 않게\"\n가장자리 «날카롭고 단단하게» — 흐린 경계 금지\n```\n★**\"unmistakable, visually commanding\"**을 마지막 줄에 다시 못박는 것까지 설계다. 모델은\n지시가 과감할수록 순화하려 드는데, 강도를 두 번 적으면 그 경향을 누른다.\n\n★배경도 «사진»이 아니라 **«납작한 그래픽 포스터 필드»**로 규정한다 — 큰 파스텔 사각형,\n원, 가는 선 다발, 잘린 사진 패널, 레트로 인쇄 악센트. 인물 사진과 평면 그래픽을 부딪치게\n해서 **에디토리얼 포스터**로 만든다. [[derekwall-hard-grid-times-soft-material]]의\n「정반대 둘의 충돌」과 같은 자리.\n\n원문은 `[CHARACTER]/[CLOTHING]/[ELEMENT]/[BACKGROUND]/[SCENERY]/[COLORS]` 6슬롯 템플릿이라\n주제만 갈아 끼우면 시리즈가 된다.",
