      "title": "★★「사실적인 얼굴」과 「먹 그래픽」을 한 화면에서 충돌시킨다 — 거대한 주홍 원형 붓자국 하나를 축으로, 디지털 티가 나는 요소를 이름으로 전부 배제한다",
      "prompt": "Created with Google Gemini Nano banana 🍌 \n Prompt ⤵️ \nContemporary neo-Japanese mixed-media portrait illustration blending refined realism with expressive sumi-e aesthetics, urban editorial art, and premium street-culture design. Ultra-detailed painterly rendering with crisp facial realism contrasted against bold graphic ink elements. Hand-painted brush textures, dry-brush strokes, ink splatters, paint drips, distressed paper fibers, cracked pigment, weathered parchment texture, and layered mixed-media collage create a handcrafted museum-quality appearance. Strong minimalist composition with large bold vermilion circular brush mark, dynamic calligraphic energy, selective graphic symbols, distressed stamp-print aesthetics, and asymmetrical visual balance. Limited color palette dominated by warm ivory paper, carbon black, deep charcoal, muted sepia, and vivid vermilion red accents for dramatic impact. Soft matte finish with cinematic directional lighting, subtle atmospheric depth, realistic material textures, organic imperfections, elegant negative space, premium editorial poster aesthetic, handcrafted fine-art illustration, timeless Japanese-inspired contemporary design, non-digital appearance, gallery-quality mixed-media masterpiece. Vertical composition, --ar 9:16.\"\n\nNegative Prompt:\nCGI, 3D render, glossy finish, plastic skin, hyper-smooth surfaces, futuristic cyberpunk, neon lighting, colorful gradients, watercolor wash, oil painting impasto, anime, manga, cartoon, comic style, vector art, flat illustration, photobash, low detail, oversaturated colors, excessive ornaments, busy background, modern typography, clean geometric shapes, metallic reflections, airbrushed textures, blurry edges, low resolution, watermark, logo, text, frame.",
      "gen_prompt": "A contemporary neo-Japanese mixed-media portrait illustration that blends refined realism with expressive sumi-e ink aesthetics, urban editorial art and premium street-culture design. The face is rendered with crisp painterly realism and is set directly against bold flat graphic ink elements, so the two treatments collide in one frame. Hand-painted brush textures, dry-brush strokes, ink splatters, paint drips, distressed paper fibres, cracked pigment and weathered parchment build a handcrafted, museum-quality surface. Strong minimalist composition anchored by one large bold vermilion circular brush mark behind the head, with dynamic calligraphic energy, a few selective graphic symbols, distressed stamp-print marks and asymmetrical balance. Limited palette of warm ivory paper, carbon black, deep charcoal, muted sepia and vivid vermilion red for impact. Soft matte finish, cinematic directional light, subtle atmospheric depth, real material texture with organic imperfections, elegant negative space, premium editorial poster feel. Surfaces stay matte and papery with visible tooth and irregular pigment, edges of the ink stay ragged where the brush lifted, and the whole image reads as physical printed and painted material rather than a screen render. Vertical composition. No lettering anywhere.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**「사실적인 얼굴」과 「먹 그래픽」을 섞지 말고 «부딪히게» 둔다.**\n\n원문 첫 문장이 설계다 — *refined realism과 표현적 수묵(sumi-e)을 blend하되,\n**crisp facial realism을 bold graphic ink elements와 contrast**시킨다.* 섞으면 «수채화풍\n일러스트»가 되고, 부딪히면 **에디토리얼 포스터**가 된다.\n\n★**화면을 잡아주는 건 「거대한 주홍 원형 붓자국 하나」다.** 요소가 많은 혼합매체에서 축이\n없으면 콜라주로 흩어지는데, 원 하나가 인물 뒤에 놓이면 성상화 구조가 된다.\n([[ChillaiKalan 4색 제한 옆모습]]의 «머리 뒤 평면 원반»과 같은 장치 — 계정이 달라도 같은 문법.)\n\n★**팔레트를 다섯으로 못박는다** — 따뜻한 아이보리 종이 · 카본 블랙 · 짙은 차콜 · 탁한 세피아 ·\n선명한 주홍. 주홍만 «강조»로 쓴다.\n\n★★**네거티브가 「디지털 티」를 정조준한다** — CGI · 3D 렌더 · 광택 마감 · 플라스틱 피부 ·\n초매끈한 표면 · 벡터 아트 · 에어브러시 질감 · 깨끗한 기하 도형 · 금속 반사.\n`non-digital appearance`를 목표로 걸고, 그걸 깨는 요소를 **하나씩 이름으로** 지웠다.\n⚠️Krea2는 부정문이 안 들으므로 재현에서는 긍정으로 뒤집었다 — *\"표면은 무광 종이질로 남고,\n결이 보이고, 안료가 고르지 않고, 붓이 떨어진 자리에서 먹 가장자리가 거칠다.\"*",
