      "title": "★「흑백으로」가 아니라 「회색을 금지한다」 — 순수 검정과 흰색만 쓰고 인물은 화면의 30~40%만 차지하게 해서 여백이 주인공이 되게",
      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on CHATGPT \n\nMinimalistic black and white editorial illustration of a character from an attached photo on a pure white background with plenty of negative space. The character occupies approximately 30-40% of the frame. Stylized proportions with a slightly enlarged head, simplified facial features, small dotted eyes, expressive eyebrows, a tiny nose, and a barely noticeable friendly smile. Casual casual streetwear with voluminous silhouettes, massive sneakers, simple accessories and a casual manner. It is drawn with clear, confident lines in black ink with varying line densities, rounded contours, soft, sketch-like defects and expressive hand-drawn strokes. Use only solid black and white, without shades of gray, without colors or gradients. The clothes use large black shapes contrasting with white fabric, minimal creases, simple contour lines and sparse shading. Add only a soft shadow from the ground under your feet. The composition is placed in the center with wide white margins, which creates a modern editorial look. The background remains completely blank, except for a barely noticeable floor line or shadow. The overall aesthetic is reminiscent of the illustrations of modern indie webcomics, Scandinavian editorial drawings, playful character design style and clear vector ink sketches. High resolution, clear lines, minimalistic, expressive, stylish, charming, hand-drawn, 2D illustration, monochrome, without background elements, aspect ratio 4:5.",
      "gen_prompt": "A minimalist black and white editorial illustration of a single character on a pure white background with a great deal of empty space. The figure occupies only about thirty-five percent of the frame, centred, with wide white margins on every side. Stylised proportions with a slightly enlarged head, simplified features, small dot eyes, expressive brows, a tiny nose and a barely there friendly smile. Casual streetwear with voluminous silhouettes, massive sneakers and simple accessories. Drawn in confident black ink lines of varying weight, rounded contours, soft sketch-like imperfections and expressive hand-drawn strokes. Only solid black and pure white are used — there is no grey anywhere, no gradient and no colour. The clothing is built from large flat black shapes set against white fabric with minimal creases, simple contour lines and sparse hatching. The only shadow in the picture is one soft mark on the ground beneath the feet. The background stays completely blank apart from a barely visible floor line. Modern indie webcomic and Scandinavian editorial feel, clean vector-like ink sketch, high resolution. No lettering anywhere.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「흑백 일러스트」라고 쓰면 회색조 그림이 나온다 — 「회색을 쓰지 마라」가 진짜 지시다.**\n\n```\n안 통함   \"black and white illustration\"        → 회색 음영이 들어가 «흑백 사진»처럼 된다\n★통함     \"solid black and pure white만, 회색조 없음, 그라데이션 없음, 색 없음\"\n          + 옷은 «큰 검정 덩어리»가 흰 천과 대비 · 주름은 최소 · 해칭은 성기게\n          + ★그림자는 «발밑 하나»만\n```\n회색을 지우면 형태가 «면»으로 정리되고, 스칸디나비아 에디토리얼·인디 웹코믹 특유의 명료함이\n나온다. 오늘 담은 [[ludoviccreator-halftone-horror-dot-size-slot]]도 «회색 없음»이 조건이었다 —\n하프톤은 점 밀도로, 이건 면 대비로 같은 문제를 푼다.\n\n★**인물을 화면의 30~40%로 제한**한 것도 같은 목적이다. 크게 그리면 캐릭터 일러스트가 되고,\n작게 두고 여백을 넓히면 **에디토리얼 지면**이 된다. 여백이 «비어 있는 곳»이 아니라 «디자인»이 된다.\n\n⚠️원문은 업로드 사진을 캐릭터화하는 변환기다. 우리는 텍스트 단독으로 문법만 확인했다.",
