      "prompt": "Gpt image 2 on the Chatgpt \n\nPrompt 👇 \nA striking studio portrait of a confident man facing the camera, wearing translucent amber-orange acetate oval sunglasses with ice gradient tinted lenses. The portrait is mostly monochrome (black-and-white), while only the sunglasses remain in vivid orange, creating a selective color effect. Short textured hair with a side sweep, neatly trimmed full beard, neutral expression, black turtleneck under a tailored black jacket. Minimalist light gray background, centered symmetrical composition, ultra-sharp focus, high-end fashion editorial, luxury eyewear campaign, soft diffused studio lighting, crisp skin texture, cinematic contrast, medium close-up, 85mm lens, f/2, photorealistic, ultra-detailed, premium magazine quality, 8K.",
      "gen_prompt": "A studio portrait of a confident adult man facing the camera straight on, medium close-up, framed from the chest up. The entire photograph is black and white with one exception: his oval sunglasses are vivid translucent amber-orange acetate, and the lenses inside them carry a pale iced gradient going from warm orange at the top to near-clear at the bottom. That amber is the only colour anywhere in the frame; skin, hair, beard, clothing and background all read as neutral grey tones with no colour cast at all. Because the acetate is translucent, the light passing through it lays a soft warm patch on his cheekbone just below each lens, and the frame edges glow where they catch the light. He has short textured hair swept to one side, a neatly trimmed full beard, and a neutral unsmiling expression. He wears a black turtleneck under a tailored black jacket, both matte, which keeps every other surface colourless. Plain light grey seamless background, centred symmetrical composition, soft broad diffused studio light with a crisp catchlight in each lens, sharp rendering of skin texture and beard hair, shallow depth so the ears fall slightly soft. No text, no logos, no brand marks on the eyewear or clothing.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**선택적 채색(selective color)이 성립하는 조건 두 가지.**\n\n라이브러리에 이미 셋 있다([[taaruk-selective-color-sports-poster-series]] ·\n[[imshahid7-selective-color-matcha-splash-bw]]) — 이 건은 **다른 문법**이라 담았다.\n\n**① 남길 색을 「물건」에 걸고, 그 물건이 «원래 반투명»이게 한다**\n호박색 아세테이트 안경테 + 위→아래 그라데이션 렌즈. 반투명이라 **빛이 통과해 광대뼈에 따뜻한\n얼룩을 남기고** 테 가장자리가 발광한다 → 색이 «칠해진» 게 아니라 «그 자리에 있는 이유»가 생긴다.\n\n**② 나머지 색을 미리 없앤다 — 검정 터틀넥 + 검정 재킷 + 회색 무지 배경**\n런북 §네거티브 규칙대로 *\"다른 데 색 넣지 마\"*는 안 통하므로, **무채색 의상을 지정해** 색이 나올\n자리를 아예 없앴다. 「빼라」 대신 「그 자리를 무엇으로 채울지」다.\n\n⚠️원문의 *\"luxury eyewear campaign\"* 은 남겼지만 **브랜드명·로고 지시는 넣지 않았다** —\n런북 §브랜드(2026-08-05 `Nike-level` → 스우시 사고)대로 품질 기준 표현도 조형을 불러온다.",
