      "prompt": "Prompt share: Die-cut sticker\n\n💬Prompt:\nDie-cut sticker icon of a [subject], bold thick black linework, hand-drawn retro line art style, small sparkle and star accents, cream off-white fill, minimal flat shading, vintage cafe branding aesthetic, vector illustration style, white sticker border outline.\n\nTry it and share yours 🔥",
      "gen_prompt": "A die-cut sticker of a moka pot coffee maker, drawn as a single centred object on a plain white field. Bold thick black outlines of even weight describe the whole shape, with hand-drawn retro line art inside it — slightly wobbling contours, visible pen pressure, no perfectly straight edges. Four small four-pointed sparkles and two tiny stars sit around the object in the empty space, none of them touching it. The fills are flat cream off-white with only two steps of shading, no gradients and no rendering. The whole sticker is surrounded by a thick even white border that follows the silhouette at a constant offset, the way a kiss-cut vinyl sticker is trimmed, and a soft drop shadow sits under that border so the sticker reads as a physical object lying on the surface. Vintage cafe branding aesthetic, vector illustration style, limited palette of black, cream and one muted warm brown. There is no text of any kind anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**슬롯형 템플릿 — 짧지만 완결이다.** 런북 §분량(2026-07-31)의 첫 칸에 정확히 해당한다.\n\n```\n[subject]  ← 갈아끼우는 유일한 자리\nbold thick black linework        굵고 «균일한» 검정 외곽선\nhand-drawn retro line art        손맛 — 흔들리는 윤곽 · 펜압 보임 · 직선 없음\nsparkle / star accents           빈 공간에 반짝이 (★물체에 닿지 않게)\ncream off-white fill             면은 크림색 · 그라데이션 없음 · 음영 2단\nwhite sticker border outline     ★실루엣을 «일정 간격»으로 두르는 흰 테두리\n```\n\n★**흰 테두리가 이 스타일의 정체다.** \"sticker\"라고만 쓰면 그냥 일러스트가 나온다.\n*실루엣을 일정 간격으로 따라가는 두꺼운 흰 띠 + 그 아래 그림자*까지 적어야 «잘라낸 스티커»가 된다.\n\n★글자는 **총량 0으로 못박았다**(런북 §⑥-보강) — 원문 스타일에 \"vintage cafe branding\"이 있어\n그대로 두면 모델이 카페 이름을 지어내 새긴다.",
