      "title": "★★한 얼굴을 세로 중앙에서 정확히 갈라 좌우에 «다른 정체성»을 입힌다 — 눈·코·입·턱선은 정렬을 유지하고 조명·재질·메이크업·배경만 갈라져야 한다",
      "prompt": "Prompt:\n\nMagazine title: [NAME]\nConcept title: [TITLE]\nLeft identity: [LEFT THEME]\nRight identity: [RIGHT THEME]\nLeft palette: [LEFT COLORS]\nRight palette: [RIGHT COLORS]\nLeft styling: [COUTURE + JEWELRY]\nRight styling: [COUTURE + JEWELRY]\nTagline: [SHORT LINE]\n\nCreate a 9:16 luxury fashion magazine cover featuring one elegant adult woman in a frontal editorial portrait.\n\nSplit the portrait precisely down the vertical center. Both halves must remain the same person, with perfectly aligned eyes, nose, lips, jawline, neck, and shoulders.\n\nThe left side represents [LEFT THEME], styled with [LEFT COUTURE + JEWELRY] in [LEFT COLORS]. The right side represents [RIGHT THEME], styled with [RIGHT COUTURE + JEWELRY] in [RIGHT COLORS].\n\nUse distinct lighting, materials, makeup, hairstyle, and background atmosphere on each side, while preserving one coherent face and body. Emphasize couture fabrics, refined gemstone details, realistic skin texture, natural hair strands, elegant posture, and premium editorial lighting.\n\nAdd the magazine title “[NAME]” at the top, the concept title “[TITLE]” across the middle, and the tagline “[SHORT LINE]” near the bottom.\n\nArtistic, elegant, colorful, sophisticated, high-fashion editorial photography, luxury jewelry campaign, clean composition, controlled typography, subtle cinematic depth.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 9:16 luxury fashion magazine cover showing one elegant adult woman in a frontal editorial portrait, framed from the chest up, looking straight into the lens. The portrait is divided precisely down the vertical centre line of her face. Both halves are unmistakably the same person: the eyes sit at the same height, the two halves of the nose meet exactly, the lips join without a step, and the jawline and shoulders continue across the seam. Everything else changes at that line. The left half is a winter identity — cool blue-white light from the left, frost-pale skin finish, silver-grey sequinned couture with a high sharp shoulder, long faceted crystal drop earring, hair pulled back sleek and wet-looking, and a deep slate-blue background. The right half is a desert identity — warm amber light from the right, sun-warmed skin, terracotta silk draped soft over the shoulder, a hammered gold collar and gold cuff earring, hair loose and dry with visible individual strands, and a burnt-sienna background. Couture fabric texture, realistic skin with natural pores, elegant upright posture, premium editorial lighting on both sides at equal strength so neither half wins. Three lines of type only, all uppercase, all sitting in clean empty areas and never crossing her face or jewellery: NOCTIS across the very top in a thin wide serif; FROST AND EMBER centred in the empty band across her upper chest; ONE FACE TWO SEASONS in small letters near the bottom edge. Those three lines are the only text in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**이 프롬프트의 핵심은 「무엇을 가르고 무엇을 유지할지」를 나눠 적은 것이다.**\n\n```\n유지    눈 높이 · 코의 두 반쪽이 «정확히 만난다» · 입술이 «단차 없이» 이어진다 ·\n        턱선과 어깨가 «이음선을 가로질러» 계속된다      ← 같은 사람으로 읽히게 하는 조건\n가른다  조명 방향 · 피부 마감 · 의상 재질 · 주얼리 · 헤어 · 배경색\n```\n★**얼굴을 반으로 나누라**고만 쓰면 두 사람이 나온다. 위 네 줄(눈높이·코·입술·턱선)이\n**정렬 계약**이고, 이게 있어야 «한 사람의 두 정체성»이 된다.\n\n★**좌우 조명을 «같은 세기»로** 못박은 것도 중요하다 — 안 그러면 한쪽이 이기면서\n그냥 «반쪽만 조명받은 인물»로 무너진다.\n\n★타이포는 런북 §⑤-확정 네 조건을 다 걸었다 — 전부 대문자 · 놓일 자리를 문장으로 지정\n(*맨 위 / 가슴 위 빈 띠 / 아래 가장자리*) · 얼굴·주얼리와 «겹치지 않게» · **\"이 세 줄이 전부\"**.\n원문의 `[NAME]`·`[TITLE]`·`[SHORT LINE]` 슬롯을 비워두면 프롬프트 본문에서 아무 구절이나\n주워 채운다(§⑥-보강 실측) → 실제 문구로 채웠다.",
      "ref_image": "results/mrlarus-one-face-split-into-two-identities-ref.jpg",
