      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 on ChatGPT \n\nPrompt:\nTransform this photo into a clean, hand-drawn editorial illustration with a modern urban lifestyle aesthetic. Preserve the exact composition, pose, clothing, headphones around the neck, smartphone, motorcycle, yellow e-scooters, glass fence, and apartment buildings in the background. Use bold black outlines, simplified geometric shapes, minimal facial details, soft beige and cream tones, muted brick red, slate blue, charcoal black, and warm yellow accents. Apply a textured paper/grain finish with subtle ink scratches and brush imperfections. Flatten the lighting with gentle shadows, giving it a cozy Scandinavian-inspired illustrated poster look. Maintain a calm, everyday city atmosphere while keeping the proportions accurate and the character recognizable from the original photo. High-quality digital illustration, flat colors, vector-inspired, minimalistic, artistic, clean linework, textured print aesthetic, 4:5 aspect ratio.\n\nNegative prompt (optional):\n\nPhotorealistic, 3D render, anime, watercolor, oil painting, excessive detail, hyper-realistic skin, blurry, distorted anatomy, extra limbs, messy lines, noisy background, oversaturated colors, text, logo, watermark, low quality.",
      "gen_prompt": "A hand-drawn editorial illustration of a young man standing beside a motorcycle on a city street, drawn in a modern urban lifestyle style. Everything from the original scene is kept in place and named: his relaxed standing pose with weight on one leg, the over-ear headphones resting around his neck, the smartphone held in his right hand, the motorcycle angled beside him, two yellow e-scooters parked behind, a glass balustrade fence running across the middle ground, and apartment buildings rising in the background. It is drawn with bold black outlines of even weight and simplified geometric shapes; facial features are reduced to a few marks with no shading on the skin. The palette is soft beige and cream, muted brick red, slate blue, charcoal black and warm yellow, laid down flat. Lighting is flattened into a few gentle shadow shapes rather than gradients. A textured paper grain runs over the whole image with subtle ink scratches and small brush imperfections at the edges of the shapes. Cosy Scandinavian illustrated poster feel, calm everyday city atmosphere, accurate proportions, clean linework, vector-inspired and minimal, 4:5 aspect ratio. No text, no lettering, no logo and no watermark anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**변환 프롬프트의 요령 — 스타일보다 «남길 목록»이 먼저다.**\n\n원문이 잘 하고 있는 것: *\"Preserve the exact composition, pose, clothing, **headphones around the\nneck, smartphone, motorcycle, yellow e-scooters, glass fence, apartment buildings**\"* —\n**있는 것을 하나씩 이름으로 부른다.** \"원본을 유지하라\"고만 쓰면 무엇이 원본인지 모델이 모른다.\n\n```\n안 통함   \"preserve the original\"  ·  \"keep it recognizable\"\n★통함     남길 것을 «명사로 열거» — 목에 걸린 헤드폰 · 오른손의 스마트폰 · 노란 전동스쿠터 둘 ·\n          유리 난간 · 뒤편 아파트                    ← 이게 곧 구도 지시가 된다\n```\n\n★**평면화 지시도 세 갈래로 쪼개져 있다** — ①굵고 «균일한» 검정 외곽선 ②얼굴은 «몇 개의 표시»로\n축약, 피부에 음영 없음 ③조명을 «그라데이션이 아니라 몇 개의 부드러운 그림자 «모양»»으로.\n런북 §부정 규칙과 맞물린다 — «음영을 없애라»가 아니라 «무엇으로 대체할지»를 적었다.\n\n★종이 그레인·잉크 긁힘·붓 결함은 «인쇄물»로 앉히는 마감. 이게 없으면 클립아트가 된다.\n\n⚠️원본 사진을 입력으로 받는 img2img 프롬프트다. 텍스트 단독 재현이라 인물은 우리가 정했다 —\n**변환 문법 자체가 이 항목의 값어치**이므로 대상은 바뀌어도 된다.",
