      "title": "★★★원문이 품질 기준으로 부른 브랜드 셋(ESPN×Nike×NBA)을 지우고 그 자리를 «조형»으로 채운다 — 페인트 폴리곤 얼굴 · 세로 거대 성씨 · 팀 색 물감 폭발 · 크림 배경",
      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 \n\nPrompt:\nSuperstar in a mid-air action pose performing a dunk, jumpshot, or intense celebration. Cinematic sports illustration style with highly detailed muscular anatomy, dramatic motion, realistic face featuring painterly polygon brush texture, explosive paint splashes behind the character matching the team's colors, bold typography with the player name in huge vertical letters, motivational quote text layout, sports stats and achievements infographic, clean minimal cream background, modern editorial composition.\n\nStreetwear-inspired sports poster aesthetic, premium ESPN × Nike × NBA campaign vibe, aggressive lighting, ultra-detailed jersey fabric, realistic sneakers, dynamic perspective, motion blur energy, bold graphic elements, grunge paint streaks, ink splatter effects, layered typography design, signature section, logo-inspired icons, collectible magazine cover feel, heroic sports energy, poster-ready composition, contemporary digital painting blended with graphic design.\n\nColor palette based on team colors (purple/gold for Lakers, green/black for Celtics, blue/white for Mavericks, purple/red for Raptors), sharp contrast, dramatic shadows, energetic composition, luxury sports branding aesthetic, high-detail sports portrait illustration, trending Behance poster design, modern athletic artwork, ultra-realistic, 8K, masterpiece.\n\nStyle Keywords: Sports editorial poster, NBA legend artwork, athletic graphic design, dynamic basketball illustration, paint splash poster aesthetic, modern sports branding, cinematic athlete portrait, typography-heavy composition, Nike campaign vibe, collectible sports print, gritty digital painting, heroic basketball poster.",
      "gen_prompt": "A cinematic sports poster of a basketball player caught mid-air at the top of a dunk, seen from a low dynamic angle, on a clean minimal cream background. The anatomy is highly detailed and muscular with the jersey fabric stretched and rippling and the sneakers rendered with real sole geometry. His face is painted rather than photographed: it is built from angular polygon facets of brushed paint, each facet a slightly different value, so the likeness reads clearly from a distance but dissolves into brushwork up close. Behind him, explosive splashes of purple and gold paint burst outward from the point of takeoff, mixed with grunge streaks and ink spatter, all of it behind the figure and never in front of his body. Down the right edge of the poster, the surname HAYES is set in huge condensed capitals running vertically from top to bottom, dark against the cream, partly hidden behind his trailing arm. In the lower left, four small stat blocks sit in a neat row, each one a single number above a single word: 34 POINTS, 12 BOARDS, 9 ASSISTS, 41 MINUTES. HAYES and those four pairs are the only text in the image. The jersey, shorts and shoes carry no logos, no swooshes, no stripes and no maker's marks of any kind — the jersey front is plain with only a number 8, and the shoes have a smooth unmarked side panel with a single thin horizontal line along the midsole.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★★**원문에 브랜드가 「품질 기준」으로 세 개나 박혀 있다 — 런북 §브랜드의 정확한 재발 조건.**\n\n```\n원문   \"premium ESPN × Nike × NBA campaign vibe\"\n```\n2026-08-05 `zephyraleigh` 건에서 **`Nike-level advertising`이라고만 썼는데 신발에 스우시가 그려졌다.**\n제품명을 지목하지 않아도, «어떤 수준으로»를 말하는 표현이 조형을 불러온다. 여기는 셋이다 —\nESPN(스포츠 방송 그래픽) · Nike(신발·저지 조형) · NBA(팀 로고·유니폼).\n\n★**해법은 지우는 게 아니라 자리를 채우는 것**이다(§부정 규칙):\n```\n지운 것              채운 것\nESPN vibe        →   크림 무지 배경 · 좌하단 «숫자 위에 단어 하나»짜리 스탯 블록 넷\nNike             →   ★\"측면 그래픽 없음 · 미드솔에 가는 수평선 한 줄 · 매끈한 무지 사이드 패널\"\nNBA 팀           →   퍼플·골드 «색만» 차용(일반 색명은 안전) · 저지 전면은 «숫자 8만»\n```\n\n★**얼굴을 「페인트 폴리곤」으로 만든 것**이 이 스타일의 본체다 — *\"각 면이 조금씩 다른 명도의\n붓칠 다각면이라, 멀리서는 인물로 읽히고 가까이서는 붓질로 흩어진다.\"* 사진 얼굴에 효과를 얹는 게\n아니라 **처음부터 칠해진 얼굴**로 지시해야 한다.\n\n★타이포는 §⑤-확정 네 조건 + §⑦-정정 — 거대 성씨를 **팔에 일부 가리게** 두었다.\n불투명한 팔이 글자를 가리는 건 안전하다(diplomeme `ENERGY` 실측).",
      "ref_image": "results/goodmanprotocol-brand-vibe-replaced-by-named-shapes-ref.jpg",
