      "title": "★레시피 포스터를 «층으로 쌓는다» — 히어로 사진 · 아이콘 재료판 · 번호 단계 · 원형 배지 효능 · 팁 박스. ⚠️작은 글자 총량이 §⑤ 한계를 넘는 건이라 붕괴를 예상하고 담는다",
      "prompt": "Brewed with warmth, served with soul 🤎\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a premium vertical digital infographic poster for a [Recipe Name] using a warm, rustic color palette with earthy beige, soft browns, terracotta, and subtle botanical accents. Feature a bold, elegant title combining script and modern sans-serif fonts, a short tagline, and a brief introduction describing the dish or drink. Include a high-quality, photorealistic hero image with realistic ingredients arranged around it. Design a clean ingredients panel with icons, an authenticity or quality badge, and a visually engaging numbered step-by-step preparation guide using illustrated process scenes. At the bottom, add a benefits section with circular icon badges highlighting key advantages, a secondary hero image surrounded by fresh ingredients, and a stylish tip box for serving or preparation advice. Use a balanced editorial layout, premium food magazine aesthetics, soft shadows, subtle textures, clean spacing, ultra-detailed food photography, and high-resolution print-quality design.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium vertical infographic poster for spiced honey chai, laid out as a stack of clearly separated horizontal bands on a warm rustic ground of earthy beige with soft botanical accents in the margins. At the top, a title in an elegant script sits above a modern sans serif line, reading SPICED HONEY CHAI over the smaller line SLOW BREWED AT HOME. Below it, a large photoreal hero shot of a glass cup of chai with milk swirling into it, ringed by real cardamom pods, cinnamon sticks, star anise and a honey dipper arranged on the surface around it. Under that, an ingredients panel where six small line icons sit in two rows, each icon with one short word beside it: TEA, MILK, HONEY, CARDAMOM, CINNAMON, GINGER. Below that, a numbered preparation strip of four small illustrated scenes in a row, each with a large numeral above it — 1, 2, 3, 4 — and no other words. Near the bottom, three circular badges in a row, each holding one line icon and one word beneath: WARMTH, CALM, ENERGY. Finally a small tip box in the lower right corner containing a single short line reading SERVE HOT. Balanced editorial layout, generous spacing, soft shadows, subtle paper texture, premium food magazine aesthetic. Every piece of text listed above is in capitals and nothing else is written anywhere in the poster.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**레시피 인포그래픽의 구조 — 「층」이 정보 종류를 가른다.**\n\n```\n① 제목       스크립트체 + 산세리프 한 줄\n② 히어로     실사 음료 + «둘러싼 실제 재료»\n③ 재료판     ★아이콘 + 단어 «하나»씩\n④ 단계       ★번호만 크게, 설명 없이 그림 넷\n⑤ 효능 배지  원형 + 단어 하나\n⑥ 팁 박스    한 줄\n```\n\n⚠️★**이 건은 실패를 예상하고 담았다.** 런북 §⑤(작은 라벨은 무너진다)와 §⑤-확정(살아남는 네 조건)에\n비추면 **작은 글자 조각이 14개**로, 배치1 #8 색상보드(라벨 5개 중 2개 붕괴)보다 훨씬 많다.\n그래서 **각 조각을 §⑤-확정 조건에 최대한 맞췄다** — 전부 대문자 · 한 단어 · 놓일 자리를 문장으로 지정 ·\n총량 못박기. 원문에 있던 «소개 문단 · 단계별 설명문 · 인증 배지 문구»는 뺐다(문장은 반드시 뭉개진다).\n\n★**단계 표시를 「번호만」으로 줄인 것**이 이 재현의 핵심 실험이다. 런북 §⑦-정정에 따르면\n«짧고 흔한 문자열»(숫자)은 살고 조합어는 깨진다 — 1·2·3·4는 가장 안전한 문자열이다.\n설명이 꼭 필요하면 코드로 얹어야 한다(§⑤).",
      "ref_image": "results/noorwithwifi-recipe-poster-as-a-layered-information-stack-ref.jpg",
