      "title": "★식품 광고 슬롯 템플릿 — 브랜딩·헤드라인은 위, 히어로는 중하단, «재료와 공정 패널»은 맨 아래. 35~45° 부감으로 층이 보이게 찍는다",
      "prompt": "Prompt:\n\nCreate a 9:16 premium food advertising poster for a French pâtisserie brand.\n\nBrand: [BRAND NAME]\nDessert: [DESSERT NAME]\nHeadline: [MAIN TITLE]\nTagline: [3 SHORT ADJECTIVES]\nDescription: [ONE-SENTENCE PRODUCT DESCRIPTION]\nIngredients: [4 KEY INGREDIENTS]\nCraft details: [3 SHORT SELLING POINTS]\nBrand line: [SHORT BRAND SLOGAN]\nPalette: [MAIN COLORS]\nProps: [2–3 RELEVANT PROPS]\n\nUse a refined editorial layout with the branding and headline in the upper section, one hero dessert in the lower-middle section, and a small ingredient and craftsmanship panel near the bottom.\n\nPhotograph the dessert from a slightly elevated 35–45° angle. Keep the product realistic, appetizing, clearly structured, and visually dominant. Use natural side light, soft botanical or window shadows, warm textured plaster walls, stone or ceramic surfaces, and restrained styling.\n\nCombine elegant serif typography, a small handwritten accent, and clean sans-serif supporting text. Maintain generous negative space, clear hierarchy, accurate readable text, and a cohesive premium restaurant-brand aesthetic.\n\nUse one dominant product, 2–3 supporting props, low-saturation colors, realistic food textures, subtle film grain, natural depth of field, and polished commercial food photography.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 9:16 premium food advertising poster for a French pâtisserie. The upper section carries the branding: the name MAISON VERLINE in an elegant letter-spaced serif, with the headline PISTACHIO ROSE beneath it in larger type, and under that three short adjectives on one line reading DELICATE FLORAL LAYERED. In the lower middle sits the hero: a single round pistachio and rose entremet photographed from a slightly elevated angle of about forty degrees, so the top glaze and the side layers are both visible — a glossy pale green mirror glaze, a ring of piped rose cream around the rim, crushed pistachios along one edge, and a clean cross-section band showing the mousse and biscuit layers. It sits on a pale ceramic plate on a stone surface, with a warm textured plaster wall behind, natural side light from the left throwing soft botanical leaf shadows across the wall, a linen cloth and a small brass spoon placed nearby. Near the bottom, a slim panel divided into two rows: the upper row lists four ingredients in small capitals — PISTACHIO, ROSE, ALMOND, CREAM — and the lower row three craft points in the same size — 72 HOUR REST, HAND PIPED, SMALL BATCH. A single line sits at the very bottom edge reading PARIS SINCE 1994. Warm ivory and soft green palette, restrained styling, appetising and expensive. Every word listed here is the only text in the poster.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**식품 광고 슬롯 템플릿 — 슬롯 열 개가 곧 브리프 양식이다.**\n\n```\n[BRAND NAME] [DESSERT NAME] [MAIN TITLE] [3 SHORT ADJECTIVES] [ONE-SENTENCE DESCRIPTION]\n[4 KEY INGREDIENTS] [3 SHORT SELLING POINTS] [SHORT BRAND SLOGAN] [MAIN COLORS] [2–3 PROPS]\n```\n★**슬롯이 「무엇을 정해야 하는지」의 목록**이라는 게 이런 템플릿의 값어치다. 채우기만 하면\n빠진 정보가 없다. 런북 §분량의 첫 칸(슬롯형 완결 프롬프트)에 해당한다.\n\n★**촬영 각도를 35~45°로 못박은 이유**가 명확하다 — 정면은 층이 안 보이고 부감은 옆면이 사라진다.\n이 각도라야 **윗면 글레이즈와 옆면 층이 동시에** 보인다. gen_prompt에 «단면 띠로 무스와 비스킷\n층이 보인다»까지 적어 강제했다.\n\n★배경은 «자연 측광 + 식물 그림자 + 따뜻한 미장 벽 + 석재/도자 표면»으로 고정 — 소품을 늘리지\n않고 «빛과 재질»로 고급감을 만든다.\n\n⚠️§⑤-확정대로 작은 글자는 전부 **대문자 · 한두 단어 · 자리 지정 · 총량 못박기**로 처리했다.\n원문의 `[ONE-SENTENCE PRODUCT DESCRIPTION]`(문장)은 뺐다 — 문장은 §⑤에서 반드시 뭉개진다.",
      "ref_image": "results/mrlarus-patisserie-poster-slot-with-craft-panel-ref.jpg",
      "result": "results/mrlarus-patisserie-poster-slot-with-craft-panel.webp",
      "seed": 333888681,
      "private": false
