      "id": "goodmanprotocol-no-base-means-background-shows-underneath",
      "source": "https://x.com/Goodmanprotocol/status/2084926339740766229",
      "author": "Goodmanprotocol",
      "date": "2026-08-06",
      "lang": "en",
      "target_model": "GPT Image 2",
      "category": "브랜딩",
      "title": "★★「받침대를 두지 마라」를 여덟 번 써도 받침이 생긴다 — 자리를 «배경이 로고 아래에서 그대로 보인다»로 채워야 마크가 진짜로 뜬다",
      "prompt": "GPT Image 2 \n\nPrompt:\nUNIVERSAL LOGO IDENTITY MASTER PROMPT \n\nUse the uploaded logo EXACTLY as provided. Do NOT redesign, redraw, recolor, crop, distort, recreate, or modify it in any way.\n\nASPECT RATIO: 5:7 Vertical\n\nLOGO PRESENTATION\n\nRemove any supporting surface completely.\n\nThere must be:\n• No podium\n• No pedestal\n• No platform\n• No stage\n• No table\n• No floor stand\n• No display block\n• No base of any kind\n\nThe logo must float naturally in mid-air as the single hero object with elegant cinematic depth.\n\nBACKGROUND\n\nCreate a premium Apple-style luxury environment using the brand colors extracted from the uploaded logo.\n\nInclude:\n\n• Soft brand-color to light grey gradient\n• Warm ivory highlights\n• Soft charcoal transitions\n• Golden hour lighting\n• Volumetric light rays\n• Atmospheric haze\n• HDR reflections\n• Cinematic glow\n• Soft bloom\n• Refined vignette\n• Elegant depth\n• Apple keynote minimalism\n\nThe environment should feel clean, premium, bright, and sophisticated without becoming too dark.\n\nLOGO HERO\n\nPlace the uploaded logo perfectly centered.\n\nThe logo should float naturally with:\n\n• Soft rim lighting\n• Elegant glow\n• Glass reflections\n• Premium shadows\n• Cinematic depth\n• Balanced composition\n• No supporting surface underneath\n\nThe uploaded logo remains completely untouched and is the unmistakable focal point.\n\nFLOATING BRAND ELEMENTS\n\nAutomatically identify the brand's industry from the uploaded logo and generate premium floating elements that naturally represent that category.\n\nExamples include products, tools, materials, interface elements, symbols, packaging, abstract forms, or signature objects relevant to the brand.\n\nArrange them naturally around the logo with generous spacing.\n\nKeep the composition elegant, balanced, and uncluttered.\n\nMATERIALS\n\n• Crystal Glass\n• Frosted Glass\n• Brushed Aluminium\n• Matte Metal\n• Chrome\n• Premium Acrylic\n• Ceramic\n• Transparent Glass\n• Luxury Polished Surfaces\n\nLIGHTING\n\n• Hollywood Commercial Lighting\n• Warm Key Light\n• Golden Hour Ambient Light\n• Luxury Rim Lighting\n• Soft Bounce Lighting\n• HDR Reflections\n• Ray Tracing\n• Global Illumination\n• Natural Highlights\n• Photorealistic Shadows\n\nCOLOR PALETTE\n\nExtract the complete color palette directly from the uploaded logo.\n\nExtend it naturally into:\n\n• Premium gradients\n• Ambient glow\n• Reflections\n• Floating particles\n• Soft highlights\n\nMaintain perfect brand consistency throughout the composition.\n\nCOMPOSITION\n\n• Swiss Grid\n• Golden Ratio\n• Apple-level Negative Space\n• Editorial Layout\n• Balanced Visual Hierarchy\n• Luxury Presentation\n• Minimal Yet Visually Rich\n\nTYPOGRAPHY PANEL\n\nCreate a refined Swiss editorial information panel featuring:\n\n• Brand Name\n• Industry\n• Brand Personality\n• Brand Values\n• Primary Colors (HEX)\n• Typography Style\n• Target Audience\n• Brand Positioning\n• Brand Keywords\n• Visual Language\n\nUse clean white typography with premium spacing and alignment.\n\nCAMERA\n\n• 50mm Hero Lens\n• Eye-Level Perspective\n• Luxury Product Photography\n• Shallow Depth of Field\n• Ultra-Sharp Focus\n\nQUALITY\n\n• Apple Keynote\n• Pentagram\n• Landor\n• Luxury FMCG\n• Hollywood Commercial\n• IMAX\n• Octane Render\n• Unreal Engine 5\n• Redshift\n• V-Ray\n• HDR\n• Ray Tracing\n• Global Illumination\n• 8K Ultra HD\n• Hyper-Realistic\n• Behance Featured\n• Red Dot Award\n• Awwwards\n• Cannes Lions\n\nFINAL OUTPUT\n\nCreate a museum-quality luxury brand identity poster where:\n\n• The uploaded logo remains completely untouched.\n• The logo floats naturally in mid-air.\n• No podium, pedestal, platform, stage, table, display block, or base appears anywhere.\n• Premium floating elements intelligently reflect the brand's industry.\n• The background is clean, cinematic, luxurious, and Apple-inspired.\n• The composition is minimal, elegant, balanced, and award-winning.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium brand key visual, vertical. A single original three-dimensional logo mark hangs in mid-air at the exact centre of the frame — two interlocking rounded chevrons forming a stylised leaf, one in polished deep teal and one in brushed champagne gold, rendered in thick glass-like material with soft rim light along the upper edges and a gentle internal glow. The background continues without interruption directly beneath the mark: the gradient, the haze and the light rays all pass through the space under it and are visible right where a base would sit, and the mark's own soft shadow falls far below and behind it onto nothing solid. There is no podium, no pedestal, no plinth, no platform, no table, no floor line and no horizon anywhere in the picture. Around the mark, arranged with generous spacing and never crowding it, float six smaller objects belonging to a skincare brand: a frosted glass dropper bottle, a ceramic jar, a folded leaf, a droplet of serum caught mid-air, a small brushed aluminium cap and a shard of clear crystal glass. Environment of soft teal-to-light-grey gradient with warm ivory highlights and charcoal transitions, golden hour light, volumetric rays, atmospheric haze, HDR reflections and delicate bloom. Swiss grid balance with generous negative space, refined vignette. No text, no lettering and no wordmark anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**런북 §「대지 마라」 규칙의 세 번째 재발 — 이번엔 원문이 여덟 번이나 열거한다.**\n\n```\n원문   • No podium • No pedestal • No platform • No stage • No table\n        • No floor stand • No display block • No base of any kind\n```\n2026-08-05 `amirmushich v_05`에서 *\"받침판을 대지 말 것\"*을 그대로 옮겼다가 **트레이가 생겼다.**\n런북의 결론은 하나다 — **없어야 할 것을 지우려면 «그 자리를 무엇이 채우는지»를 적는다.**\n\n```\n안 통함   받침 8종을 열거하며 «두지 마라»\n★통함     \"★배경이 마크 «바로 아래에서 끊기지 않고 이어진다» — 그라데이션·안개·광선이\n           «받침이 놓일 자리를 그대로 통과해 보인다» · 마크의 그림자는 «훨씬 아래 뒤쪽»에\n           «아무 단단한 것도 없는 곳»에 떨어진다\"\n```\n★그림자의 «착지점»을 지정한 것이 요령이다. 부양은 그림자가 결정한다 — 바로 아래에 그림자를 두면\n뇌가 바닥을 만들어 낸다.\n\n★**두 번째 논지는 「업종을 유추해 부유 요소를 만든다」**이다. 원문은 *업로드한 로고에서 업종을\n자동 판별해 그 카테고리의 프리미엄 오브젝트를 띄우라*고 한다 — 재현에서는 스킨케어로 정하고\n여섯 개(드로퍼 병·세라믹 자·잎·세럼 방울·알루미늄 캡·크리스털 조각)를 배치했다.\n\n⚠️원문 `Apple-style`·`Apple keynote minimalism`은 뺐다(§브랜드). 대신 그 자리를 «스위스 그리드\n균형 · 넉넉한 여백 · 절제된 비네트»라는 조형 서술로 채웠다.",
      "ref_image": "results/goodmanprotocol-no-base-means-background-shows-underneath-ref.jpg",
      "result": "results/goodmanprotocol-no-base-means-background-shows-underneath.webp",
      "seed": 1467840222,
      "private": false
