      "prompt": "Made with GPT IMAGE 2\nPrompt:\n\nA stylish woman with a short, textured afro strides confidently in profile, wearing a structured trench coat adorned with large black polka dots over a vibrant orange jumpsuit. The composition integrates high-fashion photography with aggressive graphic design elements, featuring a split-toned teal and saturated orange background overlaid with distressed typographic textures, halftone patterns, and chaotic painterly splatters. Direct studio lighting illuminates her face with sharp highlights, creating high-contrast modeling that emphasizes her angular features. The background remains flat and non-representational, acting as a dynamic canvas for the layered mixed-media aesthetic, where sharp edges of the garment contrast against the energetic, abstracted brushstrokes and geometric shapes that surround the subject in a balanced, vertical orientation.\n\n* **Style:** Mixed-media fashion illustration, high-contrast digital collage\n* **Key elements:** Polka-dot trench coat, orange jumpsuit, typographic patterns, halftone splatters, editorial model\n* **Lighting:** Studio hard lighting, directional, high-key warm and cool balance\n* **Camera:** Full-body side profile, 85mm lens, eye-level perspective",
      "gen_prompt": "A stylish woman with a short textured afro strides confidently in strict profile across the frame, wearing a structured trench coat covered in large black polka dots over a vibrant orange jumpsuit. The photograph of her is sharp and dimensional — direct studio light rakes across her face leaving hard highlights on the cheekbone and brow and deep shadow beneath the jaw, and the coat's fabric has real weight and fold. Everything behind her is the opposite: the background is entirely flat and non-representational, split vertically into a deep teal field on the left and a saturated orange field on the right with a hard edge between them, and it never suggests a place. Over that flat field lie aggressive graphic layers — distressed typographic texture in which letterforms are broken and illegible, coarse halftone dot patterns at two different scales, and chaotic painterly splatters thrown diagonally. These layers pass behind her and also across the hem of her coat, so photograph and graphics interlock rather than sit in front of one another. The tension between the two is the picture: she stays three-dimensional while everything around her stays flat. High contrast, print-poster grain. None of the typographic texture forms a readable word, and there is no legible text in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**사진 + 그래픽 합성이 「스티커 붙인 것」으로 안 보이게 하는 규칙.**\n\n```\n인물   ★끝까지 «입체»로 — 직광이 광대뼈와 눈썹뼈에 «단단한 하이라이트», 턱 밑에 «깊은 그림자»\n배경   ★끝까지 «평면·비구상»으로 — 장소를 «암시하지 않는다» · 청록/주황 두 색면을 «딱딱한 경계»로 분할\n층     낡은 타이포 질감 · «두 가지 크기»의 하프톤 점 · 대각선 물감 튀김\n        ★이 층들이 인물 «뒤»로도 지나고 «코트 자락 위»로도 지난다 → 맞물린다\n```\n★**원문이 배경을 *\"flat and non-representational, acting as a dynamic canvas\"*라고 정의한 게 핵심이다.**\n배경에 조금이라도 장소감이 생기면 그래픽 층이 «위에 얹힌 것»이 되고, 완전히 평면이어야\n사진과 그래픽이 «같은 판 위에서 싸운다».\n\n★**타이포 질감은 「읽히지 않아야 정상」**으로 못박았다. 런북 §⑤·§⑥-보강대로 배경 가득한 작은\n글자는 반드시 뭉개지는데, 이 스타일은 **뭉개진 글자가 곧 재료**라 실패가 설계에 포함된다.\n\"낡은 타이포 텍스처\"를 쓸 때는 이렇게 «읽히지 않음»을 명시해야 모델이 문구를 지어내지 않는다.",
