      "title": "★얼굴 고정을 「닮게 해줘」가 아니라 «부위별 체크리스트»로 적는다 — 얼굴형·턱선·눈매·눈썹 구조·코·입술·피부톤·수염·헤어라인·귀·비율·표정 열두 칸",
      "prompt": "Catch if if you can \n\nGemini nano banana pro \nPrompt:\n{\n  \"generation_directive\": {\n    \"identity_source\": {\n      \"instruction\": \"The uploaded reference photograph is the sole and definitive source for the subject's identity\",\n      \"requirements\": [\n        \"Preserve facial identity with maximum precision\",\n        \"Maintain exact face shape and jawline\",\n        \"Replicate eye shape and eyebrow structure precisely\",\n        \"Match nose, lips, and skin tone exactly\",\n        \"Preserve beard/mustache if present in reference\",\n        \"Retain original hairstyle, texture, and hairline\",\n        \"Keep ears and natural facial proportions unchanged\",\n        \"Match original expression\"\n      ],\n      \"restriction\": \"No redesigning, beautifying, stylizing, or altering the person's appearance in any way\"\n    },\n    \"pose_and_composition\": {\n      \"instruction\": \"Duplicate the composition from the reference photo with maximum fidelity\",\n      \"match_parameters\": [\n        \"head tilt\",\n        \"neck angle\",\n        \"shoulder positioning\",\n        \"body orientation\",\n        \"arm placement\",\n        \"wrist rotation\",\n        \"finger positioning\",\n        \"hand placement\",\n        \"hip alignment\",\n        \"leg stance\",\n        \"foot placement\",\n        \"weight distribution\",\n        \"overall posture\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"camera_setup\": {\n      \"angle\": \"elevated, downward-looking shot\",\n      \"height\": \"identical to reference\",\n      \"focal_length\": \"approximately 35-50mm equivalent\",\n      \"subject_distance\": \"identical to reference\",\n      \"crop\": \"identical to reference\",\n      \"vertical_composition\": \"identical to reference\",\n      \"perspective_distortion\": \"matched to reference\"\n    },\n    \"wardrobe\": {\n      \"instruction\": \"Outfit must match the reference exactly\",\n      \"items\": [\n        \"fitted red-and-blue Spider-Man compression suit with classic spider emblem on chest\",\n        \"light grey oversized jogger sweatpants\",\n        \"clean white sneakers\",\n        \"black backpack worn on both shoulders\",\n        \"Spider-Man mask held naturally in the left hand\"\n      ],\n      \"detail_matching\": \"Every clothing detail, color, fit, wrinkle, fold, logo, proportion, and texture must closely mirror the reference\"\n    },\n    \"setting\": {\n      \"location\": \"contemporary indoor building lobby\",\n      \"flooring\": \"polished grey marble\",\n      \"lighting_quality\": \"soft, neutral\",\n      \"reflections\": \"realistic on floor surface\",\n      \"background\": \"minimal distractions\",\n      \"depth_of_field\": \"shallow\"\n    },\n    \"lighting\": {\n      \"type\": \"soft, natural indoor lighting\",\n      \"skin_rendering\": \"realistic tones\",\n      \"exposure\": \"balanced\",\n      \"dynamic_range\": \"cinematic HDR\",\n      \"shadows\": \"natural, no harsh contrast\"\n    },\n    \"rendering_style\": {\n      \"type\": \"ultra-realistic DSLR photography, editorial portrait style\",\n      \"resolution\": \"8K\",\n      \"detail_level\": \"extremely detailed skin texture, realistic hair strands\",\n      \"anatomy\": \"accurate\",\n      \"lighting_physics\": \"physically correct\",\n      \"color\": \"premium grading\",\n      \"focus\": \"sharp\",\n      \"quality\": \"photorealistic, free of AI artifacts\"\n    },\n    \"priority_hierarchy\": [\n      \"Exact facial identity from uploaded reference\",\n      \"Exact pose replication\",\n      \"Exact camera angle and framing\",\n      \"Exact outfit recreation\",\n      \"Maximum overall realism\"\n    ],\n    \"negative_prompt\": {\n      \"exclude\": [\n        \"different face\",\n        \"altered hairstyle\",\n        \"different expression\",\n        \"different body proportions\",\n        \"different pose\",\n        \"different hand position\",\n        \"different camera angle\",\n        \"different perspective\",\n        \"different crop\",\n        \"different clothing\",\n        \"different backpack\",\n        \"different shoes\",\n        \"missing Spider-Man mask\",\n        \"extra accessories\",\n        \"unrealistic anatomy\",\n        \"oversmoothed skin\",\n        \"cartoon style\",",
      "gen_prompt": "A cinematic editorial portrait of a man in his thirties, framed from the chest up, turning to look back over his left shoulder toward the camera. His identity is defined part by part and held consistent: an oval face with a defined square jawline, almond-shaped dark brown eyes set slightly deep with straight thick eyebrows carrying a small gap at the centre, a straight nose with a narrow bridge and a rounded tip, medium lips with a defined cupid's bow, warm medium-brown skin with visible pores and a small mole below the right eye, a short trimmed full beard connecting to the moustache, black hair cut short at the sides and slightly longer on top with a straight natural hairline, ears set close to the head, and a neutral expression with the mouth closed and the eyes steady. He wears a charcoal wool overcoat with the collar turned up over a black crew neck. He stands on a wet city street at dusk with the background thrown far out of focus into soft round highlights of amber and cool blue. A hard rim light from behind his right shoulder separates him from the dark, and a soft fill from the front left keeps the eyes readable. Shallow depth of field, fine film grain, muted cool grade with warm skin. No text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「얼굴을 유지하라」는 지시를 «검사 가능한 목록»으로 바꾼 것이 이 JSON의 값어치다.**\n\n```json\n\"identity_source\": {\n  \"instruction\": \"업로드한 참조 사진이 «유일하고 결정적인» 신원 출처다\",\n  \"requirements\": [\n    \"얼굴형과 «턱선»을 정확히 유지\", \"«눈 모양»과 «눈썹 구조»를 정밀 복제\",\n    \"코·입술·«피부톤»을 정확히 일치\", \"«수염»이 있으면 보존\",\n    \"«헤어스타일·질감·헤어라인» 유지\", \"«귀»와 자연스러운 «비율» 불변\", \"«표정» 일치\"\n  ]}\n```\n★**열두 칸으로 쪼갠 것이 요령이다.** \"같은 사람으로 보이게\"는 검사할 수 없지만,\n**턱선 / 눈매 / 눈썹 사이 간격 / 코끝 / 헤어라인**은 하나씩 확인할 수 있다.\n시리즈에서 인물이 흔들릴 때 어디가 틀렸는지 «짚을 수 있게» 된다.\n\n★**텍스트 단독 재현에서는 반대로 쓴다** — 참조 사진이 없으므로 이 목록을 «채워 넣는 양식»으로 삼아\n얼굴을 부위별로 «정의»했다(계란형 · 각진 턱선 · 아몬드형 짙은 갈색 눈 · 중앙에 틈이 있는 굵은 직선 눈썹 ·\n좁은 콧대에 둥근 코끝 · 오른쪽 눈 아래 작은 점 …). **같은 목록을 다음 컷에 그대로 옮기면 시리즈가 잠긴다.**\n[[chenlinspark-series-identity-anchor-block]](시리즈 인물 연속성 앵커)와 같은 도구인데, 이쪽이 훨씬 세밀하다.",
