      "title": "★★★「후지산 넣지 마 · 지평선 없음 · 랜드마크 없음」이 통하는 이유는 자리를 «안개»가 채우기 때문이다 — 지우고 싶으면 지울 것을 나열하지 말고 «무엇으로 덮을지»를 적는다",
      "prompt": "Prompt:\n\n— Isolated Japanese snow plain in the middle of nowhere, surrounded on every side by suffocating thick white-grey fog. NO horizon visible, NO mountains, NO Mt Fuji, NO landmarks. Beyond the fog: featureless pale grey-white void. Heavy dark storm clouds visible only at the very top of the sky, fading downward into the storm. No sun. Heavy snowfall. Ground rich with Japanese texture: tall dry susuki grass tufts with puffy beige seed-heads, dome-shaped red-leaf shrubs with crimson tiny leaves through snowdrifts, small red flowering sprigs, mossy grey rock outcrops with snow on top, scattered fallen red leaves drifting in clusters across the snow. Ground rolls in uneven drift waves. Environment only.\n \n<<<47967c0f-607b-4c15-8948-f77b8d4a8790>>> — Roco, the Crystal Knight. Adult human male of normal height (~1.8m / ~180cm), encased in massive crystal armor. Translucent deep blood-red faceted crystal armor over the entire body, internal crimson glow within the crystal mass, sealed crystal helmet with narrow visor slit. Inside the visor slit: LIVING HUMAN EYES — normal pupils, iris, catch-lights. NO glow, NO red light from the visor. Crystal greatsword fused into the right gauntlet — translucent blood-red geode, faceted, jagged edge, internal crimson glow. Same material as armor. Character.\n \n<<<cfee3e2d-67d8-40ef-92ea-9d5218ae9cd0>>> — Crystal shield ALREADY GROWN on Roco's left forearm at start of shot — same blood-red crystal as armor and sword, dense outward-radiating jagged crystal spikes (sea-urchin crown), already showing accumulated impact cracks across the surface from previous blocks. Internal crimson glow. Fused directly to the vambrace, no hilt. DEFENSIVE ONLY — used to block, NEVER swung as weapon.\n \n — Mounted dead samurai. Classical o-yoroi armor in dark rusty-brown and black lamellar, snow-dusted, weathered. Horned kabuto helmet. Mummified grey skull-face, hollow dark eye sockets (no glow). Long stringy black hair. Dark snow-dusted horse with leather/iron breastplate. Carries katana, yari, or polearm. NON-IP.\n \n — Mid-class undead, mounted. Black-lacquered armor with small gold insignia, simpler kabuto with iron side ornaments. Mummified grey-blue corpse skin, dried lips pulled back, GLOWING ORANGE-RED EYES burning steadily in dark sockets (do NOT blink, do NOT track). The burning orange-red eyes are EXCLUSIVE to this variant — no other character has glowing eyes.\n \n — The screaming class, mounted. More skeletal than — face mostly skull with dried grey skin in patches, hollow black eye sockets (no glow), jaws unhinged in permanent silent scream showing yellowed teeth. Long stringy unkempt black hair under simple kabuto with disc-medallion ornament. Most weathered rusty-brown lamellar armor with damage patches. Emaciated hunched body. Katana at hip. Dark snow-dusted horse. NON-IP.\n \n<<<81da22a1-f7dc-4d4d-9b8e-082eb713b794>>> — The most decayed foot samurai. SKELETAL — ribs visible through tattered torn cloth and leather wraps, exposed bone in arms, no real flesh. Face is a dried hollow skull, deep BLACK empty eye sockets (no glow), dried lips pulled back, jaw slack. Long stringy grey-black hair flowing loose past the shoulders. NO HELMET — bare skull crown. Armor reduced to scraps of weathered leather and cloth at waist and knees. Bare wrapped feet. Carries a single weathered katana, blade darkened and notched. Foot soldier on the snow. NON-IP.\n \n — Skeletal foot samurai in fuller armor. Mostly skeletal head with dried-grey skin patches clinging to dark-grey skull, hollow black eye sockets (no glow), fixed jaw partly open. Wears classical horned kabuto with modest kuwagata. Dark weathered black-grey lamellar over rotted cloth — more intact than <<<81da22a1-f7dc-4d4d-9b8e-082eb713b794>>> but heavily aged. Body emaciated but bulkier in armor. Carries a long ODACHI (~1.5m blade) held one or two-handed. Walks with weight. Foot soldier on the snow. NON-IP.....",
      "gen_prompt": "An isolated Japanese snow plain, wide format. On every side the ground runs out into suffocatingly thick white-grey fog that closes the scene off completely: there is no horizon line, no mountain, no building and no landmark anywhere, because beyond about forty metres the fog becomes a featureless pale grey-white void that swallows everything. Heavy dark storm clouds appear only along the very top edge of the sky and fade downward into that same greyness within a third of the frame. No sun, no shadow direction. Snow falls heavily, the near flakes large and soft-edged, the far ones dissolving into the fog. The ground is dense with texture: tall dry susuki grass tufts with puffy beige seed-heads bending under snow, dome-shaped shrubs whose tiny crimson leaves show through the drifts, small sprigs of red flowers, mossy grey rock outcrops capped with snow, and scattered fallen red leaves half-buried. Snowdrifts curve across the ground in low sculpted ridges. Everything is cool and desaturated except the crimson leaves, which are the only saturated colour in the picture. Cinematic wide shot, natural film grain, soft flat light with no visible source. No text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★★**부정 지시가 통하는 조건 — 이 건이 런북 §부정 규칙의 반례처럼 보이지만 사실은 확증이다.**\n\n원문은 부정을 무섭게 많이 쓴다: *\"NO horizon visible, NO mountains, **NO Mt Fuji**, NO landmarks,\nNo sun.\"* 런북에는 *\"부정으로는 «형태»를 못 지운다\"*(브랜드 조형 · 신체 부위 · 학습된 기본형)고\n적혀 있다. 그런데 이 프롬프트는 통한다. **왜인가:**\n\n```\n안 통했던 부정   \"no mouth\"      ← 입이 있어야 할 자리를 «비워 두기만» 했다 → 기본형이 채운다\n★통하는 부정     \"NO Mt Fuji\"    ← 그 자리를 ★«숨 막히게 두꺼운 흰회색 안개»가 «채운다»\n                 + \"안개 너머는 «특징 없는 창백한 회백색 공허»\"\n```\n★**결국 같은 규칙이다 — 「지우기」가 아니라 「덮기」다.**\n「후지산을 넣지 마라」가 아니라 **「사방 40m 밖은 안개가 전부 삼킨다」**라고 적었기 때문에\n산이 들어설 자리 자체가 없어진다. 부정 목록은 «확인용»이고, 실제로 일하는 건 안개다.\n\n★**두 번째 요령 — 지운 만큼 «앞쪽을 채운다».** 배경을 다 없앤 대신 지면 텍스처를 촘촘히 지정했다\n(억새 이삭 · 붉은 잎 관목 · 이끼 낀 바위 · 떨어진 단풍 · 눈 능선). 비우기만 하면 밋밋해진다.\n\n★색도 하나만 남겼다 — *\"진홍 잎이 화면에서 «유일한 채도 있는 색»\"*. 런북 §③의 «앵커 지정»이\n면적 비율보다 잘 통하는 사례.",
