      "title": "★장면 엔진 하나에 슬롯 셋(주체·색1·색2)만 두고 세 번 돌린다 — 반딧불 보케라는 «단 하나의 장치»가 주제가 바뀌어도 시리즈를 묶는다",
      "prompt": "🎨 ENCHANTED FOREST 🎨\n\nPrompt :\n\nAn Enchanted Forest scene with [SUBJECT] surrounded by Firefly Bokeh, where glowing light orbs mimic the magical glow of bioluminescent insects. Utilize a color scheme of [COLOR1] and [COLOR2] to create a whimsical and mystical atmosphere\n\nCheck ALTS\n\n--- ALT ---\nAn Enchanted Forest scene with an ancient wise owl perched on a branch surrounded by Firefly Bokeh, where glowing light orbs mimic the magical glow of bioluminescent insects. Utilize a color scheme of midnight blue and silver white to create a whimsical and mystical atmosphere --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nAn Enchanted Forest scene with an ethereal dragon surrounded by Firefly Bokeh, where glowing light orbs mimic the magical glow of bioluminescent insects. Utilize a color scheme of crimson and gold to create a whimsical and mystical atmosphere --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nAn Enchanted Forest scene with a unicorn surrounded by Firefly Bokeh, where glowing light orbs mimic the magical glow of bioluminescent insects. Utilize a color scheme of lavender and emerald to create a whimsical and mystical atmosphere --ar 3:2 --v 8.2",
      "gen_prompt": "An enchanted forest scene with an ancient wise owl perched on a mossy branch in the middle distance, facing the viewer. The air around it is filled with firefly bokeh: dozens of glowing orbs of light at many different depths, the nearest ones large and completely out of focus with soft haloed edges, the middle ones smaller and rounder, the far ones tiny pinpoints, all of them warm silver-white and clearly reading as living insects rather than lens artefacts because a few sit against dark foliage where their faint trails are visible. The colour scheme is strictly midnight blue and silver white: the forest, the mist and the shadows are all deep blue, and every highlight — the owl's breast feathers, the rim of the branch, the mist catching light, the orbs themselves — is silver white. No other hue appears. Tall trunks recede into blue haze behind, ferns and undergrowth catch a little of the orb light at their edges, and thin mist lies along the forest floor. Whimsical and mystical mood, shallow depth of field with the owl sharp and everything else softening away, cinematic wide framing. No text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**장면 엔진 + 슬롯 셋 — 가장 단순한 시리즈 구조.**\n\n```\nAn Enchanted Forest scene with «[SUBJECT]» surrounded by Firefly Bokeh …\ncolor scheme of «[COLOR1]» and «[COLOR2]»\n```\nALT 셋이 실제 운용을 보여준다 — **올빼미/미드나잇블루+실버화이트 · 드래곤/크림슨+골드 ·\n유니콘/라벤더+에메랄드.** 주체와 두 색만 갈아끼운다.\n\n★**시리즈를 묶는 건 「반딧불 보케」라는 «장치 하나»다.** 주제가 올빼미든 드래곤이든,\n같은 빛 알갱이가 화면을 채우면 한 세트로 읽힌다. 스타일을 길게 규정하는 대신\n**기억에 남는 장치 하나**를 고정하는 방식.\n\n★재현에서 «보케»가 렌즈 효과로만 나오지 않도록 조건을 붙였다 —\n*\"몇 개는 «어두운 잎을 배경으로» 놓여 «희미한 궤적»이 보이기 때문에 «렌즈 아티팩트가 아니라\n살아 있는 벌레»로 읽힌다.\"* 런북 §광학 규칙(현상 이름이 아니라 보이는 모양)의 적용.\n\n★깊이별 크기도 셋으로 나눴다 — 가까운 것은 «크고 완전히 초점이 나가 후광이 지고», 중간은\n«작고 둥글고», 먼 것은 «바늘 끝». 이게 없으면 같은 크기 점들이 평면으로 깔린다.",
      "ref_image": "results/ludoviccreator-one-scene-engine-three-swaps-ref.jpg",
