      "prompt": "From quirky heroes to towering machines, Recraft V4.1 excels at creating distinctive characters with strong personalities, rich details, and a cohesive visual style.\n\nPrompts ↓ https://t.co/ssrJzYyqZJ\n\n--- 답글(프롬프트 전문) ---\nPrompt 1:\nAn illustration of a squat reptilian creature with a wide mechanical helmet bristling with four lateral spike-horns and a small crown of upright spines, wearing a faded dark blue linen tunic belted at the waist, one arm encased in a massive cylindrical metal gauntlet with a red adhesive tape stripe, the other hand holding a round shield with a protruding dome boss, bare clawed feet, full body front-facing, warm beige background.\n\nPrompt 2:\nAn illustration of a thick-necked human head emerging from a large dark navy collar ring studded with rivets and gold-painted bolts, the face with a deeply furrowed brow and an enormous hooked nose, wearing a dark iron helmet with four stubby pink cone-shaped horns bolted on, a rectangular orange tape patch stuck to the forehead for no clear reason, gold sun-burst emblem on the collar, bust close-up, warm grey-beige background.\n\nPrompt 3:\nAn illustration of a very wide hunched troll-like creature entirely encased in mismatched salvaged armour plates bolted together with visible fasteners, one pauldron much larger than the other, carrying a comically tiny lantern in one enormous gauntleted hand, full body wide shot, beige desert ground, plain warm beige background.\n\nPrompt 4:\nAn illustration of a short stout female figure in a craftsman's apron over a dark blue tunic, her left arm replaced from the elbow down by a large riveted metal cylinder with a hand-shaped attachment at the end, goggles pushed up on her forehead, a small round mechanical device clipped to her belt, three-quarter bust, warm beige background.",
      "gen_prompt": "An illustration of a squat reptilian creature standing front-facing in full body on a warm beige background. It wears a wide mechanical helmet bristling with four lateral spike-horns and a small crown of upright spines, a faded dark blue linen tunic belted at the waist, and no shoes, its clawed feet bare on the ground. One arm is encased in a massive cylindrical metal gauntlet far too large for it, with a strip of red adhesive tape stuck across the gauntlet for no clear reason, its edges peeling. The other hand holds a round shield with a protruding dome boss. The drawing is flat and matte with visible grain, built from simple solid shapes with minimal shading and a limited palette of faded navy, iron grey, warm beige and one red accent. The creature is centred with even space around it, lit flatly with no cast shadow. No text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**참조 이미지 없이 캐릭터 시리즈를 묶는 방법 — 네 개의 프롬프트가 같은 «서술 순서»를 쓴다.**\n\n원문은 프롬프트 넷을 나란히 올린다(도마뱀 전사 / 두꺼운 목의 인간 흉상 / …). 공통 구조:\n```\n① \"An illustration of ...\"      항상 같은 도입\n② 실루엣의 «가장 이상한 부분»부터  넓은 기계 헬멧 · 네 개의 측면 뿔 · 거대한 원통형 건틀릿\n③ 의복을 «색+재질+마감»으로       \"바랜 감청색 «리넨» 튜닉, 허리에서 벨트로 «묶인»\"\n④ ★이유 없는 디테일 하나          «빨간 접착테이프 한 줄» · 이마에 붙은 «주황색 사각 테이프»\n                                  → 원문 그대로 \"for no clear reason\"\n⑤ 프레이밍                        full body front-facing / bust close-up\n⑥ 배경색                          warm beige / warm grey-beige   ← ★거의 같은 색으로 고정\n```\n★**④가 이 시리즈의 «서명»이다.** 세계관을 설명하지 않고 «설명되지 않는 물건»을 하나씩 심어\n같은 세계의 것들로 읽히게 한다. 넷 다 테이프가 등장하는데 매번 이유가 없다.\n\n★**⑥ 배경색 고정만으로도 시리즈감의 절반이 만들어진다.** 오늘 담은\n[[recraftai-swap-the-subject-keep-the-sentence]](같은 문장에 명사만 교체)와 같은 계정의 같은 철학 —\n**문장 구조를 고정하면 시리즈가 저절로 잠긴다.**\n\n⚠️본문은 소감뿐이었고 프롬프트 넷은 답글에 있었다(재스크랩 회수).",
