      "prompt": "📸 A little wind makes summer travel portraits come alive!\n\nLow angles, suitcases, flying skirts, and four fresh color palettes capture that perfect moment before departure ✨\n\n1. Coral sunset ferry\n2. Cream navy airport\n3. Lemon sky terminal\n4. Mint seaside station\n\nGreat for travel portraits, luggage campaigns, summer styling, and social media content.\n\nMade with ChatGPT-Image2  \nPrompt below 👇\n\n--- 답글(프롬프트 전문) ---\nPrompt:\n\nSubject: adult young woman\nOutfit: [top + skirt + socks + shoes + accessories]\nSuitcase: [brand / model / color / material]\nLocation: [airport / ferry terminal / seaside station / city platform]\nColor palette: [main color + secondary color + accent]\nLighting: [bright summer daylight / warm sunset]\nAspect ratio: 9:16\n\nCreate a highly realistic summer travel portrait of an adult young woman standing beside a matching suitcase. Use a low-angle full-body composition with a clean sky and a simple travel setting in the background.\n\nCapture the exact moment when a strong summer wind suddenly blows through the scene. Her hair, loose strands, ribbon, and lightweight skirt move clearly in one consistent direction. The skirt lifts into a natural, asymmetric curve with fitted safety shorts underneath. \n\nHer pose should feel spontaneous: one hand holding the suitcase handle, the other reacting naturally to the wind, while she looks slightly away from the camera.\n\nGive her naturally fair, healthy-looking skin with real texture, subtle tonal variation, and soft natural highlights. Avoid whitening filters, overexposure, plastic skin, or heavy retouching. The fitted top should create a natural supported silhouette, with realistic fabric thickness, folds, and tension.\n\nKeep the suitcase fully visible with accurate handles, wheels, proportions, and hard-shell details. Use fresh summer colors, realistic daylight, natural perspective, and authentic editorial photography.",
      "gen_prompt": "A highly realistic summer travel portrait, vertical, of an adult young woman standing beside a matching suitcase on a seaside station platform, shot from a low angle in full body against a clean bright sky. The picture catches the exact moment a strong summer wind sweeps through: her long hair, the loose strands around her face, the ribbon at her collar and her lightweight pleated skirt all move clearly in one single consistent direction, to her left and slightly back, none of them contradicting the others. The skirt lifts into a natural asymmetric curve with fitted shorts visible beneath it. Her pose is caught rather than posed: one hand holds the suitcase handle, the other lifts instinctively toward her hair, her weight shifted onto one leg and her head turned slightly into the wind with her eyes half-closed against it. She wears a white cropped blouse, a pale blue skirt, short white socks and canvas shoes, with a pale blue hard-shell suitcase whose colour matches the skirt. Bright summer daylight from behind and to one side, warm rim light on her hair and the edge of the skirt, crisp shadows. Clean simple background with the platform edge, a low railing and the sea beyond, nothing cluttered. No text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**바람을 그리는 규칙 하나 — 「모든 것이 같은 방향으로」.**\n\n원문: *\"Capture the exact moment when a strong summer wind suddenly blows through the scene.\n**Her hair, loose strands, ribbon, and lightweight skirt move clearly in one consistent direction.**\"*\n\n★**이 한 줄이 없으면 머리카락은 왼쪽으로, 치마는 오른쪽으로 날린다.** 각 요소를 따로 지시하면\n모델이 «흩날리는 느낌»만 흉내 내서 방향이 갈리고, 그 순간 합성으로 보인다.\ngen_prompt에 **«그녀의 왼쪽으로 그리고 약간 뒤로, 어느 것도 서로 어긋나지 않게»**로 방향까지 못박았다.\n\n★**두 번째 요령은 「포즈가 아니라 반응」**이다 — *\"pose should feel spontaneous:\none hand holding the suitcase handle, the other reacting naturally\"*.\n한 손은 «일을 하고 있고» 다른 손은 «바람에 반응한다». 양손이 다 포즈를 잡으면 화보가 되고,\n한쪽이 반응하면 순간이 된다. 여기에 «바람을 맞아 반쯤 감은 눈»을 더했다.\n\n★슬롯 템플릿이기도 하다 — 의상 / 캐리어(브랜드·모델·색·재질) / 장소(공항·페리터미널·바닷가역·\n도심 승강장) / 배색 / 조명 / 화면비. **캐리어 색을 치마와 맞추라**는 지시가 이 시리즈의 고정 규칙이다.\n\n⚠️브랜드·모델 슬롯은 오리지널 서술로 채웠다(§브랜드).",
