      "prompt": "Nano banana pro promotional and Cinematic Prompt🍅 ⤵️\n\nExtreme close-up overhead shot of [product from uploaded photo] nestled in the center of a dense pile of fresh ripe tomatoes with green stems, the product's color perfectly matching the tomatoes' rich red-orange tone, soft natural directional lighting creating gentle highlights and shadows on both the product and the surrounding tomatoes, shallow depth of field, product sharply in focus and slightly elevated above the produce, seamless organic surrounding pattern filling the entire frame with no visible background, high-end editorial product photography, hyperrealistic texture contrast between glossy tomato skin and product surface\n\nModel: Nano banana pro \n\n #NanoBananaPro",
      "gen_prompt": "An extreme close-up overhead shot looking straight down at a glass bottle of tomato passata nestled in the centre of a dense pile of fresh ripe tomatoes with their green stems still on. The bottle's contents are the same rich red-orange as the fruit around it, so product and produce read as one colour field and the eye finds the bottle by its shape and its gloss rather than by its hue. The tomatoes fill the entire frame edge to edge in a seamless organic pattern with no background visible anywhere and no table, surface or horizon showing. The bottle sits very slightly higher than the fruit around it and is sharply in focus, while the tomatoes closest to the lens and those at the outer corners fall softly out of focus. Soft natural directional light from the upper left lays gentle highlights and shadows across both the bottle and the fruit, and the texture contrast is the point: taut glossy tomato skin with tiny surface speckles against the smooth cool glass and the matte paper label. High-end editorial food photography, hyperrealistic, shallow depth of field. The label carries no words, only a plain blank paper field.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**제품 사진의 반대 전략 — 눈에 띄게 하는 대신 «재료 속에 숨긴다».**\n\n```\n① 제품을 «재료 더미 한가운데»에 파묻는다\n★② 제품의 색을 «주변 재료에 맞춘다»   → 색으로는 못 찾고 «형태와 광택»으로 찾게 된다\n③ 재료가 «화면을 가장자리까지» 채운다  — ★\"배경이 «전혀 보이지 않게»\" · 테이블도 지평선도 없음\n④ 제품만 «살짝 높이» 두고 «초점»을 준다\n★⑤ 질감 대비가 논지다               팽팽하고 광택 있는 껍질 ↔ 매끈하고 차가운 유리\n```\n★**②가 반직관적이다.** 보통 제품은 배경과 «대비»시켜 띄우는데, 여기는 **일부러 같은 색**으로\n묻어 놓고 광택과 형태만 남긴다. 그래서 «신선한 재료로 만들었다»가 시각적으로 성립한다.\n\n★**③의 「배경 없음」도 구도 지시로 적어야 한다.** *\"seamless organic pattern filling the entire\nframe with no visible background\"* — 여백을 조금이라도 남기면 그냥 «재료 옆에 놓인 제품»이 된다.\n\n★런북 §⑤ 위험을 피해 라벨은 **«글자 없는 빈 종이 면»**으로 못박았다. 제품 라벨에 문구를 열어 두면\n모델이 브랜드명을 지어내 새긴다(오늘 [[azedai-die-cut-sticker-slot-five-rules]]에서 같은 처리).",
