      "gen_prompt": "A vertical hyper-realistic CG portrait in Chinese classical style of a fictional adult East Asian woman, half-length, caught mid turn as she looks back over her shoulder toward the camera. Because of the turn, the visual centre is not the face alone but the triangle of her face, the line of her shoulder and upper back, and the wide gilded phoenix crown — her back is angled toward the viewer, her chin turned across it, and the crown reads almost in profile. Cool fair skin with real pores and fine down, soft semi-matte finish, gentle highlight along the cheekbone and the turned shoulder. Long narrow eyes glance sideways and slightly down, calm and unhurried; low-saturation rose-brown shadow, soft rouge lips. Black hair coiled high in Tang style beneath a large gilded crown of phoenixes, leaves, pearls and gemstones with gold chains of uneven length swinging slightly with the turn, and long gem earrings brushing the neck. Deep rosewood-pink and gilt court robes with a sheer pink outer gown, its cuffs and shoulder covered in gold-thread birds and clouds, the fabric across the back catching a broad soft highlight. Cinematic spatial perspective with the room falling away behind her, warm gold lantern light from behind and above picking out the crown, the gold chains and the edge of the shoulder, a cool fill opening the shadowed side of the face. Dark palace interior with hanging bead curtains thrown into round bokeh. 85mm portrait lens at f/1.8, extremely shallow depth of field, low saturation, soft focus glow, light film grain. No text, no grid, no collage.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**같은 인물·같은 의상인데 「돌아보기」 하나로 사진이 바뀐다.**\n\n정면 초상([[chenlinspark-face-crown-hands-form-a-triangle]])은 *\"얼굴·봉관·손이 삼각 구도\"*였는데,\n이 건은 *\"面部、**肩背**与凤冠为视觉中心\"* — **어깨와 등이 구도에 들어온다.**\n\n```\n정면    시각 중심 = 얼굴 · 봉관 · 손        → 정적 · 대칭 · 의례적\n회모    시각 중심 = 얼굴 · «어깨와 등» · 봉관 → 사선 · 움직임 직후 · 서사적\n```\n★**「어디를 보게 할지」가 아니라 「무엇이 중심에 들어오는지」를 적는 게 요령이다.**\n\"돌아보는 포즈\"라고만 쓰면 얼굴만 돌아가고 몸이 그대로 정면인 그림이 나온다.\ngen_prompt에 *\"등이 관객 쪽으로 «기울고» 턱이 그 위를 «가로질러» 돌아가며 봉관이 «거의 측면»으로\n읽힌다\"*고 적어 몸 전체가 돌게 했다.\n\n★금사슬이 «회전에 따라 살짝 흔들린다»는 것도 동작 직후임을 보여주는 신호다.",
