      "prompt": "Minimal luxury monument showcase\n\nSeedream 5.0\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a premium minimalist architectural presentation of [LANDMARK NAME] in [COUNTRY/CITY]. The landmark should emerge as the only focal point, sculpted in elegant metallic gold while the surrounding city is rendered entirely in matte white as a clean architectural scale model. Place the landmark precisely at the center, softly glowing with warm golden illumination that naturally draws attention. The surrounding streets, buildings, plazas, and urban layout should appear simplified, monochromatic, and highly minimal, emphasizing the monument's importance. Use a refined museum exhibition aesthetic with luxury branding, abundant negative space, soft global illumination, subtle ambient occlusion, delicate shadows, and ultra-clean geometry. Add a sophisticated serif title centered near the top: [COUNTRY] | [LANDMARK NAME] in elegant gold typography. The overall composition should feel like an Apple-style product reveal, luxury architectural visualization, premium tourism branding, and high-end editorial design.\nStyle: minimalist architecture, monochrome white city model, golden centerpiece, museum display, luxury presentation, clean geometric forms, cinematic lighting, soft gradients, photorealistic 3D render, ultra-detailed, octane render, global illumination, elegant typography, premium branding, calm aesthetic",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium minimalist architectural presentation of a single grand cathedral standing at the exact centre of a city. The entire surrounding city — streets, blocks, plazas, bridges and the river — is rendered as one continuous matte white architectural scale model with no colour at all, its buildings simplified into clean geometric masses with flat roofs and no window detail, so the whole field reads as a museum display model. The cathedral alone is sculpted in brushed metallic gold, fully detailed with its spire, buttresses, rose window and stepped facade, and it glows with a warm golden light that spills a short distance onto the white blocks immediately around it and nowhere else. It is the only saturated colour in the picture. Abundant empty white space surrounds the model on all sides, soft global illumination with delicate ambient occlusion in the street canyons, very soft shadows, ultra-clean geometry, no texture noise. Photoreal 3D render, calm and expensive, like a product reveal on a gallery plinth. Across the top, centred on the empty white, one line of elegant thin gold serif capitals reads FRANCE | NOTRE DAME, and that single line is the only text in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**「주인공을 정하는」 가장 단순한 방법 — 색을 하나만 남긴다.**\n\n```\n주변 도시   ★«무광 백색 축소모형» 하나로 통일 — 거리·블록·광장·다리까지 전부\n            창문 디테일 없이 «단순 기하 덩어리»로\n랜드마크    ★«금속 골드»로 «완전히 디테일하게» — 첨탑·버트레스·장미창까지\n            + 따뜻한 골드 조명이 «주변 흰 블록에만 짧게» 번진다\n```\n★**설명이 필요 없어진다.** 「이것이 중요하다」고 쓰지 않아도 색 하나만 살아 있으면 시선이 거기로 간다.\n런북 §③(면적 비율은 안 통해도 «대상 지정»은 통한다)의 가장 깨끗한 사례 —\n*\"화면에서 «유일하게 채도 있는 색»\"*이라고 못박으면 된다.\n\n★**디테일 밀도도 역할로 나뉜다** — 주변은 «단순화», 주인공은 «완전 디테일».\n색만 바꾸고 밀도가 같으면 모형 속에 금색 건물이 하나 있는 그림이 되고,\n밀도를 갈라야 «전시된 주인공»이 된다.\n\n★여백과 조명도 미술관 문법이다 — 사방에 넉넉한 흰 여백 · 부드러운 전역 조명 ·\n거리 협곡에만 «앰비언트 오클루전» · 질감 노이즈 없음.\n\n⚠️원문의 `Apple-style product reveal`은 뺐다(§브랜드 — 「○○급으로」도 조형을 불러온다).\n그 자리는 «갤러리 좌대 위의 제품 공개처럼»이라는 조형 서술로 채웠다.",
