      "prompt": "🦦江湖感的“毛子”\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate a same-series UE5 cinematic realism character portrait that preserves 100% of the original composition logic, camera distance, subject scale, pose structure, wardrobe layering, and lighting hierarchy: a tight vertical studio-style portrait of a tough anthropomorphic otter-like outlaw standing front and center against a deep dark background, upper body filling the frame, arms crossed confidently across the chest, head slightly tilted with a calm dominant expression, a thick smoldering cigar clenched at the side of the mouth with thin curling smoke drifting upward, and a large striped knitted tam hat sitting high on the head with textured fabric folds and a round metal leaf-shaped badge attached on one side. Keep the exact visual rhythm of oversized hat, centered face, cigar silhouette, layered dreadlock-like cords or tassels falling from beneath the hat, crossed furry forearms in the lower foreground, and richly textured jacket filling the torso area. Do not redesign the macro layout.\n\nThe character must feel like a believable high-budget UE5 film creature, not cartoon art: fully coherent mammalian anatomy, realistic skull structure, correct muzzle proportions, believable nose leather, dense whisker system, expressive amber eyes, layered eyelids, natural ear placement, thick wet-looking facial fur around the cheeks and chin, and extremely refined anti-AI realism. The anthropomorphic body must have correct shoulder width, chest volume, elbow bend, wrist structure, forearm mass, paw anatomy, finger count, claw logic, and natural crossed-arm tension. No broken paws, no malformed fingers, no duplicated whiskers, no warped snout, no bad symmetry.\n\nWardrobe and props must feel iconic, tactile, and film-real: a richly worn red-yellow-green striped knitted tam with heavy yarn texture and subtle frayed fibers, long rope-like dreadlock cords or tasseled fabric strands hanging from beneath the hat, a rugged weathered jacket in matching earthy reggae-inspired tones with rough stitching, aged fabric grain, soft fur trim, zipper and pocket detail, and a small metal whistle pendant at the chest. The cigar must have realistic ash, ember glow, smoke density, paper texture, and believable mouth contact. Every material should feel premium, layered, and physically plausible.\n\nLighting and rendering must be pure UE5 cinematic realism: controlled studio-black background, soft directional key light shaping the face and muzzle, subtle rim light on hat fibers and fur edges, elegant shadow falloff, slightly moody contrast, ultra-sharp detail on eyes, whiskers, cigar, paws, knit texture, and fur strands, with slightly printed grain and mature feature-film color grading. The color palette should stay disciplined: warm earthy fur tones, muted golden highlights, deep charcoal shadows, and rich but controlled red-yellow-green wardrobe accents. The whole image should feel like a canonical hero portrait from a premium fantasy-crime or outlaw creature film, with absolute realism, strong visual identity, and unforgettable attitude.\n\nEmphasize character presence over comedy: proud, weathered, streetwise, intimidating, self-possessed, and cinematic. No text, no logo, no poster typography, no cartoon exaggeration, no plastic fur, no toy look, no flat lighting, no anatomy mistakes, no malformed paws, no extra fingers, no muddy rendering, no low-detail smoke, no cheap costume styling.",
      "gen_prompt": "A cinematic realism character portrait in a tight vertical studio format. A tough anthropomorphic otter outlaw stands front and centre against a deep dark background, his upper body filling the frame, arms crossed confidently across the chest, head tilted slightly with a calm dominant expression. A thick smouldering cigar is clenched at the side of his mouth with thin smoke curling upward and catching the light. A large striped knitted tam hat sits high on his head with visible fabric folds and loose yarn texture. His fur is rendered with individual strands, damp and matted at the muzzle, with scars across the brow. He wears layered clothing — a worn leather waistcoat over a coarse woven shirt with a loose collar, a knotted neckerchief, and a heavy chain — each layer clearly readable as a separate garment. Lighting is a clear hierarchy: one hard key from the upper left carving the cheekbone and hat, a cool rim along the opposite shoulder separating him from the black, and almost no fill so the background stays empty. Photoreal fur and fabric, film grain, no text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**시리즈 캐릭터 초상을 «같은 세트»로 묶는 여섯 축.**\n\n원문 첫 줄이 그대로 목록이다 — *\"preserves 100% of the original **composition logic, camera\ndistance, subject scale, pose structure, wardrobe layering, and lighting hierarchy**\"*\n\n```\n① 구도 논리        정면 중앙 · 어두운 배경 · 상반신이 화면을 채운다\n② 카메라 거리      타이트한 세로 스튜디오 포맷\n③ 피사체 스케일    상반신이 «프레임을 채우는» 비율\n④ 포즈 구조        팔짱 · 고개를 살짝 기울임 · 침착한 지배적 표정\n★⑤ 의상 «레이어링»  가죽 조끼 / 거친 셔츠 / 목수건 / 체인 — ★각 층이 «따로» 읽혀야 한다\n★⑥ 조명 «위계»     좌상단 하드 키 + 반대쪽 쿨 림 + ★«필 라이트 거의 없음»\n```\n★**⑤와 ⑥이 「같은 시리즈」를 만든다.** 의상 «품목»을 바꿔도 «몇 겹인지»가 같으면 한 세트로 읽히고,\n조명의 «역할 배치»가 같으면 촬영이 같아 보인다. 캐릭터 종류(수달·너구리·곰…)는 바꿔도 된다.\n\n★디테일 지시도 재질별로 나뉜다 — 털은 «한 올씩 · 주둥이는 젖어 뭉침 · 눈썹에 흉터»,\n니트는 «접힘과 풀린 실», 가죽은 «닳음». 재질마다 다른 «망가진 방식»을 적어야 실물이 된다.",
