      "title": "★«한 제품 · 네 구역»이면 한 장으로 뽑는다 — 칸마다 배경 리듬만 바꾸고 제품을 반복시키면 Krea2의 타일링 습성이 오히려 캠페인 그리드가 된다",
      "prompt": "Pop Art Product Campaign Grid\n\nGPT Image 2\n\nSubject:\nCreate a bold, colorful 1:1 social media campaign grid for \"[PRODUCT NAME]\" using the uploaded reference image, or generate a premium, ultra-realistic version of [PRODUCT NAME]. Automatically adapt all colors, ingredients, textures, props, decorative elements, and the overall visual mood according to the product type or uploaded reference. Design a modern pop-art inspired promotional collage featuring multiple creative square sections.\n\nCanvas Size:\n1:1 Square Format — 1080 × 1080 px, optimized for Instagram posts and trendy social media branding.\n\nSetting & Background:\nUse vibrant pop-art backgrounds with energetic color blocking, abstract wave patterns, maze lines, retro squiggles, doodle outlines, neon accents, playful geometric shapes, and modern Memphis-style design elements. Divide the composition into four creative grid sections, each with a unique background style and dynamic visual rhythm.\n\nLighting:\nBright commercial studio lighting with glossy highlights, vibrant color reflections, soft realistic shadows, premium texture enhancement, and a playful modern advertising atmosphere.\n\nStyle:\nModern pop-art advertising aesthetic, Gen Z branding style, trendy Instagram campaign visuals, colorful street-style graphics, a minimal yet energetic layout, bold modern typography, premium commercial poster design, and ultra-realistic product rendering.\n\nTypography Style:\nUse oversized bold typography with playful layout placement.\nMix condensed modern fonts with handwritten accent text.\nKeep typography energetic, youthful, and visually dynamic.\n\nColor Direction:\nAutomatically adapt the color palette to the product:\n\nIce Cream → Pink, Cyan, Orange, Yellow\n\nSneakers → Neon Green, Purple, Black\n\nCosmetics → Pastel Pink, Lavender, Cream\n\nTech Products → Electric Blue, Black, Lime\n\nUse high-contrast, trend-driven colors with strong visual impact.\n\nCamera:\nCentered hero product composition, close-up commercial photography, slightly tilted dynamic framing, shallow depth of field, ultra-sharp focus, cinematic advertising quality, and 4K modern campaign rendering.\n\nText Elements:\nInclude stylish promotional texts such as:\n\n\"New Collection\"\n\"Limited Edition\"\n\"Now Available\"\n\"Fresh Drop\"\n\"Premium Quality\"\n\"Trending Now\"\n\nImportant:\n\n• Keep the design divided into creative square sections.\n• Automatically adapt colors, graphics, and decorative elements to [PRODUCT NAME].\n• Maintain a playful pop-art branding style throughout.\n• Use vibrant, modern color combinations.\n• Keep typography large, bold, and visually engaging.\n• Avoid empty spaces and dull tones.\n• Ensure the final design looks like a trendy, premium Instagram campaign.",
      "gen_prompt": "A square one-to-one pop-art advertising collage for a single ice-cream product, divided into four equal square zones by clean white gutters. The same product appears once in every zone, photographed identically each time — a glossy pink strawberry ice-cream cone with a waffle cone, a soft swirl, visible cream texture and one drip on the side — so the product itself stays completely consistent from zone to zone. What changes is the background rhythm behind it: the upper left zone is flat hot pink with thick concentric wave bands; the upper right is cyan with a black maze line pattern; the lower left is warm yellow with scattered hand-drawn squiggles and doodle outlines; the lower right is cream with bold Memphis-style geometric confetti in pink, cyan and black. Bright commercial studio lighting on the product in all four zones, glossy specular highlights, crisp soft shadow beneath it, ultra-realistic food rendering against completely flat graphic backgrounds. One oversized bold uppercase word sits across the centre where the four zones meet, reading SCOOP, in black condensed type with a thin white outline so it stays readable over every background. That single word is the only text in the image. High contrast, saturated Gen-Z colour, clean vector-flat backgrounds, no gradient and no drop shadow on the graphic shapes.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**§④(그리드는 칸별로 뽑아 합친다)의 «역방향» 사례다.**\n\n판단 기준 한 줄: **「칸 사이에 고정돼야 할 대상이 있는가?」**\n```\n있다  → 한 장으로     ★이 건 — 같은 제품이 네 번 나와야 캠페인 그리드가 된다\n없다  → 칸별 생성 후 합성 (서로 다른 주제 · 도시 · 장면)\n```\n칸별로 뽑으면 아이스크림이 칸마다 달라져 «캠페인»이 아니라 «네 장의 광고»가 된다.\n**Krea2가 한 구도를 만들어 놓고 미세 변주해 타일링하는 습성이 여기서는 바라던 동작이다.**\n선례: [[ouzhen599-identical-package-color-block-flavor-grid]] · [[missdelulu9-y2k-flash-party-triptych-collage]].\n\n★**대신 「무엇이 고정이고 무엇이 변수인지」를 프롬프트가 직접 말해야 한다.**\n```\n고정   ★\"같은 제품이 «매 구역마다 한 번씩 · 매번 동일하게» 촬영된다\" +\n       제품 서술을 «구체적으로»(와플콘 · 소프트 스월 · 크림 결 · 옆면 흘림 한 줄)\n변수   ★\"바뀌는 것은 «뒤의 배경 리듬»뿐\" + 네 구역의 배경을 각각 한 문장씩\n```\n원문의 자동 적응 지시(제품 유형에 따라 색·재료·소품을 알아서 바꿔라)는 **슬롯이라 그대로 두면\n누출된다** — 아이스크림으로 확정하고 팔레트도 핑크/시안/옐로/크림으로 실제 값을 채웠다(§gen_prompt 슬롯 규칙).\n\n★글자는 «네 구역이 만나는 중앙»에 한 단어만. 배경이 네 종류라 색을 고정하면 어딘가에서 묻는다 →\n**검정 + 흰 외곽선**으로 어느 배경에서도 읽히게 했다([[grid_repro]] 글자 밝기 규칙의 단일이미지판).",
