      "date": "2026-08-07",
      "lang": "en",
      "target_model": "GPT Image 2",
      "category": "포스터/광고",
      "title": "★인물 사진을 «에디토리얼 포스터»로 바꾸는 최소 조건 — 한 가지 «행동»을 정하고 그 주변에 색면과 타이포 층을 세우면 인물이 «소재»가 된다",
      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on Chatgpt \n\nPrompt:\nModern editorial poster design featuring a stylish young woman in a minimalist fashion look, seated at a cozy outdoor café holding a ceramic coffee cup, or captured from a dramatic low-angle while roller skating in an urban plaza. Clean neutral outfit in beige, cream, white, or monochrome tones with tailored blazer, relaxed trousers, or sporty streetwear. Large bold oversized sans-serif typography integrated behind and around the subject, with giant cropped letters spelling a single word (e.g., \"BREW\", \"ROLL\", \"CREATE\", \"MOVE\"), where the photo is seamlessly masked inside the typography. Elegant magazine layout on a warm off-white paper background with premium editorial composition. Minimal information panel on the right featuring small clean typography, title, series, time, date, visual notes, barcode, thin divider lines, and subtle graphic symbols. Warm golden-hour lighting, cinematic shadows, soft natural sunlight, muted earthy color palette, luxury fashion magazine aesthetic, Swiss graphic design, Bauhaus-inspired typography, contemporary poster layout, premium branding, negative space, ultra-clean composition, high-end editorial photography, realistic skin texture, sharp clothing details, subtle film grain, 35mm photography, Adobe InDesign style, Vogue × Kinfolk × Monocle aesthetic, print-ready, ultra-detailed, 8K, no watermark, no logo, no random text, only clean editable placeholder typography.",
      "gen_prompt": "A modern editorial poster in portrait format built around a single ordinary activity. A young woman in a minimal fashion look — a cream oversized shirt buttoned to the collarbone, wide camel trousers and flat leather shoes, fully covering — is seated at a small round table outside a café, holding a heavy ceramic cup in both hands and looking off to one side rather than at the camera. She is photographed cleanly and is not the whole picture: she sits in the lower right two thirds, cut off by the right edge of the frame. Behind and around her the poster is constructed as graphic design rather than photography — a large flat block of muted terracotta fills the upper left area behind her head, a thin dark rule runs the full width just below the top edge, and a wide band of warm off-white paper occupies the entire bottom of the sheet beneath her. One enormous uppercase headline sits across the terracotta block reading SLOWLY, set in a heavy grotesque and cropped by the left edge so the first letter is partly outside the sheet, with the woman's shoulder passing in front of the final letter as an opaque object so the word stays completely readable. One small uppercase line sits alone in the empty off-white band at the bottom reading NO 12. Those two pieces of text are the only text in the image. Soft natural daylight on the figure, flat even colour in the graphic blocks, fine paper grain over the whole sheet.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**같은 인물 사진이 «개인»으로 가느냐 «공개»로 가느냐는 이 한 걸음에서 갈린다.**\n\n이 계정의 다른 건들(스튜디오 남성 초상 · 들꽃 초원 인물 · 버스 스냅)은 전부 «인물이 감상 대상»이라\n개인 기준에 걸린다. 이 건만 다른 이유는 **«편집 층»이 화면에 실제로 있기 때문**이다 —\n원문이 `Modern editorial poster design`으로 시작하고 색면·타이포·여백을 함께 요구한다.\n런북 §공개/개인 판정: *\"인물이 들어가도 «타이포·그리드·정보층»이 함께 있으면 공개\"*.\n\n★**재현에서 「포스터」를 만드는 요소를 «면적»으로 적었다.** 형용사로는 안 나온다:\n```\n좌상단   ★«머리 뒤로» 큰 테라코타 «평면 색블록»\n상단     전폭 «가는 규칙선» 하나\n하단     ★시트 «전체 폭»의 오프화이트 종이 띠\n인물     ★화면 «전체»가 아니다 — 우하단 3분의 2에 앉고 «오른쪽 가장자리에서 잘린다»\n```\n인물을 «잘라내는 것»이 결정적이다. 전신이 온전히 들어오면 사진이 되고, 잘리면 «지면의 요소»가 된다.\n\n★글자는 §⑤ 네 조건 + [[derekwall-quiet-is-the-luxury-minimal-magazine-poster]]에서 확인된\n«불투명 오클루전»을 함께 걸었다 — 어깨가 마지막 글자 «앞»을 지나가되 단어는 온전히 읽힌다.\n반투명·발광이 지나가면 글자를 먹는다([[mrlarus-light-residue-blur-with-cause]]).\n\n⚠️의상은 피복 범위까지 명시했다(쇄골까지 잠근 셔츠 · 와이드 팬츠 · 플랫슈즈).",
