      "title": "★플랫 2D 벡터 슬롯 템플릿 — 전경·중경·배경 «세 층»을 못박고 조화 팔레트 + 대비 강조색 하나로 묶으면 어떤 장면이든 같은 화풍으로 나온다",
      "prompt": "Lost in your eyes, found in our forever. 🌉✨\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a flat 2D vector illustration of [MAIN SUBJECT] in [POSE/ACTION] at [LOCATION/SETTING]. The primary characters include [CHARACTER 1 DESCRIPTION] and [CHARACTER 2 DESCRIPTION], expressing [EMOTION/INTERACTION]. The environment features [ARCHITECTURAL ELEMENTS/LANDMARKS], [BRIDGE/ROAD/WATER FEATURE], and [SURROUNDING BUILDINGS OR LANDSCAPE]. Use clean outlines, simplified geometric shapes, and minimal shading in a modern vector style. Apply a harmonious color palette of [PRIMARY COLORS] with contrasting [ACCENT COLORS], creating a [MOOD/ATMOSPHERE]. Compose the scene with a balanced foreground, midground, and background, emphasizing depth while maintaining a clean, elegant, and stylized illustration aesthetic.",
      "gen_prompt": "A flat two-dimensional vector illustration with no gradients and no photographic texture anywhere. Two figures stand together at the railing of a long suspension bridge at dusk: a woman in a long mustard coat with her hair lifting slightly, and a man in a deep teal jacket and dark trousers beside her, both drawn as simplified geometric shapes with clean unbroken outlines of even weight and flat fills, their faces reduced to minimal features. The scene is built in three clearly separated depth layers: in the foreground, dark silhouetted railing posts and a few leaves cross the lower edge; in the midground, the two figures and the sweep of the bridge deck with its cables rising out of frame; in the background, a low city skyline of simple rectangular towers and a wide flat river, each further layer rendered in a lighter, less saturated tone so the depth reads purely through value. The palette is a harmonious range of dusk blues and slate greys carrying the whole picture, with mustard as the single contrasting accent appearing only on the coat, one window row and a thin band in the sky. Minimal shading — at most one flat shadow shape per object. Clean, elegant, stylised, and entirely free of text.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**슬롯 템플릿인데, 실제로 화풍을 잠그는 것은 «세 층»과 «팔레트 규칙» 둘이다.**\n```\n[MAIN SUBJECT] / [POSE/ACTION] / [LOCATION] / [CHARACTER 1·2] / [EMOTION] /\n[ARCHITECTURAL ELEMENTS] / [BRIDGE·ROAD·WATER] / [SURROUNDING] / [PRIMARY COLORS] / [ACCENT] / [MOOD]\n★공통 규칙  깨끗한 외곽선 · 단순화된 기하 형태 · «최소한의» 음영 ·\n           ★«전경·중경·배경»의 균형 — 깊이를 강조하되 깔끔하게\n```\n\n★**재현에서 「깊이」를 «명도»로만 만들게 했다.** 이게 플랫 벡터의 핵심 규칙이다:\n```\n★\"층이 멀어질수록 «더 밝고 덜 채도 높은» 톤 → 깊이가 «오직 명도로만» 읽힌다\"\n전경  난간 기둥과 잎 «실루엣»이 아래 가장자리를 가로지른다\n중경  두 인물 + 다리 상판과 «프레임 밖으로 올라가는» 케이블\n배경  단순 사각형 타워의 낮은 스카이라인 + 넓고 평평한 강\n```\n그림자를 «물체당 최대 하나의 납작한 형태»로 제한한 것도 같은 이유다 — 벡터는 음영이 늘면 무너진다.\n\n★강조색은 «나타나는 자리»를 셋으로 못박았다(코트 · 창문 한 줄 · 하늘의 가는 띠).\n\"accent color\"만 쓰면 화면 전체에 흩어진다 — [[ouzhen599-calm-grid-holds-the-emotional-detonation]]에서\n확인된 «어디에 무슨 색»까지 적어야 한다는 규칙과 같다.",
      "ref_image": "results/noorwithwifi-flat-vector-three-depth-slots-ref.jpg",
