      "title": "★식료품 저장고를 «사람의 기억»으로 찍는다 — 유리병에 담긴 재료를 나열하되 «누가 오래 써온 공간»의 흔적(라벨의 손글씨·닳은 나무·기울어진 줄)을 넣으면 인테리어 컷이 서사가 된다",
      "prompt": "Prompt ⬇️\n\nUltra-realistic cozy Saudi grandma’s pantry, rustic wooden shelves filled with clear glass jars of flour, sugar, oats, rice, pasta, lentils, beans, cardamom, saffron and traditional spices, warm natural sunlight coming through a small window behind the shelves. In the center, a beautifully decorated traditional Arabic dallah as the main visual focus, surrounded by small Arabic coffee cups, a plate of premium dates, cardamom jars, saffron, a small mabkhara incense burner, and subtle Sadu textile details. Vintage enamel bowls, folded kitchen towels, hanging dried herbs and garlic, wooden kitchen tools, woven baskets and traditional household objects. A sleeping cat resting on a colorful Sadu-style cushion at the bottom of the pantry, soft foreground blur with a basket of dates and fruit, warm earthy brown and beige tones, nostalgic Saudi home atmosphere, intimate storytelling, cottagecore meets Saudi heritage, cinematic photography, shallow depth of field, soft dust particles in the sunlight, highly detailed textures, photorealistic, premium editorial composition, 8K, no modern objects, no watermark.",
      "gen_prompt": "A warm photograph of a home pantry that clearly belongs to one person who has used it for decades. Rustic wooden shelves, worn pale at the front edges where hands have reached across them for years, hold rows of clear glass jars filled with flour, sugar, oats, rice, pasta, lentils, beans, cardamom pods, saffron threads and dark whole spices, the contents forming bands of colour from bone white through amber to deep rust. The jars are not styled into perfect alignment — some sit slightly forward, a few lids are mismatched, one row leans against the wall, and small handwritten paper labels curl at their corners. Between them sit the traces of use: a worn wooden scoop resting in the flour jar, a folded cloth, a small brass measuring cup gone dull, a scatter of loose grains on the shelf. Warm natural sunlight comes in low from one side through an unseen window, passing through the glass so the contents glow from within and throwing long soft shadows of the jars across the boards behind. Deep shadow in the corners of the shelving. Photoreal, macro detail on the grain and the glass, shallow depth of field falling off toward the back. There is no readable text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**\"할머니의 팬트리\"라는 소재를 «인테리어 컷»이 아니라 «사람의 기억»으로 만드는 것은 «흔적»이다.**\n\n원문은 재료 나열과 따뜻한 자연광까지만 준다. 재현에서 **«오래 쓴 흔적»을 추가로 못박은 것**이\n이 항목의 학습 지점이다:\n```\n공간   ★선반 «앞모서리»가 «손이 오간 자리»에서 «닳아 희게» 변색\n정렬   ★완벽히 정렬하지 «않는다» — 몇 개는 «앞으로 나오고», 뚜껑이 «짝이 안 맞고»,\n       한 줄은 «벽에 기대어» 있고, 손글씨 라벨의 «모서리가 말려» 있다\n사용   밀가루 병에 «꽂혀 있는» 닳은 나무 스쿱 · 접힌 천 · «광이 죽은» 놋쇠 계량컵 ·\n       ★선반 위에 «흩어진 낟알 몇 개»\n```\n★**\"완벽히 정렬하지 않는다\"가 가장 강하게 작동한다.** 팬트리 사진은 기본적으로 «정돈»으로 수렴하는데,\n어긋남을 «개수와 방식»으로 지정해야 «누가 쓰는 공간»이 된다.\n\n★조명도 유리를 통과시켜 «안에서 빛나게» 했다 — 반투명 대상의 공통 규칙\n([[ksa8turky-props-that-explain-the-product]]의 꿀, [[noorwithwifi-layers-are-the-product-cafe-poster]]의 음료와 같다).",
