      "category": "포스터/광고",
      "title": "★파스텔 종이 콜라주 «와이드 풍경» — 랜드마크 하나를 «알아볼 수 있는 앵커»로 세우고 나머지는 미니멀하게 눌러, 도시가 한 장의 조용한 지면이 되게 한다",
      "prompt": "Pastel Paper-Collage Style Illustration \n\nGPT Image 2.0\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a refined wide landscape illustration of [CITY/SUBJECT], featuring [ICONIC LANDMARK] as the main recognizable visual anchor.\nSTYLE: Minimal, elegant pastel paper-collage travel poster. Stylized rather than realistic, using clean geometric shapes, layered paper cutouts, crisp silhouettes, soft curves, subtle 3D paper relief, matte gouache texture, delicate paper grain, raised edges, gentle cut-paper shadows, and refined editorial illustration.\nCOMPOSITION: Spacious horizontal layout with [ICONIC LANDMARK] clearly recognizable through its [DISTINCTIVE FEATURES]. Surround it with simplified [CONTEXTUAL ELEMENTS], tiny people for scale, relevant vegetation, architecture, landscape, transportation, and cultural details. Generous negative space, strong visual hierarchy, balanced layering, calm open sky.\nCOLORS: Toned-down harmonious pastels — soft sky blue, blue-gray, sage, mint, cream, beige, pale stone, dusty coral, peach, muted yellow, off-white, with minimal dark accents. Naturally adapt colors to [CITY/SUBJECT] and its cultural/environmental identity.\nMOOD: Bright soft daylight, gentle shadows, calm, cultured, poetic, optimistic, leisurely, sophisticated.\nTYPOGRAPHY: Upper-left: '[CITY/SUBJECT NAME]' in uppercase geometric sans-serif, widely tracked, white. Below: '[LOCAL LANGUAGE · TRANSLATION]' and '[LANDMARK/SUBTITLE]', small, white, left-aligned, airy spacing.\nAVOID: Photorealism, heavy outlines, excessive detail, messy brushwork, neon colors, dark lighting, excessive gradients, clutter, inaccurate cultural elements, readable signage, logos, watermarks.\nFINAL: A premium collectible travel-poster illustration — tactile, minimal, recognizable, culturally authentic, softly cheerful, and visually restful.\nVARIABLES:\n[ CITY/SUBJECT ] = Target destination or subject\n[ ICONIC LANDMARK ] = Main visual anchor\n[ DISTINCTIVE FEATURES ] = Recognizable characteristics\n[ CONTEXTUAL ELEMENTS ] = Supporting local details\n[ CITY/SUBJECT NAME ] = Main title\n[ LOCAL LANGUAGE · TRANSLATION ] = Local title + translation\n[ LANDMARK/SUBTITLE ] = Short descriptive subtitle.Aspect Ratio 4:5",
      "gen_prompt": "A wide minimal landscape illustration of a coastal city, built entirely from cut and torn pastel paper layers photographed flat so each layer casts a small soft shadow on the one beneath. One landmark anchors the whole picture and is the only element rendered with real detail: a tall bell tower standing slightly right of centre, built from four or five carefully cut paper pieces with its arcade openings and roof pitch clearly readable, so the place is instantly recognisable. Everything else is deliberately reduced — the surrounding rooftops are simple overlapping rectangles and triangles with no windows, the hills behind are three flat torn bands in receding tones, the sea is one long strip with a single lighter band for surf, and a few birds are tiny paper crescents. The palette is chalky pastel throughout with no saturated colour anywhere: dusty terracotta, sage, chalk blue, bone and pale butter. Every piece shows a torn white fibrous edge on at least one side. Flat even light from slightly above with subtle drop shadows giving genuine layer depth, real paper grain and fibre visible. Generous empty sky occupies the upper third. There is no text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**같은 «파스텔 종이 콜라주»인데 [[naiknelofar788-city-told-through-its-food]]와 논지가 다르다.**\n```\n저쪽   도시를 «음식»으로 소개한다 — 대표를 «무엇으로 세울까»의 문제\n★이쪽  도시를 «랜드마크 하나»로 앵커링하고 «나머지를 미니멀하게 누른다» — «밀도 배분»의 문제\n```\n★원문: *\"[ICONIC LANDMARK]를 «주요 «알아볼 수 있는» 시각 앵커»로 삼고 · STYLE: Minimal…\"*\n\n★재현에서 «앵커 하나만 디테일»을 물리적으로 못박았다. 안 그러면 도시 전체가 균일하게 정교해진다:\n```\n★앵커    «화면에서 «유일하게» 실제 디테일로 렌더되는 요소» —\n         종이 «네다섯 조각»으로 만들되 «아케이드 개구부와 지붕 경사»가 «분명히 읽히게»\n그 외    ★의도적으로 «축소» — 주변 지붕은 «창문 없는» 단순 사각·삼각,\n         언덕은 «찢은 띠 세 개», 바다는 «한 줄 + 파도용 밝은 띠 하나», 새는 «작은 초승달»\n```\n★**\"창문 없는\"** 같은 «빼기 지시»가 미니멀을 실제로 만든다 — \"minimal\"이라고만 쓰면 안 줄어든다.\n찢긴 흰 섬유 가장자리·층 그림자는 종이를 종이로 만드는 공통 조건이다.",
