      "title": "★초현실 코미디는 «실패하는 순간»에 셔터를 끊는다 — 물리는 사실적으로 두고 «전제만» 말이 안 되게 하면 웃기면서도 사진으로 읽힌다",
      "prompt": "Some fun using GPT IMAGE 2\nPrompt:\n\nUltra-realistic surreal cinematic photography, 8K.\n\nA young woman wearing a bright turquoise oversized T-shirt, purple sweatpants, and colorful sneakers, accidentally being pulled across the living room by an enormous runaway vacuum cleaner.\n\nGesture: both hands desperately gripping the vacuum hose, body leaning backward, one foot sliding across the floor, face showing exaggerated surprise mixed with uncontrollable laughter.\n\nEnvironment: surreal living room disaster, enormous vacuum cleaner racing across the floor, rugs flying upward, cushions spinning through the air, books floating, curtains swirling dramatically, colorful household objects suspended in mid-air, a glowing wall sign saying \"Challenge Trouble\".\n\nMood: cheerful, chaotic, absurd, hilarious, goofy, ridiculous, full-color.\n\nCamera angle: dynamic side-angle tracking composition, capturing the woman's entire body and the runaway vacuum cleaner.\n\nUltra-realistic photography, cinematic lighting, vibrant colors, realistic motion implied through composition, highly detailed textures, exaggerated comedic energy.\n2",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-realistic surreal cinematic photograph, caught at the exact instant something is going wrong. A young woman in a bright turquoise oversized T-shirt, purple sweatpants and colourful trainers is being pulled off her feet by an enormous inflated shopping bag that has caught the wind like a sail: her heels have just left the pavement, her arms are extended and locked, her shirt and hair stream backwards, and her expression is caught between surprise and laughter rather than fear. Everything except the premise obeys ordinary physics — the bag deforms where the air pushes it and where her hands grip it, her shadow and the bag's shadow both fall in the same direction and are correctly separated by height, a dropped water bottle is already rolling on the ground beside her with motion blur, and her clothing folds where her body actually bends. The setting is a completely mundane suburban street with parked cars and a hedge, photographed in flat natural daylight. Real skin texture, believable fabric, genuine camera motion blur only on the fastest-moving parts. There is no text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**초현실 코미디를 «사진»으로 만드는 조건은 «셔터를 끊는 시점»이다.**\n원문 시리즈는 전부 *\"accidentally being pulled…\" · \"attempting an absurd Challenge Trouble…\"* 로\n**«실패가 진행 중인 순간»**을 지정한다.\n\n★재현에서 그 순간을 «신체 상태»로 쪼갰다 — \"being pulled\"만으로는 정지 포즈가 나온다:\n```\n★«뒤꿈치가 «막» 보도에서 떨어졌다» · 팔은 «뻗어 잠겼고» · 셔츠와 머리가 «뒤로 흐르고» ·\n표정은 «두려움이 아니라» «놀람과 웃음 사이»\n```\n★그리고 **전제를 제외한 «모든 것»을 평범한 물리에 묶었다** —\n[[gdgtify-one-impossible-premise-obedient-light]]와 같은 규칙이다:\n```\n가방은 «공기가 미는 자리»와 «손이 쥔 자리»에서 변형되고 · 인물과 가방의 그림자가 «같은 방향»이며\n«높이 차이만큼» 떨어져 있고 · 떨어뜨린 물병이 «이미 굴러가며» 모션블러가 걸려 있고 ·\n옷은 «몸이 실제로 접히는 곳»에서 접힌다\n★모션블러는 «가장 빠른 부분에만»\n```\n★**떨어뜨린 물병이 «이미» 굴러간다**가 시간을 만든다 — 사고는 «시작된 뒤»여야 사진이 된다.",
      "ref_image": "results/imshahid7-absurd-challenge-caught-mid-fail-ref.jpg",
