      "title": "★초광각 톱다운으로 «카메라를 멀리 밀면» 식탁이 무대가 된다 — 왜곡을 결함이 아니라 구도로 쓰는 법",
      "prompt": "Nano banana pro promotional and Cinematic Prompt☕️ ⤵️\n\nUltra-wide-angle hyper-realistic shooting in top-down mode. A group of 4 real people sitting at a square dining table. The camera is pushed far back, creating a significant negative space (empty floor area) around the people and the table, which provides a clear, minimalistic composition. Scene [ATMOSPHERE AND CLOTHING]: Four people are dressed in [STYLE OF CLOTHING]. Their interaction is specific: [DESCRIBE EACH PERSON'S ACTIONS]. The table is a custom-made physical prop, designed as an Instagram post: it has a solid white stripe ONLY along the top and bottom edges (no white frames on the left or right). - The upper white stripe shows a drawn profile photo with [LOGO DESCRIPTION], the username \"[USERNAME]\", followed by a small blue icon with a confirmed check mark, and \"...\" on the right. - Red hearts, comment and share icons are painted on the bottom white stripe on the left, and a Bookmarks icon on the right. The center of the table is filled in [THE EXACT COLOR OF THE CENTER and the hexadecimal CODE]. The table shows [FOOD ITEMS/ITEM DESCRIPTIONS]. important: ALL food, beverages, objects, and hands that interact with them must be located strictly within this central area, colored in [COLOR]. NOTHING should go beyond the white stripes or beyond the table. The background of the floor is made in [THE COLOR OF THE FLOOR] to create a visual separation. Professional studio lighting with clear shadows. 8k, clear focus.\n\nModel: Nano banana pro \n\n #NanoBananaPro",
      "gen_prompt": "An ultra-wide-angle photograph taken from directly overhead, with the camera pushed far back and high so the whole scene sits small in the middle of a large frame. Four adults sit around a square dining table, one to a side, seen from straight above so their heads and shoulders read as four shapes arranged around a bright square. The extreme wide lens bends the geometry deliberately: the table edges bow slightly outward, the figures at the frame's edge stretch and lean away from centre, and the floorboards radiate outward from the middle of the picture — the distortion is used as composition rather than corrected away. The table is dense with real food, plates, glasses, hands mid-reach and shared dishes, and it is the brightest thing in the frame; the floor around it falls away darker in every direction so the table reads as a lit stage. All four sets of hands are doing something specific — pouring, serving, reaching, resting. Warm overhead light with a single consistent shadow direction, photoreal detail on the food, deep shadow at the frame corners. There is no text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**초광각 + 톱다운의 조합에서 «왜곡»을 결함으로 보지 않고 «구도»로 쓰는 프롬프트다.**\n\n원문 핵심: *\"Ultra-wide-angle … in top-down mode. …\n★the camera is «pushed far back», creating…\"*\n\n★재현에서 왜곡을 «어디에 어떻게 나타나는지»로 적었다. \"wide-angle\"만으로는 그냥 넓게 나온다:\n```\n★\"식탁 가장자리가 «바깥으로 살짝 휘고»\"\n★\"프레임 «가장자리»의 인물이 «늘어나며 중심에서 멀어지듯 기울고»\"\n★\"마룻널이 화면 «한가운데»에서 «방사»된다\"\n★\"«보정하지 않고» 구도로 쓴다\"\n```\n★그리고 «카메라를 멀리 민» 효과를 «장면이 큰 프레임 «가운데 작게» 앉는다»로 번역했다 —\n이게 없으면 식탁이 화면을 꽉 채워 왜곡이 안 보인다.\n\n★식탁을 «무대»로 만드는 것도 조명이다 — «식탁이 화면에서 가장 밝고, 바닥은 사방으로 어두워진다».\n그리고 네 쌍의 손에 «각자 할 일»을 줬다(따르기·덜기·뻗기·쉬기) —\n[[gdgtify-one-key-across-distinct-individuals]]의 «모든 손에 각자의 할 일»과 같은 규칙.",
      "ref_image": "results/maddoxdigital-ultrawide-topdown-table-ref.jpg",
      "result": "results/maddoxdigital-ultrawide-topdown-table.webp",
      "seed": 1496462744,
      "private": false
