      "title": "★제품 사진을 «세 칸 콜라주»로 — 극단 매크로(착용부) · 제품 단독 · 상황컷을 한 줄에 두면 한 장이 «상세페이지»를 대신한다",
      "prompt": "Nano banana pro promotional and Cinematic Prompt🕶 ⤵️\n\nThree-panel collage product photography of [product from uploaded photo]. Left panel: extreme close-up macro shot of a young woman's eye area wearing the product, showing intricate texture and craftsmanship detail, natural skin tone, shallow depth of field, warm directional lighting. Top-right panel: clean studio product shot of the item alone resting on a flat surface at a three-quarter angle, seamless light gray background, soft even studio lighting with subtle shadow, sharp focus showcasing full design and material detail. Bottom-right panel: close-up beauty portrait of a young woman model wearing the product, direct or slightly angled gaze at camera, neutral warm-toned background, soft flattering studio lighting, editorial fashion photography aesthetic. Consistent silver/metallic tone and lighting mood across all three panels, high-resolution commercial photography, thin black divider lines between panels\n\nModel: Nano banana pro \n\n #NanoBananaPro",
      "gen_prompt": "A three-panel product collage arranged in one horizontal row with thin even gaps between the panels, all three sharing the same light direction and the same colour grade so they read as one piece. The left panel is an extreme macro of the eye area of an adult woman wearing a pair of thin-framed sunglasses: only from brow to cheekbone is in frame, skin texture and lash detail fully resolved, the lens edge and the temple arm crisp against her skin. The centre panel is the product alone — the same sunglasses folded on a plain stone surface, lit to show the hinge, the frame profile and the lens tint, with a small hard shadow beneath. The right panel is the situation: the same woman seen from the chest up outdoors in daylight, wearing the sunglasses and a plain light shirt that fully covers her, looking off-frame, the background thrown soft. Scale steps down cleanly from panel to panel — huge, then medium, then small — so the eye reads detail, then object, then context. Warm neutral palette, photoreal commercial finish, no text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**세 칸에 «다른 배율»을 배정해 한 장으로 상세페이지를 대신하는 구성이다.**\n```\n좌   ★극단 매크로 — «착용 부위»만(눈가). 재질과 마감을 «증명»한다\n중   제품 «단독» — 힌지·프레임 단면·렌즈 틴트가 보이게\n우   «상황» — 실제로 쓰는 장면\n```\n★**핵심은 「배율이 한 방향으로 계단처럼 내려간다」는 것이다** —\n크게 → 중간 → 작게. 그래서 눈이 «디테일 → 물체 → 맥락» 순으로 읽는다.\n[[gdgtify-magazine-spread-built-in-acts]]가 «시간»으로 계단을 만들었다면 이건 «배율»로 만든다.\n\n★재현에서 세 칸을 «하나»로 묶는 조건도 넣었다 — **«같은 광 방향 · 같은 컬러 그레이드»**.\n이게 없으면 세 장을 붙인 콜라주로 보인다([[gdgtify-diagonal-split-screen-ad-archive]]와 같은 규칙).\n\n⚠️의상은 피복 범위를 명시했다(밝은 셔츠, 전신 덮음).",
