      "title": "★매크로에서 «밀랍 같은 AI 질감»을 피하는 법 — 개체마다 «다른 길이·굵기·기울기»를 주고, «어긋난 겹침»과 «층 사이의 검은 틈»을 명시한다",
      "prompt": "Macro detail that holds up close. Water droplets, petal texture, insect skin — sharp where it needs to be, soft where it doesn't.\n\nRecraft V4.1 renders fine natural detail without the waxy AI look.\n\nPrompts ↓ https://t.co/gEzqphNC6S\n\n---\nPrompt 1:\nStudio macro photograph of three spider chrysanthemums (Chrysanthemum morifolium) against a solid black background, supported by thick green stems of varying length and thickness in an overlapping, staggered cluster. The flowers are wet with numerous clear water droplets. Each bloom contains hundreds of long, narrow, curling petals in saturated copper-orange, burnt sienna, and dark red, radiating from compact golden centers. The thin petals twist in different directions, creating a dense tangled silhouette with deep black gaps between layers. One lower-left bloom is smaller, tilted sharply downward, and partially obscured. The color palette is limited to copper, orange, burnt red, muted green, and black. Lighting is artificial, hard, and directional from top-front-left, producing sharp highlights on droplets and soft shadows within the dense petal structure. No vase, soil, roots, insects, people, text, or decorative props are visible.\n\nPrompt 2:\nStudio macro photograph of a golden poison frog (Phyllobates terribilis) against a solid black background, showing one compact frog in a low crouched pose with its forelimbs planted forward and hind legs folded into an overlapping silhouette. The skin is wet with numerous clear water droplets. Its body is luminous yellow with subtle golden-orange variation across the back, darker ochre shading around the limbs, and smooth rounded contours. The head is broad and slightly flattened, with small black eyes and short delicate toes ending in dark rounded tips. The frog faces slightly left while its body angles toward the camera, creating an asymmetric profile. Water droplets form a fine film and beads across the crown, back, and thighs, creating glossy texture. Lighting is artificial, hard, and directional from top-front-left, producing strong highlights on droplets and soft shadows beneath the body folds. The color palette is limited to yellow, gold, ochre, muted brown, and black, with a cool-neutral temperature. The composition is asymmetric, captured from eye-level to slightly high angle. No plants, leaves, soil, prey, or other animals are visible.\n\nPrompt 3:\nStudio macro photograph of four passionflowers (Passiflora caerulea) against a solid black background, supported by slender curling green stems in an overlapping, staggered cluster. The flowers are wet with numerous clear water droplets. Each blossom has pale ivory petals, a dense corona of alternating violet and white filaments, five dark purple anthers, and three sculptural green stigmas at the center. The radial structures overlap irregularly, creating intricate shadows and layered depth. One lower-left flower is smaller, turned slightly sideways, and partially obscured. The color palette is limited to ivory, violet, deep purple, green, and black. Lighting is artificial, hard, and directional from top-front-left, creating bright highlights on droplets and soft shadows within the radial filaments. No vase, soil, roots, insects, people, text, or decorative props are visible.\n\nPrompt 4:\nStudio macro photograph of seven green hellebore flowers (Helleborus viridis) against a solid black background, supported by slender pale-green stems of varying length and thickness in an overlapping, downward-facing cluster. The flowers are wet with numerous clear water droplets. Each blossom has five waxy lime-green sepals, subtly translucent edges, a dense center of cream-colored stamens, and faint darker green veining. The flowers hang at different angles, creating a quiet, suspended composition. One lower-left blossom is smaller, almost closed, and partly obscured behind two larger blooms. The color palette is limited to lime green, moss green, cream, pale yellow, and black. Lighting is artificial, hard, and directional from top-front-left, producing glossy highlights on the wet sepals and soft shadows within the cupped flowers. No vase, soil, roots, insects, people, text, or decorative props are visible.",
      "gen_prompt": "A studio macro photograph of three spider chrysanthemums against a solid black background, lit so the flowers glow and the background stays absolutely black. The three blooms are deliberately not uniform: they are supported by thick green stems of clearly different lengths and thicknesses, overlapping in a staggered cluster rather than sitting side by side, and one lower-left bloom is noticeably smaller, tilted sharply downward and partially hidden behind the others. Each bloom is built from hundreds of long narrow curling petals radiating from a compact golden centre, and the petals twist in different directions so the silhouette is dense and tangled, with deep black gaps opening between the layers. The flowers are wet: numerous clear water droplets sit on the petals, each one holding its own tiny highlight and casting a small distinct shadow onto the petal beneath. The palette is limited to copper orange, burnt sienna and dark red with the golden centres. Sharp focus falls on the nearest petal edges and the droplets while the furthest petals soften, so the image is crisp where it needs to be and soft where it does not. No waxy plastic surface anywhere. There is no text in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**\"Recraft V4.1은 «밀랍 같은 AI 룩» 없이 미세한 자연 디테일을 렌더한다\"** — 그 «없음»을\n프롬프트가 어떻게 만들어내는지가 이 항목의 학습 지점이다.\n\n★**밀랍 질감의 원인은 «균일함»이다.** 원문이 그것을 개체 수준에서 깨뜨린다:\n```\n★\"«길이와 굵기가 서로 다른» 두꺼운 초록 줄기\"\n★\"«겹치고 어긋난» 무리 — 나란히가 아니라\n★\"왼쪽 아래 꽃 «하나»는 «더 작고», «급하게 아래로 기울고», «부분적으로 가려져» 있다\"\n★\"꽃잎이 «서로 다른 방향»으로 비틀린다 → 실루엣이 «빽빽하고 엉키고»,\n   ★«층 사이에 깊은 검은 틈»이 열린다\"\n```\n★**\"층 사이의 검은 틈\"** 이 결정적이다. 이게 없으면 꽃이 «한 덩어리 플라스틱»이 된다.\n\n★물방울도 «각각»으로 적었다 — «저마다 «자기 하이라이트»를 갖고 «아래 꽃잎에 «각자의» 작은 그림자»를 던진다».\n\"water droplets\"만 쓰면 표면에 얼룩처럼 붙는다.\n\n★초점도 «선택적»으로 — «가장 가까운 꽃잎 가장자리와 물방울은 선명, 가장 먼 꽃잎은 물러난다».\n원문의 *\"sharp where it needs to be, soft where it doesn't\"* 를 그대로 실행한 것.",
