      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on CHATGPT \n\nPRODUCT :\nBRAND :\nDESCRIPTION : [AUTO]\nPRICE :\nCreate a premium minimalist commercial food photography scene in a clean editorial bakery style. professionally enhance the photo to make the product look more appetizing and suitable for commercial use. Do not alter the product in any way—preserve its original appearance, shape, texture, color, and proportions exactly as they are. \nratio 4:5.\nCreate a premium tropical minimalist café background with large lush Monstera Deliciosa leaves placed naturally behind the product.\nThe background should feature:\nLarge mature Monstera leaves with rich emerald green color, soft blurred indoor café environment, bright white wall with subtle natural daylight, strong depth of field with creamy bokeh, leaves positioned asymmetrically around the frame, creating natural framing without covering the product, minimalist modern café aesthetic, soft diffused daylight coming from the left side, clean, fresh, relaxing atmosphere, realistic indoor tropical plants, no flowers, no wooden shelves, no decorations, no hanging lights, no people, no text, no logo.\nLighting:\nNatural morning daylight with soft highlights and gentle shadows.\nColor Palette:\nEmerald Green, Fresh White, Soft Neutral Grey, Natural Cream\nLens:\n85mm DSLR, f/2.0, Shallow Depth of Field, Ultra smooth background blur\nMood:\nPremium café, Fresh, Organic, Minimalist, Instagram-worthy, Luxury beverage advertisement\nUltra photorealistic.\nCommercial food photography.\nTypography (Minimal Editorial Style):\nReserve the upper-left area as a clean typography zone.\nAdd a minimalist left-aligned editorial text layout consisting of:\nBrand Name: placed at the top left, large but elegant, modern luxury typography, clean minimalist sans-serif or refined high-end editorial serif, medium font weight, generous letter spacing, pure black or very dark charcoal, no outline, no shadow, no decorative effects.\nProduct Name: positioned directly below the brand name, noticeably smaller than the brand name, regular font weight, minimalist elegant font, comfortable line spacing, aligned perfectly with the brand name, dark charcoal color, subtle visual hierarchy.\nTypography should feel similar to luxury Scandinavian cafés, premium bakeries, cosmetic campaigns, and modern editorial magazines.\nOverall typography must remain: minimal, sophisticated, timeless, elegant, premium, highly readable, well-balanced with generous whitespace.\nAvoid: bold heavy fonts, script fonts, handwritten fonts, playful fonts, bubble fonts, condensed fonts, colorful typography, outlines, gradients, drop shadows, glow effects, excessive text, busy layouts.\nMaintain approximately 8–12% margin from the left edge and 8–10% margin from the top edge. Ensure the typography never overlaps the products and always preserves generous negative space.\npremium editorial magazine layout featuring refined typographic hierarchy. Use multiple text sizes, elegant spacing, subtle micro typography, small uppercase category labels, thin divider lines, refined alignment, and tasteful editorial composition similar to luxury magazines. Keep the layout minimal, sophisticated, and balanced without overwhelming the product.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium minimalist commercial food photograph in a clean studio setting. One product is the hero: a single tall glass jar of thick artisanal berry preserve with a plain matte lid, standing slightly right of centre on a smooth pale limestone surface against a seamless warm off-white background. The restraint is the point — only three supporting elements are present and each is spaced well apart: a small pile of fresh berries, one clean spoon laid flat with a thick smear of the preserve across it, and a single sprig of leaves. Nothing is clustered and nothing else is in frame. More than half the picture is empty surface and background. Soft directional light comes from the upper left through a large diffuser, modelling the curve of the glass, passing through the preserve so it glows deep and translucent from within, and leaving one soft gradient shadow to the right. Macro detail on the fruit texture and the sugar crystals at the rim, shallow depth of field with the label edge tack sharp, premium commercial finish. There is no text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**슬롯 구조가 곧 광고 브리프다:**\n```\nPRODUCT : / BRAND : / DESCRIPTION : [AUTO] / PRICE :\n```\n★`DESCRIPTION`에 `[AUTO]`가 박혀 있다 — **제품명과 가격만 주면 설명을 «추론»하게 하는 구조**.\n[[gdgtify-one-benefit-becomes-two-statements]]와 같은 계열의 «최소 입력» 엔진이다.\n\n★**\"프리미엄 미니멀\"을 «개수와 면적»으로 강제한 것**이 재현의 요령이다.\n형용사로 두면 소품이 계속 늘어난다:\n```\n★소품은 «정확히 셋»이고 «서로 충분히 떨어져» 있다 · «모여 있지 않다» · «그 외에는 아무것도 없다»\n★화면의 «절반 이상»이 빈 면과 배경\n```\n[[ksa8turky-props-that-explain-the-product]]가 «소품의 선정 기준»(정체성을 설명하는 것)을 다뤘다면,\n이 건은 «소품의 총량»을 다룬다 — **둘을 같이 걸면 제품 사진의 절반은 해결된다.**\n\n★반투명 제품이라 «빛이 잼을 «통과»해 안에서 깊고 투명하게 빛난다»를 못박았다(공통 규칙).",
