      "prompt": "Gpt image 2 on ChatGpt\n\nPROMPT:\n\nEditorial flat-vector portrait of [CHARACTER] in a tight bust crop and three-quarter view, with the head tilted slightly downward, wearing [EYEWEAR] and [ACCESSORY]. Style the hair as [HAIRCUT] and dress the subject in [CLOTHING] with a high sculptural collar. Render the face, hair, clothing, and accessories as clean interlocking color shapes with sharp geometric edges, hard-edged shadows, minimal linework, and no gradients. Limit the artwork to [COLORS]. Place the figure against [BACKGROUND], using one simple rectangular shadow shape to frame the head without clutter. Keep the expression calm and self-assured, the silhouette bold, and the composition sleek, fashion-forward, and graphic; Vertical 4:5 aspect ratio.",
      "gen_prompt": "An editorial flat-vector portrait in a tight bust crop, three-quarter view, with the head tilted slightly. The subject is an original woman with cropped dark curls and small gold hoop earrings, wearing a high-necked rust-orange top. She is drawn in completely flat unmodulated colour with no gradients, no photographic texture and no rendered volume: one flat shape for the hair, one for the face, simple flat shapes for the features, and at most one additional flat shadow shape per form to suggest the turn of the head. The outline is a clean even-weight line where it appears at all, and much of the form is defined by colour meeting colour rather than by outline. The crop is deliberately tight — the top of the head and both shoulders run off the edges of the frame, so the face fills most of the picture. The background is a single flat field of muted sage that shares no value with the skin or the top, so the silhouette reads cleanly. The palette is limited to four flats: rust orange, warm sand skin, deep ink for the hair and features, and the sage ground. Fine offset print grain over the whole image and a slight registration offset on one colour. There is no text in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**슬롯이 셋인데 «구도»가 프롬프트에 «박혀» 있는 형태다.**\n```\n[CHARACTER] 만 바뀌고 —\n★\"tight «bust crop»\" · ★\"«three-quarter» view\" · ★\"head tilted «slightly»\"\n```\n★**구도를 슬롯 밖으로 빼서 «고정»한 것**이 시리즈를 만드는 방법이다.\n[[mrlarus-same-camera-language-different-worlds]]의 «카메라 언어 고정»과 같은 축인데,\n이쪽은 사진이 아니라 «일러스트 구도»를 고정한다.\n\n★재현에서 «플랫»을 무너뜨리지 않는 조건을 셋 적었다:\n```\n① 그라디언트·사진 질감·입체 렌더링 «없음»\n② ★형태마다 «추가 평면 그림자는 최대 하나» — 고개 돌림만 암시\n③ ★윤곽선이 «있는 곳에서만» 균일한 굵기, ★형태의 상당 부분은 «색과 색이 만나» 정의된다\n```\n③이 핵심이다 — 모든 형태에 외곽선을 두르면 «스티커»가 되고,\n색 경계로 형태를 만들면 «에디토리얼»이 된다.\n[[ane5mama-uniform-thick-line-minimal-vector]]와 정확히 반대 선택 — 저쪽은 «균일한 굵은 선»이 스타일이다.\n\n★그리고 «배경이 피부·상의와 «명도를 공유하지 않게»» 못박아 실루엣이 뭉개지지 않게 했다.",
