      "title": "★동화책 일러스트의 «온기»는 색이 아니라 «구체적인 생활 소품»에서 온다 — 니트 비니·오버사이즈 스웨터처럼 만질 수 있는 것들을 세어 넣는다",
      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on Chatgpt \n\nPrompt:\n Whimsical storybook illustration of a young woman with short blonde hair wearing a mustard knit beanie, oversized dark coat, and cozy outdoor clothing, gently holding a fluffy Australian Shepherd puppy in her arms beside a cascading forest waterfall. Peaceful woodland atmosphere with moss-covered rocks, wildflowers, lush green foliage, and soft flowing water. Warm earthy color palette of olive green, beige, cream, muted brown, and golden ochre. Hand-drawn ink outlines with delicate watercolor textures, subtle paper grain, painterly brushstrokes, soft diffused natural lighting, calm and nostalgic mood, expressive eyes, detailed fur, cinematic composition, cozy adventure aesthetic, Scandinavian nature vibes, children's storybook illustration, vintage botanical art influence, highly detailed foliage, serene composition, premium editorial illustration, ultra-detailed, 8K, no text, no logo, no watermark.\n\nAlternative variation (forest walk):\nVintage watercolor storybook illustration of a young woman walking her fluffy Australian Shepherd puppy through a peaceful pine forest on a wooden boardwalk. She wears a floral fleece pullover, loose black hiking pants, sneakers, round sunglasses, and a small crossbody bag. Tall pine trees, wooden stairs, wild daisies, soft morning sunlight filtering through the forest, tranquil outdoor adventure atmosphere. Delicate ink line art combined with watercolor washes, muted natural colors, textured handmade paper, cozy cottagecore aesthetic, Scandinavian illustration style, botanical details, cinematic framing, soft shadows, detailed fur, gentle nostalgic mood, premium children's book artwork, highly detailed, ultra-realistic watercolor texture, 8K, no text, no watermark.",
      "gen_prompt": "A whimsical storybook illustration of a young woman with short blonde hair wearing a mustard knit beanie, an oversized cream cable-knit sweater with visibly loose cuffs, and dark corduroy trousers, sitting on a low wooden stool in a small cluttered workshop. The warmth comes from specific tangible things rather than from colour grading: a chipped enamel mug of something hot with real steam curling from it, a folded wool blanket slipping off the stool behind her, a cat asleep in a cardboard box by her feet, mismatched jars of brushes, and a string of small warm bulbs sagging across the back wall. She is occupied rather than posed — leaning forward with her elbows on her knees, turning a small carved wooden bird over in her hands and looking at it, not at the viewer. The rendering is illustrative rather than photographic: soft painted shapes, visible brush texture, gentle unmodelled shadows, slightly imperfect edges, and no photorealism anywhere. The palette is warm and limited — mustard, cream, soft brown, muted teal and one dusty coral — with light coming low from a single window on the left. There is no text in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**동화책풍 일러스트가 «AI 티»를 내는 지점은 대개 «온기를 색으로만» 만들 때다.**\n원문은 슬롯을 «만질 수 있는 것»으로 채운다 — 겨자색 니트 비니, 오버사이즈 스웨터.\n\n★재현에서 그 원리를 «세어» 확장했다. \"cozy\"로는 아무 일도 안 일어난다:\n```\n★이 빠진 «법랑 머그»에서 «실제로 말려 올라가는 김»\n★의자 뒤에서 «흘러내리는» 접힌 모직 담요\n★발치 «골판지 상자» 안에서 자는 고양이\n짝 안 맞는 붓 담긴 병들 · ★뒷벽을 «늘어지며» 가로지르는 작은 전구줄\n```\n★**소품마다 «상태»가 붙어 있는 게 요령이다** — 이 빠진 / 흘러내리는 / 늘어지는.\n새 물건은 온기를 안 만든다.\n\n★자세도 «포즈»가 아니라 «하고 있는 일»로 적었다 —\n«무릎에 팔꿈치를 얹고 «작은 나무새를 손에서 굴리며 그것을 본다», 관객을 보지 않는다».\n[[gdgtify-one-key-across-distinct-individuals]]의 «모든 손에 각자의 할 일»과 같은 규칙.\n\n★렌더링도 «사진이 아님»을 조건으로 못박았다 — 부드러운 채색 형태 · «보이는 붓 질감» ·\n«모델링하지 않은» 완만한 그림자 · «살짝 불완전한» 가장자리.",
