      "prompt": "Use GPT image 2 for better results. PROMPT: Pastel pop advertising illustration of [HUMAN] beside a tilted [BREW] can bursting through a dramatic splash, with a large sliced [FLAVOR] fruit in the foreground and scattered angular fragments around the scene. Add the title “[TITLE]” in bold clean display lettering. Use a pastel [PALETTE] palette, a bright geometric background with large diagonal color blocks, crisp stylized liquid shapes, semi-flat shading, subtle halftone texture, clean commercial poster composition, energetic summer mood, product-focused layout, vertical 4:5.",
