      "title": "★하드코딩 금지, «추론만으로» 미션 포스터를 조립한다 — subject/mission/era의 DNA를 각각 추론시켜 실존했던 기묘한 탈것 4종을 레트로 기술 포스터로 (2x2)",
      "prompt": "I asked GPT to visualize 4 strange vehicle concepts that were real. This poster works for other topics as well. \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 strange vehicle concepts that were real: input = [subject / mission_context / era_style / technical_role / data_mode] mode = no_hardcoding / inference_only run mission_engineering_poster_extraction: subject_dna := infer object category, silhouette, scale, material, operator relationship, functional purpose, and visual identity mission_dna := infer terrain, environment, task, risk, operating constraints, and performance promise era_dna := infer poster typography, print texture, diagram style, photo treatment, badge language, and archival composition hero_view := infer best technical hero angle: side profile, 3/4 view, cutaway, front view, field-test view, or product render feature_system := infer visible engineering features worth labeling spec_panel := infer relevant specs, attributes, milestones, or capability claims diagram_panel := infer mini blueprint, mobility diagram, exploded detail, flow schematic, operator layout, or mission map slogan := generate bold mission-ready headline and short supporting copy badge_system := infer agency, manufacturer, research group, expedition mark, or neutral emblem if appropriate surface_context := infer ground, terrain, lab floor, ocean, snow, runway, factory, street, desert, orbit, or abstract field color_system := infer monochrome / limited accent / archival ink palette render: a premium retro technical mission poster where subject is presented as a purpose-built engineering icon. forbidden: hard-coded rover, hard-coded nasa-like branding, hard-coded moon dust, hard-coded 6-wheel layout, hard-coded antenna, fake precise specs without data, random blueprint clutter.",
      "gen_prompt": "[그리드 재현 — grid_repro.py 칸별 생성 후 합성. 정본 spec 참조]\nStyle pack: A premium retro technical mission poster presenting the vehicle as a purpose-built engineering icon — one cinematic hero view, a bold mission-ready headline, a compact spec panel, one mini blueprint or mobility diagram, an era-authentic badge emblem, era-derived typography and print texture, archival ink palette with one accent, aged print paper.\nPanels (원본 4종 재현): 1) Helicron 1932 propeller car — engraved newsprint 2) Dynasphere 1932 monowheel — British motoring poster 3) Saunders-Roe SR.N1 1959 hovercraft — aviation journal 4) GM Firebird III 1958 turbine concept car — jet-age advertisement.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지 — 로버·NASA풍 브랜딩·월면 먼지 같은 «클리셰 하드코딩을 금지»하고, subject_dna(실루엣· 재질·운용자 관계)·mission_dna(지형·임무·리스크)·era_dna(시대의 타이포·인쇄 질감·도해 스타일)를 각각 «추론»시켜 조립하는 inference-only 문법. 같은 템플릿이 주제만 갈아끼우면 다른 시대 포스터가 된다.\n\n★재현 — 실존 기묘 탈것 4종(차르 탱크·다이너스피어·VVA-14·쉬넨체펠린)을 칸별 생성(§④). 스펙표·콜아웃 소형 글자는 뭉갬 예상(방침), 시대별 광고 언어 분화가 관찰 대상 — 어제 항공기 era 실험의 «탈것+시대» 확장판이자 문법은 SQL이 아닌 inference-only 파이프라인으로 상이.\n\n---\n★재현 방식 교체 — 처음엔 한 장으로 그리드를 시켰는데 **Krea2가 칸마다 같은 구도를\n반복**해서 원본과 딴판이 나왔다. 주제를 gen_prompt에 정확히 적어놔도 그렇다 — 지시를 못 따르는 게\n아니라 **단일 이미지 확산 모델이라 칸마다 다른 의미를 배정하지 못하는 것**이다.\n→ **칸마다 한 장씩 뽑아 합성**하고, Krea2가 못 쓰는 영문 타이포는 코드로 얹었다.\n   정본 스크립트 `automation/grid_repro.py` + spec `automation/grid_specs/gdgtify-mission-poster-from-inference-only.json`.\n   런북 §gen_prompt ④ 참조.",
