      "title": "★타이포를 «이미지 주변»이 아니라 «피사체와 상호작용»시켜라 — 크롭·겹침·전배경 레이어·스케일 대비 4방향 설계의 레드·블랙 에디토리얼 시스템 (Scarlet Index)",
      "prompt": "🤯 AI Visual Systems Vol.22: Scarlet Index!\n\nRed, black and white can create wildly different editorial posters!\n\n1. PUSH FRAME — perspective × typography\n2. FOCUS SHIFT — blur × sharp detail\n3. ROUGE — profile × oversized type\n4. REACH EDIT — gesture × editorial layout\n\nGreat for fashion posters, magazine covers, artist visuals and brand campaigns!\n\nMade with ChatGPT-Image2\nPrompt in the comments 👇\n\n[프롬프트 답글 전문]\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a 9:16 high-fashion editorial poster.\n\nSubject: [male / female / fashion model / artist]\nOutfit: [fashion styling]\nPalette: [red / black / white / custom palette]\nMain title: [TITLE]\nDesign direction: [perspective × typography / blur × sharp detail / profile × oversized type / gesture × editorial layout]\nSupporting text: [short phrase]\n\nBuild the poster around one strong photographic subject and one dominant graphic idea.\n\nUse oversized typography as part of the composition rather than simple text placed around the image. Let letters interact with the subject through cropping, overlap, foreground/background layering, or scale contrast.\n\nDepending on the selected direction:\n\n• Perspective × typography — use a strong foreground gesture or body movement toward the camera, with dramatic near-far perspective and large type framing the action.\n\n• Blur × sharp detail — keep parts of the portrait softly blurred while one narrow facial region remains extremely sharp, creating controlled focus contrast.\n\n• Profile × oversized type — use a sculptural side-profile portrait against a bold flat-color background, with large serif typography partially hidden behind or crossing the silhouette.\n\n• Gesture × editorial layout — combine an expressive fashion pose, subtle motion echo or secondary silhouette, and integrated magazine-style typography.\n\nKeep the layout clean and visually bold. Use one dominant color, one neutral base, and limited accent colors. Typography should include one large headline, one short supporting line, and only a few small editorial labels.\n\nMaintain realistic skin texture, natural facial anatomy, refined fashion styling, crisp fabric details, controlled studio lighting, strong negative space, and premium magazine-cover quality.",
      "gen_prompt": "Create a 9:16 high-fashion editorial poster. Direction: profile × oversized type. A sculptural side-profile portrait of an adult female fashion model with slicked-back dark hair, wearing a structured scarlet-red high-collar coat, against a bold flat crimson-red background. Huge white serif typography reading \"ROUGE\" crosses the frame horizontally, partially hidden BEHIND her silhouette so the letters weave through the profile — type as a physical layer, not a caption. One short supporting line \"SCARLET INDEX — AW26\" in small white caps near the lower edge, and nothing else. One dominant red, one neutral white, black accents only. Realistic skin texture, refined styling, controlled studio lighting, strong negative space, premium magazine-cover quality. These two text groups are the only text.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지 — 타이포는 이미지 «옆»에 놓는 순간 캡션이 된다. 글자가 피사체와 «크롭·겹침·앞뒤 레이어·스케일 대비»로 상호작용해야 구성 요소가 된다. 같은 레드·블랙·화이트로 4가지 설계 방향(원근×타이포/블러×샤프/옆얼굴×대형활자/제스처×편집 레이아웃)을 내는 시스템 프롬프트.\n\n★재현은 «Profile × oversized type» — 실루엣 «뒤로» 글자를 통과시키는 물리 레이어가 핵심 (런북 §불투명체가 글자를 가리는 건 잘 된다의 응용). 슬롯 채움: ROUGE/AW26.",
