      "title": "★제품을 «거대하게» 놓되 세계는 정상 작동시켜라 — 편익 은유→스케일 위반→바이럴 순간→물리 보존의 STEP 파이프라인 광고 문법",
      "prompt": "A prompt that could come in handy for certain kinds of ads. I will probably fix its physics logic to be a bit stronger but all comes down to what you input. \n\nPrompt: \n\nINPUT ::= [PRODUCT] + [CORE_BENEFIT]\n\nSTEP_1 :: infer the benefit metaphor\n\nidentify the single strongest thing the product promises: speed, softness, strength, freshness, precision, energy, calm, protection\ntranslate that benefit into a physical action or consequence visible without text\navoid generic symbolism; the metaphor must feel specific to this product\n\nSTEP_2 :: infer the scale violation\n\nenlarge the product until it becomes part of a believable real-world environment\nchoose a location whose normal function creates tension with the product: street, airport, beach, office, supermarket, stadium, subway\ndetermine what people, vehicles, architecture, or weather would realistically do around an object of this scale\n\nSTEP_3 :: infer the viral moment\n\ncapture one instantly understandable interaction proving the benefit\nthe product should alter normal life in a surprising but logically consistent way\ninclude one secondary detail viewers notice only after looking twice\n\nSTEP_4 :: preserve reality\n\nrealistic weight, contact shadows, surface compression, reflections, weathering, crowd behavior\npeople react naturally rather than posing for an advertisement\nproduct branding visible but not unnaturally rotated toward camera\n\nSTEP_5 :: render spec\n\ndocumentary advertising photography\nwide establishing composition with one clear focal event\nbelievable lens perspective and atmospheric depth\nforbidden: floating product, miniature-looking city, random crowds, impossible shadows, excessive brand repetition",
