      "title": "★아이는 평범하고 «그림자만» 영웅이다 — 발끝에서 시작해 광원 방향을 지키는 «물리적으로 연결된 그림자»에만 문화 영웅의 실루엣이 나타나는 마법적 사실주의",
      "prompt": "A fun prompt that shows children from different countries and their shadow is a cultural hero from their country. \n\nPrompt: <temporal_lighting_map> [ HARSH DIRECTIONAL SUNLIGHT ] \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ [ AI_INFER: ORDINARY CHILD FROM CULTURE / COUNTRY ] [ (Side-facing or three-quarter pose, holding simple symbolic prop) ] \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ [ LONG PHYSICALLY ACCURATE CAST SHADOW ON THE GROUND ] [ (AI_INFER: PUBLIC-DOMAIN CULTURAL HERO SILHOUETTE) ] [ (Shadow preserves child’s pose, contact points, sun angle) ] [ (Hero identity appears only inside the cast-shadow shape) ] [ (Future / mythic legacy suggested through shadow details) ] </temporal_lighting_map> INSTRUCTION: 1. Render as grounded magical-realism photography. 2. The anomaly is purely optical: the child remains ordinary, and only the physically connected cast shadow reveals the heroic legacy. 3. The shadow must begin at the child’s feet, follow the same light direction, stretch naturally across the ground, and remain a real cast shadow rather than a separate figure.",
      "gen_prompt": "Grounded magical-realism photography under harsh directional late-afternoon sunlight: an ordinary Korean child in a plain t-shirt stands in three-quarter pose on an old stone courtyard, holding a small wooden toy sword. The child's long, physically accurate cast shadow stretches across the ground — but inside the shadow shape, the silhouette resolves into Admiral Yi Sun-sin in full historical armor with a commander's sword, the shadow preserving the child's pose, contact points at the feet and the sun angle exactly. The anomaly is purely optical: the child remains ordinary, only the connected cast shadow reveals the heroic legacy. Natural colors, believable ground texture, no text.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지 — 판타지를 «광학 하나»로 제한: 아이는 완전히 평범하게, 이상 현상은 «물리적으로 연결된 그림자» 안에서만(발끝 시작·광원 방향·접촉점 보존). 그림자=미래/신화적 유산이라는 서사 장치. 한국 아이+이순신 장군(퍼블릭 도메인 영웅)으로 재현.",
