      "title": "★지식 도메인을 «펼친 팝업북 속 아이소메트릭 절개 방들»로 — 실루엣 배열·타임라인 축·금박 마감의 수집형 교육 디오라마 (@데코레이터 문법, 천문학판)",
      "prompt": "This is a fun prompt from educational content or just visualizing history. \n\nPrompt: \n\n@ isometric_grid(angle=30, depth=3, cell_size='variable') @ cutaway_rooms(material='matte_painted_resin', prop_style='$SUBJECT_domain', figure_scale='1:100') @ silhouette_arrangement(shape='$SUBJECT_iconic_silhouette', cell_population='density_by_category') @ infographic_layer(axes=['timeline','complexity','function'], callouts=True, swatches=True, font='serif_edu') @ open_book_spread(pages='thick_cream_cardstock', pop_up=True, binding='spiral_visible') @ premium_finish(foil='gold_on_edges', lighting='soft_museum_spot', texture='warm_paper_grain') def build_knowledge_world(subject=\"$SUBJECT\"): return \"collectible_educational_diorama\" RENDER build_knowledge_world() as an 8K macro product photo, slightly overhead, shallow DOF.”",
      "gen_prompt": "An open book spread of thick cream cardstock with visible spiral binding, photographed as an 8K macro product photo, slightly overhead, shallow depth of field, soft museum spot lighting, gold foil on the page edges, warm paper grain. Rising from the pages, a pop-up isometric world about the history of astronomy: matte painted-resin cutaway rooms at 30-degree isometric angle arranged inside one large telescope-shaped silhouette — an ancient stone observatory room, a Renaissance study with brass instruments, a lens-grinding workshop, a modern mission control room, tiny 1:100 figures working in each. A subtle infographic layer of timeline arcs, small callout markers and color swatches in serif educational style weaves between the rooms; caption text may be indistinct. Collectible educational diorama finish.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지 — @데코레이터 체이닝 문법: 그리드 각도·절개 방·실루엣 배열·인포그래픽 층·팝업북·프리미엄 마감을 «장식자»로 쌓아 지식 도메인($SUBJECT)을 수집형 디오라마로 컴파일. 천문학사로 재현 — 방들이 망원경 실루엣 «안에» 배열되는 silhouette_arrangement이 백미.",
