      "category": "웹/UI",
      "title": "★브랜드 «성격»이 레이아웃 파라미터를 결정한다 — loud/calm/cute/luxe마다 회전각·스티커 수·장식 밀도가 바뀌는 StorefrontEngine 클래스 (DTC 커머스 히어로)",
      "prompt": "Another advanced prompt for designing websites with GPT. You can just give the image to GPT and tell it to turn it into an interactive site \n\nclass StorefrontEngine:\n    KERNEL = K_DTC                                            # constant genre; NEVER sampled\n    def __init__(self, BRAND, PRODUCT, CATEGORY):\n        self.theta = infer(BRAND, PRODUCT, CATEGORY)          # personality, palette, copy, variants, menu…\n        self.P = self.layout_params(self.theta)               # A₁: the adaptive vector\n\n    def layout_params(self, th):                              # g(θ): design CHANGES per personality\n        base = dict(zone=(0.34,0.40,0.26), hero_scale=1.0, hero_rot=0, accent_sat=0.5,\n                    sticker_n=2, deco_density=0.3, type_case=\"title\", motif=\"neutral\")\n        return match th.personality:\n          case \"loud\":    base|dict(hero_rot=8, hero_scale=1.15, accent_sat=0.9, sticker_n=3, deco_density=0.7, type_case=\"UPPER\")\n          case \"calm\":    base|dict(hero_rot=2, hero_scale=1.0, accent_sat=0.3, sticker_n=2, deco_density=0.15)\n          case \"cute\":    base|dict(hero_rot=5, accent_sat=0.8, sticker_n=3, deco_density=0.5, type_case=\"UPPER\")\n          case \"luxe\":    base|dict(hero_rot=0, accent_sat=0.2, sticker_n=1, deco_density=0.1)\n          # … athletic / botanical / nostalgic / technical  (total ⇒ every input gets a distinct P)\n\n    def build(self):\n        nav    = Nav(logo=L, menu=self. theta. menu, capsule=BLACK(search|div|cart|badge))\n        hero   = ThreeZone(L=Pitch(self.theta.headline, self.theta.pitch,\n                                   CTA(self.theta.cta_verb, icon, qty=(-,n,+))),\n                           C=floating_hero(self.theta.hero_angle, scale=self.P.hero_scale,\n                                           rot=self.P.hero_rot, shadow=SOFT_CONTACT),   # η\n                           R=callouts(self.theta.benefits, icons=SEMANTIC))\n        stick  = stickers(self.theta.sticker_words, n=self.P.sticker_n, over=hero.C)     # A₅ real attributes\n        shelf  = Shelf(hue=self.theta.shelf_hue, cards=self.theta.variants,              # deep complementary\n                       break_outside=True, price+rating+action=True)\n        return page(self.KERNEL, self.P, nav, hero, stick, shelf)\n\n    def verify(self, page, other_page=None):\n        assert P(self) != P(other_input) for distinct inputs,        \"A₁: template paste (no adaptation)\"\n        assert deco_density_outside_focal(page) <= EPS,              \"A₂: playfulness not rationed\"\n        assert all_tokens_from(self.theta.personality),              \"A₃: mixed personalities\"\n        assert weight(product)>=weight(headline)>=weight(callouts)>=weight(deco), \"A₄ hierarchy\"\n        assert 0.65 <= hero_height(page) <= 0.72,                    \"A₄ composition\"\n        assert sells_category(self.theta.headline) and not vague(self.theta.headline), \"A₅\"\n        assert stickers_are_attributes(self.theta.sticker_words),    \"A₅ ¬generic praise\"\n\nStorefrontEngine($ BRAND,$PRODUCT,$PRODUCT_CATEGORY).build()",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium DTC e-commerce storefront landing page mockup, calm personality: clean nav bar with a small wordmark \"MOSSA\" and a black capsule holding search, divider and cart icons; a three-zone hero — left pitch block with the headline \"QUIET HYDRATION\", a short supporting line and a pill CTA button reading \"SHOP NOW\" with a quantity stepper; center a floating matte-sage ceramic tumbler at a gentle 2-degree rotation with one soft contact shadow; right side three small benefit callouts with minimal icons. Below, a product shelf strip in a deep complementary olive hue with three variant cards breaking slightly outside their frames, each with price and rating. Muted sage-and-cream palette, low accent saturation, generous whitespace, subtle grain, photorealistic UI mockup finish. Only the named text needs to be legible; small labels may be indistinct.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지 — 웹디자인을 «성격 함수»로: personality(loud/calm/cute/luxe…)가 히어로 회전각·스케일· 액센트 채도·스티커 수·장식 밀도·대소문자까지 결정하는 파라미터 벡터를 뽑고, verify 단계에서 «입력이 다르면 결과도 달라야 한다(템플릿 붙여넣기 금지)»를 assert하는 문법. calm×세라믹 텀블러로 재현. 웹 작업에 직접 차용 가치.",
