      "title": "★양피지의 «먹이 살아나» 3D로 응고한다 — 서체 잉크가 소용돌이치며 주인공·랜드마크로 굳는 Narrative_Materialization 클래스 (퍼블릭 도메인 4작 2x2)",
      "prompt": "Reve is one of my favorite models because it's output quality is very close to GPT but also very different at times. \n\nPrompt: \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 non copyrighted books: class Narrative_Materialization:     def __init__(self, book=\"[LITERARY_WORK]\", genre=\"[GENRE]\"):         self.base = f\"AI_INFER(A weathered, unrolled scroll or ancient tome fitting the {genre} aesthetic, resting on a dark wood desk)\"         self. lighting = \"Cinematic, moody chiaroscuro. A single flickering light source (like a candle or lantern) casting long shadows.\"              def render_ink_physics(self):         # AI INFERENCE: Deduce the story elements         hero = f\"AI_INFER(The iconic main character of {book}, standing tall in 3D)\"         environment = f\"AI_INFER(The most famous towering structure or landscape from {book} in the background)\"                  # The Transition Logic         illusion = f\"The black calligraphy ink on the parchment is pooling together, lifting off the page as thick, glossy, swirling liquid, and physically solidifying into the 3D shapes of {hero} and {environment}.\"                  # Grounding Props         props = f\"AI_INFER(A brass title plaque, a wax seal, and a specific era-accurate desk item related to {book})\"                  return [self.base, illusion, props, self. lighting]  # EXECUTE: Render as dark fantasy concept art. High contrast between the white parchment and the sweeping dark ink.",
      "gen_prompt": "[그리드 재현 — grid_repro.py 칸별 생성 후 합성. 정본 spec 참조]\nStyle: dark fantasy concept art — a weathered unrolled scroll or ancient tome on a dark wood desk, lit by a single flickering candle with long moody chiaroscuro shadows; the black calligraphy ink on the parchment pools together, lifts off the page as thick glossy swirling liquid and physically solidifies into 3D shapes of the story's hero and its most famous structure; a brass title plaque and a wax seal on the desk; high contrast between white parchment and sweeping dark ink. Caption text may be indistinct.\nPanels: 1) Moby-Dick — whale and whaling ship rising from the ink 2) Dracula — the Count and his mountain castle 3) Journey to the West — the Monkey King and a pagoda mountain 4) Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Sea — the Nautilus and a giant squid.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지 — «잉크 물리» 전환 규칙: 페이지의 서체 잉크가 «모여서, 떠올라, 응고»하는 3단 동사로 평면→입체 전환을 서술. 주인공+대표 구조물을 AI_INFER로 추출하는 클래스 문법. 퍼블릭 도메인 4작을 칸별 생성(§④).\n\n---\n★재현 방식 교체 — 처음엔 한 장으로 그리드를 시켰는데 **Krea2가 칸마다 같은 구도를\n반복**해서 원본과 딴판이 나왔다. 주제를 gen_prompt에 정확히 적어놔도 그렇다 — 지시를 못 따르는 게\n아니라 **단일 이미지 확산 모델이라 칸마다 다른 의미를 배정하지 못하는 것**이다.\n→ **칸마다 한 장씩 뽑아 합성**하고, Krea2가 못 쓰는 영문 타이포는 코드로 얹었다.\n   정본 스크립트 `automation/grid_repro.py` + spec `automation/grid_specs/gdgtify-ink-solidifies-into-the-story.json`.\n   런북 §gen_prompt ④ 참조.",
