      "title": "★한 프레임에 «여러 시간»을 담되 기법의 물리를 지켜라 — 장노출 고스트/스트로보/타임슬라이스/부패-성장 중 하나만 고르고 정적 앵커가 «시간의 증거»가 되는 합성 문법",
      "prompt": "Here is a advanced temporal compositing prompt I tested with Reve and GPT. It is a bit tricky because you need to get subject, static anchor, all these elements right.  GPT 5.6 Sol evaluation: \n\nConceptual sophistication: 9.5/10\nPhysical realism: 9.5/10\nInternal coherence: 9/10\nUsefulness as a QA / art-direction spec: 10/10\n\ninput = [ static_anchor / moving_subject / time_span / technique / product_role ] run temporal_compositing_one_frame: premise := a single still image containing multiple moments in time at once technique := choose one and hold its physics — long_exposure_ghost := a rigid static anchor stays tack sharp while a moving person appears as a transparent ghost everywhere they paused briefly and solid only where they stayed longest; the longer at a spot, the more opaque; empty air stays clear; ambient light accumulates so the scene reads brighter than the eye sees stroboscopic := a single motion sampled at even intervals by repeated flashes — the subject appears as a sequence of discrete sharp copies along the motion path, evenly spaced, each fully exposed, overlapping where the movement slowed and spread where it sped up; the background exposed once and clean time_slice := a single frame whose strips read as different moments — light shifting from dawn on one edge to night on the other across one continuous scene, seamless gradients rather than hard joins decay_or_growth := alternatively a subject shown at several stages of a process simultaneously — an apple fresh at one side and progressively decayed across to the other, one continuous object, the transition gradual and physical consistency_law := one camera position, one framing throughout — only time changes across the frame; the static elements are identical wherever they appear product_role := the product is the constant — the one thing sharp and unchanged while everything around it moves through time, or the agent that drives the change context_dna := infer a setting that reads clearly and holds a locked camera capture_dna := tripod-locked; for ghost and time-slice, long exposure at low iso with clean shadows; for stroboscopic, repeated flash against a dark field focal_anchor := the static anchor sharp corner to corner — its sharpness proves the rest is time light_logic := consistent with the technique — accumulating ambient for exposure methods, hard repeated flash for stroboscopic, a real day-arc gradient for time-slice imperfection := a faint secondary ghost, a slight exposure gradient, a hot highlight core, one sampled copy fainter than the others depth & frame := static geometry against time-varying elements; 16:9 or 3:2 mood := contemplative, uncanny, time made tangible render: one honest frame where a single locked viewpoint holding multiple moments makes the image. forbidden — objects: multiple camera angles, a scene where the static anchor also changes forbidden — look: ghost figures beside a blurred static background, stroboscopic copies at uneven or random spacing, hard cut joins in a time-slice, a decay gradient that is really separate objects composited, the constant element drifting between moments",
      "gen_prompt": "A single still frame containing multiple moments in time — stroboscopic technique: in a dark gymnasium against a clean black field, one basketball player's crossover drive is sampled by repeated hard flashes into six discrete sharp copies along the motion path, evenly spaced, overlapping where the movement slowed at the plant step and spreading where it accelerated, each copy fully exposed. The basketball hoop and one pair of white sneakers on the floor stay tack sharp and identical — the static anchors whose sharpness proves the rest is time. One camera position, one framing; a faint secondary ghost and one sampled copy fainter than the others as honest imperfections. Tripod-locked look, clean shadows, no text.",
      "prompt_ko": "★논지 — 시간 합성의 «기법 물리 보존»: 장노출 고스트(머문 시간=불투명도)/스트로보(등간격 복제)/타임슬라이스(새벽→밤 그라디언트)/부패-성장 중 «하나만» 고르고 그 물리를 유지. 정적 앵커의 선명함이 «나머지가 시간임을 증명»한다는 조항이 백미. 스트로보×농구 크로스오버로 재현 (런북 §광학 — «무엇이 보이는가»로 번역).",
