      "prompt": "🎨 SURREALIST SCENARIO 🎨\n\nPrompt :\n\n[SUBJECT] reimagined in a Chalkboard Surrealist Scenario, with dreamlike, hand-drawn imagery and unexpected juxtapositions. Employ a vibrant chalk color scheme, with [COLOR1] and [COLOR2] highlights, to capture the essence of the surreal\n\nCheck ALTS\n\n[이미지 ALT 변주 전문]\nA door floating in outer space reimagined in a Chalkboard Surrealist Scenario, with dreamlike, hand-drawn imagery and unexpected juxtapositions. Employ a vibrant chalk color scheme, with cosmic purple and star gold highlights, to capture the essence of the surreal --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n---\nA staircase spiraling into infinity reimagined in a Chalkboard Surrealist Scenario, with dreamlike, hand-drawn imagery and unexpected juxtapositions. Employ a vibrant chalk color scheme, with coral red and mint green highlights, to capture the essence of the surreal --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n---\nA melting clock tower reimagined in a Chalkboard Surrealist Scenario, with dreamlike, hand-drawn imagery and unexpected juxtapositions. Employ a vibrant chalk color scheme, with neon pink and electric blue highlights, to capture the essence of the surreal --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n---\nA fluttering monarch butterfly reimagined in a Chalkboard Surrealist Scenario, with dreamlike, hand-drawn imagery and unexpected juxtapositions. Employ a vibrant chalk color scheme, with cerulean blue and pumpkin orange highlights, to capture the essence of the surreal --ar 3:2 --v 8.2",
