      "prompt": "Smart energy. Better life. ⚡\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a premium [BRAND] [PRODUCT] concept presentation featuring a sleek [PRODUCT TYPE] with a sophisticated [COLOR PALETTE] design, realistic materials, subtle texture, reflections, and high-end studio lighting. Showcase the main product prominently with [KEY BRANDING ELEMENTS], supported by multiple-angle views, packaging, feature icons, and concise design callouts. Include [FLAVOR/VARIANT], [KEY FEATURES], and a bottom specification section covering colors, materials, graphic system, and layered construction. Overall aesthetic: modern, premium, minimal, photorealistic, highly polished commercial product presentation, clean grid layout, dark cinematic background, sharp typography, and professional brand-design case study style.",
