      "target_model": "GPT-image 2",
      "category": "미니어처/그리드",
      "title": "★랜드마크는 «지도 축척이 아니라 시각적 중요도»로 배치한다 — 그리고 그 사이를 도시 조직으로 메워야 «사람이 사는 세계»가 된다 (두 손 안의 미니어처 월드 × 4도시)",
      "prompt": "I love these tiny city prompts. Here is another one. A bit different from the others I have done. \n\n2x2grid, 16:9, do this for 4 famous interntional cities:\n\nINPUT ::= [PLACE]\n\nGenerate a photorealistic miniature world representing [PLACE], resting entirely inside two cupped human hands.\n\nInfer PLACE_DNA automatically.\n\nConstruct:\n\na compact elevated micro-world containing the most recognizable architecture, geography, infrastructure, vegetation, and cultural signatures of PLACE\nHERO_LANDMARKS positioned according to visual importance rather than literal map scale\nURBAN_FABRIC filling the gaps so the world feels inhabited rather than like isolated landmarks\nNATURAL_SYSTEM integrated through the model\nTRANSIT_SIGNATURE wrapping, crossing, or circulating around the micro-world when semantically appropriate\nvisible miniature streets, windows, vehicles, boats, trees, lights, and people for scale\n\nRules:\n\nentire world must fit plausibly within the palms\npreserve coherent miniature scale\nhands support the world physically from beneath\nno floating city\nuse golden-hour macro photography\nbackground becomes a heavily defocused continuation of PLACE\nno fixed landmarks, geography, or transit elements; infer everything from PLACE",
      "gen_prompt": "[칸별 개별 생성 후 2열 합성 — 각 칸 1216x684]\n\n── 칸 1 (kyoto) · 얹은 글자: \"KYOTO\"\nThe micro-world is Kyoto: a five-storey wooden pagoda, a hillside temple standing on a tall stilted wooden scaffold, a vermilion gate corridor climbing a green slope, rows of low townhouses with grey tiled roofs along a narrow stone canal, maples turning red, and a shallow river crossed by stepping stones circulating through the model.\n\n── 칸 2 (venice) · 얹은 글자: \"VENICE\"\nThe micro-world is Venice: a domed basilica and a tall square brick campanile on a small paved square, a white marble bridge arching over a green canal, rows of ochre and rose palazzi with striped mooring poles, gondolas and a small ferry threading the water that loops through the whole model.\n\n── 칸 3 (istanbul) · 얹은 글자: \"ISTANBUL\"\nThe micro-world is Istanbul: a great domed mosque ringed by slender minarets, a second domed complex facing it across a narrow blue strait, a suspension bridge spanning that water, the long lead roof of a covered market, ferries crossing, and a hillside of pale apartment blocks with red tiled roofs.\n\n── 칸 4 (rio) · 얹은 글자: \"RIO DE JANEIRO\"\nThe micro-world is Rio de Janeiro: a bare granite peak rising straight out of the water with a cable car strung to its summit, a forested ridge carrying a small mountaintop statue with outstretched arms, a crescent beach edged by a wave-patterned promenade, dense white apartment towers, and a hillside of stacked colourful houses.\n\n── 네 칸 공통 스타일\nPhotographed as a golden-hour macro photograph: a compact elevated micro-world rests entirely inside two cupped adult human hands that physically support it from beneath, so nothing floats. The miniature keeps one coherent scale throughout, with visible tiny streets, windows, vehicles, boats, trees, street lights and people for reference. Hero landmarks are placed by visual importance rather than map accuracy, and the gaps between them are filled with ordinary urban fabric so the world feels inhabited rather than like isolated monuments. The background is a heavily defocused continuation of the same place. Warm low sunlight, shallow depth of field, tactile realism. There is no lettering anywhere in the frame.",
      "prompt_ko": "★이 프롬프트의 값어치는 «HERO_LANDMARKS positioned according to visual importance rather than literal map scale» 한 줄에 있다. 미니어처를 지리대로 만들면 «축소 지도»가 되고, 중요도로 재배치해야 «작품»이 된다.\n\n★두 번째 규칙이 더 중요하다 — «URBAN_FABRIC filling the gaps so the world feels inhabited rather than like isolated landmarks». 랜드마크만 세우면 기념품 진열장이 된다. «사이를 평범한 것으로 메워라»가 이 계정 미니어처 프롬프트의 공통 문법.\n\n★고정 랜드마크를 «하나도 적지 않고» `[PLACE]`에서 전부 추론시키는 슬롯형(`INPUT ::= [PLACE]`). 재현에서는 교토·베네치아·이스탄불·리우로 채웠다. «손바닥 안에 물리적으로 들어갈 것 · 떠 있는 도시 금지»가 스케일을 잡아주는 장치.\n\n---\n★재현 방식 교체 — 처음엔 한 장으로 그리드를 시켰는데 **Krea2가 칸마다 같은 구도를\n반복**해서 원본과 딴판이 나왔다. 주제를 gen_prompt에 정확히 적어놔도 그렇다 — 지시를 못 따르는 게\n아니라 **단일 이미지 확산 모델이라 칸마다 다른 의미를 배정하지 못하는 것**이다.\n→ **칸마다 한 장씩 뽑아 합성**하고, Krea2가 못 쓰는 영문 타이포는 코드로 얹었다.\n   정본 스크립트 `automation/grid_repro.py` + spec `automation/grid_specs/gdgtify-miniature-world-in-cupped-hands.json`.\n   런북 §gen_prompt ④ 참조.",
