      "prompt": "“跨屏感”不是放一台手机就够了，关键是让动作真的越过边框。\n📱 upper body and reaching hand visibly projecting beyond the smartphone screen boundary\n这样，手机不再是背景道具，而是一个入口。人物有一部分还留在屏幕里，手已经来到真实空间，错层立刻成立。\n🤲 enlarged hand in forced perspective, reaching toward the product with a near-touch gap\n别让手只是伸出来。近处手更大、产品离指尖只差一点时，画面会有“护理从屏幕来到皮肤上”的明确动作。\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate an ultra-premium beauty advertising poster for an original luxury skincare brand called AURELLE, designed as a Cannes-level campaign visual that preserves the exact structural logic, camera impact, and emotional minimalism of the image, while strengthening the core concept that both the woman and her reaching hand are actively emerging out of the smartphone screen into real space. The final artwork must feature a warm monochrome beige studio, one oversized upright smartphone in the mid-background, one sophisticated adult woman partially stepping out from inside the screen, and one hyper-real luxury hand cream tube in the lower-right foreground as the absolute commercial hero. The image must feel modern, elegant, tactile, intimate, and conceptually sharp, with a stronger sense that digital beauty care is physically crossing into reality.\n\nCore composition:\nUse a tall vertical composition with a clean warm-beige studio environment and a strong editorial luxury mood. Place one large smartphone upright in the center-left background, perfectly frontal, with a crisp black frame and a softly lit interior scene visible inside the display. The woman must no longer feel only framed inside the phone; instead, her upper body and reaching arm should visibly project beyond the screen boundary into the viewer’s space. Her hand must extend dramatically toward the lower-right foreground with convincing perspective, scale enlargement, and spatial separation, as if it has broken through the screen plane. The product tube sits exactly in the physical space she is reaching toward, creating a strong real-world contact tension. The viewer must instantly understand: care is leaving the screen and entering life.\n\nConcept enhancement:\nStrengthen the “emerging from the screen” illusion. The phone should function as a portal, not just a frame. Part of the woman’s torso, arm, and hand should feel visually outside the screen boundary, with the screen edge acting like a threshold between digital intimacy and physical beauty ritual. The reaching gesture should be more assertive and closer to the product, creating a near-touch moment with strong emotional and visual pull. The concept must feel luxurious and seamless, never gimmicky.\n\nHero product:\nDesign the hero item as a premium hand cream from AURELLE, globally market-ready, elegant, and collectible. Use a refined ivory tube with a satin finish, warm champagne-gold typography, subtle metallic cap detailing, and a minimal French-luxury layout. Add original English branding such as:\nAURELLE\nVELVET HAND RITUAL\nROSE SILK REPAIR\nThe tube must feel expensive, clean, feminine, and highly tactile, with beautiful material rendering, crisp print clarity, elegant proportions, and soft realistic shadowing on the studio floor. It must remain the clearest and strongest product focal point in the image.\n\nCharacter styling:\nThe woman must be an adult fashion-forward beauty figure with calm confidence and understated luxury. She wears dark refined sunglasses, a cream silk blouse, tailored deep-brown trousers, and elegant neutral heels. Her hair is smooth, shoulder-length, softly styled, and natural. Her expression is composed, modern, and quietly powerful. Her body posture should clearly suggest that she is leaning out from the phone into real space, while one leg and part of her body still remain inside the screen world. She must feel like a luxury editorial model, never casual, never influencer-like.\n\nTransit visual system:\nUnify the entire poster into a mature luxury skincare campaign language. The smartphone interior, model styling, hand cream tube, serif headline, support line, floor tone, shadow density, and beige-brown-gold palette must all belong to one disciplined beauty system. Keep the color world tightly controlled: warm beige background, ivory product body, champagne-gold labeling, espresso-brown tailoring, soft black accessories, and creamy interior neutrals. Typography weight, spacing, and layout must feel precise, fashion-beauty, and globally premium.\n\nScreen world:\nInside the phone display, show a softly blurred warm interior suggesting a refined private beauty environment: neutral seating, creamy textiles, muted furniture shapes, and quiet domestic softness. Keep this world secondary and understated, serving only as the intimate origin point from which the woman emerges. The screen must clearly read as a transition threshold between private ritual and tangible product access.\n\nTypography and layout:\nAdd original English-only headline typography near the upper center in a refined high-fashion serif, such as:\n“Care Steps Closer.”\nor\n“Reach the Ritual.”\nAdd a smaller elegant support line near the lower area if needed, such as:\n“Luxury hand care, crossing from screen to skin.”\nTypography must be minimal, spacious, premium, and editorial, with no copied wording and no generic layout.\n\nLighting:\nUse soft high-end beauty lighting with warm neutral tones. The overall light should be delicate, diffused, and luxurious, with gentle sculpting on the woman’s blouse, face, trousers, and especially the extended hand. The hand cream tube must receive the cleanest and most refined highlight structure, with subtle reflective accents on the cap and smooth tonal transitions across the tube body. The smartphone frame should remain crisp and slightly darker, grounding the composition and emphasizing the portal effect.\n\nColor direction:\nUse a disciplined palette of warm beige, ivory, cream, espresso brown, soft black, and champagne gold. Keep the whole image elegant, minimal, and cohesive, allowing the reaching gesture and the product to dominate. The scene must feel calm, elevated, tactile, and expensive.\n\nMaterial realism:\nRender every surface with exceptional realism: satin skincare tube finish, metallic cap reflections, realistic smartphone glass and frame, silk blouse sheen, tailored fabric drape, natural skin texture, manicured nails, and soft studio floor reflections. The perspective of the emerging hand and partially projected upper body must feel especially convincing and cinematic.\n\nCreative direction:\nThe final image must feel like a world-class luxury beauty campaign that transforms digital proximity into physical intimacy. The strongest memory point is the moment a woman literally reaches out of the phone toward the product, making the brand promise tangible. The poster should balance editorial restraint, commercial clarity, and conceptual sharpness in one unforgettable modern beauty key visual.\n\nMood:\nelegant, intimate, modern, tactile, luxurious, reachable, editorial, calm, premium, feminine, minimal, emotionally precise\n\nRendering style:\nultra-premium beauty advertising poster, luxury hand cream hero product, woman partially emerging from smartphone screen, strong reaching-hand perspective, enhanced portal illusion, warm beige editorial studio, minimal serif typography, fashion-beauty campaign aesthetic, 8k, world-class image quality\n\nNegative prompt:\ncopied luxury skincare branding, copied slogans, cluttered set, cheap influencer aesthetic, generic phone ad, weak product visibility, plastic-looking tube, harsh shadows, messy typography, exaggerated expression, low-resolution skin, overdecorated background, random props",
