      "id": "gdgtify-d3-culinary-architecture-infographic",
      "source": "https://x.com/Gdgtify/status/2087194830568861849",
      "author": "Gdgtify",
      "date": "2026-08-11",
      "lang": "en",
      "target_model": "GPT-image 2",
      "category": "그리드 인포그래픽",
      "title": "★같은 d3.js 엔진을 «다른 도메인»에 이식했다 — 시계 커터웨이와 판형은 같고 패널만 플레이팅 기하·풍미 레이더·주방 시퀀스·질감 매크로로 바뀐 요리 인포그래픽",
      "prompt": "I asked ChatGPT to show me 4 interesting dishes from  Texas. \n\nThey all look great to be honest. \n\nPrompt: // system: d3.js culinary architecture infographic render engine\nconst svg = d3. select(\"canvas\").attr(\"width\", 1920).attr(\"height\", 1080);\nconst dish = \"[$dish]\";\nconst cuisine = \"[$cuisine mood]\";\n// 1. hero plate\nsvg.append(\"g\").attr(\"id\", \"hero-render\")\n.attr(\"style\", render-3d: true; subject: plated ${dish}; style: ${cuisine}; lighting: soft restaurant spotlight; camera: overhead plus low-angle depth;);\n// 2. plating geometry\nconst panel1 = svg.append(\"g\").attr(\"transform\", \"translate(50, 50)\");\npanel1.append(\"text\").text(\"plating geometry\");\npanel1.append(\"diagram\").attr(\"src\", ai.infer_plating_composition(dish, cuisine));\n// 3. flavor architecture\nconst panel2 = svg.append(\"g\").attr(\"transform\", \"translate(50, 320)\");\npanel2.append(\"text\").text(\"flavor architecture\");\npanel2.append(\"radar-chart\").attr(\"data\", ai.infer_flavor_balance(dish));\n// 4. preparation timeline\nconst panel3 = svg.append(\"g\").attr(\"transform\", \"translate(50, 680)\");\npanel3.append(\"text\").text(\"kitchen sequence\");\npanel3.append(\"flowchart\").attr(\"steps\", ai.infer_cooking_process(dish));\n// 5. texture closeups\nconst panel4 = svg.append(\"g\").attr(\"transform\", \"translate(1390, 700)\");\npanel4.append(\"table\").attr(\"data\", ai.infer_texture_contrast(dish));\npanel4.append(\"circle-mask\").attr(\"content\", macro close-up of sauce, crust, steam, garnish, and plate surface);\n// execute: render photorealistic fine dining infographic, cinematic plating, clean labels, luxury menu-book design",
      "gen_prompt": "[칸별 개별 생성 후 2열 합성 — 각 칸 1216x684]\n\n── 칸 1 (brisket) · 얹은 글자: \"SMOKED BRISKET\"\nThe dish is a thick slice of slow-smoked beef brisket with a black pepper bark and a visible pink smoke ring, fanned across a white plate with pickled onion, a smear of dark barbecue glaze and two slices of white bread.\n\n── 칸 2 (chili) · 얹은 글자: \"BOWL OF RED\"\nThe dish is a deep bowl of dark chunky beef chilli with no beans, glossy with rendered fat and dried chilli paste, topped with shaved raw onion, grated cheese and a single dried chilli pod.\n\n── 칸 3 (kolache) · 얹은 글자: \"SAUSAGE KOLACHE\"\nThe dish is a soft golden enriched-dough roll split open around a coarse smoked sausage link, with a jalapeno slice and melted cheese, resting on a sheet of brown paper with crumbs and an egg wash sheen.\n\n── 칸 4 (chickenfried) · 얹은 글자: \"CHICKEN FRIED STEAK\"\nThe dish is a wide craggy breaded steak cutlet flooded with pale cream gravy and cracked black pepper, with a scoop of mashed potato and green beans set beside it on a heavy diner plate.\n\n── 네 칸 공통 스타일\nPresented as one page of a luxury menu book: a photorealistic hero render of the plated dish sits large at the centre under a soft restaurant spotlight, shot from overhead with low-angle depth, and thin cream leader lines run out from it to a small plating-geometry diagram, a radar chart of the flavour balance, a compact row of the kitchen sequence, and one circular macro inset of sauce, crust, steam and plate surface. Cinematic fine-dining plating, clean editorial rules and hairlines, warm neutral palette on a dark table. Four words appear in the image, set in plain cream capitals, each sitting in a clean empty area and never overlapping the plate: PLATING, FLAVOUR, SEQUENCE, TEXTURE. These four words are the only text in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★[[gdgtify-d3-horology-cutaway-infographic]]과 «문법이 같고 도메인이 다른» 짝이다. `svg.append(\"g\").attr(\"transform\",\"translate(50, 320)\")`로 패널 «좌표»를 못박는 구조가 그대로고, 바뀐 것은 `ai.infer_*()` 함수 이름뿐이다 — 시계면 무브먼트·복잡기구·조립, 요리면 플레이팅 기하·풍미 밸런스·주방 시퀀스·질감 대비.\n\n★**같은 구조를 다른 주제에 적용한 것이 곧 데이터다**(런북 §재탕 기준) — 이 엔진의 «적용 범위»를 알려준다. 주제만 바꿔 끼우면 판형이 따라온다는 것이 이 문법의 값어치.\n★라벨 넷은 §⑤-확정 네 조건으로. 텍사스 요리 4종(브리스킷·칠리·콜라치·치킨프라이드)로 재현.\n\n---\n★재현 방식 교체 — 처음엔 한 장으로 그리드를 시켰는데 **Krea2가 칸마다 같은 구도를\n반복**해서 원본과 딴판이 나왔다. 주제를 gen_prompt에 정확히 적어놔도 그렇다 — 지시를 못 따르는 게\n아니라 **단일 이미지 확산 모델이라 칸마다 다른 의미를 배정하지 못하는 것**이다.\n→ **칸마다 한 장씩 뽑아 합성**하고, Krea2가 못 쓰는 영문 타이포는 코드로 얹었다.\n   정본 스크립트 `automation/grid_repro.py` + spec `automation/grid_specs/gdgtify-d3-culinary-architecture-infographic.json`.\n   런북 §gen_prompt ④ 참조.",
