      "title": "★«장면 ⊗ 재질» 텐서곱으로 쓴 변환 엔진 — 장면 기하는 변수로 비워 두고 재질 행렬만 종이로 고정해, 어떤 장면이 들어와도 100% 종이로 번역시키는 문법",
      "prompt": "This paper world style is kind of fun. I asked GPT to use it to show me 4 hopeful visions of the future.\n\nPropmt: 2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 hopeful vision of the future:\n\n[SCENE_MATERIAL_TRANSLATION_ENGINE]\n\nVECTOR_G (Scene Geometry) = [VARIABLE_SCENE]\nMATRIX_M (Material World) = \"Paper Craft Materials: Origami Paper, Folded Cardstock, Vellum, Paper Fibers, Layered Paper Cutouts\"\nVariables:\n[VARIABLE_SCENE] = \"[INSERT ANY SCENE HERE]\"\n\nEQUATION:\nVECTOR_G ⊗ MATRIX_M = RENDER_TARGET\n[SCENE_DECOMPOSITION_RULES]\nThe AI must infer all structural elements of [VARIABLE_SCENE] and translate them into a pure paper-engineering system.\n\n[MAPPING_CONSTRAINTS]\nReplace 100% of the scene materials with paper-based materials only.\n\nNo actual metal, stone, glass, wood, cloth, or plastic may remain.\nEvery form must feel folded, creased, cut, layered, rolled, slotted, or assembled from paper.\n\nThe construction should look intelligent, crisp, and handcrafted.\n\n[COMPOSITION]\nMacro paper-sculpture photography.\nThe entire scene appears as a miniature paper diorama on a matte black tabletop.\n[VISUAL_EXECUTION]\nRender the RENDER_TARGET.\nLighting: clean directional studio light.\nTexture: visible paper grain, sharp creases, soft vellum translucency, layered cut-paper edges.\nThe illusion of the scene must be strong, but the paper craftsmanship must be undeniable.",
      "gen_prompt": "[칸별 개별 생성 후 2열 합성 — 각 칸 1216x684]\n\n── 칸 1 (reef) · 얹은 글자: \"A HEALED REEF\"\nThe scene is a coral reef brought back to life: branching corals of rolled and slotted paper tubes, fan corals cut as pleated vellum sheets, a school of folded paper fish curving overhead, and a diver of layered cardstock releasing a ribbon of paper bubbles.\n\n── 칸 2 (transit) · 얹은 글자: \"A CITY THAT WALKS\"\nThe scene is a car-free city street: a tram of folded cardstock gliding on creased paper rails, layered paper street trees arching over the roadway, cut-paper pedestrians and cyclists crossing freely, and paper-fibre facades with vellum windows on both sides.\n\n── 칸 3 (farm) · 얹은 글자: \"FOOD FROM THE TOWER\"\nThe scene is a vertical farm: stacked paper growing trays climbing a slotted cardstock frame, rows of tiny folded lettuce and herb rosettes, vellum panels diffusing the light, and a rolled paper irrigation pipe threading through every level.\n\n── 칸 4 (orbit) · 얹은 글자: \"A QUIET LAUNCH\"\nThe scene is a small spaceport at dawn: a slender rocket of rolled paper on a slotted cardstock gantry, folded paper exhaust unfurling as flat pleated plumes rather than smoke, vellum clouds layered behind it, and paper technicians watching from a cut-paper platform.\n\n── 네 칸 공통 스타일\nRendered as macro paper-sculpture photography: the entire scene is a miniature paper diorama standing on a matte black tabletop. Every material in the scene has been replaced by paper-based material only, so nothing metal, stone, glass, wood, cloth or plastic remains: every form is folded, creased, cut, layered, rolled, slotted or assembled from origami paper, folded cardstock, vellum and paper fibres. The construction looks intelligent, crisp and handcrafted, with visible paper grain, sharp creases, soft vellum translucency and layered cut-paper edges. Clean directional studio light. The illusion of the scene is strong but the paper craftsmanship is undeniable. There is no lettering anywhere in the frame.",
      "prompt_ko": "★수식 표기가 실제로 일을 한다 — `VECTOR_G(장면 기하) ⊗ MATRIX_M(재질 세계) = RENDER_TARGET`. 장면은 «변수»로 비워 두고 재질만 못박아, 무엇이 들어와도 같은 번역을 받게 만든 구조다.\n\n★강제 조항이 핵심 — «장면 재질의 100%를 종이 계열로 치환한다. 금속·돌·유리·나무·천·플라스틱이 «남아 있으면 안 된다». 모든 형태는 접히거나 접선이 있거나 잘리거나 겹치거나 말리거나 끼워지거나 조립된 것으로 보여야 한다.» 비율이 아니라 «100%»와 «남으면 안 된다»로 쓴 것이 통하는 이유는, 이게 «면적 배분»이 아니라 «허용 목록»이기 때문이다(런북 §③ 면적 퍼센트는 안 따르지만 이런 제약은 따른다).\n★재현 = 희망적 미래 4장면(산호초 회복·차 없는 거리·수직농장·조용한 발사).\n\n---\n★재현 방식 교체 — 처음엔 한 장으로 그리드를 시켰는데 **Krea2가 칸마다 같은 구도를\n반복**해서 원본과 딴판이 나왔다. 주제를 gen_prompt에 정확히 적어놔도 그렇다 — 지시를 못 따르는 게\n아니라 **단일 이미지 확산 모델이라 칸마다 다른 의미를 배정하지 못하는 것**이다.\n→ **칸마다 한 장씩 뽑아 합성**하고, Krea2가 못 쓰는 영문 타이포는 코드로 얹었다.\n   정본 스크립트 `automation/grid_repro.py` + spec `automation/grid_specs/gdgtify-paper-material-translation-engine.json`.\n   런북 §gen_prompt ④ 참조.",
