      "target_model": "GPT-image 2",
      "category": "제품 광고",
      "title": "★파이썬 클래스로 쓴 «결정론적» 캠페인 생성기 — run_id를 시드 삼아 무브먼트·그래픽 풀에서 3개씩 뽑고 60/30/10 위계로 가중해, 같은 제품에서 «재현 가능한» 다른 광고를 뽑는 구조",
      "prompt": "2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 strange international snacks that were real: class universal_deterministic_campaign:\n    def __init__(self, category=\"[$category]\", product=\"[$product]\", run_id=\"[$run_id]\"):\n        self.canvas = \"2:1 aspect ratio sheet. professional negative space. believable print-production detail.\"\n        self.core_virtue = infer_core_virtue(category) # [u4] concept truth\n\n    def execute_combinatorics(self):\n        # [u1 & u2] universal pool & deterministic 60/30/10 selection\n        movement_pool = generate_pool(self.category, type=\"movement\")\n        graphic_pool = generate_pool(self.category, type=\"graphic\")\n        \n        movements = unrank_selection(movement_pool, self. run_id, count=3)\n        graphics = unrank_selection(graphic_pool, self. run_id, count=3)\n        \n        hierarchy = {\"dominant\": 0.6, \"supporting\": 0.3, \"accent\": 0.1}\n        return apply_weights(movements, graphics, hierarchy)\n\n    def preserve_product_fidelity(self):\n        # [u3] product truth\n        return f\"exact model, proportions, and defining geometry of {self.product}. zero malformed functional parts. photorealistic materials.\"\n\n    def generate_print_layout(self):\n        # [u4, u5, & η] concept truth & honest print\n        selections = self.execute_combinatorics()\n        headline, tagline = generate_copy(self.core_virtue, selections)\n        \n        return f\"16:9-safe advertisement on a 2:1 sheet. sharp body geometry. authentic ink/paper registration. headline: '{headline}'. tagline: '{tagline}'.\"\n\nrender_campaign(universal_deterministic_campaign())",
      "gen_prompt": "[칸별 개별 생성 후 2열 합성 — 각 칸 1216x684]\n\n── 칸 1 (seaweed) · 얹은 글자: \"SEAWEED CRISPS\"\nThe product is a flat sheet of roasted seasoned seaweed, glossy dark green and translucent at the edges, held upright against a bold flat vermilion field that occupies most of the sheet, with a thin ivory rule and one small circular accent of pale gold. The headline reads CRISP FROM THE TIDE.\n\n── 칸 2 (pickleicecream) · 얹은 글자: \"PICKLE ICE CREAM\"\nThe product is a pale mint-green scoop of ice cream with visible flecks of dill and cucumber, set on a cold steel scoop rest against a dominant field of brine yellow, with an off-white diagonal band supporting it and one small chartreuse dot as the accent. The headline reads SWEET AND SOUR AT ONCE.\n\n── 칸 3 (eggcandy) · 얹은 글자: \"CENTURY EGG CANDY\"\nThe product is a glossy amber-black hard candy with a dark translucent centre, resting on a cream paper wrapper against a dominant deep charcoal field, with a wide band of muted jade supporting it and one small orange accent square. The headline reads A HUNDRED YEARS IN ONE BITE.\n\n── 칸 4 (meatfloss) · 얹은 글자: \"PORK FLOSS PUFFS\"\nThe product is a pale round puffed cracker coated in fine golden-brown shredded pork floss, shown large and slightly tilted against a dominant warm sand field, with a bold brick-red horizontal bar supporting it and one small white circle as the accent. The headline reads SAVOURY AND WEIGHTLESS.\n\n── 네 칸 공통 스타일\nRendered as a printed advertisement on a wide press sheet with professional negative space and believable print-production detail: authentic ink and paper registration, a faint halftone rosette in the flat areas, and one clean sheet edge. The product is photographed with exact proportions and defining geometry preserved, photorealistic materials, no malformed parts. Three graphic movements and three graphic devices are combined in a strict sixty-thirty-ten hierarchy, so one element dominates the sheet, one supports it and one is a small accent. The headline sits in a clean empty area of the sheet and never crosses the product. No other lettering appears anywhere in the frame.",
      "prompt_ko": "★이 계정의 코드 패러다임 중 «난수를 다루는» 유일한 판이다. `unrank_selection(pool, run_id, count=3)` — 풀에서 무작위로 고르는 게 아니라 **run_id로 «순위를 역산»해** 뽑는다. 같은 run_id면 같은 광고가 나오고, 바꾸면 다른 광고가 나온다. **«다양성»과 «재현성»을 동시에 얻는 장치**다.\n\n★뽑은 뒤에는 `hierarchy = {dominant 0.6, supporting 0.3, accent 0.1}`로 «위계»를 씌운다. 요소를 세 개 고르는 것과 그중 하나를 지배시키는 것은 다른 일이고, 후자가 광고를 광고답게 만든다.\n★`preserve_product_fidelity()`가 «정확한 모델·비율·규정 기하 · 기형 부품 제로»를 별도 메서드로 분리한 것도 눈여겨볼 점 — 스타일과 제품 정확도를 «따로» 지시한다.\n★재현 = 실재했던 기묘한 세계 과자 4종.\n\n---\n★재현 방식 교체 — 처음엔 한 장으로 그리드를 시켰는데 **Krea2가 칸마다 같은 구도를\n반복**해서 원본과 딴판이 나왔다. 주제를 gen_prompt에 정확히 적어놔도 그렇다 — 지시를 못 따르는 게\n아니라 **단일 이미지 확산 모델이라 칸마다 다른 의미를 배정하지 못하는 것**이다.\n→ **칸마다 한 장씩 뽑아 합성**하고, Krea2가 못 쓰는 영문 타이포는 코드로 얹었다.\n   정본 스크립트 `automation/grid_repro.py` + spec `automation/grid_specs/gdgtify-deterministic-campaign-class-print-ad.json`.\n   런북 §gen_prompt ④ 참조.",
