      "title": "★«같은 굵기로 화면을 가로지르다가 제품에서만 반응하는 선» — 80%는 두께가 변하지 않고 제품 근처에서만 감기게 해서, 선 하나로 좌우를 잇고 제품에 시선을 꽂는 21:9 광고 구조",
      "prompt": "Nano banana pro promotional and Cinematic Prompt🕸 ⤵️\n\nUsing the uploaded product as the exact reference, preserve its original shape, branding, packaging, label, logo, colors, proportions and details. Do not redesign, replace or modify the product in any way. Create a premium minimalist advertising composition in a panoramic 21:9 format. Use a seamless studio background matching the dominant color of the product (or the user-specified color) with a soft radial gradient and subtle vignette. On the far left, place a generic red web- pattern glove performing a web-shooting hand gesture. A realistic white spider web shoots horizontally across the frame, maintaining identical thickness across approximately 80% of its length. Only near the product should the web naturally wrap around, attach to, interact with, or visually blend into the product in a clean and satisfying way while preserving the product's original appearance.\n The web should remain the same width throughout the composition and create a smooth, seamless transition from left to right. Keep the composition clean with plenty of negative space. Luxury commercial product photography, ultra-realistic, premium advertising aesthetic, soft studio lighting, realistic shadows, ultra-sharp focus, glossy details, 8K, highly detailed, photorealistic.\n\nModel: Nano banana pro \n\n #NanoBananaPro",
      "gen_prompt": "Using the product as the exact reference, preserve its original shape, packaging, label, colours, proportions and details; do not redesign, replace or modify the product in any way. The product is a tall matte-teal glass bottle of cold brew coffee with a plain kraft label and a brushed copper cap.\n\nCreate a premium minimalist advertising composition in a panoramic 21:9 format on a seamless studio background of the same matte teal as the product, with a soft radial gradient and a subtle vignette.\n\nOn the far left, a bare adult hand reaches in from outside the frame with the index finger extended. The hand wears no glove and no costume of any kind: it is plain bare skin with a plain grey shirt cuff at the wrist, with no mask, no red fabric, no black webbing pattern, no wrist device and no emblem anywhere.\n\nA single realistic white silk thread runs horizontally across the frame from that fingertip, holding exactly the same thickness across roughly eighty percent of its length. Only near the bottle does the thread divide, wrap around the glass and attach to the cap in a clean, satisfying way, while the bottle's own appearance stays untouched. The thread makes a smooth seamless transition from left to right.\n\nKeep the composition clean with generous negative space. Luxury commercial product photography, ultra-realistic, premium advertising aesthetic, soft studio lighting, realistic shadows, ultra-sharp focus, glossy details, highly detailed and photorealistic. No lettering appears anywhere except the plain kraft label on the bottle.",
      "prompt_ko": "★한 줄이 이 광고의 전부다 — *「maintaining identical thickness across approximately 80% of its length. Only near the product should the web naturally wrap around, attach to, or visually blend into the product」*. 선을 «장식»이 아니라 «시간축»으로 쓴다: 지루하게 일정하다가 «제품에서만» 사건이 일어난다.\n\n★배경을 «제품의 지배색과 같게» 잡은 것도 장치다 — 색 대비를 버리고 «형태 대비»만 남겨서 가느다란 선이 유일한 사건이 된다. 21:9 파노라마가 그 지루한 80%를 만들 공간을 준다.\n\n⚠️★**원문의 「generic red web-pattern glove」와 웹슈팅 제스처는 브랜드명을 안 써도 그 캐릭터를 부른다.** 런북 §치환 공식대로 부품마다 다른 형태를 적었다 — 장갑을 «맨손 + 회색 셔츠 커프»로 바꾸고 마스크·빨간 천·검은 웹 패턴·손목 장치·엠블럼을 각각 명시적으로 다른 것으로 채웠다. 거미줄은 «흰 실크 실»로. 이번 배치의 신발 건과 같은 조치.",
