      "prompt": "لا تعرض المنتج اجعله يفرض حضوره\n\nالبرومبت في الوصف ⬇️ https://t.co/oRsFsnP6JQ\n\n[이미지 ALT 전문]\nCreate a powerful premium advertising campaign for [PRODUCT], making the product the absolute hero of the scene. Use dramatic cinematic lighting, bold composition, strong visual hierarchy, dynamic perspective, realistic reflections and materials, deep contrast, and carefully controlled shadows. Add subtle motion-inspired elements and atmospheric depth to create energy and impact without distracting from the product. Maintain a clean luxury commercial aesthetic with intentional negative space, sophisticated brand colors, and high-end art direction. The final image should feel iconic, confident, expensive, and instantly attention-grabbing — like a global flagship campaign created by a top advertising agency. Ultra-detailed, photorealistic, polished commercial photography, premium product visualization, cinematic quality.\n\nCreate a powerful premium advertising campaign for [PRODUCT], making the product the absolute hero of the scene. Use dramatic cinematic lighting, bold composition, strong visual hierarchy, dynamic perspective, realistic reflections and materials, deep contrast, and carefully controlled shadows. Add subtle motion-inspired elements and atmospheric depth to create energy and impact without distracting from the product. Maintain a clean luxury commercial aesthetic with intentional negative space, sophisticated brand colors, and high-end art direction. The final image should feel iconic, confident, expensive, and instantly attention-grabbing — like a global flagship campaign created by a top advertising agency. Ultra-detailed, photorealistic, polished commercial photography, premium product visualization, cinematic quality.\n\nCreate a powerful premium advertising campaign for [PRODUCT], making the product the absolute hero of the scene. Use dramatic cinematic lighting, bold composition, strong visual hierarchy, dynamic perspective, realistic reflections and materials, deep contrast, and carefully controlled shadows. Add subtle motion-inspired elements and atmospheric depth to create energy and impact without distracting from the product. Maintain a clean luxury commercial aesthetic with intentional negative space, sophisticated brand colors, and high-end art direction. The final image should feel iconic, confident, expensive, and instantly attention-grabbing — like a global flagship campaign created by a top advertising agency. Ultra-detailed, photorealistic, polished commercial photography, premium product visualization, cinematic quality.\n\nCreate a powerful premium advertising campaign for [PRODUCT], making the product the absolute hero of the scene. Use dramatic cinematic lighting, bold composition, strong visual hierarchy, dynamic perspective, realistic reflections and materials, deep contrast, and carefully controlled shadows. Add subtle motion-inspired elements and atmospheric depth to create energy and impact without distracting from the product. Maintain a clean luxury commercial aesthetic with intentional negative space, sophisticated brand colors, and high-end art direction. The final image should feel iconic, confident, expensive, and instantly attention-grabbing — like a global flagship campaign created by a top advertising agency. Ultra-detailed, photorealistic, polished commercial photography, premium product visualization, cinematic quality.",
      "gen_prompt": "Nothing in this image carries any writing. The flask surface is one unbroken matte black field with no label, no logo and no printed word on it, the copper collar is plain knurled metal, and every open area of the background is a smooth charcoal gradient with nothing written across it.\n\nCreate a powerful premium advertising campaign for a matte black stainless vacuum flask with a knurled copper collar, making the product the absolute hero of the scene. Use dramatic cinematic lighting, bold composition, strong visual hierarchy, dynamic perspective, realistic reflections and materials, deep contrast, and carefully controlled shadows. Add subtle motion-inspired elements and atmospheric depth to create energy and impact without distracting from the product. Maintain a clean luxury commercial aesthetic with intentional negative space, sophisticated brand colors, and high-end art direction. The final image should feel iconic, confident, expensive, and instantly attention-grabbing — like a global flagship campaign created by a top advertising agency. Ultra-detailed, photorealistic, polished commercial photography, premium product visualization, cinematic quality. The brand colours are charcoal, copper and bone.",
      "prompt_ko": "★슬롯이 `[PRODUCT]` 하나뿐인 최소 템플릿인데, 나머지 문장이 «제품 광고가 실패하는 방식»을 정확히 겨눈다 — *「energy and impact «without distracting from the product»」*. 요소를 더하되 주인공을 뺏지 말라는 조건이 템플릿 전체에 걸려 있다.\n\n★그리고 «고급»을 형용사가 아니라 조건으로 적는다 — 의도된 여백 · 정제된 브랜드 색 · 통제된 그림자 · 강한 시각 위계. 마지막 문장이 완성도의 기준을 준다: *「최고 광고 대행사가 만든 «글로벌 플래그십 캠페인»처럼 느껴질 것」*.\n★본문은 아랍어 두 줄뿐이고 프롬프트 전문은 ALT에 있었다. 재현 = 무광 스테인리스 보온병.",
