      "title": "★슬롯 여섯 개로 1960년대 유럽 광고를 재현한다 — [인물]·[탈것]·[동물]·[의상]·[팔레트]·[배경]만 바꾸고 «과슈 색면·드라이브러시·단순화된 이목구비»는 고정",
      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 on CHATGPT \n\nPROMPT:\n\nMid-century travel-ad illustration featuring [HUMANS] riding [VEHICLE], accompanied by [ANIMAL]. Dress them in [CLOTHING] using [PALETTE]. Place the scene in [SCENERY], with lush stylized foliage framing the figures and vehicle. Render with flat gouache-like color shapes, visible dry-brush strokes, simplified facial features, crisp graphic silhouettes, hand-painted texture, decorative botanical forms, and warm sunlit color harmony. Keep the composition elegant, cheerful, fashion-forward, and distinctly 1960s European advertising. Aspect ratio 4:5.",
      "gen_prompt": "Mid-century travel-ad illustration featuring two adult travellers riding a pale blue open-top scooter, accompanied by a long-haired whippet sitting upright between them. Dress them in tailored cream linen and a soft coral headscarf, using a palette of coral, cream, olive and sun-faded turquoise. Place the scene on a cliffside coastal road above a bay, with lush stylised foliage framing the figures and the scooter. Render with flat gouache-like colour shapes, visible dry-brush strokes, simplified facial features, crisp graphic silhouettes, hand-painted texture, decorative botanical forms and warm sunlit colour harmony. Keep the composition elegant, cheerful, fashion-forward and distinctly 1960s European advertising. Aspect ratio four by five. There is no lettering anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★교과서적인 슬롯형이다. 바뀌는 것 여섯 개를 대괄호로 열어 두고, 나머지는 «렌더링 어휘»로 잠근다 — 평평한 과슈풍 색면 · 보이는 드라이브러시 획 · 단순화된 이목구비 · 선명한 그래픽 실루엣 · 손으로 칠한 질감 · 장식적 식물 형태 · 따뜻한 햇빛 색 조화.\n\n★★특히 «simplified facial features»가 중요한 선택이다 — 얼굴을 단순화해야 인물이 «주인공»이 아니라 «그래픽 요소»로 남고, 그래서 이 템플릿은 인물이 들어가도 공개행이다(런북 §공개/개인 판정: 인물 형상이 디자인의 «재료»로 쓰인 것).\n★그리고 «lush stylized foliage framing the figures and vehicle»로 프레이밍까지 고정해 무엇을 넣어도 같은 구도가 나오게 했다.",
