      "prompt": "🎨 VICTORIAN GHOSTLY ELEGANCE 🎨\n\nPrompt  :\n\n[SUBJECT] illustrated in a Victorian Ghostly Elegance pencil sketch, blending refined period details with spectral, haunting figures using soft, flowing lines. Employ subtle tonal gradients of [TONE1] and [TONE2] grays to create an eerie yet sophisticated mood\n\nCheck ALTS\n\n[이미지 ALT 전문]\nA horse-drawn carriage illustrated in a Victorian Ghostly Elegance pencil sketch, blending refined period details with spectral, haunting figures using soft, flowing lines. Employ subtle tonal gradients of smoky and dove grays to create an eerie yet sophisticated mood --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nForgotten ballroom dancers illustrated in a Victorian Ghostly Elegance pencil sketch, blending refined period details with spectral, haunting figures using soft, flowing lines. Employ subtle tonal gradients of iron and dove grays to create an eerie yet sophisticated mood --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nA Victorian library illustrated in a Victorian Ghostly Elegance pencil sketch, blending refined period details with spectral, haunting figures using soft, flowing lines. Employ subtle tonal gradients of ashen and slate grays to create an eerie yet sophisticated mood --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nAn abandoned manor illustrated in a Victorian Ghostly Elegance pencil sketch, blending refined period details with spectral, haunting figures using soft, flowing lines. Employ subtle tonal gradients of charcoal and silver grays to create an eerie yet sophisticated mood --ar 3:2 --v 8.2",
      "gen_prompt": "A horse-drawn carriage illustrated in a Victorian Ghostly Elegance pencil sketch, blending refined period details with spectral, haunting figures using soft, flowing lines. Employ subtle tonal gradients of smoky and dove grays to create an eerie yet sophisticated mood Vertical three by two format. There is no lettering anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★슬롯이 셋뿐인 짧은 템플릿(`[SUBJECT]` + `[TONE1]` + `[TONE2]`)인데 «대비의 축»을 명시한다 — *「blending refined period details with spectral, haunting figures」*(정제된 시대 디테일 × 유령 같은 형상). 어느 한쪽으로 기울면 골동품 삽화나 공포 그림이 된다.\n\n★그리고 색을 «두 개의 회색»으로만 받는다 — 팔레트를 슬롯으로 여는 대신 «몇 개»를 못박는 방식. 런북 §③(면적 퍼센트는 안 통하고 개수·형용사는 통한다)에 부합하는 설계.\n★본문에 «Check ALTS»라고 적어 두고 완성 예시를 ALT에 넣었다 — 슬롯 템플릿과 실제 채운 예시를 «한 트윗에» 담는 방식(런북 §ALT숨김형의 변형). 재현은 그 예시(유령 마차) 그대로.",
