      "title": "★★코스프레·의상 제작을 «만들 수 있었는가»로 구속한다 — 모든 마모는 «닿은 사건»으로, 모든 무게는 «지지물의 반력»으로 역추적된다",
      "prompt": "I was looking for a system to generate images for classic books to turn them into videos. Here is one that GPT says is very advanced: \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 non-copyrighted books: COSPLAY_HONEST_FRAME   INPUT = [ CHARACTER_REF / BUILD_MATERIALS / LIGHT_RIG / POSE / T ]  UNKNOWNS  L⃗ (light position, 3) · α (source angular radius) · κ (colour temp)           · M (costume mass distribution) · T (shutter)  LAWS   developable   flat woven cloth ⇒ K=0. Compound curve ⇒ darts | bias/knit | heat-form.                 Exactly one is visible. Seamless woven over positive K = FORBIDDEN.   bending       fold wavelength λ ~ (B/ρ_s g)^(1/3) — set by the cloth, never finer.   load path     every element's weight back-projects to a support (strap/harness/magnet/rig).                 Support present ⇒ its reaction is visible (compression, tension, sag).   fabrication   feature size ≥ material minimum. EVA stock ∈ {2,5,6,10mm}; FDM layers                 0.1–0.3mm unless sanded; Worbla pebbles unless sealed; resin shows seam+pinhole.                 A 0.3mm edge on a 10mm foam blade has no process that made it.   optics        penumbra w ≈ d·(s/r) ; specular lobe width = f(roughness, α) ;                 falloff ∝ 1/r² ; catchlight = scaled image of the source.   kinematics    the pose must be reachable given the armour's articulation gaps.   wear          every scuff back-projects to a contact event. High points, hems, grip zones.                 Weathering on a surface that touches nothing has no cause.  CONSERVATION   Mass(costume) = Σ support reactions + postural compensation.   Read-as-steel ⇒ straps bite. Read-as-foam ⇒ edges show stock thickness. Not both.  OVERDETERMINATION   5 unknowns, 8 recovery routes ⇒ 3 redundant equalities   L̂_catchlight   L̂_shadow_dir   L̂_specular   L̂_falloff   α̂_penumbra     α̂_catchlight_size     α̂_terminator     κ̂_shadow_colour  NESTED EXPOSURE   T is its own scalar. hair blur = ‖v_strand‖·T ; cape blur = ‖v_hem‖·T.   Crisp strands ⇒ T≈0 ⇒ cape, dust, breath, background ALL frozen.  FIDELITY   sil(character_ref) vs sil(frame): IoU ≥ τ, with LAWFUL deviation only —            a real body's proportions, and the armature any cantilever needs.  TWO COHERENT REGIMES (the degenerate branch, per #3)   A: strobe — T≈0, hard specular, frozen everything, ambient suppressed   B: ambient/dusk — T long, hem and hair smeared together, practicals trail   Mixing regimes without dragged-shutter evidence = FORBIDDEN.  FORBIDDEN  (each = a named violation)   floating pauldron, no strap/harness/magnet         → load path   steel-read armour, zero strap compression          → weight conservation   seamless woven cloth over a helmet dome            → developable   chiffon-scale ripple in heavy leather              → bending length   razor edge on a foam prop                          → fabrication minimum   weathering where nothing contacts                  → wear back-projection   two shadow families from one visible source        → light field   frozen hair beside smeared cape                    → nested T   pose the joint gaps cannot reach                   → kinematics",
      "gen_prompt": "A full-length studio photograph of a costumed figure in handmade armour, shot as documentation rather than fantasy. The chest and shoulder plates are cut from foam of a visible, consistent stock thickness — every edge shows that same thickness, and no edge is thinner than the material could be. The pauldron does not float: a leather strap runs under the arm to a harness, and the strap bites into the fabric beneath it, compressed and slightly creased where the weight sits. The wearer's stance carries that load — one hip set, shoulders drawn back against the mass. The cloth of the underlayer is flat woven, so where it wraps the body it is gathered into darts and seams rather than stretched smoothly over the curve, and its folds fall in broad soft waves, never fine ripples. Scuffing appears only on the high points, the hem and the grip zones — the raised ridge of the breastplate, the lower edge that meets the ground, the palm of the glove — and the recessed panels are clean. A single soft key light from upper left throws a shadow with a wide gradual edge; the catchlight in the eyes is a large soft rectangle matching that source, and the shadow side falls to a cool neutral. Hair strands are perfectly sharp, and so is everything else in the frame — one frozen instant, no drifting dust, no trailing cape. Neutral seamless backdrop, natural colour, no text anywhere in the image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**물리 법칙형 문법의 «제작(fabrication)» 판.** [[gdgtify-underwater-laws-bound-the-color-budget]]가\n광학이라면 이쪽은 **재료와 하중**이다. 지금까지의 «리얼하게»가 왜 실패했는지를 설명한다.\n\n```\n전개가능성   평평한 직물은 가우스 곡률 0 → 복곡면을 덮으려면 다트 · 바이어스/니트 · 열성형\n             중 «정확히 하나»가 보여야 한다. ★이음매 없는 직물이 볼록면을 매끈히 덮으면 금지\n굽힘 파장    주름 λ ~ (B/ρ_s g)^(1/3) — 옷감이 정하는 값이라 «그보다 잘게» 잡히지 않는다\n★하중 경로   모든 부품의 무게는 지지물(스트랩·하네스·자석)로 역투영된다.\n             지지물이 있으면 «그 반력이 보여야» 한다 — 눌림 · 장력 · 처짐\n제작 최소치수 EVA 폼은 2·5·6·10mm 규격 · FDM은 0.1~0.3mm 적층 · 레진은 이음매와 핀홀이 남는다\n             ★10mm 폼 칼날에 0.3mm 엣지는 «그것을 만든 공정이 존재하지 않는다»\n★마모        모든 긁힘은 «닿은 사건»으로 역투영된다. 높은 지점 · 밑단 · 쥐는 곳.\n             아무것도 닿지 않는 면의 웨더링은 «원인이 없다»\n```\n★**보존식이 판정을 강제한다** — `Mass = Σ지지 반력 + 자세 보정`. «강철로 읽히면 스트랩이 살을\n파고들고, 폼으로 읽히면 모서리에 원자재 두께가 보인다. 둘 다는 안 된다.»\n\n★이 구조가 값어치 있는 이유는 **«가짜 티»의 정체를 명명했기 때문**이다. AI 의상 이미지가\n어색한 건 해상도가 아니라 ①무게를 받는 지지물이 없고 ②마모가 닿지 않는 곳에 있고\n③재료가 만들 수 없는 두께로 그려지기 때문이다. 세 가지를 각각 문장으로 막았다.\n\n📌원문 2x2 그리드 중 칸 하나를 대표로 단일 재현. 원문의 «비저작권 도서 4종» 슬롯은 IP 회피를\n위해 무국적 창작 갑주로 채웠다.",
