      "seed": 384370730,
      "prompt_ko": "★**«정교하게»가 아니라 «덜 자르기»가 고급의 조건이다.**\n\n```\n상단 22~25%     무조건 빈 종이로 남긴다 — 제목이 앉을 자리이자 «비싼 여백»\n★랜드마크       가장 정의적인 조형만 남기고 «장식 디테일을 지운다» (창문·조각 금지)\n요소 개수 고정   구름 2~3 · 다리 1 · 배경 실루엣 몇 · 전경 나무 몇 · ★특징 사물 «정확히 1개»\n금지 명시       해·원·붉은 점 같은 «장식 디스크»를 콕 집어 배제\n```\n★**«실루엣이 디테일을 이긴다»가 종이컷의 규칙**이다. 층이 늘어나면 공예품이 아니라 클립아트가 된다.\n\n같은 계정의 [[goodmanprotocol-four-inks-tones-only-by-stipple]]와 짝 — 저쪽은 «색 수»를, 이쪽은 «층 수»를 잠근다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical 9:16 travel poster made as a minimal handcrafted layered paper-cut collage on a warm off-white cardstock ground with fine visible paper fibres, crisp cut edges, soft dimensional relief and delicate contact shadows. The top quarter of the poster is open empty paper. Centred in it, the single word NEW YORK is set in dark navy uppercase geometric sans with wide letter spacing; this is the only text in the image. Beneath the title float two small white paper clouds and nothing else in the sky. The dominant centrepiece is the Empire State Building reduced to clean layered paper shapes, keeping only its defining setbacks, spire and proportions, with elegant symmetry and a strong silhouette rather than sculptural detail. One smooth simple paper form crosses the lower middle as a bridge deck. Behind the landmark a few flat simplified city silhouettes sit as supporting layers. In the foreground a very minimal street layer: a few soft sage paper tree shapes, one pale paving band, and exactly one small yellow paper taxi as the single characteristic detail. Palette limited to warm ivory, deep navy blue, muted blue-gray, sage green and one restrained yellow accent. Soft studio light from the upper left casting subtle shadows toward the lower right."
