      "category": "실험/기법",
      "title": "★프롬프트를 «목적함수 + 하드 제약»으로 쓴다 — 가중치로 우선순위를 주고 `>=` 로 «절대 양보 못 할 선»을 따로 못박는 문법",
      "prompt": "Another attempt at data physication. Used to see similar images on Reddit. Now you can make them with AI \n\nGPT Prompt: AI picks topics\nVARIABLES ::=\nSi = silhouette clarity     (the subject form reads instantly)\nCt = category-share fidelity (object count per zone maps to supplied share)\nOb = object recognizability (individual items are identifiable)\nZn = zone distinctness      (category regions separable inside the silhouette)\nUn = unit-key clarity       (one object = X, stated)\nDn = packing density        (tessellated, no dead space)\nLb = label + leader-line clarity\nTh = thumbnail survival\nPl = palette discipline\nNe = negative-space cleanliness\nSc = series consistency\nLt = lighting consistency   (one flat-lay light, no mixed shadows)\nFa = factual restraint\nPo = premium render polish\n\nMAXIMIZE ::=\nJ = 0.14Si + 0.13Ct + 0.10Ob + 0.09Zn + 0.08Un + 0.07Dn + 0.07Lb + 0.07Th + 0.06Pl + 0.04Ne + 0.04Sc + 0.02Lt + 0.07Fa + 0.02Po\n\nCONSTRAINTS ::=\nSi >= 0.92   // the silhouette must survive at any size\nCt >= 0.88   // zone area tracks the category share\nOb >= 0.88   // items stay identifiable close up\nZn >= 0.86   // regions are separable\nUn >= 0.86   // the unit is stated\nDn >= 0.86   // density carries the richness\nLb >= 0.88   // hairline leaders, small-caps labels\nTh >= 0.90   // reads as the subject at 400px\nPl >= 0.88   // restrained, unified\nNe >= 0.88   // clean bone-white field\nSc >= 0.86\nLt >= 0.86\nFa >= 0.94   // no invented category shares\nPo >= 0.88\n\nENCODING ::=\nzone area within silhouette -> that category's share of the whole\nobject count per zone       -> supplied count, or stated as illustrative\nsilhouette shape            -> the subject itself (carries no value)\nobject size                 -> true relative object size, never a data channel\n\nCOMPOSITION ::=\ncenter zone   :: the filled silhouette, generous margin on all sides\nmargin zone   :: 6-8 category labels around the perimeter\nleader lines  :: thin hairlines from each label to its zone\nbase zone     :: unit key and source line, small, bottom-aligned\n\nPALETTE ::=\nbone-white or warm cream ground\ndesaturated earth range: charcoal, bronze, ivory, olive, oxblood\nno more than one saturated accent across the whole set\n\nMATERIAL ::=\nreal objects, top-down flat lay, soft even studio light\nconsistent shadow direction, slight contact shadow only\n\nTYPOGRAPHY ::=\nlabels     :: small-caps serif, letterspaced, ~2% of frame height\nunit key   :: same family, lighter weight\nhierarchy  :: silhouette > labels > key > source\n\nSERIES ::=\nidentical ground color, margin, label style, and light across all panels\none subject per panel, same silhouette scale relative to frame\ncategory label count consistent (6-8) panel to panel\n\nTHUMBNAIL_TEST ::=\nat 400px the silhouette must be identifiable without labels\n\nUNIT_CHAIN ::=\nif object counts are illustrative rather than counted, print \"illustrative density\"\nif zone areas encode shares, print the share figures in the key\n\nREQUIRED ::=\na stated unit key, 6-8 perimeter labels, a leader line per label,\na source line, uniform margin\n\nFORBIDDEN ::=\nunverified source data, made up data, hallucinations, inaccurate data\nzone areas untied to shares, object size used as a hidden value channel, invented category proportions\nobjects breaking the silhouette edge, gaps that fracture the form, mixed lighting directions\nlabels without leaders, overlapping leader lines, cluttered or textured background",
      "ref_image": "results/gdgtify-objective-function-with-hard-constraints-ref.jpg",
      "result": "results/gdgtify-objective-function-with-hard-constraints.webp",
      "seed": 249144005,
      "prompt_ko": "★**이 프롬프트의 형식이 논지다 — 「좋게 해줘」를 «점수 함수»와 «하한선»으로 분리해 쓴다.**\n\n```\nVARIABLES ::=  Si 실루엣 명료 · Ct 카테고리 면적 충실 · Ob 개체 식별 · Zn 구역 분리 ·\n               Un 단위키 명료 · Dn 밀도 · Lb 라벨/리더선 · Th 썸네일 생존 · Pl 팔레트 규율 …\nMAXIMIZE   ::=  J = 0.14Si + 0.13Ct + 0.10Ob + 0.09Zn + … ← ★가중치가 «우선순위»다\n★CONSTRAINTS ::= Si>=0.92 · Ct>=0.88 · Ob>=0.88 · Zn>=0.86 ← «양보 못 할 하한»\n```\n★**가중치와 제약을 «분리»한 게 핵심이다.** 가중치만 있으면 모델이 낮은 항목을 버려서 총점을 올릴 수 있는데, 하한선이 그걸 막는다. 「실루엣은 어떤 크기에서도 살아남아야 한다(Th)」 같은 **검수 기준을 프롬프트 안에 미리 넣어 둔 것**이기도 하다.\n\n⚠️Krea2는 수치 자체를 못 따른다(런북 §④ 수치 제약). 그래서 gen_prompt에서는 «0.92»를 «어떤 크기에서도 즉시 읽힌다»로, «면적 공유»를 «큰 구역/작은 구역»으로 **번역**했다 — 런북 「수치는 말로 하지 말고 형용사·비유로」.\n\n---\n★★**재현 실측 — 라벨 다섯 조각(BEANS·SUGAR·MILK·COCOA·ONE BEAN = 1G)이 리더선까지 전부 정확.**\n런북 ⑤-확정 4조건을 그대로 걸었고(대문자 · 한두 단어 · 자리를 빈 종이로 지정 · 총량 못박기), 단위키 「ONE BEAN = 1G」처럼 «기호가 섞인 줄»도 살았다.\n★**수치 제약을 «형용사»로 번역한 것이 통했다** — `Si>=0.92`를 «어떤 크기에서도 즉시 읽힌다»로, 면적 공유를 «큰 구역/작은 구역»으로 옮기니 컵 실루엣과 4구역 분리가 다 나왔다(런북 §수치 번역).",
      "gen_prompt": "A flat-lay data physicalization: the clean silhouette of a coffee cup, filled edge to edge with real physical objects arranged in tessellated zones, no empty space anywhere inside the outline. The silhouette reads instantly at any size. Inside it the objects are grouped into four clearly separable regions by kind, each region's area matching its share: a large region of roasted coffee beans, a smaller region of white sugar cubes, a narrow region of dried milk pearls, and a small region of cocoa nibs. Every individual object stays identifiable close up. Beside the silhouette, on clean empty paper, five short uppercase labels sit at the ends of thin leader lines pointing into their regions: BEANS, SUGAR, MILK, COCOA, and beneath them a unit key reading ONE BEAN = 1G. Those five pieces of text are the only text in the image. One single flat overhead light, no mixed shadows, disciplined palette of browns and creams on white, premium product render polish."
