      "title": "★프롬프트를 «대수식»으로 쓴다 — `OUTPUT = (체인 :: 규칙) − NEGATIVE`, 그리고 대상 재질에 따라 Mode A/B로 분기시킨다",
      "prompt_ko": "★**프롬프트의 마지막 줄이 논지다:**\n> `OUTPUT = (RENDER_CHAIN :: FUSION_RULES) - NEGATIVE`\n\n지시를 나열하는 대신 **«체인 × 규칙집합 − 배제집합»이라는 식(式)으로 조립**했다.\n\n```\nRENDER_CHAIN  \"[$ CITY :: $ CURRENCY :: money_art_extrusion :: macro_photography]\"\n★FUSION_RULES  dict — analyze_currency / base / extrusion / landmarks / micro_economy /\n               lighting / camera 를 «키:값»으로\n★Mode 분기      analyze_currency 가 통화 재질(니켈·구리·면·폴리머)과 도시 건축 질량을 «추론»해\n               Mode A(동전) 또는 Mode B(지폐)를 «고른다»\n                 A 동전 → 부조면이 위로 폭발, 같은 합금이 흘러 3D 건축이 된다\n                 B 지폐 → 잉크 선이 솟아올라 «지폐 자신으로 만든 팝업 종이 건축»이 된다\nmicro_economy  ★같은 금속·종이로 된 1:500 무채색 인물들이 «동전을 채굴하거나 지폐를 짓는다»\n```\n★**Mode 분기가 값어치다** — 하나의 프롬프트가 «대상의 재질에 따라 다른 연출로 갈라진다». 슬롯만 바꾸는 템플릿보다 한 단계 위다.\n\n★같은 작성자의 다른 문법과 나란히 보면 계보가 보인다 — [[gdgtify-weighted-stack-orders-form-over-render]](::N 우선순위) · [[gdgtify-sql-view-chain-culture-to-diorama]](SQL 뷰 체인) · [[gdgtify-embossing-repurposed-into-roads]](S0~S9 상태기계) · 이것(대수식). **주제가 아니라 문법이 매번 다르다.**\n\n---\n★**재현 실측 — Mode A(동전)가 그대로 나왔다.** 동전 부조면에서 같은 합금이 흘러 성당·시계탑·박공 주택이 솟았고, 표면과 «끊기지 않고 이어져» 있다(별도 모형이 얹힌 게 아니다). 1:500 무채색 인물 둘이 부조 위에서 «채굴»한다. 벨벳·매크로·수차 있는 얕은 심도까지.\n★`OUTPUT = (체인 :: 규칙) − NEGATIVE` 형식은 Krea2에서도 무리 없이 읽혔다.",
      "gen_prompt": "An extreme macro photograph of a single high-denomination coin resting on dark velvet cloth, its surface showing scratches, worn relief and mint lustre in nickel-brass alloy. From the bas-relief face of the coin the metal erupts upward: the same alloy flows and rises into three-dimensional architecture of a city, a domed cathedral, a clock tower and a row of narrow gabled houses, all formed out of the coin's own metal and still continuous with its surface, never a separate model placed on top. Tiny unpainted figures at roughly 1:500 scale, cast in that same alloy, work across the relief as though mining the coin. Numismatic angled lighting gives high specularity on the metal faces and deep raking shadow in the struck detail. Front plane tack sharp, background falling into creamy bokeh, square 1:1 framing, 8k detail. No text anywhere in the image.",
      "source": "https://x.com/Gdgtify/status/2088283252511719804",
      "prompt": "haven't done these currency prompts for a while. Here is another one I tested for 4 different cities. \n\nRENDER_CHAIN = \"[$ CITY :: $ CURRENCY :: money_art_extrusion :: macro_photography]\"\n\nFUSION_RULES = {\n    \"analyze_currency\": \"infer currency material (nickel, copper, brass, cotton, polymer, ink) and high denomination; infer city architectural mass to choose Mode A (Coin) or Mode B (Banknote)\",\n    \"base\": {\n        \"coin_mode\": \"single high-denomination coin resting on velvet cloth; macro details of scratches, relief, mint luster\",\n        \"note_mode\": \"crisp banknote lying flat on wooden desk; macro details of cotton fibers, intaglio ink, holographic strip\"\n    },\n    \"extrusion\": {\n        \"coin_mode\": \"bas-relief face of coin explodes upward; same alloy flows to form 3D skyscrapers/castles/temples of the city; landmarks rise from the metal\",\n        \"note_mode\": \"ink lines of bill rise upward into paper architecture; buildings look like origami/pop-up structures made of the note itself\"\n    },\n    \"landmarks\": \"infer 2-3 most famous landmarks; they are focal points of the extrusion, integrated into the currency material\",\n    \"micro_economy\": \"tiny unpainted 1:500 scale figures made of the same metal/paper; they are mining the coin or building the bill\",\n    \"lighting\": \"numismatic angled light: high specularity on coin metal, translucency on banknote paper\",\n    \"camera\": \"extreme macro, front sharp, background creamy bokeh, 1:1 aspect ratio\"\n}\n\nNEGATIVE = \"separate 3D model city, painted figures, wrong metal color, flat lighting, non-macro, watermarks\"\n\nOUTPUT = (RENDER_CHAIN :: FUSION_RULES) - NEGATIVE\nRENDER: single 8k Money Art image.",
