      "title": "★부품끼리 «⇒·≡·⇄»로 인과를 묶어 서로를 검증하게 한다 — 캠 프로파일이 밸브 타이밍과 모순되면 그림이 틀렸다고 프롬프트가 판정한다",
      "prompt": "This is a much more advanced prompt than the one I posted a couple of days ago. GPT gives it a score of 9.3/10. \n\nPrompt: \n2x2 grid, 16:9 do this for 4 complex legendary engines: K₁  COMBUSTION⇄LINKAGE COUPLING (master ::5)   the inferred cycle (intake timing, AFR, spark point, scavenging)       must be consistent with the linkage (crank throw, rod ratio, cam profile, pushrod geometry):       cam_profile ⇒ valve_events ≡ stated intake/exhaust timing;  V_angle + crank_throw ⇒ firing_interval;       pushrod_geometry ⇒ OHV/OHC truth.   ¬K₁ = cam contradicting valve timing / throw contradicting V‑angle. K₂  THERMAL TRUTH (::4)   cooling strategy matches heat load: air‑cooled ⇒ fin_area ∝ Q_comb (deep fins);       liquid ⇒ radiator, sparse fins; oil flow + exhaust shielding consistent with output.       ¬K₂ = tiny fins on a hot air‑cooled motor / fins on a liquid‑cooled block. K₃  HIDDEN‑CRAFT MACRO TRUTH (::3)   the macro callouts (ring gaps, bearing surfaces, valve seats, carb jets)       show REAL tolerances consistent with the engine's character (performance ⇒ tight clearance, big jets);       callouts point at genuine detail, ¬decorative circles.   ¬K₃ = callout pointing at nothing / wrong jets. K₄  EXPLODED CROSS‑SECTION COHERENCE   ONE central engine, exploded + sectioned along correct assembly axes,       parts in correct order/orientation (mentally re‑assemblable); cylinders/pistons/crank/cam/valves/carbs separated.       ¬K₄ = parts in wrong order/orientation / impossible assembly / multiple engines / clutter. K₅  ACOUSTIC + STYLE DNA + BRAND DISCIPLINE   acoustic signature inferred (firing rhythm, exhaust tuning) and       represented (restrained firing‑interval/waveform diagram); style blend = C4D .35 + catalog .25 + cross‑section .20       + workshop .15 + alu/chrome .10; deep charcoal/warm metallic bg; monospace technical type; restrained callouts;       premium negative space; brand omitted unless inevitable.   ¬K₅ = neon/hologram/VR / cheap glossy / wrong type. η   HONEST METAL   hyper‑real machined textures (machining marks, casting skin, chrome, polished alu); refined       lighting; ¬plastic shine · ¬watermark · ¬low‑poly · ¬messy garage · ¬stock photo. FORBIDDEN (your NEGATIVE + ::‑4) = ¬K₁∨¬K₂∨¬K¬K₄¬K₅∨¬η",
      "prompt_ko": "★**부품 사이의 «물리적 인과»를 기호로 묶어, 그림이 스스로를 검증하게 만든다.**\n```\nK₁ COMBUSTION⇄LINKAGE COUPLING (master ::5)\n   cam_profile ⇒ valve_events ≡ 명시된 흡·배기 타이밍\n   V_angle + crank_throw ⇒ firing_interval\n   pushrod_geometry ⇒ OHV/OHC 진위\n   ★¬K₁ = 캠이 밸브 타이밍과 모순 / 크랭크 스로가 V각과 모순\nK₂ THERMAL TRUTH (::4)  공랭 ⇒ fin_area ∝ Q_comb (깊은 핀) · 수랭 ⇒ 라디에이터, 성긴 핀\n   ★¬K₂ = 뜨거운 공랭 엔진에 «작은 핀» / 수랭 블록에 핀\nK₃ HIDDEN-CRAFT MACRO TRUTH (::3)  콜아웃이 «실제 공차»를 가리킨다 · ¬장식용 원\nK₄ EXPLODED CROSS-SECTION COHERENCE  ★«머릿속에서 재조립 가능한» 순서·방향\nK₅ ACOUSTIC + STYLE DNA  발화 리듬을 파형 도해로 · 스타일 혼합 비율을 소수로 지정\n   (C4D .35 + 카탈로그 .25 + 단면도 .20 + 공방 .15 + 알루/크롬 .10)\n```\n★**`⇄`가 이 프롬프트의 발명이다** — 연소와 링키지가 «서로»를 제약한다. 한쪽만 맞아선 안 된다.\n★[[gdgtify-physical-laws-forbid-impossible-combinations]](매크로 사진의 LAWS)와 같은 사고인데, 저쪽이 «광학 법칙»이라면 이쪽은 «기계 인과»다. 그리고 여기엔 `::N` 가중치까지 얹혀 있다.\n\n⚠️작성자가 *\"GPT gives it a score of 9.3/10\"*이라고 **자기 프롬프트를 모델에 채점시킨 것**도 기록해 둔다 — 프롬프트를 «작품»으로 다루는 이 계정의 태도가 드러난다.\n\n---\n★**재현 실측 — K₂(열역학 진실)가 눈에 보인다.** 공랭이라 «깊은 핀»이 실린더를 감싸고 라디에이터가 없다. V트윈 배치·분해 축·발화 간격 파형 도해까지 나왔다.\n⚠️콜아웃 라벨의 작은 글자는 뭉갰다(런북 ⑤: 작은 라벨은 코드로 얹는다). 구조는 정확하니 발행용이면 라벨만 후처리하면 된다.",
      "gen_prompt": "One legendary air-cooled flat-twin motorcycle engine, exploded and sectioned along its correct assembly axes at the centre of the frame, the parts separated in the order and orientation they would actually come apart so the whole thing could be mentally reassembled: cylinders, pistons, crank, cam, valves and carburettors each pulled out along their own axis. Because it is air cooled, the fins are deep and their area is large in proportion to the heat it makes, and there is no radiator anywhere. The cam profile, the valve gear and the pushrod geometry all agree with each other and with an overhead-valve layout. Thin restrained callout lines point at genuine detail — a ring gap, a bearing surface, a valve seat, a carburettor jet — never at empty space or a decorative circle. Along the lower edge a small restrained diagram shows the firing interval as a simple waveform. Deep charcoal ground with warm metallic light, hyper-real machined textures with machining marks, casting skin, chrome and polished aluminium, premium negative space, monospace technical labels kept to a handful of words. No plastic shine, no neon, no hologram, no watermark.",
