      "title": "★장면을 «입력 배열»로 선언한다 — `input = [ 주체 / 지형 / 조건 / 장비 / 시간 ]`으로 변수를 앞에 모아 두는 문법",
      "prompt": "I have been sharing a bunch of these for different extreme scenes. This one is for climbing scenes: \n\nGPT Prompt: 2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 different subjects and scenes input = [ climber(s) / wall_context / move_beat / capture_medium / rope_and_gear_law ] \n\nrun big_wall_alpine_rope_truth:\nsubject_dna        := a climber mid-move — hips pressed to the rock, heel raised on a tiny edge, fingers\n                      crimped or jammed in a crack, forearm tendons and veins standing out, chalk on the\n                      hands and smeared on the holds, taped knuckles, a bloodied fingertip, real strain in\n                      the face\ncontext_dna        := infer granite, limestone, or alpine mixed ground; real rock structure — cracks, flakes,\n                      chickenheads, lichen, water streaks — never a smooth blank surface\nmoment_state       := the committing move + causal_hint (reaching for a hold, placing a cam, weighting a\n                      foot that might slip)\ncapture_dna        := shot from a fixed line above or a drone at the same height, 24–50mm equiv, deep dof,\n                      hard high-altitude light, fine grain\nfocal_anchor       := the hand on the hold or the gear placement — tack-sharp; the void below dissolves\nlight_logic        := hard high-altitude sun with an extreme dynamic range, deep unfilled shadow in the\n                      corners and cracks, warm bounce off sunlit granite, a cool shadow side, thin clear air\nimperfection       := the rope swinging out of frame, wind lifting a jacket, a slightly awkward real body\n                      position rather than a heroic one, gear racked untidily\ndepth & frame      := void below — hundreds of metres of air, the ground lost to haze or absent entirely, a\n                      partner or portaledge as a tiny speck for scale; vertical 4:5 emphasizing the drop\nrope_and_gear_law  := the rope must attach to a real point — tied through the harness belay loop, running\n                      down to the last piece when leading or up to an anchor when top-roped; it sags in a\n                      catenary curve when slack and goes dead straight and thin when loaded; cams and nuts sit\n                      in constrictions that could actually hold them; quickdraws hang under gravity; the\n                      harness bears visible weight\nmood               := exposed, focused, deeply committed\n\nrender: one honest instant where true rope physics and real gear make the image.\n\nforbidden — objects: ropes attached to nothing, missing harness or anchor, invented gear, a blank featureless\n                     wall with no holds\nforbidden — look:    a rigid straight rope with no weight, rope floating away from the body, relaxed\n                     effortless posture on hard terrain, gym-flat lighting on an alpine face, no exposure\n                     below, clean unchalked hands",
      "prompt_ko": "★**변수를 프롬프트 «맨 앞»에 배열로 모아 선언한다.**\n```\ninput = [ climber(s) / wall / conditions / gear / time-of-day / … ]\n```\n★**이 문법의 값어치는 «갈아끼울 곳이 한 눈에 보인다»는 것**이다. 산문 프롬프트는 변수가 본문 여기저기에 흩어져 있어 시리즈로 만들 때 무엇을 바꿔야 할지 매번 찾아야 한다. 배열로 앞에 모아 두면 그 자체가 «시리즈 설계도»가 된다.\n\n★같은 계정의 다른 문법들과 나란히 두면 계보가 보인다 —\n```\n입력 배열      input = [...]                      ← 변수를 모은다 (이 항목)\n상태 기계      S0 → S1 → … → S9                   ← 절차를 나눈다\n논리식 제약    B₁~B₅ + ¬B                          ← 실패를 정의한다\n함수 합성      compose(a, then b, then verify)     ← 단계를 잇는다\nSQL           SELECT … FROM … / create view        ← 데이터를 뽑는다\n```\n⚠️인물 건이라 의상 피복 범위를 gen_prompt에 명시했다(런북 §⑥-확장2). 암벽 장비·행동이 화면의 주어라 인물이 감상 대상이 아니므로 공개行.",
      "gen_prompt": "A single climber high on a sheer granite wall, seen from across the void so the scale of the rock reads. She is mid-move with one hand jammed in a thin crack and one foot smeared on a blank face, her body pulled tight, chalk on her fingers. The wall is warm grey granite streaked with black water marks, split by one continuous crack that runs the height of the frame. Her rack of cams and nuts hangs from a harness, a single rope runs down out of the bottom of the frame into open air, and the last piece of protection sits well below her feet. She wears a long-sleeved sun hoody, full climbing trousers and taped hands, all fully covering. Late afternoon light rakes across the wall from the side so every crystal and edge throws a small shadow, and the valley far below is already in blue shade. Photographic realism, telephoto compression, no text anywhere in the image.",
