      "prompt": "4 underrated street foods visualized with Nano Banana. \n\nPrompt:\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 underrated street foods : { \"Aesthetic\": \"Miniature Food Diorama, Cultural Typography\", \"Subject\": \"[FOOD/DISH]\", \"AI_Semantic_Inference\": { \"The_Base\": \"Crumpled, culturally accurate street-food wrapping paper. Printed with AI_INFER(vintage typography, logos, and prices from [CULTURE/COUNTRY]).\", \"The_Food\": \"A giant, incredibly appetizing piece of [FOOD/DISH] resting on the wrapper.\", \"The_Interactions\": \"AI_INFER(Tiny figures interacting with the garnishes. E.g., hoisting giant sesame seeds, painting on sauce with brooms, or grilling tiny meats on a miniature BBQ).\" }, \"Lighting\": \"Cozy, warm street-lamp or golden-hour sunlight. Glowing steam.\" }",
      "prompt_ko": "★**JSON 키가 «빠지면 안 될 항목표» 노릇을 한다.**\n```json\n{ \"Aesthetic\": \"Miniature Food Diorama, Cultural Typography\",\n  \"Subject\":   \"[FOOD]\",  … }\n```\n★**값은 짧은데 결과가 흔들리지 않는 이유**가 여기 있다 — 값을 길게 쓰는 대신 «무엇을 반드시 정해야 하는가»를 키로 고정했다. 키를 채우기만 하면 빠뜨릴 수 없다.\n★`Cultural Typography`가 미학 항목에 «함께» 들어 있는 것도 설계다 — 타이포를 나중에 얹는 장식이 아니라 «미학의 일부»로 선언한 것.\n\n★같은 계정의 산문판([[gdgtify-plain-english-no-code-as-the-control]])과 비교하면 **둘 다 「항목의 완결성」을 노린다** — 하나는 JSON 키로, 하나는 문단 순서로. 형식은 달라도 해결하려는 문제가 같다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A miniature food diorama of a street-food stall, shot as a premium tabletop model. At the centre, built at doll scale but rendered with real food realism, sits a small cart selling grilled skewers: the charcoal glowing, thin smoke rising, skewers laid across the grate with the glaze catching the light, a stack of paper trays and a squeeze bottle at the side. Around the cart, a compact slice of pavement built from modular pieces — a kerb, a drain, a folding stool, a plastic crate, a hand-lettered menu board. Warm practical light from the cart's single bulb pools on the food and falls off fast into cool evening blue. Above the scene, one short line of bold display type reads SKEWERS in a cultural poster style, and beneath it in smaller type the word STALL 04; those two lines are the only text in the image. Macro camera near table level, shallow depth of field, appetising crisp detail, believable contact shadows.",
