      "title": "★작가 한 명을 입력으로 «그 사람의 세계»를 추론시켜 짓는다 — 작품을 그리는 게 아니라 「작가가 만든 세계의 표본실」을 만든다",
      "prompt": "A fun way to visualize your favorite authors. \n\nPrompt: \n\n2x2 grid,  Do this for George R.R. Martin<instruction>   Input A is a Famous Author or World-Builder  Analyze the author's work to generate   3 Narrative Assets  :       The Habitat  :   Identify a signature architectural or natural element of their world to fuse with the furniture.          (e.g., Tolkien -> Gnarled tree roots and a Hobbit hole. Martin -> Forged swords and castle battlements. Rowling -> Gothic spires and stone owls).      Artifacts (The Minis):   Identify 2-3 iconic characters or creatures to appear as tiny 1:35 scale miniatures on the desk.       Floating Element:   Identify a small, recurring symbolic object that can defy gravity.          (e.g., Golden Rings, Floating Candles, Dragon Eggs, Snitches).  2.   Container (The Diorama Plinth): Goal: \"The Architect of Imagination\" High-End Sculpture Photography. The Base: A thick, circular rock or mossy mound acting as the diorama foundation. The Structure: A rustic, weathered wooden writing desk and chair sit atop the mound. The Fusion: CRITICAL: The desk is not standard; its legs and frame are physically made from \"The Habitat\" (Step 1), growing out of the base. 3. Central Composition (The Master): The Figure: A hyper-realistic 1:6 scale figurine of Input A (The Author) sits in the chair. The Action: They are engrossed in the act of creation, writing with a quill or pen in a leather-bound journal. The Persona: Include their signature personal accessories (e.g., a pipe, specific knitwear, or glasses). 4. Visual Syntax (The World Leak): The Cartography: A large, detailed Parchment Map of their fictional world drapes over the front edge of the desk, reaching down to the mossy base. Inhabitants: The tiny \"Artifact\" figurines (Step 1) are scattered among the inkwells and loose papers on the desktop. Magic: 4-6 of the \"Floating Elements\" (Step 1) are suspended in the air around the author, catching the light. 5. Lighting & Atmosphere: Lighting: God Rays. Warm, volumetric shafts of sunlight stream from the top-left, illuminating dust motes in the air and highlighting the texture of the wood and parchment. Focus: Sharp focus on the author and the desktop; the background shows soft, dreamlike curtains or distant forest bokeh. Output: ONE image, 1:1 Aspect Ratio, \"Professional Miniature\" aesthetic, 8k resolution, extreme texture fidelity. </instruction>",
      "prompt_ko": "★**입력이 «작품»이 아니라 «작가»다.**\n```\nInput A is a Famous Author or World-Builder\n★Analyze the author's work to generate …   ← 특정 작품이 아니라 «그 사람이 만든 세계»를 추론\n```\n★**그래서 산출물이 「어느 장면의 삽화」가 아니라 「그 세계 전체의 표본실」이 된다.** 원고지에서 세계가 «일어서고», 책상 위 도구가 «만든 사람의 흔적»으로 남고, 작은 작가 인형이 «자기 세계 안에서 여전히 쓰고 있다».\n\n★같은 계정의 [[gdgtify-ink-lines-become-terrain-not-decoration]](문신) · [[gdgtify-blueprint-lines-build-the-building]](청사진)과 **같은 골격의 세 번째 판**이다 —\n```\n잉크    → 지형과 구조가 된다\n청사진  → 벽과 기둥이 된다\n★원고   → 세계가 된다\n```\n«[재료]가 장식이 아니라 구조가 된다»는 하나의 골격을 도메인마다 재사용하는 것 — 이 계정에서 배울 것은 개별 프롬프트가 아니라 **재사용 가능한 골격을 갖고 있다는 사실**이다.\n\n⚠️원문은 실명 작가를 입력으로 썼다. 재현에서는 «판타지 작가»로 일반화하고 특정 IP 고유명사·상표는 넣지 않았다(런북 §저작권).",
      "gen_prompt": "A dense diorama of a fantasy author's invented world, built on and around a heavy writing desk under a low lamp. Out of the open manuscript pages the world rises in three dimensions: a wind-bitten northern wall of ice crossing the back of the scene, a great hall with a throne built from blades, banners of rival houses hanging at different heights, and a raven mid-flight between them, all of it formed out of paper, ink lines and the pages themselves rather than placed on top of them. On the desk sit the tools of the trade: a heavy typewriter, stacked ribbon spools, a hand-drawn map weighted at its corners, a chipped mug, index cards pinned into a family tree. A tiny figure of the author sits at the desk with his back to us, still writing inside his own world. Warm lamplight on the desk falls away into cold blue at the edges of the map. Highly tactile, photographic depth, archival shadows, no text anywhere in the image.",
      "ref_image": "results/gdgtify-author-world-inferred-then-built-ref.jpg",
