      "prompt": "飞溅想显得高级，必须像在给产品让位，而不是把产品淹掉。\n🪽 two compact symmetrical liquid-silk splash wings behind the bottle, clear label area left untouched\n这样，奶油状液体会像两侧展开的布料，托住瓶身；标签和瓶子轮廓始终干净，读者第一眼仍是产品名。\n🧊 one halved avocado at the base, two wedges, two or three ice cubes, a few leaves, generous spacing\n它解决的是“新鲜感”容易拍成食材堆的问题。冰块、果肉和叶片只提供口味证据，数量一多就会抢走瓶装产品的发布感。\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate an ultra-premium product advertising poster in the exact same luxurious visual logic: one elegant bottled avocado drink centered in a tall vertical frame, standing on a glossy reflective black surface, surrounded by highly sculptural avocado-cream splash forms that read like frozen liquid silk, with a restrained number of floating avocado wedges, fresh leaves, and crystal-clear ice cubes against a deep black-green gradient background. The final image must feel rich, fresh, polished, and highly commercial, like a Cannes-level launch poster for a premium avocado elixir. No copied text, no logo clutter, no watermark. If text appears on the bottle, it must be newly invented and more refined than the reference.\n\nCore composition:\nUse a strict centered vertical composition with the bottle occupying the dominant middle axis from lower-middle to upper-middle frame. Build two balanced avocado-cream splash wings radiating from behind and around the bottle, but keep them compact, sculptural, and highly controlled. The splash must frame and elevate the bottle rather than compete with it. Around the upper-middle area, suspend only a curated number of avocado wedges, a few leaves, and a few ice cubes with generous spacing. At the base, build a formal flavor-release zone with only a small number of supporting ingredients arranged with precision. The bottle must remain the unquestioned hero.\n\nHero product:\nDesign one original premium avocado beverage bottle with a softly cylindrical silhouette, rounded shoulders, and a refined metallic gold cap. The bottle is filled with pale avocado-green creamy drink, dense and velvety, with subtle condensation droplets for freshness. On the bottle, place an original elegant name such as:\n“VELORIA ELIXIR”\nwith a smaller line like:\n“Avocado Reserve”\nTypography must feel luxurious, centered, minimal, and beautifully art-directed.\n\nOrbit splash styling:\nPush the avocado-cream splash into a more sculptural and iconic form. The splash should feel like frozen green silk or creamy couture liquid, curving outward in refined symmetrical arcs. Avoid random explosive fragments. Use only a few small droplets to support realism. The liquid forms should read like premium visual sculpture, not beverage chaos.\n\nFloating garnish system:\nSuspend a restrained set of avocado wedges, fresh leaves, and a few ice cubes around the bottle with deliberate rhythm and clean spacing. Let each element feel visible and precious. Some wedges may rotate slightly in perspective, but keep the airborne system minimal, elegant, and highly organized.\n\nPort flavor-release zone:\nAt the base, organize the reflective tabletop into a clean formal release display. Use only a few carefully placed elements:\none halved avocado with visible seed,\none or two avocado wedges,\n2 to 3 ice cubes,\na few fresh leaves,\nand perhaps a tiny amount of creamy drip or reflected droplets.\nThe base must feel styled like a premium ingredient-release platform, not a messy tabletop still life. Preserve negative space and product clarity.\n\nLighting:\nUse highly controlled luxury lighting. The main soft key should come from upper front-left, shaping the bottle, revealing the creamy drink body, condensation droplets, avocado texture, and sculptural splash edges. Add a subtle rear or side rim light to separate the bottle and splash from the dark background and to make the ice cubes sparkle. Keep shadows rich, dimensional, and breathable. The lighting must feel polished, appetizing, and premium.\n\nColor system:\nPrimary palette: avocado green, pale cream-green, deep emerald-black, glossy leaf green, gold, soft white. Secondary accents: dark avocado skin, cool gray in the ice, soft reflective black. Keep the strongest contrast between the pale creamy bottle and the luxurious black-green backdrop. The emotional color balance must feel fresh, rich, clean, and expensive.\n\nBackground:\nUse a deep black-to-emerald studio gradient background with a subtle luminous glow behind the bottle and only the faintest low mist near the lower edge if needed. Keep the environment abstract and minimal so the product remains the absolute focus.\n\nMaterial realism:\nRender every material with exquisite realism: creamy beverage density, bottle reflections, metallic cap finish, avocado flesh softness, textured dark skin, leaf veining, crisp ice refraction, glossy liquid-silk splash surfaces, and mirror-like tabletop reflections. Everything must feel tactile, edible, fresh, and expensive. Avoid plastic-looking avocado or fake cream.\n\nAdvertising finish:\nThe final image must feel like a world-class premium beverage campaign key visual: one central avocado elixir bottle, two sculptural liquid-silk splash wings, a restrained floating garnish system, a formal flavor-release zone at the base, and impeccable luxury styling. Suitable for beauty-beverage launch advertising, premium retail campaign, editorial food-drink photography, or boutique poster use.\n\nNegative prompt:\ncopied text, cluttered composition, excessive splash fragments, too many floating objects, muddy shadows, black blotches, plastic avocado, fake ice, low-resolution bottle, warped product shape, generic drink ad, oversaturated green, poor reflections, messy garnish, cheap props, watermark, logo clutter",
      "prompt_ko": "★**액체가 제품을 «덮으면» 광고가 아니라 사고 장면이 된다.**\n```\n★모양    좌우 «대칭»인 컴팩트한 «실크 날개» 둘 — 천이 펼쳐지듯 제품을 «떠받친다»\n★금지구역 라벨 영역은 «손대지 않는다(untouched)» — 앞을 가로지르지 않는다\n질감     두껍고 매끄러운 «비단» · 접힌 가장자리 · 미세 부유 방울 몇\n         ↔ 무작위 폭발이 아니다\n```\n★같은 계정의 [[ouzhen599-wave-goes-behind-the-bottle]](파도벽)과 같은 규율의 다른 재료 판이다 — «효과를 키우는 법»이 아니라 «효과가 비켜야 할 자리»를 지정한다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical dairy drink advertising poster. One bottle stands upright dead centre, its label face completely clean and untouched. Behind it, two compact symmetrical wings of creamy liquid rise and spread outward like lengths of silk cloth, one to each side, holding the bottle up rather than pouring over it; the two wings mirror each other in scale and curl, and neither crosses in front of the label. The liquid reads as thick and silky with soft folded edges and a few fine suspended droplets, not as a chaotic burst. Cool studio lighting with a soft rim separating the bottle from the deep neutral ground, high-end commercial finish, immaculate product silhouette. No text anywhere in the image.",
