      "title": "★도시 야경에서 병은 «확대된 소품»이 아니라 «랜드마크»여야 한다 — 주변 택시·횡단보도·신호등을 작게 유지해 스케일을 만든다",
      "prompt": "城市夜景再复杂，也要让瓶子像一座地标，而不是一件被放大的道具。\n🧊 colossal bottle placed diagonally across the intersection, surrounding taxis, crosswalks, and traffic lights kept miniature\n这样，俯视画面会先读成一座城市，再突然意识到主角是一瓶啤酒；尺度反差就是这张海报的记忆点。\n✨ cold teal-blue city haze and wet reflections, silver-charcoal label with one restrained crimson accent\n它解决的是夜景容易脏、标签容易消失的问题。城市负责冷光和秩序，瓶内金色酒液与一处深红文字负责把视线拉回产品。\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate an ultra-premium cinematic beer advertising poster with a dramatic top-down aerial view of a dense modern city intersection at night, surrounded by towering glass skyscrapers, rain-slick rooftops, and wet reflective streets. A colossal fictional beer bottle named NOCTIS SILVER stretches diagonally across the crossroads like an impossible urban monument, reading as both a luxury product and a city-scale sculptural landmark. The bottle is the absolute visual anchor of the composition: hyper-realistic chilled pale-gold beer inside crystal-clear glass, dense condensation droplets, razor-sharp reflections, brushed silver and deep charcoal label architecture, a restrained crimson accent word, embossed seal details, and original high-end European-inspired packaging design with no real branding. Push the scale contrast aggressively so the surrounding taxis, traffic lights, and crosswalks feel miniature beneath it, amplifying the sense of awe and dominance. The city atmosphere should lean colder and more futuristic than nostalgic: teal-blue night haze, silver-white neon glints, cool cyan reflections on glass towers, fine mist, streaking headlights, and controlled warm tungsten traces only as secondary contrast. Preserve a clean luxury advertising logic with one dominant hero product, disciplined supporting environment, strong diagonal momentum, deep urban canyon perspective, and a polished Cannes-level commercial finish. Lighting must feel physical and cinematic, with cold ambient skylight, crisp metallic highlights, realistic wet-surface specularity, breathable shadow detail, and immaculate material separation. Add a short elegant fictional headline and a minimal premium launch footer in original English, making the image feel like a global flagship campaign for a high-end urban lager. ultra-detailed, photorealistic, large-format commercial photography, perfect perspective control, premium ad retouching, atmospheric depth, sophisticated cold color grading, no clutter, no visual chaos.\n\nNegative prompt:\nreal brand names, copied beer labels, existing typography, extra bottles, duplicated objects, warped glass, melted bottle shape, distorted city perspective, unreadable label, fake reflections, messy layout, cluttered streets, cartoon style, low detail, muddy shadows, oversaturated neon, excessive particles, cheap poster design, blurry hero product, broken symmetry, random signage, AI artifacts, noisy composition",
      "prompt_ko": "★**«거대하게 그려라»와 «랜드마크로 만들어라»는 다른 지시다.**\n```\n안 통함   병을 크게 → 「확대된 소품」이 된다. 도시가 배경 그림으로 전락\n★통함     ①교차로를 «대각선으로 가로질러» 세운다 (도로에 심긴 기념물처럼)\n          ②★주변 택시·횡단보도·신호등을 «작게 유지» — 크기는 «주변이» 말해 준다\n          ③병이 «도시의 빛»을 받는다 — 냉색 림 + 젖은 아스팔트의 반사\n            (따로 조명 친 것처럼 보이면 합성으로 읽힌다)\n```\n★**스케일은 대상 크기가 아니라 «비교 대상»이 만든다.** 런북 §[[ouzhen599-pressure-comes-from-the-unreasonably-large]](거대 우상)과 같은 원리인데, 저쪽은 «크기를 확정하지 않아» 공포를 만들고 이쪽은 «확정해» 기념비를 만든다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical night-city advertising poster. One colossal bottle stands diagonally across a busy intersection, planted in the road like a monument rather than a prop dropped into the scene. Everything around it is kept deliberately small in comparison: taxis, crosswalk stripes, traffic lights, street signs and pedestrians all read at their true city scale, so the bottle's size is understood from them. The surrounding towers recede into cool blue night haze while warm shop and headlight glow pools at street level. The bottle catches a cold rim light down one edge and a warm reflection from the street on the other, so it belongs to the light of the city rather than being lit separately. Wet asphalt reflects it back. Cinematic commercial finish. No text anywhere in the image.",
