      "title": "★종이 콜라주는 «가위로 자른 벡터»가 아니라 «찢은 종이»여야 한다 — 가장자리의 섬유가 보이는 것이 재질의 증거",
      "prompt": "GPT image 2\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a premium 4:5 vertical vintage travel poster for [CITY], [COUNTRY], designed as an elegant handmade paper collage.\n\nUse a warm aged ivory paper background with subtle fibers, soft grain, slightly imperfect printed edges, and layered cut-paper shapes. Build the city from simplified but recognizable architectural silhouettes, landmarks, rooftops, streets, trees, mountains, water, and local cultural elements.\n\nUse a sophisticated muted pastel palette: dusty blue, faded terracotta, sage green, warm cream, muted peach, and soft ochre. Add subtle vintage print imperfections, gentle paper shadows, slight ink fading, and tactile handmade textures.\n\nComposition should feel like a beautifully designed mid-century European travel poster, with strong visual hierarchy and plenty of negative space.\n\nAt the top, place elegant typography:\n[CITY]\n[COUNTRY]\n\nAt the bottom, add a small understated line:\nA JOURNEY THROUGH [COUNTRY]\n\nMake the city instantly recognizable while keeping the artwork artistic rather than photorealistic. Avoid generic tourist clichés. The overall result should feel like a collectible vintage paper travel poster, sophisticated, nostalgic, editorial, minimal, and premium.\n\n4:5 vertical composition, centered layout, crisp paper-cut edges, layered depth, subtle shadows, authentic vintage print texture, no photorealism, no 3D-rendered look, no clutter.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**같은 「종이 콜라주」인데 «자른 것»과 «찢은 것»은 완전히 다른 결과다.**\n```\n자른 종이   가장자리가 «깨끗한 직선» → 결국 «플랫 벡터»와 구분이 안 된다\n★찢은 종이  가장자리가 «불규칙»하고 ★찢긴 자리에 «흰 섬유질 속»이 보인다\n            → 이 한 가지가 «손으로 만든 물건»의 증거가 된다\n★층        각 층이 «살짝 들려» 아래 층에 «부드러운 실제 그림자»를 던진다\n질감       종이 결 + 펄프 부스러기 몇 점\n```\n★오늘 담은 [[goodmanprotocol-fewer-paper-layers-reads-premium]](종이컷 — 「층을 줄여라」)와 짝을 이룬다. 저쪽은 «층 수»를, 이쪽은 «가장자리의 성질»을 규정한다.\n\n---\n★**재현 실측 — 「찢은 가장자리」가 재질을 증명했다.** 가장자리마다 «흰 섬유질 속»이 드러나고 층이 살짝 들려 아래에 실제 그림자를 던진다. PORTO 자간 정확.\n★같은 「종이」 소재라도 [[goodmanprotocol-fewer-paper-layers-reads-premium]](자른 종이컷)과 결과가 완전히 다르다 — 가장자리의 성질 하나가 장르를 가른다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 4:5 vertical travel poster for Porto made as an elegant handmade paper collage. Every shape is torn rather than cut: the edges are irregular and show the white fibrous core of the paper where it separated, and no outline is perfectly straight. The city is built from a small number of layered torn papers — a terracotta plane for the roofs, a deep indigo band for the river, a cream sheet for the sky, one ochre strip for the bridge deck — each layer slightly lifted so it throws a soft real shadow onto the one below. Fine paper grain and a few flecks of pulp are visible across the surfaces. A single word PORTO is set at the top in a clean letterspaced sans, and it is the only text in the image. Restrained palette, generous margins, quiet handmade warmth.",
