      "prompt": "GPT image 2 on chatGPT\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a 4:5 vertical retro urban album-art illustration built around [CITY BLOCK THEME]. Show [FOCAL SUBJECT] naturally interacting within a nostalgic 1990s neighborhood environment. Fill the street with [STREET DETAILS], arranged as believable foreground, middle-ground, and background elements without making the composition cluttered.\n\nUse a broad city-block composition from slightly above pedestrian eye level, with strong perspective carrying the viewer through storefronts, sidewalks, brick buildings, stoops, parked objects, utility poles, and distant architecture.\n\nGive the figures simplified cartoon-like anatomy, confident poses, expressive gestures, thick black contour lines, rhythmic motion marks, and playful hand-drawn graphic symbols.\n\nRender the scene in [COLOR PALETTE] using flat color areas, imperfect ink registration, faded halftone shading, rough screen-print edges, paper fibers, tiny scratches, dusty grain, and subtle vintage vinyl-record-sleeve wear.\n\nAdd loose graffiti-inspired abstract shapes and energetic marks, but no readable tags or random lettering.\n\nThe atmosphere should feel [MOOD], combining neighborhood storytelling, vintage hip-hop visual culture, analog-print character, and handmade editorial illustration.\n\nKeep the artwork original rather than reproducing any specific artist’s identifiable composition. No logos, trademarks, signatures, watermarks, readable brand names, unintended text, borders, grids, collage panels, or photorealism.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**도시를 그릴 때 «스카이라인»으로 가면 엽서가 되고, «블록 하나»로 좁히면 앨범 재킷이 된다.**\n```\n★범위    도시가 아니라 «한 블록» — 나머지 도시는 «암시»되고 보여주지 않는다\n★초점    인물이 그 블록 «안에 자연스럽게 속해» 있다 — 중앙에 «세워 놓은» 게 아니다\n형식     평면·굵은 윤곽·5색 제한 잉크 · 그레인과 견양 어긋남 · ★정면 정사각 구도\n         → 「레코드 재킷」이라는 매체가 구도를 정한다\n```\n★**매체를 먼저 정하면 구도가 따라온다**는 사례다. 「도시 일러스트」로 두면 시점·범위·인물 배치가 매번 흔들리는데, 「앨범 재킷」으로 두면 정면성·정사각·인쇄 질감이 한꺼번에 정해진다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 4:5 vertical retro album-art illustration built around one single city block rather than a skyline: a corner of low brick buildings with a laundromat, a record shop and a fire escape, cropped tight so the rest of the city is implied and never shown. One focal subject sits naturally inside that block, a man leaning against the record shop window with a bag of records under his arm, scaled and placed as though he simply belongs there rather than posed at the centre. The drawing is flat and graphic with heavy outlines, limited to five inks: warm brick red, mustard, deep teal, cream and near-black. Grain and a slight misregistration give it a printed sleeve quality, and the composition is squared up and frontal like a record cover. No text anywhere in the image.",
