      "title": "★타이포를 인물 «주위에 배치»하지 말고 인물과 «물리적으로 상호작용»시킨다 — 인물이 글자 앞을 지나가고, 아크릴 판이 몸을 자른다",
      "prompt": "🤯 AI Visual Systems Vol.23: CUT / FORM!\n\nPortraits get much more interesting when the subject starts interacting with the layout.\n\n1. SIGNAL — oversized type × figure\n2. FRAME — acrylic form × spatial layering\n3. STRATA — vertical slices × portrait\n4. STUDIO MODE — fashion × structural layout\n\nGreat for fashion editorials, campaign posters, magazine covers and experimental visual design!\n\nMade with GPT-Image2\nPrompt in the comments 👇\n\n--- 답글(프롬프트 본문, x.com/MrLarus/status/2088168150042857473) ---\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a 9:16 high-fashion editorial poster built around the interaction between portrait photography, typography, structure, and physical space.\n\nSubject: [male / female fashion model]\nOutfit: [minimal tailoring / black fashion / white suit / structured styling]\nPalette: [black + acid lime / ivory + burgundy / black + teal / custom palette]\nTitle: [TITLE]\nDesign direction: [oversized type / acrylic frame / vertical slicing / structural layout]\n\nStart with a strong fashion photograph: realistic skin, refined facial features, expressive pose, detailed fabric, controlled studio lighting, and premium magazine quality.\n\nThen make the graphic design physically interact with the subject instead of simply placing text around the portrait.\n\nDirections:\n\n• Oversized type × figure\nUse extremely large typography that extends beyond the canvas. Let the subject pass in front of some letters and behind others, creating foreground/background depth.\n\n• Acrylic form × spatial layering\nIntroduce a transparent glass or acrylic frame with visible thickness, reflections, edge highlights and subtle refraction. Let the subject touch, enter or intersect the structure.\n\n• Vertical slices × portrait\nReconstruct one portrait through 4–5 unequal vertical image sections with visible gaps and subtle positional shifts. Keep the main facial features readable and attractive.\n\n• Fashion × structural layout\nUse a strong fashion pose, geometric color fields, oversized typography and architectural framing. Let the body, furniture, color blocks and type form one unified composition.\n\nKeep typography bold but controlled: one dominant title, one short supporting phrase and minimal micro-text.\n\nUse asymmetrical composition, strong scale contrast, intentional negative space, layering, cropping and selective color accents.\n\nThe final image should feel like a premium fashion campaign, experimental magazine cover or contemporary exhibition key visual.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「글자를 인물 주위에 놓기」와 「글자와 인물이 서로를 가리기」는 다른 작업이다.**\n```\n★쌍방 오클루전  인물이 «어떤 글자 앞»을 지나가고, «다른 글자»는 인물 앞을 가로지른다\n                → 한 방향만이면 합성으로 보인다. 양방향이어야 «같은 공간»에 있는 것\n방향 4종        oversized type × figure / acrylic frame × 공간 층위 /\n                vertical slicing × 인물 / structural layout × 패션\n재료 개입       아크릴 판이 «몸의 절반»을 굴절시켜 띠로 자르고, 나머지 절반은 선명하게\n```\n★런북 ⑦-정정(불투명 물체가 글자를 가리는 것은 «잘 된다»)의 정확한 응용이다 — 인물은 불투명하므로 글자를 가려도 깨지지 않는다.\n\n---\n★★**재현 실측 — 쌍방 오클루전이 나왔다.** 거대한 FORM 글자 앞을 인물이 지나가고, 동시에 글자가 인물의 어깨를 가로지른다. 세로 슬라이싱까지 걸려 화면 절반이 라임, 절반이 검정으로 갈렸다.\n★런북 ⑦-정정(불투명 물체가 글자를 가리는 건 잘 된다)의 정확한 응용 — 한 방향만이면 합성으로 보이는데 양방향이라 «같은 공간»으로 읽힌다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 9:16 high-fashion editorial poster where the graphic design and the photographed subject occupy the same physical space. A model in minimal black tailoring stands in controlled studio light with realistic skin, refined features and detailed fabric, photographed at magazine quality. Behind and around her, extremely large typography spelling FORM runs beyond the canvas on both sides, and she physically passes in front of some of the letters while others cross in front of her shoulder and forearm, so figure and type occlude each other in both directions. A vertical acrylic panel stands between the camera and one half of her body, refracting and slicing that side into offset bands while the other half stays sharp. Palette of black and acid lime only. The composition is structural and deliberate, not text placed around a portrait.",
