      "prompt": "🤯 City posters hit different when every landmark rises toward the same point!\n\nIconic landmarks converge toward the center, with giant city type filling the background.\n\n1. TOKYO — red × cherry blossom\n2. NEW YORK — cobalt blue × yellow cab\n3. PARIS — burgundy × classic landmarks\n4. DUBAI — orange × vertical city\n\nSame visual system, totally different city energy. ✨\n\nMade with GPT-Image2\nPrompts below 👇\n\n--- 답글(프롬프트 본문, x.com/MrLarus/status/2088976592470999090) ---\nPrompt:\n\nCITY: [TOKYO / NEW YORK / PARIS / DUBAI / YOUR CITY]\nMAIN LANDMARK: [most iconic landmark]\nOTHER LANDMARKS: [4–5 recognizable landmarks]\nTYPE COLOR: [accent color]\nFOREGROUND DETAIL: [cherry blossoms / taxi / leaves / palm leaves]\nCOUNTRY: [country name]\n\nCreate a 9:16 vertical city poster using iconic landmarks from the same city.\n\nTreat each landmark as an independent architectural collage element rather than a realistic street scene. Place the landmarks around the edges of the frame using an extreme worm’s-eye perspective, with their forms rising and converging toward the center of the sky.\n\nUse the MAIN LANDMARK as the central vertical anchor. Keep it the most complete and recognizable structure in the composition.\n\nArrange the other landmarks from the upper-left, upper-right, lower-left and lower-right edges. Make them large near the frame edges and gradually narrower toward the center, creating a strong radial, upward-moving composition.\n\nDo not follow real geographic positions. The goal is to reconstruct the visual identity of the city through its landmarks.\n\nBehind the architecture, place the city name in huge ultra-tall condensed sans-serif typography. The letters should occupy around 45–60% of the image, partially hidden behind the landmarks while remaining clearly readable.\n\nKeep the city-name typography clean, solid and sharp. No distressed texture, cracks or worn lettering.\n\nUse a limited three-color system: warm off-white paper background, charcoal / grayscale architecture, one strong accent color for the city name.\n\nRender the landmarks with realistic architectural photography, then add subtle vintage editorial print texture, fine grain, halftone and paper texture.\n\nAdd a small blurred foreground detail connected to the city, occupying only around 5–10% of the lower edge, to create depth and local atmosphere.\n\nCore visual formula:\niconic landmarks + extreme low-angle perspective + radial convergence + giant city typography + limited colors + subtle foreground depth.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**도시 포스터가 «관광 엽서»로 떨어지는 이유는 «실제 지리»를 따르기 때문이다.**\n```\n★목표    실제 거리 풍경이 아니라 «랜드마크로 도시의 시각 정체성을 재구성»한다\n         → ★「실제 지리적 위치를 따르지 말 것」이 명시돼 있다\n★시점    극단적 «벌레 눈» 앙시 — 건물들이 안쪽으로 기울며 «하늘의 한 점»을 향해 솟는다\n★배치    주 랜드마크 = 중앙 수직 앵커, «가장 완전하고 식별성 높게» 유지\n         나머지 4~5개는 네 «모서리»에 — 가장자리에서 크고 중앙으로 갈수록 «좁아진다»\n         ⇒ 강한 방사형 상승 구도\n전경     벚꽃/택시/잎/야자 등 «한 가지»만 하단 모서리를 가로지른다\n```\n★오늘 담은 [[mrlarus-one-core-everything-points-back]](시각 응집핵)의 «도시» 판이다 — 저쪽은 요소가 «중심을 가리키고», 이쪽은 «한 점으로 솟는다».\n\n---\n★**재현 실측 — 「실제 지리를 따르지 말 것」이 효과를 냈다.** 랜드마크들이 네 모서리에서 안쪽으로 기울며 하늘 한 점으로 솟고, 벚꽃 가지가 하단 모서리를 가로지른다. 관광 엽서가 아니라 «도시의 시각 정체성»으로 읽힌다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A 9:16 vertical city poster built from the landmarks of one city, treated as independent architectural collage elements rather than a realistic street view. Everything is seen from an extreme worm's-eye perspective so the buildings lean inward and rise toward a single point in the sky at the centre of the frame. The most iconic landmark stands as the central vertical anchor, kept the most complete and recognisable structure in the composition. Four other recognisable landmarks are placed at the upper-left, upper-right, lower-left and lower-right edges, large where they meet the frame and narrowing steadily toward the centre, which builds a strong radial upward movement. Their real geographic positions are ignored entirely. In the foreground, cherry blossom branches cross the lower corners. The sky behind them is a flat accent field. No text anywhere in the image.",
