      "gen_prompt": "A cinematic advertising photograph of a burger food truck parked on the cratered surface of the Moon, under a deep black star-filled sky with Earth glowing small in the distance. The truck has a futuristic brushed-metal body with warm orange neon trim and a large glowing sign above the hatch reading MOON BURGER with a neon burger icon beside it. An astronaut in a chef's apron works inside the truck preparing food, while a second astronaut sits at a small folding table outside, eating. Warm hanging bulbs, stainless-steel detail, glowing menu boards and a cosy diner glow spill out onto the grey dust, and the contrast between that warm restaurant light and the cold hard lunar environment is the point of the picture: everything the truck lights is amber, everything beyond its reach is blue-grey and airless. Fine lunar dust, hard shadows, volumetric light, ultra-photorealistic sci-fi realism, wide-angle composition. Those two words on the sign are the only text in the image.",
