      "prompt": "Postcard views, real life moments.\n\nGPT Image 2\n\nPrompt:\nVintage layered paper-cut travel poster of {LOCATION}, portrait orientation with a cream textured border and subtle drop shadow. Giant bold destination title integrated into the sky, a small country label top-left, and a short elegant travel blurb top-right. Iconic {LOCATION} landmarks and architecture overlooking dramatic water/coastline or landscape at golden sunset, with seagulls, boats, flowers, and Mediterranean-inspired details framing the foreground. Intricate 3D papercraft depth, soft pastel palette, warm peach-and-gold light, crisp cut-paper edges, cinematic composition, highly detailed, premium tourism poster illustration. Aspect ratio 3:4",
      "prompt_ko": "★**이 계정에서 가장 «짧은» 프롬프트인데 층 구조가 나온다.** 앞의 수채 건들이 2,000~4,000자인 것과 대비된다 — 재료(cut-paper)와 광원(golden sunset)과 «층 사이 그림자»만 있으면 페이퍼컷은 성립한다는 뜻이다.\n```\n★제목   integrated into the sky  ← 하늘 «위»가 아니라 «안»\n★층     intricate 3D papercraft depth + crisp cut-paper edges\n★틀     cream textured border + subtle drop shadow  ← 종이 자체를 액자로\n```\n★**정보 배치가 세 자리로 고정돼 있다** — 하늘 안의 거대 제목 / 좌상단 국가 라벨 / 우상단 짧은 여행 문구. 도시만 갈아끼우면 시리즈가 된다.\n\n⚠️런북 ⑤: 글자를 세 조각으로 줄이고 «그 셋이 전부»라고 못박아야 가짜 글자가 안 생긴다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vintage layered paper-cut travel poster of LISBON, portrait orientation with a cream textured border and a subtle drop shadow. A giant bold destination title, LISBON, is integrated into the sky itself rather than laid on top of it, with a small country label, PORTUGAL, at the top left and a short elegant travel line, city of seven hills, at the top right. Tiled hillside facades, a castle on the ridge and a red suspension bridge overlook the wide estuary at golden sunset, with gulls, small boats, flowers and wrought-iron balcony details framing the foreground. Intricate three-dimensional papercraft depth with each layer cut and stacked, soft pastel palette, warm peach and gold light, crisp cut-paper edges, cinematic composition, highly detailed premium tourism poster illustration. Those three lines are the only text in the image.",
