      "title": "★«알아보는 데 필요한 최소한의 선»만 긋는다 — 끊긴 형광 마커 획과 검정 여백 절반",
      "prompt": "GPT Image 2\n\nPrompt:\nCITY = [CITY NAME]\n\nCreate a vertical 3:4 minimal fluorescent brush-art travel poster for [CITY] on a pure black background.\n\nFirst identify the city’s most iconic and instantly recognizable visual symbols, then select:\n\nONE hero landmark — large and dominant\n\nONE or TWO secondary landmarks — much smaller supporting elements\n\nDo not create a full skyline.\n\nDraw all landmarks using only thick, broken fluorescent paint-marker strokes with simplified silhouettes, incomplete outlines, large gaps, rough dry-brush edges, and tapered endings. Use the minimum number of lines needed for instant recognition.\n\nUse vivid fluorescent magenta, pink, cobalt blue, cyan, violet, acid lime, yellow, and orange, with irregular color shifts between brush strokes.\n\nAdd huge expressive hand-painted lettering:\n“[CITY]”\n\nOptionally add a small handwritten phrase such as:\n“city nights”\n\nKeep 50–60% of the composition as uninterrupted pure black negative space. Add only 2–3 isolated paint accents such as a brush slash, compact splatter, or tiny dots.\n\nAvoid dense skylines, realistic architecture, detailed windows, complete outlines, clean vector graphics, neon tubes, 3D lighting, and excessive decoration.\n\nOverall aesthetic:\nminimal fluorescent brush art, iconic city landmarks, expressive hand-painted typography, urban nightlife, fashion-editorial poster, sophisticated street art, bold black negative space, high contrast.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「단순하게」를 «선의 개수»로 번역했다.**\n```\n★use the ★minimum number of lines needed for ★instant recognition\n   → 목적(즉시 식별)을 함께 적어서 «어디까지 줄일지»의 기준을 준다\n★incomplete outlines · large gaps · tapered endings — ★끊긴 것을 «지시»한다\n★50~60%는 «건드리지 않은 순수 검정» — 여백을 색이 아니라 «면적»으로 확보\n```\n★**금지 목록이 「이 스타일로 흘러가기 쉬운 이웃」을 정확히 겨눈다** — 촘촘한 스카이라인 · 사실적 건축 · 세밀한 창 · «완결된 윤곽» · 깔끔한 벡터 · ★«네온 튜브» · 3D 조명. 특히 형광색을 쓰면 모델이 **네온사인으로 흘러가는데** 그걸 미리 막았다.\n\n★**색 지시가 «목록 + 불규칙 전환»이다** — 여덟 색을 나열하고 *「획과 획 사이에서 색이 불규칙하게 바뀐다」*를 붙여 «한 자루 마커로 그린 것이 아님»을 만든다.\n\n★강조 요소도 세 개로 못박았다(슬래시 하나·스플래터 하나·작은 점들).",
      "gen_prompt": "A minimal fluorescent brush-art travel poster for TOKYO on a pure black background, vertical. One hero landmark dominates — a tall lattice broadcasting tower — with two much smaller supporting elements, a curved temple gate and a bowl of noodles, and there is no full skyline. Every landmark is drawn only with thick broken fluorescent paint-marker strokes: simplified silhouettes, incomplete outlines, large gaps, rough dry-brush edges and tapered endings, using the minimum number of lines needed for instant recognition. The colours are vivid fluorescent magenta, pink, cobalt blue, cyan, violet, acid lime, yellow and orange, shifting irregularly between one brush stroke and the next. Huge expressive hand-painted lettering reads TOKYO across the sheet, and a small handwritten phrase beneath it reads city nights. Half the composition or more stays uninterrupted pure black negative space, with only three isolated paint accents — one brush slash, one compact splatter and a few tiny dots. Flat hand-painted marks throughout, no realistic architecture, no detailed windows, no complete outlines, no clean vector shapes, no neon tubing and no three-dimensional lighting. Those two lines of lettering are the only text in the image.",
