      "title": "★★글자를 화면에 «얹지» 않고 도로 위에 «칠한다» — 곡률·경사·원근 단축을 그대로 따르게",
      "prompt": "GPT Image 2\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a premium tourism campaign poster for {LOCATION} in a strong vertical composition, viewed from an elevated aerial or scenic viewpoint. A long sweeping road should dominate the foreground and curve naturally toward the destination’s most recognizable landscape, landmark, coastline, skyline, or horizon.\n\nThe giant words “{LOCATION}” must be painted directly onto the road as bold, premium white road typography. The letters should stretch across a long section of asphalt, following the road’s curves, slope, perspective, and foreshortening. Foreground letters should be oversized and immersive, gradually shrinking into the distance so the typography feels physically engineered into the journey.\n\nInclude a refined luxury vehicle naturally in motion as a secondary visual anchor. Surround the road with {ICONIC LANDSCAPE / LANDMARKS}, using authentic local architecture, terrain, vegetation, water, geological features, or cultural elements that immediately identify the destination without feeling generic.\n\nUse minimal luxury tourism branding:\n“{LOCATION}”\n“{SHORT TRAVEL TAGLINE}”\nOptional: “{SECONDARY LINE}”\n\nUse cinematic natural lighting suited to the destination, with controlled highlights, open shadows, atmospheric depth, and realistic transitions between road, landscape, architecture, water, and sky.\n\nColor palette should reflect the destination naturally while maintaining a sophisticated premium travel aesthetic. Hyper-realistic commercial travel photography, elegant composition, strong depth and perspective, world-class tourism campaign quality, ultra-detailed, 8K.\n\nNegative prompt: generic scenery, weak or unreadable road typography, short text, distorted perspective, fake landmarks, inaccurate local architecture, oversaturated colors, muddy shadows, cluttered composition, unrealistic vehicle, cartoon elements, low-detail environment, cheap postcard aesthetic, low-resolution advertising.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**타이포를 «레이어»에서 «물체»로 옮긴 프롬프트다.**\n```\n★painted directly onto the road as bold white road typography\n★following the road's ★curves, ★slope, ★perspective and ★foreshortening\n★가까운 글자는 «거대하고 몰입적», 멀어질수록 줄어든다\n   → \"타이포가 여정 안에 «물리적으로 시공된» 것처럼 느껴지게\"\n```\n글자를 화면 좌표가 아니라 **바닥면 좌표**에 놓는다는 뜻이고, 그래서 원근 단축(foreshortening)을 명시적으로 요구한다. 「도로 위에 글자」로만 쓰면 대개 «평평한 스티커»가 나온다.\n\n★**네거티브가 실패 모드 목록이다** — 「약하거나 읽히지 않는 도로 타이포」·「짧은 텍스트」·「왜곡된 원근」·「가짜 랜드마크」·「부정확한 현지 건축」. **무엇이 잘 망가지는지 아는 사람이 쓴 목록**이다.\n\n⚠️**차는 로고가 붙는 품목이라 부품 조형을 지정했다**(런북 §브랜드 조형) — 넓게 벌린 원형 소형 램프 둘 · 세로 슬롯형 그릴 · 와이어 스포크 휠 · 무지 측면. 「unbranded」라고 쓰는 것으로는 못 지운다는 2026-08-01 실측 때문이다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium tourism campaign poster for BIG SUR in a strong vertical composition, seen from an elevated scenic viewpoint. A long sweeping coastal road dominates the foreground and curves naturally toward a high arched bridge and the headlands beyond it. The word BIG SUR is painted directly onto the road surface as bold white road typography: the letters stretch along a long section of asphalt and follow the road's curve, its slope and its perspective, so the nearest letters are oversized and immersive and the further ones shrink and compress into the distance, the type reading as physically engineered into the journey rather than laid over the picture. A single refined convertible moves along the road as a secondary anchor — a low open two-seater whose front is a plain rounded shell with two small circular lamps set wide apart, a narrow vertical slot where a grille would be and smooth unbadged flanks over wire-spoke wheels. Around the road are weathered cypress, dry golden grass, steep cliffs and the Pacific breaking white below. Minimal luxury tourism branding sits at the top: BIG SUR in a restrained line and, beneath it, the road knows the way. Cinematic natural light with controlled highlights, open shadows and atmospheric depth, a sophisticated coastal palette of fog blue, ochre grass and weathered asphalt, hyper-realistic commercial travel photography with strong depth and perspective. Those two lines and the painted road lettering are the only text in the image.",
