      "prompt": "Combined a couple of prompts I have done in the past as an experiment. I want to make it a bit trippier. \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 days that changed history: 2x2 grid, AI infers, 16:9 CONCEPT ANCHOR 1: \"Hypnotic concentric op-art tunnel — neon cyan, magenta, yellow, black; crisp wavy bands radiating toward a central vanishing point; flat graphic precision; eye-pulling rhythmic repetition\"  :: CONCEPT ANCHOR 2: \"Rotational psychedelic vortex — spiraling elastic zigzag stripes, immersive motion illusion, liquid distortion, high-frequency visual vibration, neon blue / pink / green against black\"  :: CONCEPT ANCHOR 3: \"Geometric hex-grid bulge illusion — clean vector honeycomb topology, bold yellow-blue contrast, central convex sphere distortion, precise edge control, mathematically ordered optical depth\"  INSTRUCTION: Find the exact visual center of these three concepts. Ignore the literal abstract patterns. Capture only the style essence.  Render {$SUBJECT} as an optical-illusion supergraphic in which the subject is transformed into the organizing force of a psychedelic geometric field.  STYLE RULES: - The entire composition should feel like an impossible optical event built around {$SUBJECT}. - The subject may appear as a silhouette, emblem, mask, totem, object, creature, typography-form, or icon inferred from {$SUBJECT}. - The subject should distort the surrounding field as though reality is being bent by its presence. - Use a strong central focal pull: tunnel, vortex, portal, sinkhole, lens, or bulging field center. - Build the field from tightly repeated wave bands and hex-based tessellation systems. - Let some regions remain purely concentric and rhythmic, while others spiral and twist. - Introduce one or more geometric pressure zones where a hexagonal lattice stretches, bulges, or wraps over convex form. - The subject’s internal details should be inferred through negative space, alternating bands, nested contours, and topology shifts, not realism. - Emphasize perfect edge crispness, flat color fields, and aggressive optical readability.  COLOR SYSTEM: - Infer one dominant neon palette from {$SUBJECT}, chosen from:   - cyan / magenta / yellow / black   - electric blue / hot pink / acid green / black   - cobalt / yellow / black / white - Use hard color separation only, no gradients unless used sparingly at the deepest focal center. - Preserve maximum vibrational contrast.  COMPOSITION: - Poster-like frontality. - Central tunnel or vortex bias. - Strong frame-filling graphic density. - Optional mirrored or near-symmetrical outer rhythm with increased chaos toward the center.  OUTPUT: A visually overwhelming op-art identity image for {$SUBJECT}, combining hypnotic tunnel rhythm, spiraling psychedelic motion, and hex-lattice geometric distortion into one crisp high-impact graphic.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**참조를 «따라 그려라»가 아니라 «세 개의 중심을 구하라»로 준다.**\n```\nCONCEPT ANCHOR 1  최면적 동심 옵아트 터널 — 네온 시안·마젠타·옐로·블랙\nCONCEPT ANCHOR 2  회전 사이키델릭 소용돌이 — 탄성 지그재그 스트라이프, 액체 왜곡\nCONCEPT ANCHOR 3  기하 헥스그리드 팽창 착시 — 벡터 벌집 위상, 중앙 볼록 왜곡\n★INSTRUCTION  \"이 셋의 «정확한 시각적 중심»을 찾아라.\n               ★문자 그대로의 추상 패턴은 무시하고, 스타일 «본질»만 취하라\"\n```\n★**미드저니 sref를 텍스트로 흉내 내는 방법이기도 하다.** 우리가 sref 코드를 이식 못 해 「스타일 어휘만 차용」해 온 그 자리에, **«참조 셋의 교집합을 구하라»는 지시**를 놓았다.\n\n★**주체를 «장식»이 아니라 «장의 조직력»으로 만든다** — *「주체가 자기 존재로 현실을 휘게 하듯 주변 장을 왜곡시킨다」*, 그리고 *「주체의 내부 디테일은 사실적으로가 아니라 «음영이 아닌 여백·교대 밴드·중첩 윤곽·위상 변화»로 읽히게 한다」*.\n\n★색 규칙이 «분리»에 있다 — 하드 컬러 세퍼레이션만, 그라데이션은 «가장 깊은 초점 중심»에서만 아주 드물게. 그래서 인쇄된 옵아트처럼 진동한다.",
