      "prompt": "حوّل أي منتج إلى إعلان بصري يخطف الانتباه من أول نظرة 🔥\n\nالبرومبت في الوصف ⤵️ https://t.co/eMqKj1PLys\n\n[ALT]\nCreate an illustrated advertisement where [PRODUCT] appears as a real photographic object placed inside a hand-drawn illustrated world. Build the environment from bold flat vector shapes, thick confident outlines, exaggerated perspective, playful clouds, arrows, sparkles, and stylized characters reacting to the product. Keep the illustration in a limited palette of 3 to 4 colors sampled directly from the product itself. Add a soft painted shadow beneath the product so it sits naturally in the scene. Preserve the product's original shape, colors, materials, logo, branding, and packaging exactly.\n\nStyle: modern editorial illustration, flat vector meets photo-real insert, bold graphic poster, clean negative space, print-quality detail.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**한 화면에 «재질을 두 개만» 두고 그 대비를 광고의 장치로 쓴다.**\n```\n★제품    real photographic object — 굴절 · 결로 · 하이라이트 그대로\n★나머지  전부 flat vector — 굵은 윤곽선 · 음영 없음 · 과장된 원근\n```\n오늘 배치14의 「로우폴리 지형 + 점토 초목」과 같은 원리다 — **섞으라고 하지 않고 «무엇이 어느 재질인지» 배분하면 둘 다 선명해진다.**\n\n★**그림 쪽에 «동작»을 준다** — 제품을 향해 휘어드는 화살표, 굴러오는 과일, 프레임 밖에서 들어오는 손. 실사는 가만히 있고 그림이 움직여서 시선이 제품에 모인다.",
      "gen_prompt": "An illustrated advertisement in which a real photographic object sits inside a hand-drawn world. The product is a glass bottle of orange juice with a plain paper label carrying no words, rendered as a true photograph with real glass refraction, condensation and highlights, and it is the only photographic element in the picture. Everything around it is built from bold flat vector shapes with thick confident black outlines: an exaggerated perspective road curving away beneath the bottle, playful rounded clouds, a big drawn sun, curved arrows sweeping toward the product, drawn oranges tumbling along the road and simple drawn hands reaching in from the frame edge. The drawn world is flat with no shading while the bottle keeps full depth, so the contrast between the two materials is the point. Clean negative space, modern editorial illustration, bold graphic poster, print-quality detail. No text in the image.",
