      "gen_prompt": "A poster in which a low-saturation, almost grey-white narrative image carries the subject: an abandoned industrial hall drawn in fine, slightly dry line work with pale ink washes and restrained bare paper, historic in feel but not prettified — broken skylights, a rusted gantry and standing water, rendered without romantic light. Over it, oversized black lettering collides with the picture: the word RESIDUE runs across the middle, its letters overlapping the gantry so the structure passes behind some strokes and in front of others, the word cropped at the right edge. The type is not a caption but a weight pressing on the image. A small block of tiny black type sits in the lower left. Flat ink, no gradients, paper grain only where the wash sits. Those two pieces of text are the only writing in the image.",
