      "prompt": "VISUAL OS 021 — Cut Word Pairs\n\nWhite room. Two words. One thing sitting between them.\n\nLOUD SIGNAL — night session / edition 07\nROLL RUSH — saturday / track 04\nCLICK FLASH — field notes / frame 12\nLEAF SHIFT — new growth / issue 03\n\nLocked:\n– pure white field. No texture, no gradient, no drop shadow.\n– two words stacked one per line: black on top, electric blue below\n– hand-cut letterforms — wobbly contours, uneven baselines, nothing typeset clean\n– a soft lime fringe glowing off the letter edges\n– the subject sits BETWEEN the two words, overlapping and hiding part of each\n– one hero object, or one tight body crop, lit hard against white\n– the subject's color echoes the poster: red and blue, every time\n– a tiny mono caption in one corner — a session and a number\n– one small line glyph in the opposite corner\n\nSwaps: subject / word pair / caption / glyph\n\nSound, motion, light, growth. Four words for the same impulse.\n\nPrompt ↓",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**「사이에 놓는다」를 «둘 다 가린다»로 못박은 판이다.**\n```\n★the subject sits ★BETWEEN the two words, ★overlapping and hiding part of each\n```\n위 단어의 끝과 아래 단어의 시작을 각각 가리게 해서 «글자–대상–글자» 세 층이 생긴다. 오늘 배치12·21에서 반복 확인한 규칙(겹침은 «무엇이 가려지는지»로 적어야 정해진다)의 또 다른 적용이다.\n\n★**「hand-cut letterforms — 흔들리는 윤곽, 고르지 않은 베이스라인, 깔끔하게 조판되지 않은」** — 손으로 오린 글자를 «불규칙 항목»으로 분해했다.\n\n★색 규칙 하나가 화면을 묶는다 — *「대상의 색이 포스터의 색을 그대로 되울린다: 빨강과 파랑, 매번」*.",
      "gen_prompt": "A poster on a pure white field with no texture, no gradient and no drop shadow anywhere. Two words are stacked one per line: LOUD in black on top and SIGNAL in electric blue below, both in hand-cut letterforms with wobbly contours and uneven baselines, nothing typeset clean, a soft lime fringe glowing off the letter edges. Between the two words sits the subject — a vintage ribbon microphone, lit hard against the white — overlapping both lines so it hides the end of the upper word and the start of the lower one. The microphone's body is red and its grille blue, echoing the poster's colours exactly. A tiny mono caption in the lower right corner reads night session 07. Those three pieces of text are the only writing in the image.",
