      "prompt": "Visualizing fashion with GPT. Using the same function structure. \n\nPrompt: \n2x2 grid, 16:9, AI picks subjects\n\nfunction couture(AA){\n\nInput A is a Defining Fashion Era / Style Movement.\nAnalyze:\nsilhouette, palette, fabric, and cultural mood of the era\n\nsignature garments, accessories, and recurring motifs\nthe social tension it expressed and the world it dressed\ntextile texture translated into landscape and architecture\nperiod-authentic sewing tools and atelier culture\nGoal:\nAn \"Atelier Thread World.\"\nA dress form and a vintage sewing machine sit amid bolts of fabric in a lamp-lit atelier.\nThreads, fabric swatches, and paper patterns unspool from the machine and rise into a detailed 3D environment expressing the era:\nstreets, salons, and figures woven from cloth, seams, and pattern paper themselves.\nRules:\nthread and fabric should become terrain and structure, not decorative clutter\nthreads, seams, pleats, and pattern pieces must physically form roads, buildings, skies, and the era's garments\ninclude pinned muslin, tailor's chalk, a pincushion, brass shears, a tape measure, and a torn fashion-plate page\ninclude a tiny version of the designer at a sketch table draping inside the scene\ninclude a fashion-plate clipping, a department-store notice, or a runway headline tied to the era\nsemantically infer decade, region, class signals, and symbolic garments\nlighting: warm atelier lamplight on fabric weave, soft archival shadows\nOutput:\nONE image, 4:5, couture-process diorama aesthetic\nOutput:\n2x2 grid, each cell a different couture(AA) from the same era\n}",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「함수형」 프롬프트가 실제로 강제하는 것은 «규칙(Rules) 항목»이다.**\n```\nfunction couture(AA){ Input / Analyze / Goal / ★Rules / Output }\n★Rules  \"실과 천이 ★«지형과 구조»가 되어야 한다 — 장식적 잡동사니가 아니라\"\n        \"실·솔기·주름·패턴 조각이 ★«물리적으로» 길·건물·하늘·그 시대의 의복을 «형성»해야 한다\"\n```\n★**「재료로 세계를 짓는다」 계열의 결정판이다** — 오늘 담은 「재료의 거동으로 해부를 다시 짓는다」·「로우폴리와 점토를 대상별로 배분한다」와 같은 축이고, 여기서는 «한 재료가 모든 것»이 된다.\n\n★소품 목록(핀 꽂은 머슬린·재단 초크·핀쿠션·놋 가위·줄자·찢긴 패션 플레이트)이 «그 일이 실제로 벌어지는 작업장»을 만든다. 그리고 «작은 designer 본인»을 씬 안에 넣는다.\n\n⚠️원문은 «2x2 그리드로 네 주제»를 한 번에 뽑는 형식이다. 칸 사이에 고정돼야 할 대상이 없어 (런북 §④ 판단 기준) **문법 재현이 목적인 이 항목은 대표 한 칸을 단일 이미지로 뽑았다.**",
      "gen_prompt": "An atelier thread world rendered as a couture-process diorama. In a lamp-lit workroom a dress form and a vintage sewing machine stand among bolts of fabric, and from the machine threads, fabric swatches and paper pattern pieces unspool upward and rise into a detailed three-dimensional environment of a 1920s city: the threads do not decorate that world, they build it — taut thread becomes tram cables and street lines, folded pattern paper becomes building facades with their notches and seam allowances still visible, pleated fabric becomes a boulevard, and small figures in period dress are themselves cut from cloth with visible seams. Pinned muslin, tailor's chalk, a pincushion, brass shears, a tape measure and a torn fashion-plate page lie on the workbench in the foreground. A tiny version of the designer sits at a sketch table draping inside the scene. Warm atelier lamplight rakes across the fabric weave, soft archival shadows. No text in the image.",
