      "prompt": "This was actually a fun experiment for prompt engineering. The goal was to come up with a prompt for real inventions. However, the structure leads to the model overweighing style over factual grounding, which means you get fake inventions. At least with GPT. Nano Banana gave real inventions. \n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 failed inventions that were real:  CREATE VIEW hybrid_style_render AS WITH style_params AS (   SELECT     0.30 AS texture_weight,  -- Miniature diorama cross-section     0.25 AS structure_weight, -- Fine line patterns, decorative symmetry     0.20 AS energy_weight,    -- Vintage sports poster brush strokes     0.20 AS surface_weight,   -- 3D clay render smooth matte     0.05 AS mutation_weight,  -- Ornate borders containing clay scenes     'Victorian banknote base with aged paper texture' AS base,     'ornamental engraved border + clay cutaway compartments' AS framework,     'pastel palette: soft pink, mint, peach, lavender, cream' AS colors,     'central cutaway diorama, decorative compartments, brush accents breaking symmetry' AS composition,     'soft diffused lighting on clay, flat engraving on patterns, warm aged paper tone' AS lighting ), subject_data AS (   SELECT '$SUBJECT' AS subject.  ) SELECT    compose_hybrid_style_image(     subject := subject_data.subject,     base_layer := style_params.base,     ornamental_framework := style_params.framework,     clay_scenes := 'cross-section cutaway views of ' || subject || ' rendered as chunky rounded clay miniatures with smooth matte pastel colors',     brush_energy := 'sketchy hand-drawn vintage sports poster accents breaking the precision',     engraving := 'fine symmetrical border patterns, heraldic elements, intricate linework',     typography := 'ornamental engraved letterforms for titles, hand-sketched brush pen secondary text, integrated into decorative framework',     lighting := style_params.lighting,     format := 'square with ornamental border',     constraints := 'no photorealism in clay, maintain ornamental precision, keep pastel palette for 3D elements, authentic aged paper texture'   ) AS final_image FROM subject_data, style_params; RETURN final_image;",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**작성자가 실패를 먼저 보고한 건이다 — 그래서 값어치가 크다.**\n```\n★\"목표는 «실재하는» 발명품을 위한 프롬프트를 만드는 것이었다.\n   그런데 ★이 구조는 모델이 «사실 근거»보다 «스타일»에 과대 가중치를 두게 만들어서,\n   결국 «가짜 발명품»이 나온다. 적어도 GPT에서는. Nano Banana는 실재 발명을 냈다\"\n```\n★**형식이 내용을 이긴 사례다.** SQL 뷰로 `texture_weight 0.30 / structure 0.25 / energy 0.20…`처럼 **스타일 지분을 숫자로 선언**하니 모델이 그 배분을 맞추는 데 집중하고 «실재 여부»를 놓쳤다.\n\n★**우리 실측과 연결된다** — 8/19에 얻은 「코드는 형식이지 성능이 아니다」의 반대편 증거다. 형식은 성능을 올리지 않지만 **주의를 옮길 수는 있다.**\n\n⚠️원문은 «2x2 그리드로 네 주제»를 한 번에 뽑는 형식이다. 칸 사이에 고정돼야 할 대상이 없어 (런북 §④ 판단 기준) **문법 재현이 목적인 이 항목은 대표 한 칸을 단일 이미지로 뽑았다.**",
      "gen_prompt": "A Victorian banknote-style plate on aged paper, ornately engraved, presenting an imaginary failed invention. An ornamental engraved border of fine symmetrical linework and heraldic elements frames the sheet, and inside it sit clay cutaway compartments: chunky rounded plasticine miniatures showing cross-sections of a pedal-powered flying machine — its wing frame, its gearing, its seat — each compartment set into the engraving like a window. The clay is smooth matte pastel in soft pink, mint, peach, lavender and cream, lit with soft diffused light, while the engraved patterns stay flat and printed. A few sketchy hand-drawn brush accents in vintage sports-poster manner break the precision, crossing the ornamental frame. Ornamental engraved letterforms spell FLIGHT No. 4 at the top and a hand-sketched brush-pen line sits beneath. Aged paper texture, warm tone. Those two lines are the only text in the image.",
      "ref_image": "results/gdgtify-style-weights-as-sql-columns-ref.jpg",
