      "title": "★SDF 셰이더 의사코드로 장면을 «조립»한다 — 컨테이너·기구·제품·인물을 각각 거리함수로 선언",
      "prompt": "Another fun vending machine prompt, includes other countries. I like the third one :) \n\nPrompt: \n2x2 grid, 16:9, 4 different countries in Europe or Middle East, 4 different eras   // For each panel, define an SDF scene.\nfloat sdf_container = cutaway_box(...); // front open\nfloat sdf_room = interior_volume(sdf_container, product_type);\n// Mechanism SDFs: \nfloat sdf_conveyor = instanced_belt_sdf(positions);\nfloat sdf_spring = array_of_springs(positions);\nfloat sdf_chute = angled_plane(...);\n// Oversized product SDF: scaled version of dispensed item, intersecting room.\nfloat sdf_product = scaled_dispensed_item(product);\n// Users: small posed figure SDFs.\nfloat sdf_users = user_figures(ritual);\n// Props: small detailed SDFs.\n// Combine all inside the container.\n// Materials: glass, metal, plastic with realistic shaders; internal lighting via emissive surfaces.\n// Camera: 45mm, shallow DOF. Render each panel, assemble 2×2.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**셰이더 의사코드가 강제하는 것은 «부품의 선언»이다.**\n```\nfloat sdf_container = cutaway_box(...);      // 앞면 개방\nfloat sdf_room      = interior_volume(sdf_container, product_type);\nfloat sdf_conveyor  = instanced_belt_sdf(positions);\nfloat sdf_spring    = array_of_springs(positions);\n★float sdf_product = scaled_dispensed_item(product);  // ★확대해 «내부 공간과 교차»시킨다\nfloat sdf_users    = user_figures(ritual);\n```\n★**`intersecting room` 한 줄이 이 장면의 사건이다** — 제품을 «크게 확대해 실내 볼륨과 겹치게» 두면 자판기가 «물건을 파는 상자»가 아니라 «그 물건을 품은 공간»이 된다.\n\n★8/18 배치7에서 담은 SDF 건(선이 어디에 생기는지를 수식으로)과 같은 형식이지만 거기는 «윤곽», 여기는 «부품 배치»에 쓴다 — 같은 문법의 다른 적용.\n\n⚠️원문은 «2x2 그리드로 네 주제»를 한 번에 뽑는 형식이다. 칸 사이에 고정돼야 할 대상이 없어 (런북 §④ 판단 기준) **문법 재현이 목적인 이 항목은 대표 한 칸을 단일 이미지로 뽑았다.**",
      "gen_prompt": "A cutaway view of a 1960s Italian vending machine, its front face open so the interior volume is fully visible. Inside, the mechanism is laid out clearly: an instanced conveyor belt running along the base, an array of coiled dispensing springs in rows, and an angled chute falling to the delivery tray. One product — a glass bottle of orange soda — is scaled far larger than the others and intersects the interior space, half embedded in the machine's volume as the hero object. Two small posed figures stand at the machine: one inserting a coin, one bending to the tray. Small period props sit around them — a folded newspaper, a scooter helmet on the floor. Materials are precise: brushed metal casing, thick glass front, moulded plastic buttons, with emissive internal lighting spilling from the cabinet onto the figures. Shot at 45mm with shallow depth of field. No text in the image.",
