      "title": "★시대와 그래픽 시스템을 «60/30/10 비중»으로 섞는다 — 지배 시대가 전체 인상을, 보조가 질감을, 악센트가 디테일을",
      "prompt": "I have done a bunch of these posters in the past. This time AI picked 4 different ones I had not used before. \n\nPrompt: 2x2 grid, 16:9, RENDER_CHAIN = \"[list_of_4_unusual_cars :: heritage_ad_grid :: 60_30_10_era_blend :: 16:9]\"\n\nFUSION_RULES = {\n    \"infer_vehicles\": \"if no list given, infer 4 unusual but real automobile models (e.g. Citroën DS, Tucker 48, etc.)\",\n    \"per_vehicle\": {\n        \"randomly select 3 eras and 3 graphic systems from the provided pools, assign 60/30/10 hierarchy\",\n        \"create heritage advertisement: preserve exact car identity (grille, lights, roofline, etc.)\",\n        \"integrate selected eras/graphics as per weighting; dominant era sets the overall feel, secondary adds a supporting texture, accent a subtle detail\",\n        \"generate campaign name, headline, provenance tagline – all historically literate, no fabricated awards or prices\"\n    },\n    \"assembly\": \"place the four resulting ads in a 2x2 grid, 16:9 format, clean white or period‑appropriate borders\",\n    \"global_style\": \"elegant heritage advertising, archival credibility fused with premium print production, no generic vintage\",\n    \"negative\": \"fake historical claims, duplicate pool selections, anachronisms, modern CGI gloss\"\n}\n\nOUTPUT = (RENDER_CHAIN :: FUSION_RULES) - NEGATIVE_SET\nRENDER: single 16:9 image.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「여러 시대를 섞어라」를 «비중»으로 못박은 형식이다.**\n```\nRENDER_CHAIN = \"[차 4대 :: heritage_ad_grid :: ★60_30_10_era_blend :: 16:9]\"\n★per_vehicle: 시대 3개와 그래픽 시스템 3개를 «무작위로 뽑아» 60/30/10 위계를 배정\n★\"지배 시대가 «전체 느낌»을 정하고, 2차가 «받쳐 주는 질감»을, 악센트가 «미묘한 디테일»을\"\n★그리고 「차의 정체성(그릴·라이트·루프라인)은 «정확히 보존»」\n```\n★**혼합을 «퍼센트»로 주면 어느 것이 주인공인지 흔들리지 않는다** — 8/18에 담은 「STYLE DNA ::0.35/0.25…」와 같은 계열이고, 여기서는 «시대»에 적용했다.\n\n⚠️네거티브가 «가짜 역사적 주장 · 중복 선택 · 시대착오 · 현대 CG 광택»을 막는다.\n⚠️차는 로고 품목이라 부품 조형을 지정했다(런북 §브랜드).\n\n⚠️원문은 «2x2 그리드로 네 주제»를 한 번에 뽑는 형식이다. 칸 사이에 고정돼야 할 대상이 없어 (런북 §④ 판단 기준) **문법 재현이 목적인 이 항목은 대표 한 칸을 단일 이미지로 뽑았다.**",
      "gen_prompt": "A heritage advertisement for an unusual mid-century car, composed by blending three eras in a sixty-thirty-ten hierarchy. The dominant sixty per cent is 1950s American automotive advertising: an idealised painted rendering of the car in three-quarter view, exaggerated in length and lowness, on a flat cream ground with a hand-lettered headline. Thirty per cent is 1920s art-deco print: stepped geometric borders, a sunburst behind the car and a narrow band of deco ornament along the foot. Ten per cent is 1970s Swiss grid typography: one small block of tight sans-serif specification text set in a strict two-column grid at the lower right, the only modern element. The car keeps its own identity — a low fastback body, a narrow vertical grille, small round headlamps set close together, and a plain unbadged bonnet. Warm cream, deep teal and one brass accent, with subtle print misregistration. The headline reads THE LONG WAY and the specification block is the only other text.",
