      "prompt": "4 extinction level events visualized with GPT. Kind of a cute style.\n\nPrompt: \n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this 4 extinction level events in earth's history in this style {A = { central subject: rounded sculptural clay/vinyl figure, chunky toy proportions } B = { pencil‑sketch marks: black contour lines, doodle eyes, loose shading, construction marks } C = { pop‑color accents: bright stickers, beads, confetti, decorative icons } D = { miniature playset: simplified buildings, soft hills, toy trees, clouds, signs } E = { background: colorful backdrop, poster‑like separation }  SCENE = (A ∩ centerpiece) ∪ (B ∩ overlay) ∪ (C ∩ scattered) ∪ (D ∩ environment) ∪ (E ∩ backdrop) Where: - A is a smooth, rounded 3D object inferred from $ SUBJECT, simplified into soft capsules and thick tubes. - B lines are generated from the silhouette and internal features; thicker on outer edges, lighter doodles inside. - C elements are placed in a Poisson‑disk pattern around the figure, avoiding clutter. - D is kept low‑height to frame the subject, with chunky blocks and toy plants. - E is a gradient from cream to bubblegum pink with soft clouds. All colors locked to the candy palette; black pencil is reserved for sketch marks only. }}",
      "prompt_ko": "★**집합 표기 `{A = {central subject}, B = {...}}` 가 하는 일은 «자리의 선언»이다** — 중앙에 무엇이 오고 둘레에 무엇이 오는지를 «변수 이름»으로 못박아, 주제를 갈아끼워도 구성이 유지되게 한다.\n\n★**소재와 화풍의 어긋남이 이 시리즈의 장치다** — 대멸종이라는 주제를 «귀여운 그림책 화풍»으로 그리면 정보가 무섭지 않게 읽힌다. 작성자도 *「kind of a cute style」*이라고만 적었다.\n\n★둘레 요소를 «같은 단순화 수준»으로 유지하라는 조건이 없으면 하나만 정교해져 균형이 깨진다.\n\n⚠️원문은 «2x2 그리드로 네 주제»를 한 번에 뽑는 형식이다. 칸 사이에 고정돼야 할 대상이 없어 (런북 §④ 판단 기준) **문법 재현이 목적인 이 항목은 대표 한 칸을 단일 이미지로 뽑았다.**",
      "gen_prompt": "A cute flat-illustrated diagram of an extinction event, drawn in a friendly picture-book manner despite the subject. At the centre sits the main subject: a large rounded asteroid with simple crater dots, tilted and trailing a soft tapered flame. Around it, arranged evenly in a ring, sit small supporting elements drawn at the same simplified level — a tiny long-necked dinosaur looking up, a small fern, a puff of dust cloud, a broken shell, a thermometer, and a drifting seed. Everything is flat vector with thick rounded outlines, no shading, and a limited palette of dusty coral, sage, cream and charcoal on a warm sand ground. The composition is centred and symmetrical, with generous space between the ring elements. No text in the image.",
