      "prompt": "The reveal works because the motion is vertical.\nThe glove lifts the cloche, the mist rises, and the bottle stays locked on the same center axis, so the product feels unveiled instead of simply placed.\n🧊 transparent glass cloche lifted higher above the frosted bottle by a black lace-gloved hand\nThis makes the action readable. You see the moment of release, while the hand stays elegant and secondary.\n✨ luminous cyan-blue mist rising in controlled sculptural plumes around the bottle\nThis gives the scene its luxury drama. The vapor adds motion and mystery, but the bottle remains the brightest, cleanest object in the frame.\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate a premium vertical social-poster advertisement for a fictional luxury beauty brand called VELUNE LAB, merging stronger Orbit reveal drama with more refined Transit sophistication. Preserve the original structural logic exactly: a dark midnight-blue to black gradient background, one bold title in the upper-left, one compact profile-card style info module in the upper-right, one elegant gloved female hand entering from the upper-right and lifting a transparent glass cloche, one hero frosted cosmetic bottle centered beneath it, luminous blue mist swirling around the bottle, a matte black tray and sculptural pedestal below, and one minimalist call-to-action line near the bottom. The image must feel like a flagship luxury beauty reveal card: mysterious, cinematic, controlled, and highly premium.\n\nMain product scene:\nPlace one premium frosted glass skincare or serum bottle in the exact center, standing inside a matte black square tray on a dark sculptural pedestal. The bottle should be pale icy blue-white with a subtle internal glow, a minimal luxury label, crisp geometry, and highly refined cosmetic realism. Above it, the transparent glass cloche is being lifted upward by a realistic feminine hand in a black lace glove. Strengthen the Orbit direction by making the reveal moment feel more active: the cloche should be slightly higher, the mist should rise more decisively, and the whole center axis should feel like the product is being unveiled in one dramatic upward release.\n\nAtmosphere and effects:\nThe blue vapor is the key motion language. Build elegant luminous cyan-blue mist around and above the bottle, rising in layered, sculptural plumes that expand as the cloche lifts. The smoke should feel controlled, luxurious, and physically believable, with soft transparency, gradual density variation, delicate curling edges, and a premium theatrical glow. Let the upward drift of the vapor reinforce the reveal energy without overwhelming the bottle.\n\nHand and styling:\nThe hand enters from the upper-right edge, gracefully gripping the glass knob. It must feel realistic, elegant, and anatomically correct, with refined finger separation, natural nail shape, believable skin under the glove, and no distortion. The black lace glove must show delicate floral mesh texture, subtle stretch over the fingers, and couture-level detail. The hand remains secondary to the bottle, but strongly supports the unveiling action.\n\nPoster layout and branding:\nTop-left: one original bold title word in clean uppercase typography, such as “REVEAL” or “UNCOVER,” fully original.  \nTop-right: one small profile-card style block with a tiny portrait thumbnail and a few lines of original English informational text, clean and premium, like campaign metadata.  \nBottom-center or lower area: one short original minimalist call-to-action line.  \nAll text must be original, crisp, and elegant, with cleaner spacing and more restraint than a typical social promo. Push the Transit direction by making the information architecture lighter, more international, and less noisy.\n\nLighting:\nUse cinematic studio lighting with a luminous cool core centered on the bottle and smoke, glossy but controlled highlights on the cloche, a subtle rim light on the glove, and deep sculptural shadow in the tray and pedestal. Build stronger contrast and product separation so the bottle emerges clearly from darkness while keeping the mood mysterious and premium. The brightest focal areas should be the bottle shoulder, pump, and the densest rising mist.\n\nMaterial realism:\nThe bottle must show believable frosted cosmetic glass, subtle semi-opaque liquid presence, precise metallic pump reflections, clean label print, and refined luxury-packaging realism. The cloche must have convincing thick-glass reflections and elegant curvature. The tray and pedestal should feel matte-black and architectural. The glove must read as premium lace, not flat fabric. Everything should look like a high-budget international beauty campaign.\n\nColor system:\nMidnight navy, black, luminous cyan-blue mist, icy frosted blue-white bottle, silver or gunmetal pump, white text accents, and black lace glove. Keep the palette restrained, dark, polished, and globally premium.\n\nNegative prompt:\nno copied text, no existing brand names, no watermark, no low-detail bottle, no messy smoke, no broken glass reflections, no distorted hand, no extra fingers, no fused fingers, no cheap CGI look, no muddy blacks, no black blotches, no cluttered background, no random props, no noisy layout.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**작성자 관찰 — *「리빌이 통하는 이유는 움직임이 «수직»이기 때문이다. 장갑이 클로시를 들고, 안개가 오르고, 병은 같은 중심축에 고정돼 있다. 그래서 제품이 «놓인» 게 아니라 «벗겨진» 것으로 느껴진다」*.**\n\n```\n★· 클로시를 «더 높이» 들어올린 순간을 잡는다 — 정지된 배치가 아니라 «해제되는 중»\n· 안개는 클로시를 따라 «상승»하며 층을 이룬다. 병 어깨 위가 가장 짙고 오를수록 옅어진다\n· 병은 중심축에서 절대 움직이지 않는다 — 손과 안개만 움직인다\n· 손은 «부차»지만 동작을 지탱한다: 레이스의 메시·손가락 마디의 늘어남까지 지정\n```\n★**여기서 배울 것은 「제품 광고의 동사」다.** 대부분의 제품 컷은 «있다»를 그리는데 이 구성은 «드러난다»를 그린다. 그러려면 화면에 «움직이는 것 하나»(덮개)와 «그 움직임을 따라가는 것 하나»(안개)가 필요하고, 제품 자체는 오히려 «고정»돼야 한다.\n\n★타이포는 두 덩이로 못박았다 — 자리만 열어 두면 모델이 본문에서 아무 구절이나 주워 채운다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A cinematic vertical beauty advertisement on a midnight-navy to black gradient. At the exact centre a frosted pale icy-blue serum bottle with a plain minimal label stands in a matte black square tray on a dark sculptural pedestal. A realistic hand in a black lace glove enters from the upper right and lifts a thick transparent glass cloche well above the bottle, caught mid-motion. Luminous cyan mist rises with the cloche in layered sculptural plumes, densest just above the bottle shoulder and thinning as it climbs, so the whole centre axis reads as one upward release. Controlled studio lighting with a cool luminous core on the bottle, a soft rim light along the glove, deep shadow inside the tray. The lace shows fine floral mesh and natural stretch over the knuckles, the fingers separated and anatomically correct. One bold uppercase word REVEAL sits in the upper left and one short line at the bottom reads LIFT TO BEGIN. Those are the only words in the image.",
