      "title": "★★전경의 스카이라인 «가장자리»를 인물 실루엣과 정확히 일치시킨다 — 도상반전 포스터",
      "prompt": "Another attempt at visualizing movies and books. Works with Reve, GPT Image 2 and Nano Banana. \n\nPrompt: \n\n create temp view franchise_dna as\nselect\ninfer_iconic_character_profile(:franchise) as profile_mask,\ninfer_flat_environment(:franchise) as foreground,\ninfer_light_color(:franchise) as light_ink,\ninfer_dark_color(:franchise) as dark_ink;\n\ncreate temp view poster_layers as\nselect\nlayer1 = render_background(light_ink, texture='archival_paper'),\nlayer2 = render_foreground(foreground, dark_ink, mask=profile_mask)\nfrom franchise_dna;\n\n-- gestalt logic: the foreground is printed with the profile_mask as negative space.\n-- the environment's skyline edge aligns exactly with the profile silhouette.\n\ncreate temp view final_poster as\nselect\ncomposite(layer1, layer2, mode='screen_print_overprint') as artwork\nfrom poster_layers;\n\nrender artwork\nwith style='olly_moss_minimalism, gestalt_figure_ground',\nconstraints='no_gradients, no_3d, no_floating_faces_in_sky';",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**프롬프트를 «SQL 뷰 3단»으로 썼다 — 그리고 레이어 구조가 실제로 그 순서다.**\n```sql\ncreate temp view franchise_dna as select\n  infer_iconic_character_profile(:franchise) as profile_mask,   -- 인물 «옆모습 마스크»\n  infer_flat_environment(:franchise)         as foreground,     -- 평면 환경\n  infer_light_color(:franchise) as light_ink, infer_dark_color(:franchise) as dark_ink;\ncreate temp view poster_layers as select\n  layer1 = render_background(light_ink, texture='archival_paper'),\n  ★layer2 = render_foreground(foreground, dark_ink, mask=profile_mask) from franchise_dna;\n-- ★gestalt logic: 전경은 profile_mask를 «음의 공간»으로 삼아 인쇄된다.\n--                환경의 «스카이라인 가장자리»가 인물 실루엣과 «정확히» 정렬된다.\ncreate temp view final_poster as select\n  composite(layer1, layer2, mode='screen_print_overprint') as artwork from poster_layers;\nrender artwork with style='olly_moss_minimalism, gestalt_figure_ground',\n  constraints='no_gradients, no_3d, ★no_floating_faces_in_sky';\n```\n★**`no_floating_faces_in_sky`가 이 기법의 실패를 정확히 짚는다.** 도상반전 포스터를 시키면 대개 «하늘에 얼굴이 떠 있는» 그림이 나오는데, 그건 실루엣을 «그린» 것이지 «남긴» 것이 아니다.\n★핵심 규칙은 한 줄 — **스카이라인의 «가장자리»가 곧 얼굴선이어야 한다.** 그래서 인물 안쪽에는 아무것도 그리지 않는다.\n\n⚠️원문은 2x2 그리드로 네 주제를 한 번에 뽑는 형식이다 — 칸 사이에 고정될 대상이 없어 (런북 §④) 문법 재현이 목적인 이 항목은 대표 한 칸을 단일 이미지로 뽑았다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A two-ink screen-printed poster in the tradition of minimal figure-ground poster art. The background is a flat field of pale bone ink on archival paper. Printed over it in a deep ink is a flat foreground scene of a rain-slicked harbour town — rooftops, a lighthouse, cranes, mooring posts and a low ridge behind them. The upper edge of that entire skyline is cut so that it traces the exact profile of a hooded figure seen from the shoulders up, facing left: the ridge becomes the back of the head, the lighthouse becomes the brow, a crane arm becomes the nose, the rooftops become the jaw. The figure exists only as the pale negative space above the town — nothing is drawn inside it, no face floats in the sky. Hard flat shapes with no gradients and no three-dimensional shading, visible screen-print overprint where the two inks meet. There is no text in the image.",
      "ref_image": "results/gdgtify-foreground-skyline-doubles-as-the-silhouette-ref.jpg",
