      "title": "★제품을 일러스트에 «녹이지» 않는다 — 배경 전체를 «같은 방향의 벡터 세계»로 밀어붙인다",
      "prompt": "The key is making the shoe break the illustration, not blend into it.\nThe poster works because the product stays hyper-real while everything around it becomes a directional vector world pushing the same way.\n🍊 one oversized hyper-real orange running shoe floating diagonally upward-forward\nThis gives the shoe acceleration. You see the toe driving into space, while the underside angle shows the sole technology instead of hiding it.\n🧊 reduced vector motion world with angled slogan blocks following the shoe’s axis\nThis keeps the energy controlled. The runners, roads, clouds, and type all support the same forward direction instead of becoming a busy cartoon background.\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate a Cannes-level premium running shoe campaign poster for a fictional brand called VELOCENE, designed as a world-class fusion of hyper-real product photography and bold designer-led vector illustration. Square format, deep midnight-navy base, one oversized hero performance running shoe floating diagonally across the center as the absolute visual focus, surrounded by a cleaner, more internationally refined illustrated motion world. The image must merge Orbit energy with Transit sophistication: stronger directional thrust, sharper motion architecture, cleaner graphic reduction, and a more premium athletic-brand finish.\n\nMain product:\nOne ultra-real performance running shoe in vivid orange with black and white engineered sole structure, shown in a dramatic three-quarter underside angle, enlarged and suspended in midair. Increase the Orbit feeling by tilting the shoe slightly more aggressively upward-forward so the toe projects into space and the whole silhouette feels like it is accelerating out of the frame. The shoe must feel lightweight, breathable, and technically advanced: dense knit mesh upper, perforation zones, sculpted heel pull tab, layered support cage, precise lace system, responsive foam midsole, black traction outsole, realistic stitching, subtle matte-sheen overlays, and highly believable sports-footwear construction. Lighting on the shoe must be premium, dimensional, and crisp, clearly separating it from the illustrated background.\n\nBackground concept:\nBuild a stylized running-life universe around the shoe using a reduced but highly intentional vector language. Keep the playful spirit, but make it more curated and globally premium: simplified sunshine icon, a few energetic runners, abstract urban blocks, flowers, clouds, curved roads, leaves, and one or two lifestyle accents only. Remove decorative excess and keep the background cleaner than a typical cartoon poster. Every illustrated element must support the shoe’s forward motion and comfort story. The environment should feel like a branded motion landscape, not a busy cartoon scene.\n\nTypography and layout:\nIntegrate oversized dynamic slogan blocks into the illustrated composition, using original English only, such as “RUN LIGHT. GO LONG.” and “AIR IN EVERY MILE.” The typography should be bold, angled, condensed, and architectural, helping create forward thrust around the shoe. Strengthen the Orbit direction by making the large type panels slant and push in the same movement axis as the shoe. Strengthen the Transit direction by keeping type spacing cleaner, hierarchy sharper, and the number of text elements more restrained. Add one small original brand wordmark near the top with a minimal running descriptor.\n\nStyle:\nHyper-real product hero plus designer vector world, premium global sports campaign, youthful but not childish, playful but not noisy, graphic but commercially luxurious. The final image must feel like a top-tier international running brand seasonal key visual with award-level clarity and momentum.\n\nLighting and atmosphere:\nThe shoe receives premium studio lighting with controlled highlights, elegant shadow falloff, and subtle warm bounce from surrounding orange-yellow graphic elements. The vector background remains mostly flat but can include minimal tonal layering for depth. Keep contrast strong, composition clean, and motion unmistakable. Use angled type, directional clouds, and selective flying leaves to amplify movement without clutter.\n\nColor system:\nDeep midnight navy background, vivid orange hero shoe, yellow and cream typography highlights, restrained violet or purple support blocks, touches of lime green and coral, crisp black-and-white outsole contrast. Keep the palette energetic but controlled, with a more international flagship polish.\n\nNegative prompt:\nno copied brand names, no copied slogans, no messy background, no low-detail shoe, no deformed footwear, no broken sole structure, no muddy colors, no black blotches, no cheap cartoon look, no childish illustration, no weak hierarchy, no photoreal background, no cluttered typography, no watermark, no existing logo.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**작성자 관찰 — *「핵심은 신발이 일러스트에 «섞여 드는» 게 아니라 «깨고 나오게» 하는 것이다. 이 포스터가 통하는 이유는 제품이 하이퍼리얼로 남고, 주변 전부가 «같은 방향으로 미는 벡터 세계»가 되기 때문이다」*.**\n\n★**두 축을 동시에 건 것이 값어치다.** ①질감의 대비(사진 vs 플랫 벡터) ②방향의 통일(구름·띠·잎·도형이 전부 한 방향). 대비만 있으면 합성처럼 보이고, 방향만 있으면 제품이 묻힌다.\n★프레임 «밖»으로 나오는 [[aziz4ai-make-the-product-break-the-frame]]과 다르다 — 이쪽은 프레임 안에서 «층»으로 분리한다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A bold square sneaker campaign poster. The background is a flat vector illustration in orange, amber and cream — angled speed clouds, streaking diagonal bands, a few flying leaves and slanted geometric shapes, every element tilted the same way so the whole field pushes hard from lower left to upper right. Sitting on top of that flat world, and clearly not part of it, is one hyper-real running shoe photographed with premium studio lighting: knitted mesh texture, stitched panel edges, a layered white midsole and a gum outsole, with controlled specular highlights and a soft warm bounce picked up from the orange graphics around it. The shoe casts a real shadow onto the flat artwork. The contrast between photographic product and flat vector world is unmistakable, the composition clean, the motion in one direction only. There is no text in the image.",
      "ref_image": "results/ouzhen599-product-breaks-the-illustration-ref.jpg",
      "result": "results/ouzhen599-product-breaks-the-illustration.webp",
