      "prompt": "Character Sheet 1: HYPERION-01 (Entity A)\n\nCreate a detailed production character sheet for a high-budget sci-fi mecha anime short film, 16:9 cinematic format, modern high-budget Japanese anime style, heavy mechanical transformable detail, no copyrighted characters, no existing anime IP, no celebrity likeness.\n\nEntity: HYPERION-01 (Dual-State Vehicle and Mecha)\n\nState 1 (Vehicle Form):\nSleek, low-slung crimson-red Korean hypercar. Carbon-fiber splitters, glowing neon-cyan LED headlights, gold-finished sports rims, dark tinted glass, rear dual plasma exhaust ports.\n\nState 2 (Mecha Form):\n6-meter tall aggressive bipedal combat mecha. Crimson chest armor formed from the hypercar hood, glowing cyan visor display on an angular helmet, exposed mechanical joints, hydraulics, back-mounted thruster pods firing cyan plasma.\n\nTransformation Details:\nMechanical callouts showing wheels folding into ankle and shoulder joints, front fenders shifting into chest plates, headlights moving to form visor optics.\n\nStyle:\nModern high-end mecha anime design, crisp linework, hard mechanical shading, vibrant crimson red and cyan contrast. Neutral dark-grey grid background.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**캐릭터 시트를 «두 상태 + 그 사이»로 설계했다.**\n```\nEntity: HYPERION-01 (Dual-State Vehicle and Mecha)\n  State 1 (Vehicle Form): 낮게 깔린 크림슨 하이퍼카 — 카본 스플리터·네온 시안 헤드램프·\n                          골드 림·후방 듀얼 플라스마 배기\n  State 2 (Mecha Form) : 6미터 이족 전투 메카 — ★가슴 장갑이 «차량 보닛에서 형성»되고,\n                          각진 헬멧의 시안 바이저·노출 유압 관절·등의 스러스터 포드\n★Transformation Details: 바퀴가 접히고… 각 단계를 «기계 콜아웃»으로 표시\n★제약: no copyrighted characters, no existing anime IP, no celebrity likeness\n```\n★**「가슴 장갑이 «보닛에서» 온다」처럼 부품의 «출처»를 지정한 것이 변형 시트의 핵심이다.** 두 형태를 따로 그리면 «닮은 두 로봇»이 되고, 부품의 이동 경로를 적으면 «같은 기계»가 된다.\n★그리고 IP·유명인 배제를 프롬프트 안에 «제약으로» 박아 뒀다 — 우리 런북의 저작권 처리와 같은 문제의식이다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A production character sheet for a sci-fi mecha short film, laid out on a dark technical background in modern high-budget Japanese animation style. On the left, State 1: a sleek low-slung crimson hypercar in three-quarter view with carbon splitters, glowing neon-cyan headlights, gold rims and dual rear plasma ports. On the right, State 2: the same machine as a six-metre bipedal combat mecha, its crimson chest armour visibly formed from the car's bonnet, an angular helmet with a glowing cyan visor, exposed hydraulic joints and back-mounted thruster pods firing cyan plasma. Between them, a row of small transformation callouts shows the intermediate stages — wheels folding inward, the roof splitting into shoulder plates, the chassis hinging upright — each linked by thin leader lines to the part it describes. A scale bar with a human figure runs along the bottom. Fully original design with no existing franchise cues. Only the callout numbers appear as text in the image.",
      "ref_image": "results/yourplugai-dual-state-character-sheet-with-callouts-ref.jpg",
