      "prompt": "Prompt 1:\nDense mystical cinema poster featuring an abandoned house standing alone in a vast black landscape, surrounded by thick nocturnal fog. An impossible vertical beam of saturated cobalt-blue light passes directly through the roof and disappears into the sky. Huge condensed typography reading “THE SILENT FREQUENCY” fills the composition, partially buried inside darkness and fragmented by horizontal analog interference. Pitch black, electric blue, cold white and subtle crimson accents. Heavy 35mm grain, halation, VHS distortion, scratched film texture, deep shadows, luminous atmospheric haze, experimental supernatural thriller aesthetic. Small text: “SILENCE HAS A FREQUENCY”, “SIGNAL UNKNOWN”, “DO NOT ANSWER.”\n\nPrompt 2:\nPsychological mystery poster featuring a solitary empty chair positioned in the center of an enormous dark room filled with dense blue-black fog. A narrow column of icy white light falls from an invisible opening above, illuminating only the chair and a small circle of floor. Giant elegant serif typography reading “THE DEEPER ROOM” dominates the image, with sections submerged into darkness and others melting into liquid horizontal distortion. Black, ultramarine, icy silver and subtle dirty ivory palette. Extreme grain, chromatic fringes, analog film scratches, soft blooming light, deep crushed blacks, surreal architectural atmosphere, sophisticated experimental horror poster. Small text: “THERE IS ALWAYS ANOTHER ROOM”, “MEMORY IS NOT A PLACE”, “LOOK INSIDE.”\n\nPrompt 3:\nMystical psychological horror movie poster with a black forest almost disappearing into darkness. In the center, a small solitary white horse stands beneath several narrow beams of intense blue-white light cutting vertically through heavy fog, while the surrounding trees dissolve into grain and darkness. Massive deep-red condensed typography reading “WHERE THE NIGHT OPENS” occupies the background from edge to edge, with letters disappearing behind the forest and breaking into blurred horizontal slices near the center. Strong contrast between vivid crimson type, electric blue light and near-black photography. Thick cinematic grain, halation, imperfect print registration, photocopy texture, dense fog, unsettling dream logic, experimental film-poster design. Small text: “DON’T FOLLOW THE LIGHT”, “NIGHT STUDIES”, “SOMETHING IS WAITING BETWEEN THE TREES.”\n\nPrompt 4:\nDark mystical cinematic poster featuring a giant black stag standing motionless in shallow water at night, almost reduced to a silhouette. Behind it, enormous columns of radiant cobalt and icy white light rise vertically into darkness, reflected in the water and dissolving into dense blue mist. Huge ultramarine condensed typography reading “THE ANIMAL BETWEEN WORLDS” stretches across the poster, partially hidden behind the stag and cut by irregular horizontal bands of blur and analog interference. Small sections of letters shift into deep red and pale cyan through chromatic misregistration. Extremely dense blacks, luminous blue highlights, atmospheric fog, scratched film emulsion, heavy grain and overexposed glow, haunting supernatural cinema aesthetic. Small text: “IT ONLY APPEARS WHEN NO ONE IS LOOKING”, “BEYOND THE VISIBLE”, “ENTER QUIETLY.”",
      "prompt_ko": "★**타이포를 «완전히 보이게» 두지 않는 것이 이 포스터의 문법이다.**\n```\n· 거대한 응축 타이포가 구도를 «채우되», ★«어둠 속에 부분적으로 묻히고»\n★  «수평 아날로그 간섭»에 의해 조각난다\n· 불가능한 «수직 광선»이 지붕을 «직접 관통»해 하늘로 사라진다\n· 칠흑 · 일렉트릭 블루 · 차가운 흰색 · 절제된 크림슨 액센트\n· 35mm 입자 · 할레이션 · VHS 왜곡 · 긁힌 필름 질감 · 발광하는 대기 헤이즈\n```\n★**글자를 가리면 읽히지 않을 것 같지만 반대다** — 사람은 부분만 보여도 단어를 복원하고, 그 «복원하는 순간»이 포스터를 기억에 남게 한다. 온전한 큰 글자는 그냥 제목이 된다.\n★두 가지 가리는 방식을 함께 쓴 것도 요령이다 — «어둠에 묻히기»(면적)와 «간섭 띠에 잘리기»(선). 하나만 쓰면 실수처럼 보이고, 둘이 겹치면 «매체의 성질»로 읽힌다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A dense mystical cinema poster: an abandoned clapboard house stands alone in a vast black landscape, surrounded by thick nocturnal fog that swallows the ground. One impossible vertical beam of saturated cobalt-blue light passes straight down through the roof and disappears upward into the sky, lighting the fog from within. Huge condensed uppercase typography fills the composition around the house — but it is only partly visible: the lower portions of the letterforms are buried in the darkness with no edge at all, and horizontal bands of analogue interference cut across the type, fragmenting whole letters into displaced slices. Pitch black, electric blue, cold white and a restrained crimson accent. Heavy 35mm grain, halation around the light beam, VHS distortion, scratched film texture, deep shadows and luminous atmospheric haze. The typography reads THE SILENT FREQUENCY and is the only text in the image.",
