      "prompt": "This is what happens when you trust restraint: the folds of fabric become calligraphy, a whisper of color does the work of a whole palette and everything unnecessary simply falls away.\n\nEditorial minimalism at its most human.\n\nPROMPT ↓ \n“Minimal illustration of [PERSON], natural body movement, expressive flowing linework, simplified clothing folds, tiny muted color accents, vast off-white negative space, elegant lifestyle magazine aesthetic.”",
      "prompt_ko": "★**작성자 메모 — *「절제를 믿으면 이런 일이 일어난다: 천의 주름이 «캘리그래피»가 되고, 색 한 마디가 «팔레트 전체의 일»을 하며, 불필요한 것은 그냥 떨어져 나간다」*.**\n```\nMinimal illustration of [PERSON], natural body movement, ★expressive flowing linework,\n★simplified clothing folds, ★tiny muted color accents, vast off-white negative space,\nelegant lifestyle magazine aesthetic.\n```\n★**짧지만 네 가지를 정확히 지정한다** — ①선이 «흐르게» ②주름을 «단순화»해 그 주름이 곧 선이 되게 ③색은 «아주 작게, 탁하게» ④여백은 «광대하게».\n★특히 「주름을 단순화하라」가 핵심이다. 옷 주름을 사실적으로 그리면 선이 많아져 «일러스트»가 아니라 «드로잉 습작»이 된다. 주름을 몇 개의 긴 곡선으로 줄이면 그 선들이 동세를 만들고, 그래서 몸의 외곽선이 «필요 없어진다».\n★색 한 곳만 쓰는 규칙은 라이브러리에 여러 형태로 반복된다 — [[xiaoxiaodong01-subject-breaks-out-of-the-black-rectangle]]의 «유일하게 켜진 부분»과 같다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A minimal editorial illustration of an adult figure mid-stride on a vast off-white field, drawn with expressive flowing linework where the folds of the clothing are the drawing itself: a long coat and wide trousers are described by a handful of continuous curved strokes that vary in weight as they turn, with no outline around the body and no interior shading. The face is suggested with two or three marks only. Almost the entire sheet is empty warm white; the figure sits low and to the left. A single muted colour accent — a soft clay red — appears only in the scarf, doing all the chromatic work in the image. Elegant lifestyle-magazine restraint, natural body movement, nothing decorative anywhere. There is no text in the image.",
