      "target_model": "GPT Image 2",
      "category": "포스터/타이포",
      "title": "★★타이포를 건축으로 만들 때 «구축 논리 하나»를 고른다 — 자라나거나(Growth) 파이거나(Carved)",
      "prompt": "🤯 Turn type into architecture, and the poster comes alive!\n\nA visual system built from concrete, glass, metal, shadow, and space\n\n1. FLOW — path, movement, continuity\n2. VOID — light, silence, negative space\n3. MASS — weight, structure, scale\n4. SKIN — material, texture, reflection\n\nPerfect for architectural posters, exhibition visuals, and editorial design!\n\nMade with GPT-Image2\nPrompt below 👇\n\n[답글에서 회수한 전문 — 재스크랩 2026-08-21]\nPrompt:\n\n[WORD]: {MASS / VOID / FLOW / SKIN / 4–6 letter word}\n[CONCEPT]: {weight / light / movement / material}\n[MODE]: {Growth / Carved}\n[MATERIALS]: {concrete / metal / glass / stone}\n[LINES]: {structural mesh / spatial lines / flow field / surface topology}\n[FORMAT]: 9:16 vertical\n\nCreate a high-end experimental architectural poster where typography becomes architecture itself.\n\nMake “[WORD]” the main spatial structure, built from real architectural materials rather than placed over a photo or rendered as floating 3D text.\n\nUse one construction logic:\n\nGrowth: letters grow into walls, ramps, corridors, façades, and structural forms.\n\nCarved: letters are cut, recessed, folded, or opened directly into one continuous architectural surface through negative space, glass, shadow, and material changes.\n\nThe architecture itself should feel sculptural and visually striking, with strong massing, curves, voids, light, and refined material transitions. Use realistic perspective, material thickness, joints, reflections, and tiny human figures for scale.\n\nAdd fine parametric lines derived from real letter edges, structural joints, paths, light boundaries, or surface curvature. Let them evolve naturally:\n\nstructure → abstraction → deformation → dissolution\n\nKeep the lines thin, gray-white, non-glowing, with one concentrated Line Event before they gradually fade into the black space.\n\nUse a deep matte-black field with generous negative space. Keep colors restrained: graphite, concrete gray, metal silver, glass tones, plus a subtle warm-light or cool-blue accent.\n\nUse minimal micro typography like an architectural research archive.\n\nOnly show:\n“AETHER — SPATIAL STUDIES”\n“[WORD]”\n“[CONCEPT]”\n“[MATERIALS]”\n“2026”\n\nFinal result: sculptural, spatial, minimal, experimental, and highly designed.\n\nAvoid floating 3D text, random decorative lines, cyberpunk effects, UI graphics, extra text, page numbers, logos, and watermarks.",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**「타이포를 건축으로」를 두 개의 «구축 논리» 중 하나로 강제한다.**\n```\n[WORD]: {MASS / VOID / FLOW / SKIN / 4~6글자}   [MODE]: {Growth / Carved}\n\n★사진 «위에 얹거나» 떠 있는 3D 텍스트로 렌더하지 말고, 실제 건축 재료로 «지어진»\n 주 공간 구조가 되게 한다. 그리고 «하나의» 구축 논리만 쓴다:\n  ★Growth : 글자가 «자라나» 벽·램프·복도·파사드·구조체가 된다\n  ★Carved : 글자가 «하나의 연속된 건축 표면»에 잘리고 파이고 접히고 열린다\n            — 음의 공간·유리·그림자·재질 변화를 통해\n★선은 «실제 글자 모서리·구조 접합부·동선·빛의 경계·표면 곡률»에서 파생되고,\n structure → abstraction → deformation → dissolution 으로 «진화»한다.\n 얇고 회백색이며 «발광하지 않고», ★«집중된 Line Event 하나» 뒤에 검은 공간으로 사라진다.\n· 스케일을 위해 «작은 인물»을 넣는다 · 아카이브풍 마이크로 타이포만\n금지: 떠 있는 3D 텍스트 · 무작위 장식선 · 사이버펑크 이펙트 · UI 그래픽 · 로고 · 워터마크\n```\n★**두 논리를 «양자택일»로 만든 것이 핵심이다.** 섞으면 «자라면서 파인» 형체 불명의 덩어리가 된다. Growth는 «더하기», Carved는 «빼기»라서 재료의 거동이 반대다.\n★선의 생애를 네 단계로 적고 「Line Event 하나」로 절정을 지정한 것도 배울 점 — 파라메트릭 선은 균일하게 깔면 벽지가 되고, 한 곳에서 집중됐다 흩어져야 «사건»이 된다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A high-end experimental architectural poster on a deep matte-black field with generous negative space. The word MASS is not text placed over a photograph — it is the building itself, carved: the letterforms are cut and recessed directly into one continuous concrete surface, opened through negative space, deep shadow and slots of glass, so the counters read as courtyards and the stems as canyons between walls. Realistic perspective, believable material thickness, visible formwork joints and reflections in the glass, with two tiny human figures at the base for scale. Fine grey-white parametric lines derive from the real letter edges and structural joints and evolve outward — structure, then abstraction, then deformation, then dissolution — with one concentrated burst of line activity before they fade into the black. The lines are thin and do not glow. Restrained palette of graphite, concrete grey, metal silver and glass, with one cool blue light accent. Small archival micro type reads AETHER — SPATIAL STUDIES, MASS, WEIGHT, CONCRETE and 2026. Those are the only words in the image.",
