      "prompt": "1. Add your animal\n2. Add your background colour\n\nPiranha exploding out with regression degradation glitch distortion digital decay and broken fragmented pixels, cinematic, bright vivid colours, bright orange background --ar 16:9 --raw --stylize 300 --hd --v 8.2 https://t.co/fvh0q6wYmZ",
      "prompt_ko": "★**템플릿의 «사용법»을 두 줄로 줄인 것이 이 건의 값어치다.**\n```\n★1. Add your animal\n★2. Add your background colour\n\n[ANIMAL] exploding out with regression degradation glitch distortion digital decay and\nbroken fragmented pixels, cinematic, bright vivid colours, [COLOR] background\n--ar 16:9 --raw --stylize 300 --hd --v 8.2\n```\n★**슬롯이 많은 템플릿은 쓰이지 않는다.** 채울 칸이 둘뿐이면 누구나 바로 돌려 본다 — 나머지(글리치 어휘·시네마틱·채도·비율)는 전부 «고정»으로 넘겼다.\n★글리치 어휘를 네 개 겹친 것도 계산이다 — `regression degradation` + `glitch distortion` + `digital decay` + `broken fragmented pixels`. 하나만 쓰면 «필터»가 되고, 겹치면 «붕괴»가 된다.\n★[[ludoviccreator-name-the-effect-then-leave-slots]]와 같은 설계 — 효과는 고정, 대상만 슬롯.",
      "gen_prompt": "A piranha bursting toward the camera against a flat bright orange background, its body breaking apart mid-motion into regression degradation glitch artefacts: horizontal scan tears displace whole sections of the fish sideways, blocky fragmented pixels spray outward from the leading edge, and the tail dissolves into digital decay with chromatic fringing along every torn boundary. The head stays sharp and readable — the teeth, the eye and the gill line hold — so the destruction reads as motion rather than noise. Cinematic lighting on the intact portion, bright vivid colour throughout, hard contrast against the flat ground. There is no text in the image.",
