      "title": "★모션 블러를 «주역이 아니라 암시»로 제한한다 — 주체는 또렷하게 남긴다",
      "prompt": "🎨 WHISPERS OF VELOCITY 🎨\n\nPrompt  :\n\nWhispers of Velocity surrounding [SUBJECT], where the motion blur appears as subtle, almost ethereal wisps of color in [COLOR1] and [COLOR2]. The subject should be relatively clear, with the blur acting as a subtle suggestion of movement rather than a dominant feature\n\nCheck ALTS\n\n[ALT]\nWhispers of Velocity surrounding a sprinting cheetah, where the motion blur appears as subtle, almost ethereal wisps of color in amber and burnt orange. The subject should be relatively clear, with the blur acting as a subtle suggestion of movement rather than a dominant feature --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nWhispers of Velocity surrounding a cyclist leaning into a turn, where the motion blur appears as subtle, almost ethereal wisps of color in electric blue and silver. The subject should be relatively clear, with the blur acting as a subtle suggestion of movement rather than a dominant feature --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nWhispers of Velocity surrounding a white stallion galloping across a misty plain, where the motion blur appears as subtle, almost ethereal wisps of color in moonlit silver and icy blue. The subject should be relatively clear, with the blur acting as a subtle suggestion of movement rather than a dominant feature --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nWhispers of Velocity surrounding a celestial warrior drawing a glowing sword, where the motion blur appears as subtle, almost ethereal wisps of color in cosmic violet and radiant gold. The subject should be relatively clear, with the blur acting as a subtle suggestion of movement rather than a dominant feature --ar 3:2 --v 8.2",
      "prompt_ko": "★**속도 표현에서 흔한 실패 — «주체를 뭉개 버리는 것» — 을 프롬프트가 직접 막는다.**\n```\nWhispers of Velocity surrounding [SUBJECT], where the motion blur appears as subtle,\nalmost ethereal wisps of colour in [COLOR1] and [COLOR2].\n★The subject should be relatively clear, with the blur acting as a subtle suggestion of\n★movement rather than a dominant feature\n```\n★**「블러는 지배적 요소가 아니라 «암시»여야 한다」는 한 줄이 결과를 가른다.** 모션 블러를 요구하면 대개 형체가 사라지는데, 주체의 선명함을 «먼저» 요구하면 블러가 «윤곽을 따라 흐르는 색»으로 변환된다.\n★같은 계정의 명명 효과 템플릿 계열이다 — 효과에 이름을 붙이고 대상·색만 슬롯으로 둔다. [[ludoviccreator-name-the-effect-then-leave-slots]]\n★그리고 우리 실측과 정확히 맞물린다 — Krea2는 «선명함을 훼손하는» 지시를 잘 안 따르는데([[kingofdairyque-recognizable-through-the-blur]]), 이 프롬프트는 «훼손하지 말라»가 기본값이라 오히려 재현이 잘 된다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A sprinting cheetah photographed in full stride, the animal itself relatively clear and sharply defined — the face, the shoulder muscles and the spotted coat all readable. The motion is not carried by smearing the subject but by faint ethereal wisps of colour trailing off its contours: thin ribbons of amber and burnt orange peel away from the back, the tail and the trailing paws and dissolve into the air within a short distance, like coloured breath rather than a blur. The ground and background stay quiet and low-contrast so those wisps read clearly. Warm dry savannah light, shallow depth of field, fine dust in the air. There is no text in the image.",
