      "title": "★형체가 «다른 차원으로 비틀려 들어가게» 한다 — 소용돌이가 공간을 휘게",
      "prompt": "🎨 VORTEX PORTAL DISTORTTION 🎨\n\nPrompt  :\n\n[SUBJECT] caught within a Vortex Portal Distortion, as forms twist and spiral into another dimension. Use swirling [COLOR1] and [COLOR2] colors to accentuate the sense of motion and the bending of space.\n\nCheck ALTS https://t.co/PP5dJfc7HS\n\n[ALT]\nA human face dissolving caught within a Vortex Portal Distortion, as forms twist and spiral into another dimension. Use swirling emerald and ruby colors to accentuate the sense of motion and the bending of space --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nA medieval knight riding a black horse caught within a Vortex Portal Distortion, as forms twist and spiral into another dimension. Use swirling obsidian black and burning amber colors to accentuate the sense of motion and the bending of space --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nA majestic white tiger caught within a Vortex Portal Distortion, as forms twist and spiral into another dimension. Use swirling luminous turquoise and fiery orange colors to accentuate the sense of motion and the bending of space --ar 3:2 --v 8.2\n\nA celestial goddess caught within a Vortex Portal Distortion, as forms twist and spiral into another dimension. Use swirling cosmic violet and liquid gold colors to accentuate the sense of motion and the bending of space --ar 3:2 --v 8.2",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「왜곡을 걸어라」가 아니라 «공간이 휜다»로 쓴 것이 이 효과의 핵심이다.**\n```\n[SUBJECT] caught within a Vortex Portal Distortion, ★as forms twist and spiral into\n★another dimension. Use swirling [COLOR1] and [COLOR2] colours to accentuate the sense\n★of motion and the bending of space.\n```\n★**「the bending of space」가 없으면 결과는 «피사체에 소용돌이 필터를 씌운 것»이 된다.** 공간이 함께 휘어야 «포털»이 성립하므로, 배경의 선까지 같은 나선을 따라야 한다.\n★그리고 색 둘이 «비틀림의 방향»을 따라 흘러 회전을 읽히게 한다 — 색을 채우는 게 아니라 «운동 경로»에 배치하는 것이다.\n★어제 이 건을 「글리치와 왜곡 축이 겹친다」고 뺐다가 되살렸다. 실제로는 [[ludoviccreator-name-the-effect-then-leave-slots]](시간 반복)과 «무엇이 변형되는가»가 다르다 — 그쪽은 «시간», 이쪽은 «공간»이다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A majestic white tiger caught within a vortex portal distortion: the animal's body twists and spirals as it is drawn toward a point behind and to the right of it, the stripes stretching into long curved bands that follow the rotation while the head at the front stays largely intact and forward-facing. The space itself bends with it — the ground line and the faint background elements curve into the same spiral so the distortion reads as the room turning, not as a filter on the animal. Swirling luminous turquoise and fiery orange sweep along the direction of the twist, brightest where the compression is strongest near the vanishing point. Deep neutral surroundings, strong sense of rotational motion. There is no text in the image.",
