      "title": "★대상과 사물을 «상호작용»으로 묶는다 — 흑백 선화, 흐르는 윤곽만으로",
      "prompt": "Prompt share: Timeless Line Elegance\n\n💬 Prompt:\nElegant [subject] interacting with a [object], sophisticated black and white line art, delicate flowing outlines, refined illustration, minimal composition, graceful forms, luxury editorial aesthetic, crisp ink strokes, clean white background\n\nTry it and share yours ✨",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「우아한 [대상]」이 아니라 「[대상]이 [사물]과 «상호작용»한다」로 쓴 것이 차이다.**\n```\n★Elegant [subject] ★interacting with a [object], sophisticated black and white line art,\ndelicate flowing outlines, refined illustration, minimal composition, graceful forms,\nluxury editorial aesthetic, crisp ink strokes, clean white background\n```\n★**슬롯 두 개를 «관계»로 연결하면 구도가 저절로 생긴다.** 대상만 주면 초상이 나오지만, 상호작용을 요구하면 둘이 «겹치고 교차하는» 자리가 필요해지고 그게 곧 구도다.\n★선화에서 «윤곽의 굵기 변화»를 명시한 것도 요령이다 — 균일한 선은 클립아트가 되고, 곡선에서 굵어지고 끝에서 사라지는 선은 «붓»이 된다.",
      "gen_prompt": "An elegant black and white line illustration on a clean white ground: a heron interacting with a tall stemmed glass, the bird's neck curving down so its bill just touches the rim while one wing lifts and sweeps behind the bowl of the glass, the two forms crossing so neither can be read without the other. Everything is described with delicate flowing outlines of varying weight — crisp confident ink strokes that thicken at the curves and thin to nothing at the tips — with no fill, no shading and no texture anywhere. Minimal composition with the pair set off-centre and a great deal of empty white around them. Refined luxury editorial feeling, graceful and restrained. There is no text in the image.",
      "ref_image": "results/azed-ai-elegant-subject-interacting-with-an-object-ref.jpg",
