      "prompt": "I asked GPT to visualize Tesla Optimus Robot but at a monumental museum-scale\n\nPrompt: INPUT ::= [TOPIC]\n\nGenerate a monumental museum-scale technical dossier wall explaining TOPIC.\n\nFirst:\n- classify TOPIC\n- identify HERO_VIEW\n- decompose TOPIC into SUBSYSTEMS\n- infer COMPONENTS and INTERNAL_ARCHITECTURE\n- determine meaningful MOTION_SYSTEM and FLOW_SYSTEM\n- select DETAIL_VIEWS appropriate to each subsystem\n\nComposition:\n- HERO_VIEW dominates the central panel\n- surrounding vertical panels each explain one major subsystem\n- every subsystem includes a mixture of:\n  exploded assembly\n  cutaway\n  component array\n  sectional view\n  motion study\n  operating diagram\n  flow schematic\n  labeled close-up\n\nVisual language:\narchival engineering manual,\nsepia drafting paper,\nblack ink,\nfine dimension lines,\nnumbered sections,\ntechnical microcopy,\ndiagram arrows,\ngrid coordinates,\ncallout boxes,\nsmall tables.\n\nEnvironment:\nthe entire document is physically mounted as a gigantic illuminated wall inside a dark exhibition hall;\nsmall human visitors stand below for scale.\n\nRULE:\nall panels, terminology, diagrams, numbers, and decomposition must be inferred from TOPIC.\nNo fixed subsystem names or subject-specific components.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「하나의 도해」가 아니라 «벽 하나 분량의 도시에»를 요구하고, 분해 순서를 지정했다.**\n```\nFirst:\n★ - TOPIC을 «분류»한다\n★ - HERO_VIEW를 «식별»한다\n★ - TOPIC을 SUBSYSTEMS로 «분해»한다\n  - COMPONENTS와 INTERNAL_ARCHITECTURE를 «추론»한다\n  - 의미 있는 MOTION_SYSTEM과 FLOW_SYSTEM을 «결정»한다\n  - 각 서브시스템에 «적합한» DETAIL_VIEWS를 «선택»한다\nComposition:\n★ - HERO_VIEW가 중앙 패널을 지배한다\n★ - 주변의 세로 패널들이 «각각 하나의 주요 서브시스템»을 설명한다\n★ - 모든 서브시스템은 다음을 «섞어» 포함한다:\n     분해 조립도 · 커터웨이 · 부품 배열 · 단면도 · 운동 연구 · 작동 다이어그램\n```\n★**「섞어서 포함하라」가 핵심이다.** 같은 종류의 도해를 반복하면 벽이 지루해지고, 분해도·커터웨이·운동 연구가 섞이면 «무엇을 설명하려는지»에 따라 도해 종류가 달라진다 — 그게 기술 문서의 리듬이다.\n★그리고 «패널 하나 = 서브시스템 하나»라는 대응이 정보 위계를 저절로 만든다.\n\n⚠️원문은 2x2 그리드로 네 주제를 한 번에 뽑는 형식이다 — 칸 사이에 고정될 대상이 없어 (런북 §④) 문법 재현이 목적인 이 항목은 대표 한 칸을 단일 이미지로 뽑았다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A monumental museum-scale technical dossier wall explaining a humanoid service robot, shot straight on as a single wide panel arrangement. The centre is dominated by one large hero view: the full robot standing, orthographic, lit evenly. Around it, six narrower vertical panels each explain one subsystem, and each panel mixes several kinds of drawing rather than repeating one — an exploded assembly of the shoulder actuator, a cutaway through the torso showing the battery stack, a component array of the hand linkages laid out flat, a sectional view of the knee, a motion study showing one leg in five phases of a step, and an operating diagram tracing power and signal flow with thin arrows. Every panel is aligned to a strict shared grid with consistent margins, thin rules between them, and small leader lines running from each drawing to a short label block. Neutral warm-white wall, fine technical linework in charcoal with one amber accent reserved for the flow arrows.",
