      "gen_prompt": "A luxury wildlife poster on a pale bone ground. Three tall narrow window panels stand side by side across the upper two thirds of the sheet, and a single peafowl stands upright on a weathered wooden post behind them, composed so that the bird crosses all three: the head and upper neck fall across the join of the left and middle panels, the torso and legs align through the centre panel, and the long folded tail descends through the right one — so the three windows read as one cadence from head to body to tail rather than three separate crops. The bird is poised and alert, facing slightly left, anatomically correct and naturally balanced, framed like a rare field encounter rather than a decorative mascot. Behind and below the panels a lush forested hillside fades into soft mist, subdued and atmospheric. The top of the sheet stays clean and pale. There is no text in the image.",
