      "prompt": "The route works because it behaves like the main character, not just a line on a map.\n✨ a bright winding route line with sweeping curves, glowing nodes, and directional bends\nThis gives the eye a rhythm to follow. You don’t just read the stops; you feel the journey moving through the poster from one destination to the next.\n🧭 scenic vignettes embedded into the map as vivid memory bursts\nThis keeps the map from becoming a flat itinerary. Each stop feels activated by the route, so the poster reads like a collected travel story instead of a list of places.\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate a premium vertical destination campaign poster for a fictional travel brand called KHMERA TRAILS, designed in a strong Orbit-style composition for a Cambodia journey map. The image must feel like a luxury explorer’s route board seen from above, but with much stronger motion, directional pull, and narrative momentum. The travel route itself must become the main visual engine of the poster, guiding the eye like a living line of memory, movement, and discovery across Cambodia.\n\nMain composition:\nTop-down immersive travel-board layout. On the left side, a premium hard-shell suitcase in deep indigo or dark forest blue enters the frame, held naturally by a realistic adult hand with correct finger anatomy and elegant tension. From the lower center, one traveler’s leg and shoe step directly into the composition, making the viewer feel physically inside the trip. Across the center of the board, a bright winding route line travels dynamically through Cambodia with 8 to 10 numbered stops, curving, sweeping, tightening, and opening rhythmically to create a strong sense of forward movement. On the right edge, a vertical strip of pinned travel snapshots reinforces the route like collected memories.\n\nOrbit direction:\nMake the route dramatically more alive and cinematic. The path should not feel flat or static; it should pulse visually through sweeping curves, glowing nodes, directional bends, and scenic expansions, as if every stop is igniting the next. The journey line should pull the eye downward and upward in a controlled rhythm, with each destination acting like a visual orbit point. Small scenic vignettes along the route must feel embedded into the map as vivid memory bursts: Angkor temple silhouettes, Phnom Penh riverside lights, Kampot countryside, Kep coast, Tonle Sap water villages, Battambang heritage streets, jungle roads, and coastal horizons. Each stop should feel like the route is actively passing through and awakening it.\n\nDestinations:\nUse a premium Cambodia route such as:\n1 Phnom Penh\n2 Kampong Cham\n3 Siem Reap\n4 Angkor\n5 Battambang\n6 Tonle Sap\n7 Kampot\n8 Kep\n9 Sihanoukville\n10 Koh Rong\nEach point should have a distinct marker, short elegant label, and subtle distance or transfer note. Route segments may vary slightly in glow or icon language to suggest road, river, or scenic transfer.\n\nRight-side photo strip:\nPlace 5 to 7 vertically stacked travel snapshots, each like a collected field memory, showing Cambodia-specific scenes: temple corridors, riverside city glow, monks or market alleys from distance, floating village water life, tropical coast, countryside sunrise, old colonial facades, jungle road atmosphere. These photos should feel like premium printed keepsakes, lightly taped or pinned, with subtle handwritten-style English labels.\n\nTop branding and typography:\nAt the top center, place an original expressive handwritten-style headline:\n“Cambodia in Motion”\nBeneath it, a smaller elegant word:\n“Journey”\nAdd one subtle stamp or patch at the top-left such as:\n“Gathered Along the Kingdom”\nAdd a refined compass or exploration emblem at the upper-right.\nTypography should feel adventurous, crafted, premium, and editorial.\n\nSupporting system:\nInclude one small legend panel on the left with elegant icons for route types, one torn-paper itinerary note listing the journey stops, and two or three subtle travel stamps or collectible badges near the corners. Add one short footer quote:\n“Every stop becomes a story.”\nAll supporting graphics must feel curated, tactile, and premium.\n\nLighting and atmosphere:\nWarm moody editorial lighting over a dark textured board surface, with localized glows around route points and destination scenes. The route line should feel like it is lighting the journey from within. Background remains rich charcoal-brown with subtle vintage grain, scratches, paper wear, and travel-board depth. Strong contrast, but still clean and premium.\n\nMaterial rendering:\nThe background should feel like aged premium map-board paper or dark archival travel leather. The suitcase must be ultra-real with precise shell ridges, polished handle hardware, realistic wear, and refined reflections. The visible hand and leg must be fully realistic, with correct anatomy, proper fabric folds, natural skin texture, and grounded perspective. Snapshot photos, torn itinerary paper, and badges should have believable paper grain, print texture, edge lift, and layered shadow.\n\nColor system:\nDeep charcoal brown, antique gold, warm ivory typography, moss-green and golden route accents, rust-red stop markers, and rich tropical greens and blues inside the scene inserts. Controlled saturation, premium warmth, and strong hierarchy.\n\nStyle:\nCannes-level tourism campaign poster, luxury scrapbook-travel editorial, immersive route storytelling, highly designed destination branding, kinetic yet elegant, globally marketable, collectible, and emotionally memorable.\n\nNegative prompt:\ncopied original text, copied original route names from reference, static flat route, weak motion, cluttered infographic mess, unreadable path, too many decorations, fake scrapbook stickers, warped suitcase, broken hand anatomy, extra fingers, missing fingers, distorted leg perspective, low-detail landmarks, neon map lines, cartoon icons, cheap brochure style, muddy background, messy labels, watermark",
      "prompt_ko": "★**작성자 관찰 — *「경로가 통하는 이유는 그것이 «지도 위의 선»이 아니라 «주인공처럼 행동»하기 때문이다」*.**\n\n★**선을 «주인공»으로 만드는 조건이 구체적이다** — 크게 휘고, 의도적으로 꺾이고, 굵기가 변하고, 오브젝트의 «앞뒤를 통과»하고, 꺾이는 자리마다 노드가 빛난다.\n★그래프 요소를 배경에 «깔면» 정보가 되고, 화면을 «가로지르며 물체와 층을 나누면» 캐릭터가 된다.\n★그리고 나머지(가방·손·다리·종이 조각)는 전부 «극사실»로 못박아 선의 그래픽함과 대비시켰다.",
