      "prompt": "The key detail is not the world map.\nIt’s making the wheels feel physically connected to it.\n🧊 glowing circular wheel hubs touching the illuminated world-map floor\nThis turns the suitcase from a product placed on top of a graphic into the source of the whole scene. You see the wheels behave like active contact points, not decorative lights.\n✨ thin luminous travel lines flowing directly into and out of the wheel contact points\nThis gives the motion a clear origin. The route arcs don’t just float around the image; they visually funnel into the suitcase, so the product becomes the center of global movement.\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate a premium vertical flagship travel campaign poster for a fictional luxury luggage maison called AERAVAL, merging Orbit-style directional motion with Transit-style editorial restraint. The image must feel ultra-clean, cinematic, global, and aspirational, with one luxury suitcase as the absolute visual hero.\n\nCore composition:\nA single premium black aluminum carry-on suitcase stands slightly below center on a dark mirror-like reflective surface, shown in a clean front-facing three-quarter angle. Beneath it, a luminous golden world map is embedded into the floor like refined illuminated inlay, with elegant global route arcs converging toward the suitcase base and wheels. The visual flow must make the product feel like the center of international movement.\n\nHero energy connection:\nThe most important visual effect is that the suitcase wheels themselves emit a warm golden light and appear physically connected to the illuminated route-map below. Each wheel should act like an active energy node touching the floor, with glowing circular hubs, soft radiant halos, and thin luminous travel lines flowing directly into and out of the wheel contact points. The wheel glow and the map glow must feel seamlessly fused, as if the suitcase is powering, activating, or navigating the world network beneath it. This connection must be sleek, futuristic, elegant, and highly premium, not sci-fi messy.\n\nOrbit direction:\nStrengthen the sense of global motion through the route-map structure. The glowing travel lines should sweep across the continents in elegant arcs and visually funnel toward the suitcase wheels, as if worldwide trajectories are being drawn into the product. The line flow, skyline perspective, and reflections should all guide the eye inward and upward, creating a luxurious feeling of movement, reach, and expansion.\n\nTransit restraint:\nKeep the composition highly disciplined and premium. Reduce all secondary elements to the minimum necessary. The skyline should remain soft, elegant, and low-noise. Preserve large breathing room around the suitcase and headline. The final image should read instantly as: brand, hero suitcase, illuminated world reach, glowing wheel-network connection.\n\nProduct design:\nThe suitcase must look ultra-premium and precisely engineered: black anodized aluminum shell, vertical ribbed structure, brushed metal finish, clean corner reinforcements, telescopic handle, refined wheel housings, discreet logo plaque, and luxurious manufacturing detail. It should feel durable, elegant, and expensive, with subtle warm edge highlights and believable construction logic.\n\nLighting:\nCinematic blue-hour lighting with a deep navy sky fading to warm amber near the horizon. The primary glow comes from the embedded golden map and the illuminated suitcase wheels, creating a soft underlight around the lower shell. Add gentle cool ambient fill from the sky and restrained warm reflections from the skyline. The suitcase must remain beautifully separated from the background with sculptural highlight control.\n\nMaterial rendering:\nUltra-real brushed black aluminum, polished hardware accents, realistic rubber wheels with glowing internal hubs, crisp telescopic handle reflections, premium badge detailing, and a polished dark floor with softened reflections of the suitcase, wheel glow, map lines, and skyline. The world map must feel physically integrated into the surface, like illuminated glass or precision-lit inlay, not a flat graphic overlay.\n\nTypography and branding:\nUse only original English typography. At the top center, place a refined luxury serif headline: “THE WORLD, IN MOTION”. Beneath it, add one small line: “AERAVAL Global Travel Collection”. At the bottom center, place one short restrained line: “Engineered to move farther.” Include a very subtle luxury brand mark. Typography should be warm champagne gold, widely spaced, elegant, and clearly secondary to the suitcase.\n\nColor system:\nDeep midnight blue, black metal, warm champagne gold, amber skyline glow, soft silver reflections, and restrained dark neutrals. The palette must feel international, luxurious, and highly controlled, with the glowing wheel-map connection as the central emotional accent.\n\nStyle:\nCannes-level luxury travel campaign, flagship product advertising, futuristic-global editorial design fused with ultra-real commercial rendering, aspirational, polished, clean, and globally marketable.\n\nNegative prompt:\ndetached wheels, non-glowing wheels, wheels not connected to floor light, flat world map graphic, random neon effects, cheap sci-fi look, cluttered airport scene, fake CGI metal, warped suitcase geometry, broken wheels, floating suitcase, muddy reflections, oversaturated gold, blurry skyline, excessive jet presence, cheap brochure style, unreadable typography, watermark",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**작성자 관찰 — *「가장 중요한 시각 효과는 «바퀴 자체가 따뜻한 금빛을 내며 아래의 발광 경로지도와 물리적으로 연결돼 보이는 것»이다」*.**\n\n★**제품과 배경을 «접촉점»으로 잇는 것이 이 광고의 발명이다.** 제품 아래에 그래픽을 깔면 그건 배경인데, «바퀴가 닿는 정확한 지점»에서 빛의 선이 들어오고 나가면 제품이 그 시스템을 «작동시키는» 것으로 읽힌다.\n```\n★각 바퀴는 바닥에 닿는 «능동 에너지 노드»처럼 — 발광 원형 허브 · 부드러운 후광 ·\n★ 접촉점으로 «직접 흘러 들어오고 나가는» 가는 발광 이동선\n★바퀴의 빛과 지도의 빛이 «이음매 없이 융합»되어, 가방이 아래 세계 네트워크를\n 「구동·활성화·항행」하는 것처럼 보이게 한다\n★단, «세련되고 우아하고 프리미엄하게» — 「SF처럼 지저분하지 않게」\n```\n★마지막 조건이 중요하다 — 발광 요소는 쉽게 «싸구려 SF»가 되므로 «절제»를 명시적으로 요구한다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium vertical luggage advertisement on a dark ground. A hard-shell suitcase stands centred — black anodised aluminium with vertical ribbed structure, brushed metal finish, clean corner reinforcements, a telescopic handle and refined wheel housings, with a small unbranded plaque. Beneath it, an illuminated route map glows across the floor in thin warm-gold lines. The key effect is the join: each wheel emits a warm golden light and reads as an active energy node touching the floor, with a glowing circular hub, a soft radiant halo, and thin luminous travel lines flowing directly into and out of the exact point where the wheel meets the surface, so the wheel glow and the map glow are one continuous system and the suitcase appears to be powering the network beneath it. Sleek and elegant rather than science-fiction busy, with subtle warm edge highlights on the shell. There is no text in the image.",
