      "title": "★요소들이 «칠해진 표면에서 배어나오게» 한다 — 파스텔 구아슈 종이 회화",
      "prompt": "GPT image 2\n\nPrompt:\n\nCreate a beautiful vertical 4:5 pastel-colored paper painting featuring [COUNTRY] as an entire miniature world painted onto textured handmade paper. Use delicate pastel gouache, soft watercolor and colored-pencil textures, with visible paper fibers, gentle brush strokes, imperfect painted edges and subtle layered pigments.\n\nLet the country’s most recognizable landmarks, landscapes, traditional architecture, local flowers, food, clothing, wildlife and cultural elements naturally emerge from the painted surface, blending together like one continuous handmade illustration. Include the [COUNTRY] flag subtly integrated into the artwork and elegantly write “[COUNTRY]” at the bottom in beautiful hand-painted lettering.\n\nUse a sophisticated palette of powder blue, blush pink, butter yellow, mint green, lavender, peach and cream, with soft shadows and delicate highlights. Minimal, whimsical, premium editorial art style, dreamy atmosphere, tactile handmade paper, artistic imperfections, elegant composition, highly detailed miniature elements, no harsh outlines, no photorealism, no 3D rendering, no clutter.\n\nFeels like a luxury travel postcard painted by hand with pastel colors.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「배어나온다(emerge)」와 「섞인다(blend)」가 이 회차의 두 동사다.**\n```\n· 질감 있는 «수제지»에 그린 파스텔 종이 회화 — 섬세한 파스텔 구아슈 · 부드러운 수채 ·\n  색연필 질감 · 보이는 종이 섬유 · «불완전한 칠 경계» · 은은하게 겹친 안료\n★· 랜드마크·풍경·전통 건축·꽃·음식·의복·야생동물·문화 요소가\n★ «칠해진 표면에서 자연스럽게 배어나와» 서로 «섞이게» 한다\n```\n★**이 개념의 성패는 «윤곽선의 부재»에 달려 있다.** 요소마다 선을 그으면 콜라주가 되고, 색과 안료 농도로만 넘어가면 «한 장의 그림»이 된다.\n★그래서 재현에서 전환 지점을 «이름으로» 적었다 — 산등성이가 지붕선으로, 지붕선의 곡선이 꽃대로. 「자연스럽게 섞이게」라고만 쓰면 안 섞인다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical pastel paper painting of a country rendered as an entire miniature world on textured handmade paper. The work is made in delicate pastel gouache with soft watercolour washes and coloured-pencil hatching, with visible paper fibres, gentle brush strokes, imperfect painted edges and subtly layered pigment. Its recognisable elements do not sit as separate illustrations but seem to emerge from the painted surface itself and blend into one another: a mountain range dissolves into a temple roofline, the roofline's curve becomes the stem of a large local flower, the flower's petals shade into a length of patterned traditional cloth, and a bird and a bowl of food resolve out of the wash at the lower edge. Nothing has a hard outline; transitions happen through colour and pigment density. Soft blush, sage, butter and dusty blue palette, large breathing space. There is no text in the image.",
      "ref_image": "results/naiknelofar788-a-country-emerging-from-painted-paper-ref.jpg",
