      "gen_prompt": "A modern botanical packaging poster on a clean warm off-white ground. A large chamomile plant dominates the composition, occupying most of the frame and enlarged well past its natural scale so that its upper stems and two flowers are cropped by the top edge and one leaf runs off the left — it fills the space rather than floating neatly in the centre. The plant is drawn in bold hand-drawn black contour lines with simple internal detail and the slightly imperfect look of a printed illustration. Most of it stays pure line art; only three flower centres and two leaves are filled with flat pastel colour. Behind the plant sit three simple flat shapes — a large circle, a soft oval and one organic blob — in muted sage and dusty apricot, opaque with no gradient and no watercolour bleed. A small package of tea stands at the lower right, its label carrying the same line style. One short title sits at the top reading CHAMOMILE. That is the only text in the image.",
