      "prompt": "Created with mid journey \n\nPROMPT ⤵️ \n\nStylized mid-century modern illustration of [HUMAN] lounging [POSE] on [SOFA], wearing [CLOTHING], with [ANIMAL] resting nearby. Set the scene in [SCENERY], composed with clean architectural geometry, one strong diagonal beam of sunlight, long hard-edged shadows, and a few carefully placed period objects. Render with flat matte color fields, simplified elongated anatomy, minimal facial detail, crisp geometric silhouettes, subtle printed-paper texture, and elegant 1950s–60s editorial illustration styling. Use a controlled palette of [COLORS], keeping the composition calm, sophisticated, slightly detached, and visually spacious.Vertical 4:5 AR.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**시대 양식을 «분위기»가 아니라 «형태 어휘»로 지정하면 재현이 안정된다.**\n```\nStylized mid-century modern …\n```\n★**미드센추리의 정체는 색이 아니라 «가는 벌어진 다리 · 유기적 곡면 · 얇은 창살 · 평평한 무영 색면 · 비대칭 여백»이다.** 팔레트만 맞추면 «복고 색의 현대 일러스트»가 나온다.\n★그리고 인쇄 그레인과 «색면과 어긋나는 손그림 윤곽»이 시대의 인쇄 공정을 흉내 낸다 — 이 계정과 goodmanprotocol이 같은 장치를 쓴다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A stylised mid-century modern interior scene rendered as a flat illustration. A low walnut sideboard on thin splayed legs runs across the lower third, an egg-shaped lounge chair sits at an angle beside it, and a slim floor lamp arcs overhead with a conical shade. A large window of thin mullions fills the back wall, and outside it two simplified palm forms sit against a flat sky. Everything is built from flat unshaded colour with hard edges, with texture supplied only by a fine printed grain and a few hand-drawn contour lines that do not always meet the colour exactly. Restrained period palette of mustard, sage, burnt orange and warm cream against a bone ground, with one black accent in the lamp. Composition is asymmetric and calm, with generous empty wall. There is no text in the image.",
