      "title": "★«고딕 위미컬» 캐릭터의 비례를 목록으로 고정한다 — 큰 눈·가는 사지·작은 입",
      "prompt": "GPT IMAGE 2 ON CHATGPT \n\nPROMPT:\n\nGothic whimsical hand-drawn illustration of [HUMAN] wearing [CLOTHING], accompanied by [ANIMAL], set in [SCENERY], using a [COLORS] palette. Both characters have oversized staring eyes, elongated spindly proportions, tiny mouths, bony awkward posture, and a slightly melancholic but charming expression. Loose scratchy black ink linework, rough sketch texture, scribbled shading, crooked perspective, barren trees or warped buildings, eerie cute atmosphere, surreal indie storybook mood, flat saturated colors with a glowing gradient sky, expressive naive drawing style, no realism, aspect ratio 4:5.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**캐릭터 스타일을 «비례와 선질»의 목록으로 고정한 슬롯 템플릿이다.**\n```\nGothic whimsical hand-drawn illustration of [HUMAN] wearing [CLOTHING],\naccompanied by [ANIMAL], set in [SCENERY], using a [COLORS] palette.\n★Both characters have: oversized staring eyes · elongated spindly proportions ·\n★ tiny mouths · bony awkward posture · slightly melancholic but charming expression\n★Loose scratchy black ink linework · rough sketch texture · scribbled shading ·\n★ crooked perspective · barren trees\n```\n★**「둘 다 같은 규칙을 따른다」가 중요하다.** 인물과 동물이 «같은 해부»를 공유해야 한 세계의 캐릭터로 읽힌다 — 하나만 스타일라이즈하면 합성이 된다.\n★그리고 «비뚤어진 원근»까지 규칙에 넣어, 배경도 같은 손에서 나온 것처럼 만든다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A gothic whimsical hand-drawn illustration of a tall thin child in a long black coat, accompanied by a scruffy crow, standing in a bare winter garden. Both figures share the same anatomy rules: oversized staring eyes, elongated spindly proportions, tiny mouths, bony awkward posture and a slightly melancholic but charming expression. The drawing is made of loose scratchy black ink linework with rough sketch texture and scribbled hatching for shading, and the perspective is deliberately crooked — the fence leans, the ground tilts. Barren trees with thin twisting branches stand behind them, and a low crooked gate sits at the edge. Limited palette of ink black, bone paper and one muted plum accent in the scarf. Visible paper texture, uneven line weight. There is no text in the image.",
