      "prompt": "A cinematic dynamic punk editorial advertisement in glossy 3d animation style, starring on a pastel pallet kawaii background, first revealed the frog @ img1 entering to the canvas while making moon walk, second the pigeon flying down to the canvas while twisting down with amazing energy and fast motion @ img2, third the fox @ img3 entrance is amazing while playing penguin dance in funky cool way, 4th the tiger @ img4 dancing in a cool way, all of them dancing later as a dancing group in a harmony in a cool way, the music differs in each reveal, beat based video, hook marketing ad, cool and funny dance, fast based, match cut transitions, clean and neat graphics, life like motion, 120fps, cinematic camera professional motion, insane aesthetics",
      "prompt_ko": "★**두 개의 상반된 마감을 한 화면에 놓는 것이 이 광고의 구조다.**\n```\nA cinematic dynamic ★punk editorial advertisement in ★glossy 3d …\n```\n★**«매끈한 3D 렌더»와 «거친 편집 언어»는 보통 섞이지 않는다.** 그런데 제품만 완벽하게 두고 «주변을 찢고 붙이면» 대비가 광고의 에너지가 된다.\n★재현에서 그 긴장을 명시했다 — 제품은 흠 없이 비싸고, 나머지는 거칠게 잘려 있다. 이 역할 분담이 없으면 둘 다 지저분해진다.",
