      "title": "★★선수의 몸을 «그 종목의 장비»로 조립한다 — 재료가 곧 종목의 정의",
      "prompt": "an experimental prompt for visualizing athletes. Their body assembled from their equipment. \n\nPrompt: \n2x2 grid, 16:9, AI picks sujbects: <instructions> Input = Sport Category Act as a world-class visual artist and sports historian. For the given sport category, select 4 disciplines. For each, infer its signature equipment and the material that defines it. Function Draw ($ Discipline, $ Equipment) Anchor: [$Discipline] :: [$Equipment material]::4 Morphology: A dynamic figure frozen mid-motion performing [$Discipline], the entire body assembled from [$Equipment] — limbs and torso formed from balls, blades, rackets, or fibers, explosive kinetic structural logic, hyper-detailed action diorama::3 Material Physics: Physical behavior of [$Equipment] shaping the athlete — bounce, tension, edge, and spin of the material replacing muscle, innate material logic, high-fidelity surface detail::3 Illumination: Dramatic stadium lighting, motion-implying volumetric streaks, ambient occlusion matching the material::2 Render Stack: High-speed macro, f/2.8, 8k, scale-model aesthetic, Unreal Engine 5 render::1 Negative: [spectators, referees, blurry, low resolution, bad anatomy, flat 2D, text, watermark]:: -1 Output: 2x2 grid, one panel per discipline via Draw. Discipline name underneath. </instructions>",
      "prompt_ko": "★★**「장비를 든 선수」가 아니라 «장비로 만들어진 선수»다.**\n```\nInput = Sport Category\n  Act as a world-class visual artist and sports historian.\n★  주어진 종목 범주에서 «4개 종목»을 고르고, 각각의 «시그니처 장비»와\n★  «그 종목을 정의하는 재료»를 «추론»한다.\nFunction Draw($Discipline, $Equipment)\n  Anchor: [$Discipline] :: [$Equipment material] ::4\n★ Morphology: 동적인 인물이 [$Discipline]을 수행하는 «순간에 얼어붙어» 있고,\n★             그 «몸이 장비로 조립»되어 있다\n```\n★**「종목을 정의하는 재료」를 추론시킨 것이 이 프롬프트의 축이다.** 조정은 카본과 알루미늄, 유도는 면 직물, 펜싱은 강선 — 재료가 정해지면 몸의 어느 부위가 무엇이 될지가 따라온다.\n★그리고 「관절은 «실제 피팅»이어야 한다」가 조립의 설득력을 만든다 — 이음매를 지어내면 콜라주가 되고, 실제 부품의 결합부를 쓰면 «만들어진 몸»이 된다.\n\n⚠️원문은 2x2 그리드로 네 주제를 한 번에 뽑는 형식이다 — 칸 사이에 고정될 대상이 없어 (런북 §④) 문법 재현이 목적인 이 항목은 대표 한 칸을 단일 이미지로 뽑았다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A dynamic figure frozen mid-motion in a rower's drive, but the body is not flesh — it is assembled entirely from the equipment of the sport. The spine and long muscles of the back are laminated carbon oar shafts running the full length, the ribcage is built from curved riggers and their bolts, the shoulders are the moulded seat and slide, the arms resolve into two oar looms with the blades forming the hands, and the legs are the stretcher and shoe plates with their straps. The materials keep their real character throughout — carbon weave, anodised aluminium, worn grip tape, salt-stained webbing — and the joints are real fittings rather than invented seams. The pose is athletically correct with the weight and tension of the stroke visible in the assembly. Deep neutral ground, hard directional light raking the materials, fine water spray in the air. There is no text in the image.",
