      "title": "★두 종목 × 두 소재기술을 «한 장비»로 융합 — 포즈·배경·실루엣은 그대로 두고 장비만 바꾼다",
      "prompt": "I asked GPT to visualize 4 goats in 4 different sports. Working on even more sports posters and will share soon\n\n2x2 grid, 16:9, do this for 4 goats of different sports: Input A is a photograph of a piece of sports equipment or an athlete using it. You are an elite sports engineer and industrial designer.  Phase 1: Dual-Synthesis Selection Randomly select TWO Performance Disciplines and TWO Material Technologies. Fuse them into a single piece of performance equipment.  Performance Disciplines: [Tennis, Snowboarding, Cycling, Basketball, Climbing, Surfing, Running, Archery, Fencing, Skateboarding, Swimming, Golf]  Material Technologies: [Carbon Fiber Weave, Graphene Infusion, Aerogel Padding, Kevlar Composite, Shape Memory Alloy, Bio-Based Polymer, 3D Lattice Midsole, Cork Vibration Dampening, Nylon Ballistic, Recycled Ocean Plastic, Titanium Skeleton, Liquid Crystal Elastomer]  Phase 2: Visual Rendering (The Grid) Generate a 2:1 Horizontal Asset Sheet. LEFT HALF: Re-engineer the equipment using the discipline-material synthesis. Preserve the exact athlete pose, background, equipment silhouette, and camera perspective of Input A. RIGHT HALF: A clean, dark-grey technical panel with white text: discipline names, material names, stress-point diagram, aerodynamics note, grip texture detail, and material stack callout.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**두 개의 목록에서 각각 둘씩 뽑아 «하나»로 합치라는 지시다.**\n```\nPerformance Disciplines  테니스·스노보드·사이클·농구·클라이밍·서핑·러닝·양궁·펜싱·스케이트·수영·골프\nMaterial Technologies    카본위브·그래핀·에어로젤·케블라·형상기억합금·바이오폴리머·\n                         3D 격자 미드솔·코르크 방진·발리스틱 나일론·재생 해양플라스틱·티타늄골격·액정엘라스토머\n★Fuse them into a single piece of performance equipment\n```\n★**진짜 규칙은 「무엇을 바꾸지 않는가」에 있다** — *\"Preserve the exact athlete pose, background, equipment silhouette, and camera perspective of Input A.\"* 포즈·배경·실루엣·시점을 고정하고 **장비의 «재질과 구조»만** 재설계한다. 고정점이 있어야 융합이 «변형»으로 읽히고, 없으면 그냥 다른 사진이 된다.\n\n★**오른쪽 절반은 기술 패널이다** — 다크그레이 바탕에 흰 글자로 종목명·소재명·응력점 도해·공기역학 노트·그립 텍스처 상세·소재 적층 콜아웃. 왼쪽의 «결과»에 오른쪽이 «근거»를 붙이는 구조다.\n\n⚠️**로고가 붙는 품목이다.** 스포츠 장비는 브랜드명 없이도 조형이 소환되므로([[ouzhen599-shoes-hit-before-the-face]]), 재현에서는 **측면 그래픽·미드솔·스우시 계열 조형을 통째로 피하고** 다른 관절의 형태(가로 랩 밴드·펀칭·오버레이 패널)를 지정했다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A wide two-panel asset sheet. The left half is a photorealistic close view of a climbing shoe mid-step against a pale grey studio wall, the foot pressing onto a small rock hold, the pose and camera angle those of an ordinary sports photograph. The shoe itself has been re-engineered: its upper is a woven carbon-fibre lattice in charcoal with a faint iridescent sheen, wrapped by one wide horizontal band across the midfoot punched with six round ventilation holes, and its sole is a visible three-dimensional lattice midsole in pale titanium grey. There are no stripes, chevrons, swooshes or side graphics anywhere, no lettering and no emblem. The right half is a flat dark charcoal technical panel carrying thin white line diagrams and small white text blocks: a stress-point map of the sole, a cutaway of the material stack in layers, a magnified square of the grip texture, and a short airflow note with arrows. Crisp studio light on the left, flat matte panel on the right, strict alignment between the two halves.",
