      "title": "★배경을 «극적으로» 만들지 말고 «안쪽을 가리키게» 만든다 — 암벽이 좁은 수직 통로를 이룬다",
      "prompt": "The watch feels powerful because the environment points inward instead of just looking dramatic.\n🧊 jagged volcanic rock walls forming a narrow vertical cradle around the watch\nThis gives the product a protected, monumental center. You see the watch held inside the darkness, not simply placed in front of a textured backdrop.\n✨ gold mineral seams and reflected highlights converging toward the dial and bezel\nThis creates the magnetic pull. The rock details quietly lead the eye into the watch face, while the restrained gold dust echoes the dial accents without turning into fantasy lighting.\n\nGPT- image 2 prompt👇\nCreate a premium vertical luxury watch campaign image for a fictional haute horlogerie maison called NOCTIS AUREL, combining Orbit-style energy convergence with Transit-style editorial restraint. Feature one flagship black chronograph wristwatch as the absolute visual hero, centered within a dark mineral cavity of fractured volcanic rock. No text, no logo, no captions, no extra props.\n\nCore composition:\nA single black chronograph watch stands perfectly centered and upright inside a naturally formed cradle of jagged obsidian-like volcanic rock. The product is front-facing with a subtle three-quarter angle, enough to reveal bezel depth, crown guards, pushers, and bracelet articulation while keeping the dial fully legible. The surrounding rock walls form a narrow vertical cavern that visually funnels inward toward the watch, making it feel rare, protected, and monumental.\n\nOrbit direction:\nThe surrounding environment must create a strong inward pull toward the watch. Rock fractures, mineral seams, scattered metallic dust, subtle reflected highlights, and faint atmospheric haze should all visually converge toward the dial and bezel. The gold mineral particles should appear lightly concentrated along crack lines and edges, as if the watch is the energetic core drawing surrounding matter toward itself. The result should feel magnetic, controlled, and luxurious rather than chaotic.\n\nTransit restraint:\nKeep the scene extremely minimal and highly disciplined. No unnecessary environmental storytelling, no fantasy cave excess, no dramatic clutter. Preserve large shadow masses and clean negative darkness around the product. Use only the essential elements: central watch, dark volcanic rock cavity, restrained gold mineral dust, and subtle atmosphere. The image should read instantly as a flagship luxury product visual.\n\nWatch design:\nA museum-grade modern chronograph in black DLC-coated metal or brushed black ceramic, with a deep black dial, warm rose-gold or bronze-accented hands and markers, three recessed subdials, a tachymeter bezel, sculpted pushers, and a premium integrated bracelet. The case finishing must feel ultra-precise, masculine, and collectible. The dial should be richly detailed and crisp, with polished hand stacks, fine chapter markings, and subtle warm reflections echoing the mineral gold tones.\n\nLighting:\nUse cinematic luxury lighting from above and slightly front-left, creating a focused cool highlight on the crystal, bezel, and upper bracelet links. Add restrained warm bounce from the gold mineral dust inside the rock cavity. The watch must remain the brightest and most refined object in the frame. Rocks should stay mostly dark but readable, with selective edge highlights and elegant shadow separation. No blown reflections, no muddy blacks, no flat lighting.\n\nMaterial rendering:\nUltra-real black ceramic or DLC-coated metal with brushed and polished transitions, sapphire crystal with subtle curvature and controlled glare, deep dial lacquer or fine-grain depth, crisp subdial recesses, and premium metallic detailing. Rocks must show fractured volcanic texture, matte carbon-black surfaces, mineral grain, and restrained embedded warm metallic shimmer. Dust should feel geological and precious, never glittery.\n\nColor system:\nDeep black, charcoal, obsidian blue-black, soft steel grey, restrained bronze-gold highlights, and faint cool midnight atmospheric undertones. The palette must feel dark, elemental, luxurious, and tightly controlled.\n\nStyle:\nCannes-level luxury watch campaign, ultra-premium product still life, dark geological minimalism, editorial restraint, energy-converging composition, highly cinematic, tactile, globally marketable, elegant, and intense.\n\nNegative prompt:\ntext, logo, watermark, captions, extra props, hands, wrists, copied branding, distorted watch case, warped bracelet, unreadable dial, plastic-looking metal, fake CGI reflections, oversaturated gold dust, fantasy cave, neon lighting, muddy blacks, low-detail rocks, cluttered composition, cheap ecommerce style",
      "prompt_ko": "> *\"The watch feels powerful because the environment **points inward** instead of just looking dramatic.\"*\n```\n★jagged volcanic rock walls forming a narrow vertical corridor\n   ★들쭉날쭉한 화산암 벽이 «좁은 수직 통로»를 이룬다\n```\n★**「멋진 배경」과 「가리키는 배경」의 차이가 이 한 줄에 있다.** 화산·폭풍·폐허를 넣으면 화면은 극적이 되지만 시선은 흩어진다. **벽을 세워 통로를 만들면** 그 통로 자체가 제품을 향한 화살표가 된다.\n\n★배경을 «분위기»가 아니라 «구조»로 쓰는 방법이고, 같은 배치의 [[ouzhen599-arrows-stay-secondary-to-the-building]]과 정반대 방향에서 같은 문제(무엇을 보게 할 것인가)를 푼다.\n\n★@ou_zhen599 계열은 본문 첫 줄이 «왜 이 구성이 성립하는가»를 스스로 적는다 — 그 한 줄이 곧 이 카드의 제목이다.",
