      "prompt": "Spot Color AI Filter Prompt\n\n[Palette] Choose 4–6 bold, high-saturation colors that fit the scene\n[Style Strength] High\n[Output Mode] Before/after comparison\n[Final Ratio] 9:16\n\nUse the uploaded real photo as the source.\n\nKeep the landmark or architecture clearly recognizable. Preserve its main shape, iconic structural features, camera angle, perspective, composition, and placement in the frame.\n\nTransform the entire scene into a bright spot-color illustration with a clean flat screen-print feel.\n\nSimplify realistic details into bold graphic shapes and large areas of solid color. Use 4–6 vivid contrasting colors such as coral, pink, yellow, cyan, blue, violet, mint, lime green, and cream. The colors do not need to match the original photo exactly.\n\nPreserve the most recognizable architectural features such as domes, towers, arches, columns, rooflines, windows, bridges, or facade rhythms, while removing unnecessary surface details, stone textures, small decorations, and visual clutter.\n\nStylize the environment in the same visual language:\ntrees become rounded graphic color masses, grass becomes clean flat fields, clouds become simple decorative shapes, and water becomes broad irregular bands of color and reflection.\n\nKeep the result bright, clean, youthful, graphic, and highly saturated.\n\nAvoid realistic textures, heavy gradients, 3D rendering, dark muted colors, vintage distressing, paper grain, halftone dots, or overly detailed linework.\n\nOutput one 9:16 vertical comparison image with two exactly equal sections:\n\nTop 50%: the original photo\nBottom 50%: the spot-color filtered version\n\nKeep both panels closely matched in crop, scale, composition, and subject position.\n\nDo not add any text, landmark names, city names, Before/After labels, logos, numbers, borders, watermarks, or decorative typography.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**필터형 프롬프트인데 «유지 목록»과 «제거 목록»이 나뉘어 있다.**\n```\n★Preserve: domes, towers, arches, columns, rooflines, windows, bridges, facade rhythms\n★Remove:   surface details, stone textures, small decorations, visual clutter\n★Palette:  4–6 vivid contrasting colours … ★do not need to match the original photo\n★Environment in the same language: trees → rounded graphic masses, grass → flat fields,\n                                    clouds → simple shapes\n```\n★**「단순화하라」로 끝내지 않고 «무엇이 식별을 만드는가»를 열거한 것이 핵심이다.** 돔·아치·지붕선·창 리듬은 남기고 돌 질감·잔장식은 버린다 — 그래야 색이 완전히 달라져도 그 장소로 읽힌다.\n\n★**색이 원본과 일치할 필요가 없다**고 명시한 것도 눈여겨볼 것. 사진 변환 계열은 대개 「원본에서 색을 뽑으라」고 하는데, 이 회차는 반대로 **자유로운 고채도 팔레트**를 허용한다 — 대신 형태 유지 조건을 더 촘촘히 걸어 균형을 맞춘다.\n\n★배경도 같은 언어로 옮기라는 조항이 있다. 주체만 평면화하고 배경을 사진으로 두면 두 층이 따로 논다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A flat screen-print style illustration of a domed basilica seen across an open square, reduced to bold graphic shapes and large areas of solid colour. The identifying architecture survives completely: the great dome and its lantern, the arched portico, the row of columns, the stepped roofline and the rhythm of tall windows are all clearly readable. All stone texture, carving, small ornament and street clutter are gone. The palette is five vivid contrasting flat colours unrelated to reality — coral for the dome, cream for the facade, cyan sky, violet shadow, lime green for the trees. The environment is stylised in the same language: trees become rounded solid masses, the square becomes one clean flat field, clouds become simple soft shapes. No gradients, no photographic texture, crisp edges throughout, slight print misalignment along a few colour borders.",
