      "title": "★제품을 «대부분 숨기고» 그림자가 광고를 떠맡는다 — 물리는 믿을 만하게, 개념은 놀랍게",
      "prompt": "Use the uploaded product as the single source of truth.\n\nCreate a premium 16:9 ad where the product is mostly hidden or cropped, while its cast shadow becomes the main visual hook and reveals a powerful metaphor for its function, benefit, or brand identity.\n\nPreserve the product exactly. Make the shadow physically believable in light direction, perspective, contact, and scale, but conceptually surprising.\n\nSilently generate 5 shadow ideas, reject anything obvious, and produce only the strongest.\n\nMinimal scene, strong negative space, premium editorial lighting, sharp material realism, authentic brand DNA, and one original two-word headline.\n\nNo grid, no collage, no duplicated product, no random props, no generic silhouette, no unnecessary text.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**두 조건을 «동시에» 건 것이 이 프롬프트의 핵심이다.**\n```\n★the product is mostly hidden or cropped, while its cast shadow becomes the main visual hook\n★Make the shadow ★physically believable in light direction, perspective, contact, and scale,\n  but ★conceptually surprising\n```\n그림자만 놀랍게 하면 합성 티가 나고, 물리만 맞추면 그냥 그림자다. **광원 방향·원근·접지·크기는 실제와 맞되 «형상»만 은유로 바뀌어야** 성립한다.\n\n★**그리고 모델에게 «자기 선별»을 시킨다.**\n```\n★Silently generate 5 shadow ideas, reject anything obvious, and produce only the strongest.\n   조용히 5개를 만들고, 뻔한 것은 버리고, 가장 강한 하나만 낸다\n```\n후보를 내부에서 만들게 하고 **「뻔한 것을 버려라」는 기준까지 준다.** 우리 라이브러리에 드문 문법이고, 결과가 첫 발상에 머무는 것을 막는 장치다.\n\n⚠️Krea2는 text2img라 「업로드한 제품」 전제가 없다. 재현에서는 제품과 그림자를 **함께 지정**해 같은 구조를 만들었다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium 16:9 advertising photograph on a seamless warm grey backdrop with large empty space. A tall glass perfume bottle stands at the far right edge of the frame, cropped so only a third of it is visible. A single hard light from the upper right throws its long shadow across the floor toward the left, and that shadow does not match the bottle: it opens out into the unmistakable silhouette of a blossoming branch, its stem rising from the bottle's base and its flowers spreading across the empty floor. The shadow's direction, length, perspective and contact point are all physically correct for that one light, its edges softening with distance exactly as they should. The bottle itself is rendered with sharp material realism — cut glass, brushed metal collar, clear liquid. Two short words in small refined type sit in the empty upper left. No other props, no duplicated bottle, nothing else in the frame.",
