      "prompt": "Use the uploaded product as the single source of truth.\n\nCreate one premium 16:9 ad where the real product is completely absent, but its exact recognizable silhouette is formed entirely from ONE material strongly connected to its function, sensory experience, or brand DNA.\n\nPreserve the product’s true proportions and iconic geometry. Make the material physically realistic, detailed, and visually striking.\n\nSilently generate 5 material concepts and output only the strongest based on recognition, originality, brand fit, and commercial impact.\n\nAdd the authentic brand logo naturally and one original two-word headline.\n\nPremium editorial lighting, refined negative space, photoreal materials, clean composition.\n\nNo visible original product, no grid, no collage, no random splash, no unrelated props, no unnecessary text.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**앞 회차(그림자)에서 한 걸음 더 나간다 — 제품이 «완전히 부재»한다.**\n```\n★the real product is completely absent, but its exact recognizable silhouette is formed entirely\n  from ★ONE material strongly connected to its function, sensory experience, or brand DNA\n★Preserve the product's true proportions and iconic geometry\n```\n★**재료를 «아무거나»가 아니라 «기능·감각·브랜드와 강하게 연결된» 것으로 고르게 한 것이 성패를 가른다.** 커피 잔을 원두로, 향수를 꽃잎으로, 운동화를 고무 알갱이로 — 재료 자체가 이미 설명이 되어야 한다.\n\n★그리고 여기서도 같은 자기 선별을 건다 — *\"5개 재료 개념을 조용히 만들고, 식별성·독창성·브랜드 적합성·상업적 임팩트 기준으로 가장 강한 하나만\"*. **기준 네 개를 명시한 것**이 「알아서 잘」보다 낫다.\n\n★같은 계정의 [[aziz4ai-the-shadow-carries-the-whole-ad]]와 한 쌍이다 — 그쪽은 제품을 «가리고», 이쪽은 «없앤다».",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium 16:9 advertising image on a deep espresso-brown seamless background with refined negative space. In the centre stands the exact silhouette of a classic espresso cup and saucer — correct proportions, the same curved handle, the same low wide bowl — but the real cup is nowhere in the picture. The entire form is built from roasted coffee beans: thousands of them packed tight and held in that shape, their oily surfaces catching a soft directional light, individual beans visible along the rim and handle where the silhouette breaks into loose grains. No ceramic, no liquid, no actual cup anywhere. A few stray beans rest on the surface beneath. Premium editorial lighting with one soft highlight down the left of the form, photoreal texture throughout, and two short words set small in the upper right.",
