      "prompt": "GPT Image 2\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a breathtaking vertical luxury travel artwork in a 3:4 aspect ratio, featuring the entire recognizable silhouette of [CITY/COUNTRY] intricately handcrafted using authentic Kashmiri Sozni embroidery.\n\nThe complete silhouette should be delicately woven with ultra-fine threads, incorporating authentic regional floral motifs, paisley patterns, botanical elements, traditional Kashmiri designs, and elegant Persian-inspired detailing. The embroidery must look genuinely handmade, with visible individual threads, subtle imperfections, raised textile texture, delicate stitching, and exceptional artisan craftsmanship.\n\nWithin the embroidered silhouette, seamlessly weave [CITY/COUNTRY]’s most iconic landmarks, cultural symbols, architecture, landscapes, and recognizable visual elements directly into the Sozni patterns. These details must appear naturally embroidered into the textile rather than as separate objects.\n\nPlace the embroidered silhouette on a luxurious ivory Kashmiri fabric background, with elegant folds, realistic textile fibers, soft shadows, and warm natural window light. Add a few loose colored embroidery threads and a traditional Kashmiri embroidery needle beside the artwork to reinforce the handcrafted process.\n\nAt the bottom, elegantly display:\n\n[CITY/COUNTRY]\n“[ORIGINAL POETIC TAGLINE]”\n\nPremium luxury travel advertising poster, museum-quality textile art, photorealistic macro embroidery, exquisite craftsmanship, sophisticated composition, soft pastel palette, tactile fabric texture, cinematic natural lighting, ultra-detailed stitching, elegant negative space, authentic cultural atmosphere, culturally respectful, highly recognizable destination identity, 8K.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**「자수풍」이 아니라 «자수 그 자체»를 요구한다.**\n```\n★delicately woven with ultra-fine threads\n★The embroidery must look ★genuinely handmade,\n  with ★visible individual threads, ★subtle imperfections\n★authentic regional floral motifs, paisley patterns, botanical elements\n```\n★**실 한 올이 보이는 것과 «흠»이 있는 것 — 이 둘이 손자수를 만든다.** 매끈하면 프린트가 되고, 미세한 어긋남이 있으면 손으로 놓은 것이 된다. 같은 배치의 [[goodmanprotocol-print-texture-makes-it-a-magazine]]과 정확히 같은 규칙(결함이 실물을 만든다)이 다른 매체에 적용된 것이다.\n\n★그리고 문양을 «지역 정통»으로 지정한다 — 카슈미르 소즈니, 페이즐리, 치나르 잎. 일반 「꽃무늬」가 아니라 **이름 붙은 문양 계보**를 쓰는 것이 우리가 반복 확인한 「이름 붙은 형태는 통한다」의 사례다.\n\n⚠️같은 개념이 @naiknelofar788에서도 거의 동일하게 나왔다(도시 대신 국가). 동일 개념이라 그쪽은 담지 않았다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical 3:4 luxury travel artwork in which the recognizable outline of a mountainous country is rendered entirely as hand embroidery on soft undyed wool. The whole silhouette is filled with ultra-fine coloured threads worked in dense satin stitch: curling floral vines, paisley teardrops, chinar leaves and almond blossoms in saffron, deep rose, moss green and indigo. Individual threads are clearly visible, catching the light along their length, and the needlework carries genuine small imperfections — a stitch pulled slightly tight here, a thread doubling back there, a faint puckering of the cloth where the density changes. The embroidery sits raised above the fabric with soft shadows at its edges. The surrounding wool is left plain and generous, and a short place name is worked in fine chain stitch near the lower edge.",
