      "prompt": "GPT image 2\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a premium vertical 4:5 conceptual travel poster of [COUNTRY], imagined as a gigantic living organism rather than a conventional map.\n\nThe entire recognizable silhouette of [COUNTRY] is transformed into a surreal biological landscape. Its mountain ranges become a skeletal structure, rivers become glowing veins and arteries, forests become microscopic lungs and living tissue, deserts become textured skin, and major cities appear as tiny clusters of bioluminescent cells pulsing with energy.\n\nNatural elements should seamlessly merge with biological anatomy — waterfalls flowing like circulating blood, roads resembling neural pathways, forests breathing like lungs, clouds hovering like translucent membranes, and tiny settlements glowing like interconnected neurons.\n\nMaintain the accurate geographic silhouette of [COUNTRY] while making the transformation artistic and believable.\n\nCinematic macro photography, ultra-detailed 3D environment, organic textures, subtle bioluminescence, realistic atmospheric depth, dramatic but elegant lighting, soft shadows, premium editorial travel-art aesthetic, sophisticated color palette, mysterious and dreamlike mood.\n\nMinimal composition with generous negative space around the country-shaped organism. No tourists, no flags, no generic landmark collage, no clutter, no text except a small elegant [COUNTRY] title at the bottom.\n\nStyle: surreal biological realism + cinematic miniature world + luxury travel poster + scientific art\nAspect ratio: 4:5 vertical\nQuality: hyper-detailed, photorealistic textures, intricate micro-details, museum-quality conceptual artwork.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**대응표를 통째로 적어 준 것이 이 프롬프트의 전부다.**\n```\n★mountain ranges → skeletal structure      산맥 → 골격\n★rivers          → glowing veins and arteries   강 → 빛나는 혈관\n★forests         → microscopic lungs, living tissue   숲 → 폐·생체 조직\n★deserts         → textured skin                 사막 → 피부\n★major cities    → bioluminescent cells pulsing   도시 → 생체발광 세포\n```\n★**「나라를 생물처럼 그려라」로는 안 나온다.** 무엇이 무엇에 대응하는지를 낱개로 적어야 한다 — 우리가 2026-08-19 늑대·파도에서 얻고 같은 날 [[gdgtify-one-ink-drop-becomes-a-portrait]]에서 재확인한 **「부위끼리 대응」의 세 번째 사례**다. 서로 다른 세 작성자에게서 독립적으로 나왔다는 점이 중요하다.\n\n★그리고 **지리적 실루엣은 정확히 유지**하라고 못박는다. 은유가 형태를 먹어버리지 않게 하는 조항이다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical 4:5 conceptual poster in which the accurate outline of a long mountainous peninsula is rendered as a living organism against near-black space. Its mountain ranges read as a pale ridged skeleton running down the spine of the landmass. Its rivers are luminous veins and arteries branching outward in warm amber and deep red, glowing from within. Its forests are dense clusters of soft alveolar tissue, breathing green and translucent. Its dry southern plain is textured skin with fine pores and creases. Cities appear as tight knots of bioluminescent cells pulsing cyan along the coastline, connected by faint neural filaments where roads would run. Thin translucent membranes drift above like cloud. The geographic silhouette stays exactly correct throughout, and the surrounding space is left empty and dark with one short line of small type below.",
