      "prompt": "Gemini Nano Banana pro\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a premium vertical 4:5 minimalist travel poster of [CITY], [COUNTRY], inspired by modern paper sculpture with an original, elegant composition.\n\nFeature one iconic architectural silhouette emerging from or floating against a calm oversized circular moon/sun form. Integrate a recognizable local landmark subtly into the composition rather than making it dominate the scene.\n\nUse generous negative space, a soft tactile background, delicate layered paper-cut elements, extremely clean geometry, subtle 3D depth, refined edges, and tiny architectural details.\n\nAt the bottom, create a thin abstract landscape or water strip representing [RIVER / SEA / LANDSCAPE], with only one or two tiny contextual elements such as a boat, tree, bridge, or distant structure. Keep reflections extremely soft and minimal.\n\nColor palette: [3–5 SOFT COLORS], with harmonious muted tones and a sophisticated contemporary feel.\n\nTypography should be elegant, restrained, and perfectly aligned:\n\n[CITY]\n[CITY · COUNTRY]\n[SHORT POETIC TAGLINE]\n\nOverall aesthetic: luxury contemporary art print + Japanese-inspired minimalism + handcrafted paper sculpture.\n\nSoft studio lighting, tactile paper grain, delicate shadows, subtle dimensional layering, sophisticated proportions, calm atmosphere, refined editorial composition, highly detailed craftsmanship, clean background, premium design, no photorealistic clutter, no crowds, no busy skyline, no excessive objects, no unnecessary decorations.\n\nThe final image should feel quiet, artistic, collectible, modern, and instantly recognizable as [CITY].",
      "prompt_ko": "★**여행 포스터의 기본값을 뒤집는다.**\n```\n★one iconic architectural silhouette emerging from or floating against\n  a calm ★oversized circular moon/sun form\n★Integrate a recognizable local landmark ★subtly into the composition\n  rather than making it dominate the scene\n```\n★**랜드마크를 크게 그리는 대신 «거대한 원»을 주인공으로 두고 건축을 그 위에 걸친다.** 그러면 화면의 무게중심이 기하 형태로 옮겨가고, 랜드마크는 «장소를 알려주는 단서» 역할만 한다. 관광 포스터가 기념품 그림이 되지 않게 하는 장치다.\n\n★재질은 «현대 종이 조각» — 층층 페이퍼컷, 아주 깨끗한 기하, 미묘한 3D 깊이. 그리고 대면적 여백. 같은 배치의 [[goodmanprotocol-seventy-thirty-landmark-to-stylisation]]이 «정체성을 지키는» 쪽이라면 이쪽은 «비중을 낮추는» 쪽이다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A minimalist vertical 4:5 travel poster built as modern paper sculpture. One enormous pale circle — a moon or low sun — sits calm and slightly off centre, filling much of the upper half, cut from smooth matte card with a soft shadow behind it. Across its lower edge a single architectural silhouette is layered in: a tiered pagoda roofline, cut from darker paper, partly in front of the circle and partly disappearing behind it, small enough that the circle clearly dominates. A few thin paper strips suggest a hillside beneath. Everything is built from clean flat layers with crisp geometry and gentle three-dimensional depth where one sheet lifts above another. The background is a soft tactile cream with generous empty space, the palette is muted — cream, dusty rose, deep slate — and one short place name is set small and refined near the bottom.",
