      "prompt": "🇯🇵 Japan | 🇸🇬 Singapore\n\nPrompt:\nCreate a highly detailed miniature [CITY/DESTINATION] paper-craft diorama emerging from a torn opening in a rustic wooden crafting table. Feature iconic landmarks such as [LANDMARK 1], [LANDMARK 2], and [LANDMARK 3], blended with local heritage architecture, a textured [RIVER/BAY/WATERWAY], tiny boats, bridges, and lush [LOCAL FLOWERS/PLANTS]. Surround the scene with realistic crafting tools, paper supplies, glue, scissors, and decorative tape. Add elegant text reading “[CITY NAME]”, “paper craft diorama”, and “HANDMADE WITH LOVE.” Use warm natural window light, realistic shadows, intricate layered paper textures, handcrafted details, and a cozy premium miniature-art aesthetic, photographed from a slightly elevated close-up perspective.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**미니어처 디오라마를 그냥 놓지 않고 «출현 지점»을 만든다.**\n```\n★emerging from a ★torn opening in a rustic wooden crafting table\n★Surround the scene with ★realistic crafting tools, paper supplies, glue, scissors, decorative tape\n★photographed from a ★slightly elevated close-up perspective\n```\n★**「종이 공예 디오라마」만 쓰면 결과가 공중에 뜬 모형이 된다.** 찢긴 구멍에서 솟아나게 하고 주변에 가위·풀·테이프를 두면 **«방금 누가 만들고 있던 것»**이 되어 이야기가 생긴다.\n\n★같은 배치·같은 날의 [[xiaoxiaodong01-papercraft-bonsai-on-a-floating-base]]와 대조하면 축이 보인다 — 그쪽은 «부유 기저»로 수집품을 만들고, 이쪽은 «작업대»로 제작 현장을 만든다. 같은 재료, 다른 이야기.",
      "gen_prompt": "A close-up photograph taken from slightly above a rustic wooden crafting table, where a ragged torn opening has been made in a sheet of thick paper covering the surface. Rising up out of that opening is a highly detailed miniature paper-craft city: a tiered temple roof, a red arched bridge over a textured blue-paper waterway, tiny boats, a cluster of layered rooftops and small paper cherry trees, all built from cut and folded card with visible fibre edges. The torn paper curls upward around the scene. Around it on the table lie real crafting things — a pair of scissors, a glue tube, a scalpel, strips of decorative tape, offcuts and a stack of coloured sheets. Warm natural window light rakes across everything, casting real shadows into the folds. Cosy premium miniature-art feel, shallow depth of field, small elegant lettering placed on one paper offcut.",
