      "prompt": "Image On Gemini Flash \n\nPrompt:\nCreate a vintage travel scrapbook collage centered around [DESTINATION], featuring a central tablet/screen with detailed 3D illustrations of [LANDMARKS], surrounded by [LOCAL ICONS/OBJECTS] and a hand using a digital stylus. Use warm aged parchment, torn paper edges, creases, vintage stamps, postmarks, maps, handwritten notes, floral accents, and travel ephemera. Add a bold header reading \"[DESTINATION]\", subheader \"[COUNTRY/REGION]\", and a short travel tagline: \"[TAGLINE]\". Include themed notes such as \"[EXPERIENCES]\", local food/drink \"[FOOD/DRINK]\", cultural symbols \"[CULTURAL ELEMENTS]\", and handwritten quotes \"[QUOTE]\". Overall style: nostalgic, elegant, richly detailed, authentic vintage travel journal, layered scrapbook composition, warm cinematic colors, realistic paper textures.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**시대가 다른 두 층을 겹치는 것이 이 구성의 전부다.**\n```\n★a ★central tablet/screen with detailed 3D illustrations of [LANDMARKS]\n★surrounded by warm aged parchment, torn paper edges, creases, ★vintage stamps, postmarks,\n  maps, handwritten notes, floral accents, travel ephemera\n★a ★hand using a digital stylus\n```\n★**스크랩북만 그리면 복고 콜라주가 되고, 화면만 그리면 UI 목업이 된다.** 가운데 화면을 두고 «스타일러스를 쥔 손»을 넣으면 **지금 만들고 있는 중**이 되어 두 시대가 한 장면에 산다.\n\n★그리고 주변 요소를 **낱개로 열거**한다 — 우표·소인·지도·손글씨 메모·꽃 장식. 「빈티지하게」로는 안 나오는 것들이다.\n\n⚠️소량의 손글씨 문구가 지정돼 있는데, Krea2에서 **작은 글자는 무너진다**([[knowledgefxg-handdrawn-engineering-notebook-cutaway]]). 큰 헤더까지가 재현 범위다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vintage travel scrapbook page photographed from directly above, layered thick with aged materials: warm foxed parchment, torn paper edges, deep creases, old postage stamps and circular postmarks, a folded map corner, pressed flowers, a boarding stub and handwritten notes in faded ink. Lying in the middle of that pile is a thin modern tablet, its bright screen showing a crisp three-dimensional illustration of a domed cathedral and a stone bridge, glowing cleanly against all the aged paper around it. A hand enters from the lower right holding a digital stylus, its tip just above the screen. A bold header in large letterpress-style type runs across the top of the page, with a smaller line beneath it. Warm cinematic light from one side, realistic paper textures, rich nostalgic colour.",
