      "title": "★배경화를 «전경·중경·원경» 세 슬롯으로 쓴다 — 각 층에 무엇이 지나가는지까지",
      "prompt": "🇹🇷 Turkey | Southeast Asia 🇮🇩 🇲🇾 🇸🇬 🇹🇭 🇻🇳 🇵🇭 🇱🇦 🇰🇭 🇲🇲 🇧🇳 🇹🇱\n\nPrompt:\nA vibrant [SETTING] with a narrow [STREET/PATH] featuring [MAIN BUILDINGS/ARCHITECTURE], [PEOPLE/CHARACTERS], and [SMALL DETAILS/ACTIVITIES]. In the midground, [BRIDGE/ROAD/RAILWAY] crosses [RIVER/VALLEY/AREA], with [VEHICLE/BOAT/TRAIN] passing through. In the background, [MOUNTAINS/LANDSCAPE/NATURE] rise dramatically, surrounded by [TREES/VEGETATION]. Clean hand-drawn anime aesthetic, crisp defined line art, detailed cel-shading, [COLOR PALETTE], soft natural lighting, rich environmental detail, cinematic composition, and atmospheric depth.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**풍경을 «묘사»하지 않고 «세 층»으로 조립한다.**\n```\n전경  [SETTING] · 좁은 [STREET/PATH] · [MAIN BUILDINGS] · [PEOPLE] · [SMALL DETAILS/ACTIVITIES]\n중경  ★[BRIDGE/ROAD/RAILWAY]가 [RIVER/VALLEY]를 «가로지르고» [VEHICLE/BOAT/TRAIN]이 «지나간다»\n원경  [MOUNTAINS/LANDSCAPE]가 «솟아오르고» [TREES/VEGETATION]가 둘러싼다\n```\n★**중경에 «가로지르는 것 + 지나가는 것»을 배정한 것이 핵심이다.** 애니 배경화가 밋밋해지는 이유는 대개 중경이 비어서인데, 다리·철도와 그 위를 지나는 차·배·기차를 넣으면 화면에 깊이와 운동이 동시에 생긴다.\n\n★스타일은 **깨끗한 손그림 애니 — 또렷한 선화, 셀 셰이딩, 부드러운 자연광.** 슬롯을 채우기만 하면 지역이 바뀌어도 같은 결이 나오는 구조다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A hand-drawn anime background painting with crisp defined line art and detailed cel shading. In the foreground, a narrow stone-paved lane climbs between close-packed shophouses with tiled awnings and hanging lanterns; a few figures walk or crouch beside baskets of fruit, and small details fill the edges — a bicycle leaning, laundry strung overhead, a cat on a step. In the midground a long iron railway bridge crosses a wide green river valley, and a single passenger train is caught halfway across it, small but clearly moving. In the background steep forested mountains rise sharply into a hazy sky, their ridges layered in progressively paler greens. Soft natural afternoon light, warm greens and terracottas with cool blue distance, cinematic composition and strong atmospheric depth.",
