      "prompt": "حين يلتقي الواقع بالهندسة 🔺✨\nالبرومبت ⤵️ \n\nCreate a premium editorial portrait of [SUBJECT], blending realistic photography with bold geometric abstraction. Keep the subject recognizable and elegant while sharp triangles, angular planes, and layered graphic shapes intersect naturally across the face, neck, clothing, and background.\n\nUse a limited palette of deep navy, muted blue, warm ivory, and one vivid accent color. Build an asymmetrical composition with oversized architectural shapes, strong negative space, crisp edges, subtle print grain, and sophisticated shadows.\n\nCombine Bauhaus-inspired geometry, modern constructivist design, high-fashion editorial photography, and contemporary poster art. Dramatic composition, refined lighting, premium magazine aesthetic, clean details, artistic depth, 4:5 vertical.\n\nNo text, no typography, no letters, no numbers, no logos, no watermark.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**도형을 배경으로 쓰지 않고 «인물을 관통»시킨다.**\n```\n★sharp triangles, angular planes, and layered graphic shapes\n  ★intersect naturally across the ★face, neck, clothing, and background\n★limited palette of deep navy, muted blue, warm ivory, and ★one vivid accent colour\n★asymmetrical composition with ★oversized architectural shapes, strong negative space\n```\n★**「얼굴 위로 지나간다」가 이 포스터를 성립시킨다.** 도형을 뒤에만 두면 인물 사진에 배경을 깐 것이 되고, 얼굴·목·옷을 가로지르게 하면 **사진과 그래픽이 한 평면**이 된다. 같은 날의 [[mrlarus-subject-interacts-with-the-type]]가 글자로, [[ouzhen599-colour-blocking-is-the-control-point]]가 색면으로 한 일을 이쪽은 기하 도형으로 한다.\n\n★색은 «제한 팔레트 + 강조색 하나». 도형이 많아질수록 색을 줄여야 화면이 버틴다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A premium editorial portrait poster blending realistic photography with bold geometric abstraction. A person is photographed in three-quarter view with natural skin texture and a calm expression, lit softly from one side. Large flat geometric shapes cut straight across the image and over the figure itself: a sharp deep-navy triangle passes across the jaw and neck, a muted blue angular plane crosses one shoulder and continues into the background behind, and a broad ivory band slices the lower third, partly covering the clothing. The shapes are oversized and architectural, arranged asymmetrically with large areas of empty ground, and a single vivid orange wedge sits at the upper right as the only saturated accent. Crisp hard edges everywhere, a faint print grain over the whole sheet, and a short line of small type set low on the left.",
