      "title": "★천을 «흰 옷»이 아니라 «빛 받는 표면»으로 다룬다 — 젖고 구겨져 불균일해야 몸이 조각된다",
      "prompt": "The image works because the fabric is not treated as “white clothing.”\nIt is treated as a light-catching surface: thin, wet, wrinkled, and uneven, so the body shape feels sculpted by highlights instead of outlined by pose alone.\n✨ thin damp white fabric with uneven cling, stretched seams, and small wet speckles\nYou see the shirt stop looking flat. The folds, seams, and damp patches create different levels of opacity, which makes the surface feel tactile without overexplaining it.\n🧊 hard side light catching skin moisture, fabric texture, and loose hair strands\nThis keeps the portrait from becoming too clean. The face, hair, shirt, and skin all catch light in separate ways, so the image feels raw, close, and physical.",
      "prompt_ko": "> *\"The fabric is not treated as **'white clothing.'** It is treated as a **light-catching surface**: thin, wet, wrinkled, and uneven, so the body shape feels **sculpted by highlights** instead of outlined by pose alone.\"*\n```\n★thin damp white fabric with uneven cling, stretched seams, and small wet speckles\n   → 주름·솔기·젖은 자국이 «불투명도 층»을 만들어 표면이 촉각적으로 읽힌다\n★hard side light catching skin moisture, fabric texture, and loose hair strands\n```\n★**「흰 셔츠」라고 쓰면 평평한 흰 면이 나온다.** 같은 옷을 «얇고 젖고 구겨지고 고르지 않은 표면»으로 적으면 빛이 그 위에서 갈라지고, **자세가 아니라 하이라이트가 몸을 조각한다.**\n\n★재질을 «무엇인가»가 아니라 «빛을 어떻게 받는가»로 적는 방식이고, 같은 날의 [[xiaoxiaodong01-gold-leaf-on-a-flat-plane]]이 금을 「어떻게 상했는지」로 적은 것과 같은 계열이다.\n\n★@ou_zhen599 계열은 본문 첫 줄이 «왜 이 구성이 성립하는가»를 스스로 적는다 — 그 한 줄이 곧 이 카드의 제목이다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A close editorial portrait in which a thin white cotton shirt is treated purely as a surface for light. The fabric is damp and clings unevenly — pulled tight and slightly translucent across one shoulder, loose and opaque at the sleeve, gathered into deep creases at the waist where the seams stretch. Small wet speckles darken the cloth in patches, and each of those zones takes the light differently, so the body underneath is described by bands of highlight and shadow rather than by outline. Hard side light rakes in from the left, catching moisture on the skin, the raised weave of the cotton and a few loose hair strands lit against the dark background. Muted palette of white, warm skin and deep charcoal, sharp texture detail, restrained composition with the figure turned slightly away.",
