      "lang": "en",
      "target_model": "GPT Image 2",
      "category": "타이포그래피",
      "title": "★«사진이 먼저, 포스터가 나중»이어야 한다 — 실제로 일어나는 순간을 슬롯으로 적는다",
      "prompt": "Prompt:\n\n[SCENE]: {flower stall / confession / moving day / rooftop laundry / etc.}\n[PEOPLE]: {age, relationship, appearance}\n[ACTION]: {what is happening in this exact moment}\n[ARCHITECTURE]: {shopfront / apartment entrance / rooftop / street corner}\n[TITLE]: {short bold keyword}\n[ACCENT COLOR]: {red / blue / green / etc.}\n[SUBTITLE]: {short description}\n[FORMAT]: 9:16\n\nCreate a vertical editorial poster built around a real everyday moment with visible people, natural interaction, and a distinctive architectural setting.\n\nThe image should feel like a genuine lifestyle photograph first and a designed poster second. Show the people actively doing something inside the scene, with readable faces, natural expressions, believable body language, and no obvious posing or camera awareness.\n\nUse nearby architecture, furniture, objects, plants, signs, boxes, fabrics, flowers, or other real-life details to make the environment feel lived-in and visually rich.\n\nSet “{TITLE}” in oversized bold condensed typography and integrate it directly into the scene. Let people, objects, doorways, awnings, fabric, walls, or architectural lines overlap, interrupt, frame, or pass in front of the letters. Typography should feel embedded in the real space rather than simply placed over the photo.\n\nUse a restrained neutral palette with subtle paper and print texture, keeping the image clean rather than heavily distressed. Add {ACCENT COLOR} only as a small visual accent.\n\nAdd only a few meaningful editorial details such as thin lines, small labels, or graphic marks. Avoid random filler text, excessive technical information, numbering, logos, watermarks, sparkles, heavy grunge, and overly clean commercial-ad styling.\n\nOverall style: lifestyle photography × editorial poster design × experimental typography × subtle neo-retro print texture.",
      "prompt_ko": "★**슬롯 이름이 이 프롬프트의 논지다.**\n```\n[SCENE]  꽃집 좌판 / 고백 / 이사하는 날 / 옥상 빨래\n[PEOPLE] 나이·관계·외모\n★[ACTION] ★\"what is happening in this ★exact moment\"   지금 이 순간 무슨 일이 일어나는가\n[ARCHITECTURE] 가게 앞 / 아파트 입구 / 옥상 / 길모퉁이\n```\n> *\"The image should feel like a **genuine lifestyle photograph first and a designed poster second.**\"*\n\n★**「포스터를 만들라」가 아니라 「진짜 순간을 찍고 그 위에 편집을 얹으라」는 순서 지정이다.** 편집 디자인이 먼저 오면 연출된 광고가 되고, 순간이 먼저 오면 포스터가 된다.\n\n★[ACTION] 슬롯에 «정확히 이 순간»이라고 못박은 것도 요령이다. 「사람들이 이야기한다」가 아니라 「꽃을 건네려다 손이 멈췄다」처럼 **한 시점**을 적게 만든다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A vertical editorial poster that reads as a genuine street photograph first. Outside a narrow flower stall with buckets crowding the pavement, an older woman holds out a wrapped bunch of white chrysanthemums while a young man's hand has stopped just short of taking them — caught in that exact half-second before contact, both of them looking at the flowers rather than each other. Everything around them is ordinary and specific: taped price cards, a plastic stool, a rolled awning, wet pavement. Natural late-afternoon light, real skin and fabric texture, unposed body language. Over this photograph sits restrained editorial design — one short bold keyword set large across the lower third in deep green, a small subtitle line beneath it, and a thin rule at the top edge. The design layer never overwhelms the moment.",
      "ref_image": null,
      "result": "results/mrlarus-a-real-moment-first-a-poster-second.webp",
      "seed": 909360082
