      "prompt": "📸 Black-and-white fashion hits harder with one bold color!\n\nKeep the photos monochrome, then add one saturated color + oversized type.\n\n1. FITTING\n2. ZIP UP\n3. WALK TEST\n4. ON DECK\n\nDifferent layouts, one consistent visual system.\n\nMade with GPT-Image2\nPrompt below 👇 https://t.co/SZSTIq3rXK",
      "prompt_ko": "★**규칙이 짧아서 오히려 분명하다.**\n```\n★Keep the photos ★monochrome, then add ★one saturated colour + ★oversized type\n네 장 예시: FITTING / ZIP UP / WALK TEST / ON DECK\n★\"Different layouts, one consistent visual system.\"\n```\n★**흑백 위에 색 하나만 남기는 것은 흔한 기법인데, 여기서는 «거대 타이포»가 그 색을 떠맡는다.** 색이 사진 속 소품에 찍히면 스팟컬러 사진이 되고, 글자에 실리면 **편집 디자인**이 된다.\n\n★그리고 네 장이 «레이아웃은 다르되 시스템은 같다» — 같은 날의 [[ouzhen599-four-posters-share-structure-not-motion]]이 «자리를 고정»해 시리즈를 묶었다면, 이쪽은 «색과 활자 규칙»으로 묶는다. 시리즈를 잠그는 두 가지 방법이다.",
      "gen_prompt": "A fashion editorial poster in which the photograph is entirely black and white: a model seen from behind in a fitting room, one hand raised to the zip of a structured jacket, mirror edge and hanging garments visible, rich monochrome tonality with deep blacks and clean highlights. Over it, one short word is set in enormous heavy sans-serif capitals running across the lower half, cropped by both edges of the frame, printed in a single saturated vermilion — the only colour anywhere in the image. A few lines of very small type in the same vermilion sit aligned at one corner. Nothing else is coloured; no tinted props, no gradient, no second accent. Strong contrast, generous empty grey wall above the figure, precise typographic alignment.",
